{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia","id":929924,"title":"[IC] [Mage: the Awakening 2E] The Supernal Suburbia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-11T13:10:43-07:00","id":929924,"title":"[IC] [Mage: the Awakening 2E] The Supernal Suburbia","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><u>The Supernal Suburbia</u></b></span><br /> <br /> Close enough to Chicago for an easy commute, but far enough away to avoid the...less than savory aspects of the Windy City, La Grange is a Cook County suburb that some would say is a boring alternative to city living. Many families choose to live in this area for a number of convenient factors: less congestion than its neighboring villages to the east, quick CTA access to the city and nearby towns, and a downright <i>pleasant</i> feeling that scratches the suburban itch that so many middle-class American families are seeking. Locals are quick to brag about La Grange's quality schools and that, yes, the actor David Hasselhoff is from here. What more could you ask for?<br /> <br /> However, very few people, locals or otherwise, will let conversation linger on topics about the strange occurrences that have plagued parts of their town for years. It's a simple fact here: If you don't talk about it, it's not really a problem. Suburban lives goes on...except when they don't.<br /> <br /> So no one talks about, for example, the way that kids from Lyons Township High School sometimes go missing for a week or two at a time, only to show up in town with no memory of where they've been or what they have been up to. People prefer to quickly change the topic when someone asks about the distant howling they heard coming from the woods at night on the north side of town. And no one really knows, and certainly never talks about, why these disruptions to their idyllic suburban life happen in very specific pockets of town while others have almost never reported these same problems. No one in their right mind discusses how absolutely <i>dreadful</i> all of those bizarre experiences are in Chicago, only a short train or bus ride away.<br /> <br /> But you have Awakened. You don't just talk about these odd happenings; you can't get <i>enough </i>of them. And suburban life, it turns out, has a lot of secrets hiding behind its white-washed fences and nicely furnished homes.<br /> <br /> <b>Current Player Characters</b><br /> 1. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12046\" data-vbnamecard=\"12046\">Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\">Lynx</a>, Thyrsus Mystagogue, animist/college student (old character sheet here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=923352#post923352\">Lynx)</a><br /> 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1422692#post1422692\">Eurydice's Heir</a>, Moros Arrow, <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">neopagan obsessed with ephemeral beings</span><br /> 3. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25593-drsteve\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25593\" data-vbnamecard=\"25593\">DrSteve</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1421912#post1421912\">Morganna</a>, Mastigos th\u00e9arch, soccer mom / con-woman<br /> 4. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12398\" data-vbnamecard=\"12398\">DArchon5</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1421131#post1421131\">Fatewise</a>, Acanthus Mystagogue, high school grad with supernatural family problems<br /> 5. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1096_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1096\" data-vbnamecard=\"1096\">squidheadjax</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1420097#post1420097\">Caliginosa</a>, Obrimos Guardian, magical thief and artifact remover<br /> <br /> <b>Inactive Player Characters</b><br /> 1. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8026_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8026\" data-vbnamecard=\"8026\">Beans</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=924881#post924881\">Dr. Asphodel</a>, Moros theoretical physicist<br /> 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2021\" data-vbnamecard=\"2021\">MagicSwordsman</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=923245#post923245\">Binder</a>, Mastigos bookstore owner/family man<br /> 3. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=922094#post922094\">Moonstone</a>, Mastigos Sleepwalker-turned-mage<br /> 4. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2992_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2992\" data-vbnamecard=\"2992\">crapcarp</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=926755#post926755\">Phoenix</a>, Obrimos Hunter-turned-mage<br /> 5. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6498_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6498\" data-vbnamecard=\"6498\">Haberdasher</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=922838#post922838\">Ragnar</a>, Acanthus Renaissance man<br /> 6. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=984363#post984363\">Ouroboros Ophis</a>, Moros occult physician<br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <u><b>Table of Contents</b></u><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\">OOC Thread</a><br /> <br /> <b>Storm Chasers </b><b>(Old group - Game no longer active)</b><br /> Chapter 1: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=929926#post929926\">&quot;Eyes Wide Open&quot;</a><br /> Chapter 2: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=996540#post996540\">&quot;All in Order&quot;</a><br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <b> Taken by Storm</b><br /> Prologue: \u201cThe Calm Before the Storm\u201d<br /> Chapter 1: \u201cDistant Rumbles\u201d<br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <b>Awakened La Grange</b><br /> In many ways, La Grange is a stereotypical Midwestern suburb. It has picturesque streets, a healthy blend of chain restaurants and unique local attrractions, and convenient access to the city. For mages, there are also additional perks of living in the city. Suburban &quot;culture&quot; means that no one looks too closely at strange occurrences, creating a natural layer of protection that allows mages to practice their arts with minimal intrusion. While mages, Kindred, and Uratha battle over territory in Chicago for ease of access to crucial resources, conflict between these supernatural in the suburbs tends to be less deadly and less common. Sleepers aren't the only ones who might turn a blind eye to strange occurrences in the suburbs. With this kind of atmosphere, it's no surprise that many mages would gravitate towards suburbs like La Grange for their sancta.<br /> <br /> The weight of suburbia can cause other problems for mages, however. In some places around the city, the Lie settles in more strongly than other regions -- as if the city itself feeds into the Lie. Spellcasting in these areas can be impacted unexpectedly in a variety of ways, such as risking higher Paradox, being more vulnerable to Dissonance, or worsening Quiescence in Sleepers who observe obvious magic. Awakened Scholars haven't been able to pin down precisely why some regions are affected more than others, but they have observed that local events -- LT High School winning a big football game against a rival, a headline news story about an armed robbery in a wealthy neighborhood -- can cause the Lie to settle more heavily on different parts of town. This can be particularly frustrating when one of these zones moves over a sanctum.<br /> <br /> The <b>Guardians of the Veil</b> are very active in the suburb of La Grange. They are charged with protecting the secrecy of Awakened society, and the moving &quot;Lie zones&quot; make their jobs easier in many cases. However, more than once they have needed to race to the scene of a ritual gone wrong because a mage overreached and summoned a monster from the Abyss. The <b>Silver Ladder</b>, in contrast, work even harder to guide Sleepers to Awakening to compensate for the heavy weight of the Lie in this suburban town. Their work has understandably led to tension with Guardians in La Grange, as well as the <b>Adamantine Arrow</b>, who more recently lean in support of the Guardians' mission.<br /> <br /> Over the past few years, there have been additional unusual occurrences targeting the youth of La Grange. About every month, a student from La Grange's Lyons Township High School has been going missing. In almost every case, the teenager suddenly showed up a week or two later, with no memory of what had happened to them or where they had been. There have been two notable exceptions, in each case of which the teen's body was found with no identifiable causes of death. For the adolescents who go missing and do return, the community has made it a habit to just pretend that nothing strange happened, and that the teenager was out of town on some kind of vacation -- or perhaps it's the Lie that prevents them from remembering? So far, no mages have been able to figure out what, or who, is causing these teens to disappear.<br /> <br /> <u>Places of Interest:</u><br /> Brookfield Zoo: Although technically in Brookfield rather than La Grange proper, the zoo draws crowds of Sleepers and mages alike. mages in particular visit the zoo because there are several hallows scattered throughout and around the area. The Gauntlet also fluctuates here in a peculiar fashion; it is thick during the day, but razor thin during the quiet hours of the night.<br /> <br /> Bemis Woods: This 480-acre forest is located on the northwest side of La Grange. Sleepers come here for a fun, outdoorsy day of hiking and enjoying nature. mages come here primarily to collect mana from its many hallows, and some reclusive mages even hide away in their sancta here. However, Uratha frequent the area as well, usually because dangerous or powerful spirits try to use Bemis Woods as an access point to the material world.<br /> <br /> Rumors Nightclub: This gay bar has only opened in the past year, and already it has been received with excellent reviews. The welcoming, raucous atmosphere inside provides a great cover for mages trying to hide in plain sight while they meet and discuss recent Awakened politics. However, Kindred and their ghouls also frequent the bar, using the popular night scene for easy feeding.<br /> <br /> Marlin's Books: Marlin Matheson's bookstore is located here in La Grange. Although he hasn't previously known it, mages have come here investigating to see how much true occult knowledge Marlin has accumulated, especially thearchs and Mystagogues.<br /> <br /> Flying V Martial Arts: The martial arts studio where Garrick Royce works part-time as an instructor is also located in La Grange. He has good relationships with a number of quality students and other instructors. It also provides him with opportunities to keep honing his physical skills, and it does help pay the rent.<br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <b>Awakened Chicago</b><br /> Chicago is a busy city with a richly diverse urban atmosphere. Men and women from around the world travel here for business or pleasure. There are many large and well-respected universities and colleges, a thriving entertainment industry, a vibrant music and art scene, and a wealth of knowledge available through museums and public seminars. It also has its fair share of corruption, scandal, and poverty, as well a potpourri of gangs and common thugs.<br /> <br /> For &quot;normal&quot; humans, Chicago can be a dangerous but exciting place to visit or live. For the Awakened, both of these extremes are sharply magnified.<br /> <br /> On one hand, Chicago is home to some of the richest, most compelling, and most potentially lucrative Mysteries in the Midwest. Legend has it that Chicago rests on an ancient battleground where the first mages made war against the Exarchs, before the fall of Atlantis. Despite the fact that modern cabals of brave mages have scoured the city for over a century, forays into the heart of Chicago today still often find imbued items, pieces of Supernal lore, and even the occasional artifact. The exact reason for the sheer number of these items appearing is unclear. Some <b>Mystagogues </b>believe that the city's core resonance allows for Irises to other realms to form at regular intervals, opening into parallel worlds or Emanations where this Atlantean war is still being raged. Mages who return from these Emanations only come back with glimpses of knowledge that don't seem to fit with where or how they remembered discovering these objects -- if they remember anything about their journeys to these otherworldly realms at all. Regardless, it is now common knowledge that these items are more likely to be found after unusual weather patterns, which may be related to their Supernal nature: thunderclouds with red lightning, hail falling in the height of summer, and other odd events. Mages with Prime Mage Sight can identify these magical weather fronts and refer to them as Highstorms. In fact, mages are experimenting with ways to incorporate these storms into their spell casting as a yantra, which has so far enhanced Prime spells and other magic that connects the material world with other realms.<br /> <br /> But this knowledge comes with a price. Some of the items are cursed, or at least cause extreme damage to those who use them without proper precaution. Many appear tainted with the Abyss, tainting an unwary mage's imago or calling attention from horrific beings that have no known name. Mages have not been able to consistently identify and purify these items of their curses, although Masters of Prime have been the most successful to date.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, mages are not alone in Chicago. <b>Kindred </b>and <b>Uratha </b>alike have flourishing societies or pockets of influence throughout the city, and they are constantly on the prowl for any sign of supernatural beings out of fear of predation. The safest times for mages to travel into the city relatively without fear of harassment are at peak hours during the day, but obviously at the risk of being surrounded by a sea of Sleepers. Even those times are not safe, as werewolves and their wolf-blooded kin have no problem being active during the day, and vampires' ghouls can equally act in sunlight without their masters' same limitations. Kindred and Uratha may lack mages' knowledge about Highstorms, but they can detect mages in their own ways, and they know that each Highstorm often leads to an influx of Awakened invaders on their home turf. Many a cabal has met its untimely demise searching for artifacts downtown -- but not enough to entirely deter the hubris of others. And there are other supernatural beings that may be fewer in numbers, but not necessarily less dangerous.<br /> <br /> Most of the Orders still hold regular meetings downtown, due to a desire to have central meeting locations. The meetings often occur in private meeting rooms at public institutions during the lunch hour, with strict rules about not casting any spells on the premises. Each month, they also meet in varying outlying suburbs on a rotation system, where they are allowed to practice magic more freely. <b>Guardians of the Veil</b> are tasked with ensuring that mages follow these protocols during Order meetings, but also serve to protect mages when downtown. The <b>Silver Ladder</b> has been at odds with them for years; they believe that Mystery Cults downtown are especially important to give Sleepers a chance to have their eyes opened, believing that the Highstorms may be used somehow to facilitate their Awakening. The <b>Free Council</b> has been pursuing humanitarian efforts downtown with the homeless population of Chicago as well as the local LGBT community. They're also actively allied with researchers, including both mages and Sleepwalkers, at several universities downtown.<br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <b>Recent Events &amp; Awakened Politics</b><br /> The game begins on October 3, 2020. Until very recently, the Chicago Consilium was headed by a Hierarch named Atlas. Historically, the Chicago Consilium has been a republic by nature, with the leader from each Pentacle Order serving on a council that is overseen by the Hierarch. Atlas, an Obrimos Mystagogue, encouraged communication among the Order leaders but was primarily interested in his agenda to study and catalogue artifacts discovered after Highstorms. He had few policies or care for issues involving Kindred or Uratha, except to caution mages from causing more trouble than was necessary. Atlas was a pleasant but relatively reserved man, clearly brilliant and gifted but not always practical; most mages had nice things to say about him, but thought he could be more decisive or involved in major decisions pertaining to Awakened society.<br /> <br /> On September 8, 2020, a particularly large and powerful Highstorm struck the city around dusk. Pitch-black fog seeped up from the ground beneath the entire span of the city proper, rose like mist into the sky, and formed boiling, black clouds lit by red lightning. A surge of mages traveled from the Chicagoland suburbs into the city in hopes of finding artifacts or some rare knowledge.<br /> <br /> That evening, 32 mages were killed.<br /> <br /> The victims were fairly equally distributed across Path and Order, although the Adamantine Arrow and Guardians had relatively fewer, while deaths among the Mysterium and Free Council were higher. With a previous population of mages somewhere between 300 and 400, the sheer number of deaths was a sizable blow to the Orders. Disturbingly, many of their bodies were found in isolated areas with a powerful Abyssal taint; Death spells to ascertain the nature and time of their deaths caused more than one Moros to scream in agony and fall comatose for a period lasting hours to days. Most of the mages killed included Nameless or newly Awakened, but a few were even verified masters. All of them had a look of horror transfixed on their face.<br /> <br /> As a result of this incident, infamously referred to by many as the Deathstorm, a sudden shift in political power led to Atlas grudgingly stepping down as Hierarch in place of a Latina woman known as Cielo, a Thyrsus mage who was serving at the time as the Adamant Sage of the local Adamantine Arrow chapter. Cielo is part of a small but influential, all-Latina cabal known as Medianoche. Cielo and her &quot;sisters&quot; Luna and Estrella are all masters in their own right, but Cielo is a local legend rumored to have never lost a fight or a Duel Arcane.<br /> <br /> Cielo's chief policies are straight to the point: Defend mages from danger. Subdue Kindred and Uratha if they pose an immediate threat; otherwise, don't pick a fight. And above all, strike down those who willingly seek to support the Abyss or Exarchs. With the full support of the Consilium, she and her cabal led strike teams against several Seer pylons and even some Scelesti in the city and routed them. Her approach has been criticized by a minority for being too extreme, but most have applauded her emphasis on getting results.<br /> <br /> The Deathstorm has had some other subtler effects on Pentacle mages, too. The Free Council has been severely restricted in their ability to pursue some of their humanitarian efforts among the homeless. The relationships between the Silver Ladder and Guardians have grown even more tense. And a number of Nameless and newly Awakened mages have turned to the Adamantine Arrow, either out of admiration for Cielo or fear of being killed by some Abyssal monster without means of protecting themselves. Mystagogues have been arguing amongst themselves about whether it is more important to keep seeking new artifacts and knowledge from Highstorms, or if they should focus on studying the knowledge they've already accrued to ascertain what might have led to the events causing the Deathstorm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 11-22-2020, 05:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T13:11:16-07:00","id":929925,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Greater Chicago Consilium</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Hierarch</b><br /> Cielo (Thyrsus Arrow)<br /> <br /> <b>Councilors</b><br /> 1) Estrella (Acanthus th\u00e9arch)<br /> 2) Apollo (Mastigos Libertine)<br /> 3) Luna (Moros Mystagogue)<br /> 4) Atlas (Obrimos Mystagogue)<br /> 5) Poseidon (Thyrsus Guardian)<br /> <br /> <b>Provosts</b><br /> 1) Vincent (Acanthus th\u00e9arch)<br /> 2) Ghost Dog (Mastigos Arrow)<br /> 3) Scale (Moros Arrow)<br /> 4) Ares (Obrimos Guardian)<br /> 5) Ovid (Thyrsus th\u00e9arch)<br /> <br /> <b>Sentinels</b><br /> 1) Valentine (Mastigos Guardian)<br /> 2) Yari (Thyrsus Arrow)<br /> <br /> <b>Herald</b><br /> Melody (Obrimos th\u00e9arch)<br /> <br /> <b>Interfector</b><br /> TBD<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Pentacle Mages</b></u> (grouped by cabal)<br /> <br /> <b>52</b><br /> Club: Moros Libertine<br /> Diamond: Obrimos th\u00e9arch<br /> Heart: Thyrsus Mystagogue<br /> Spade: Mastigos Arrow<br /> <br /> <b>The Band</b><br /> Cadence: Acanthus Mystagogue. Order mentor to Fatewise.<br /> Chord: Mastigos Guardian<br /> Harmony: Thyrsus Libertine.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1000270#post1000270\">Melody</a>: Obrimos th\u00e9arch. Herald of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> Scale: Moros Arrow<br /> <br /> <b>Knights of Alhambra</b><br /> Askia: Thyrsus Arrow. Order mentor to Eurydice's Heir.<br /> Ghost Dog: Mastigos Arrow<br /> Rose of Sharon: Obrimos Arrow<br /> <br /> <b>Medianoche</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998598#post998598\">Cielo</a>: Thyrsus Arrow. Current Hierarch of the Chicago Consilium. Previously served as the Adamant Sage.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998598#post998598\">Estrella</a>: Acanthus th\u00e9arch. Councilor of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998598#post998598\">Luna</a>: Moros Mystagogue. Councilor of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> <br /> <b>Mythologos</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=992407#post992407\">Dante</a>: Moros Libertine.<br /> Homer: Mastigos Libertine.<br /> Ovid: Thyrsus Libertine.<br /> Virgil: Obrimos Libertine.<br /> <br /> <b>Olympians</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998599#post998599\">Apollo</a>: Mastigos Libertine. Councilor of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> Ares: Obrimos Guardian. Provost for Atlas in the Chicago Consilium.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998598#post998598\">Atlas</a>: Obrimos Mystagogue. Councilor of the Chicago Consilium. Previously served as Hierarch until Cielo assumed the title.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=998599#post998599\">Poseidon</a>: Thyrsus Guardian. Councilor of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> <br /> <b>Servants of Gaea</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=993077#post993077\">Falling Blossom</a>: Mastigos Mystagogue.<br /> Pulse: Moros Arrow.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=994795#post994795\">Raven</a>: Thyrsus Mystagogue. Order mentor to Lynx.<br /> Shepherd: Obrimos th\u00e9arch.<br /> Vincent: Acanthus th\u00e9arch.<br /> <br /> <b>Shadow Spears</b><br /> Ascalon: Thyrsus Mystagogue.<br /> Trident: Thyrsus Libertine.<br /> Yari: Thyrsus Arrow. Sentinel of the Chicago Consilium.<br /> <br /> <b>Shields of Dawn</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=982530#post982530\">Boomer</a>: Obrimos Arrow. Thunderbolt Guardian of the Adamantine Arrow.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=967438#post967438\">Mathias</a>: Acanthus th\u00e9arch who found Ragnar, Lynx, and Dr. Asphodel after their first foray in a Highstorm.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=982530#post982530\">Valentine</a>: Mastigos Guardian. Sentinel of the Chicago Consilium. Order mentor to Caliginosa.<br /> (Umbra): Moros Libertine. Killed during the Deathstorm.<br /> (Orca): Thyrsus Mystagogue. Killed during the Deathstorm.<br /> <br /> <b>Other Mages</b><br /> Dr. Asphodel: Moros Nameless, theoretical physicist at UChi. Current whereabouts unknown.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=991693#post991693\">Unknown male mage</a>: Assumed Moros mage. Has an unknown association with &quot;Anubis&quot; (Hakim). Whereabouts and motives unknown.<br /> Vivian: Obrimos th\u00e9arch. Order mentor to Morganna.<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Seers of the Throne</b></u>(grouped by pylon)<br /> <br /> None currently known.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Supporting Characters</u> </b>(grouped by relationship)<br /> <br /> <b>Sleepers and Unknown</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=929926#post929926\">Daisy Matheson</a>: Marlin's wife. Works as a librarian at the Chicago Public Library located in Lincoln Park.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=932146#post932146\">&quot;Mystery girl&quot;</a>: Student in Ouroboros Ophis' FYS class.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=973067#post973067\">Dr. Thomas Gray</a>: Dean, Humanities Division, at the University of Chicago.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=990236#post990236\">Ewan Byrne</a>: UChi undergraduate freshman, majoring in business administration.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=990416#post990416\">Seldarine</a>: Occultist and artist in Moonstone's circles of contacts.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=991693#post991693\">Ken Tanaka</a>: Phoenix's roommate at his La Grange apartment. UChi undergraduate sophomore, majoring in economics and political science. Talented viola player, passionate musician.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=996540#post996540\">Dr. Jacob Langley</a>: UChi English professor. Friend and mentor of Ragnar, who assists him with UChi issues in exchange for help with his research.<br /> <br /> <b>Garrick's Hunter Cell</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1014899#post1014899\">Brandon</a>: Member of Garrick's old Hunter cell. Really, really likes fire.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1014899#post1014899\">Gretchen</a>: Young woman in the cell with a voracious appetite for books and all things occult.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=995053#post995053\">TJ</a>: Computer analyst and hacker. Older brother of Tanya.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=995053#post995053\">Tanya</a>: Works as a librarian in Chicago. Younger sister of TJ.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1014899#post1014899\">Thomas</a>: A very nice and pleasant farmer who got caught up in the Hunter cell. Not the brightest, but very nice -- as long as you don't try to hurt his friends.<br /> <br /> <b>Sleepwalkers</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=992525#post992525\">Ace</a>: Sleepwalker in the service of the Adamantine Arrow in Moonstone's circles of contacts.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=990236#post990236\">Patty LeBlanc</a>: Ragnar's roommate at his La Grange apartment. UChi undergraduate junior, majoring in computer science.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 11-19-2020, 09:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T13:13:19-07:00","id":929926,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Chapter 1: &quot;Eyes Wide Open&quot;</b></span><br /> <i>Tuesday, September 6, 2016. Mid-afternoon. Three days after the Deathstorm.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel, Lynx, and Ragnar</b><br /> It was only the first day of classes at the prestigious University of Chicago, and already the students were complaining. Widely regarded among students as &quot;Syllabus Day,&quot; most people found the task of their professors and course instructors reviewing the course expectations and written material to be <i>rather </i>dry. Although the university was filled with some of the country's brightest, impressionable minds, there's only so much &quot;fun&quot; that could be squeezed into the same period where exams and homework expectations were discussed.<br /> <br /> The class held about 40 undergraduate students and one graduate teaching assistant. Although they had a diverse range of hopeful majors of study, all undergrads were required to take a humanitarian core sequence during their first year. There were many to pick from, all with slightly different themes and content, but each with the intention of ensuring that all students met standardized expectations for reading and writing skills. Due to the sheer number of students who needed course credit, other professors from disciplines outside the humanities department were &quot;asked&quot; to assist by leading a section.<br /> <br /> Near the tail end of the 75-minute class period, the room became drastically darker. Anyone looking outside saw that over the course of a few short minutes, what had once been a bright blue sky was now filled with ominous black clouds. Loud <i>clatters</i> against the window suggest something is falling from the sky, but it's difficult to see clearly due to the lighting.<br /> <br /> A young woman raises her hand and asks loudly without being called on, &quot;Uh...professor? What's going on?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: You can all make a perception roll (Wits+Composure) at -1 penalty. Your peripheral Mage Sight gives each of you a sensation of something <i>odd</i> going on outside. </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You are on the BNSF railway, heading from downtown Chicago back towards La Grange. You spent the better part of the morning and afternoon trying to speak with Hakim's contacts, looking for more information about the nature of his death. You know that Mages have been referring to the most recent Highstorm as the &quot;Deathstorm,&quot; but everyone has been tight-lipped over text messages and your usual contact lines. You've bumped into a few Mages recently whom you knew before your Awakening, and they were shocked to see that you were now one of the Awakened. They told you that the Consilium is holding a special meeting in a few days to discuss some local events.<br /> <br /> As your train moves along, your peripheral Mage Sight triggers. You notice the sky darkening at a rapid, unnatural rate. You hear loud clattering against the train car.<br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You came into the city for lunch to meet with Daisy, during her lunch break at the Chicago Public Library. It was a pleasant day, and now you're on the BNSF heading back home. You notice a face in the crowd, a younger man who has stopped at your bookstore in La Grange now and then. You're pretty sure he was at the library today, too.<br /> <br /> As your train moves along, your peripheral Mage Sight triggers. You notice the sky darkening at a rapid, unnatural rate. You hear loud clattering against the train car.<br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You have been on the hunt all morning and afternoon for the man you know as Anubis, the Mage that you have every reason to believe is responsible for the death of your old Hunter cell. However, you haven't been able to find even a shred of evidence of where he might be. It's as if the trail has gone cold. You don't believe he's really gone, though: you've learned all too well now that magic can be a powerful force. Maybe he's gone into hiding?<br /> <br /> As your train moves along, your peripheral Mage Sight triggers. You notice the sky darkening at a rapid, unnatural rate. You hear loud clattering against the train car.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: Everyone on the train can also make a Wits+Composure roll at -1 penalty. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-11-2016, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T14:16:02-07:00","id":929962,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL</b></div> <br /> Dr. Vivian McCallister doesn't really like having to teach First Year Seminar (whose acronym, FYS, amusingly stands for at least one other thing and far less benign than its intended reading). To be fair, she doesn't especially like teaching in general, being more a researcher, but you gotta do what you gotta do, even in the throes of divorce and neighborly whispers. Gripping her cane, she's writing something on the digital board, when the weather abruptly turns outside. The sky darkens and there's a clatter, presumably of hail? That's what tends to clatter like that, certainly, though usually not this much in the summer heat. She glances at her TA, vaguely wondering if Simon's car is exposed to the possible denting. Does he even drive? She just got this TA, she doesn't know how he works yet.<br /> <br /> &quot;M-must be a sudden thu-thunderst-derstorm, th-they, uh... they can carry pr-pretty nasty hail.&quot; She peers out the dark windows, then looks over at her class. &quot;Mist-Mister, ah---&quot; she pauses, eyes flicking to a student near the light switch. Big, burly, beard---&quot;Oscar, r-right? Th-t-the lights, if you p-if you please.&quot; She turns back to the window, adjusting her glasses, and scuttles over. Under her breath, she stammers whispered curses about not bringing an umbrella. Her eyes focus, mage senses whispering and prickling like ghosts in a radio.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417863\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for 2 sux.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T14:46:58-07:00","id":929978,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <br /> <br /> Oscar Valewood has enjoyed his first couple of days in the US - and he is enjoying his first day at Uni as well. Despite the murmurs of his fellow students of the FYS being incessantly boring, it did nothing to quench his eagerness. He ignores those who comment on his excessive note-taking - indeed, as he scans his notebook, he might've written down more than Dr. McCallister has presented - his wrist aching slightly in the aftermath.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Should I...? Could fix my wrist in a jiffy, but...Hm?</i></span><br /> <br /> His hairs stand on end, and he bristles.<br /> <br /> With the darkness that washes over the room, and the <i>clink-clank-clink</i> that resonates through the room - <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Hail? Now?</i></span> - Oscar narrows his eyes as he looks outside. He tries to focus his sight, only he doesn't quite know how, when the girl next to him nudges him in the shoulder, pointing down to Dr. McCallister. &quot;Oh, of course, Professor.&quot;<br /> <br /> He gets up from his seat, stretching his shoulders. As he goes to turn on the lights, he keeps his eyes firmly on the darkness outside.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417866\" target=\"_blank\">Rolled 1 success.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-13-2016, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T14:54:06-07:00","id":929982,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> <br /> Yeah, well, no one is more shocked than he is.<br /> <br /> He's sitting with his eyes closed, deep in his own thoughts, in a ball cap with visor over his eyes and his stuff in a messenger bag and the Cloak hidden under a leather jacket. His hands are bandaged after slicing them up That Night When Stuff Happened, but they're hidden under fingerless gloves.<br /> <br /> Then he feels it- that new recurring feeling of suddenly being in an auspicious location and moment, the wrong place at the right time. The Hour of Babel, he's calling it. He's been around magic all his adult life, but he's just now realizing that he never <i>felt</i> it before the last three days.<br /> <br /> Moonstone pulls his hat up so he can see out the window better. And as he looks, he does this trick he's learned where he pulls all the fingers on his left <i>(sinister, magical)</i> hand in order and counts possibilities. He forms an easy question: <i>What is about to happen to me?</i> And a more subtle one: <i>Am I going to die within the next hour?</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><i>Wits+Composure-1: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417868\" target=\"_blank\">2 success</a></i><i><br /> Casting my Praxis, Time 1 Divination. Yantras: Concentration (+2). 2 free Reach, spent on Instant casting and the +1 Reach effect to ask more specific questions. Subject is myself. No paradox. Gnosis+Time+2: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417874\" target=\"_blank\">2 success</a></i><br /> <br /> <i>With Potency 2 I get to ask the two questions stated above!</i></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T15:03:52-07:00","id":929986,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b></div> <br /> <br /> The clattering cuts through the music playing on Marlin's headphones, but it's the scent of smoke and incense that gets his attention. The scent of magic. He pauses his music and peers out the window at the clouds. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Ominous...</span>&quot; he mumbles to himself.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits + Composure - 1 = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417876\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-13-2016, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T18:16:02-07:00","id":930071,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> <br /> </div> The past few months have been a whirlwind for Ragnar. He can't believe it's only been a handful of months since he... <i>changed</i>. He sometimes wonders if he dreamed that conversation he had with the man who turned out to be himself, and gave himself the name &quot;Ragnar.&quot; He still answers to Simon Collins in public, because how can he possibly expect anybody to believe him? All he knows is that he has this silver knife with some weird symbol that he just knows is his new name, and the power to... do stuff. Like he can tell what's going to happen, and change it. He's had plenty of time to think about it, what with driving across about five states to get here, and the only word he can think of to describe it is... magic. <br /> <br /> The first day of classes has started, and he's been assigned to a FYS under Dr. Vivian McCallister, a theoretical physicist who somehow got roped into teaching this. The doctor seems nice enough, but shockingly frail for a woman of her age. He's heard rumors that she's going through a rocky divorce. He'll probably have to give her an extra hand to help her get this class up and running. <br /> <br /> The students are too new to him to start making any real assumptions about how easy or difficult they'll be to manage. His eyes are resting on a few of the male students that he's already taking idle interest in- some athletic looking guys who are probably on sports teams, but also a burly exchange student- Oscar. The attention surprises Ragnar- he's never been with a guy who could be considered a bear, but something about the younger man is intriguing. There's a sense of experience to him that is undefinable, like he has seen things most people his age have never experienced. <br /> <br /> The darkening skies have been setting Ragnar on edge for the entire class. Suddenly, there's a clattering on the windows. <i>Ah, crap. Is that hail? The car isn't covered! I mean, it's not exactly brand new, but still... </i>Ragnar is debating asking Dr. McCallister for permission to move his beat up old car out of the weather once the class is situated, when suddenly, he stiffens. The sound of distant chimes rings in his ears, and he knows that it always means something strange, something <i>supernatural</i>, is happening. His head jerks towards the windows, trying to see of what he presumes is hail... isn't. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits+Composure-1=3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417920\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T19:01:03-07:00","id":930102,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> [<b>Active Sight:</b> Forces, Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None]<br /> [<b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10]</div> <div align=\"center\">[<b>Conditions:</b> Grieving (Guilty) | <b>Tilts:</b> None]</div> </div> <br /> Damn, that bastard really pulled a fast one on me. Four days, and absolutely no sign of him. Probably used magic to get me off his tail. The other mages did say I could open up my senses to magic. What was it? Mage Sight? Yeah, they called it Mage Sight. Just have to find his trail again and use it before he sees me coming. Maybe I can counter his magic next time. That'll have to wait, though.<br /> <br /> After a half day of fruitless hunting, I head back home on the train so I can get to work. It was uneventful, except for the sudden storm appearing. Is that hail? My blood quickens and my new tattoos start heating up. Magic's in the air alright, and it's similar to what I felt four days ago. So I look out the window to see what's up. Might as well practice this Mage Sight of mine, so I &quot;push away the Fallen World&quot; as the other mages instructed to reveal the dream realm, the Aether they called it, to my senses.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/417884#\" target=\"_blank\">Wits + Composure - 1 = 4 \u2192 3 successes</a><br /> <br /> Active Mage Sight: Forces, Prime</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 07-12-2016, 08:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T20:50:27-07:00","id":930149,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> Despite how incredibly dark it has quickly become, you can make out that the sounds coming from outside are indeed hail. Even those who aren't originally from Chicago are pretty sure that isn't normal, but to cast all doubts aside, your Mage Sight triggers sensations that are very obviously coming from the weather. <br /> <br /> Upon closer inspection, however, you notice something else: The hail is pitch <i>black</i>. And not just from the lack of clear light; the hail itself, ranging in size from small pebbles to larger than golf balls, is made of what appears to be ice with a pure black sheen. <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel, Lynx, and Ragnar</b><br /> After Oscar turns on the lights, a number of students begin murmuring to each other nervously. The students from northern Illinois had heard of Chicago's freaky weather patterns, and even took it as a source of pride that they've lived in or near a city with so many crazy storms. For many others, to have such a storm on the very first day of classes is unnerving, leading some to question their decision to study here. <br /> <br /> After a minute, the lights flicker, threatening to turn off altogether. The whispered murmurs in the classroom grow to a loud buzz. The woman who had spoken pales and begins to pack up her bag, and she's not the only one.<br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Nothing has ever felt so invigorating as casting a spell. A few days haven't made that feeling wear off one iota. <br /> <br /> For a fraction of a second, time seems to feel...heavier is the only way you can describe it. It's a subtle sensation, but you're an observant person, and you take it in eagerly. <br /> <br /> You don't hear a voice, per se; it's more like a presence that whispers to your soul instead of your ears. But even without hearing a word, Time speaks to you.<br /> <br /> The first answer comes quickly. <i>The storm will stop the train, and you will meet other mages.</i> But the second answer comes after a pregnant pause, as if the future were...deliberating. <i>It is unlikely.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You can clearly sense something outright magical is coming from outside the train. Then, you perceive another brief scent of smoke and incense, this one less noticeable but clearly there. You can't tell where it's coming from.<br /> <br /> As you look around, you notice the interior lights in the cabin flicker. There are 10 or 15 other people sitting down or holding onto bars along the ceiling. Many of them look nervous. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Am I correct that the smoke/incense thing is the narrative effect of your peripheral Mage Sight? That's all I mean to say you're noticing here. Also, I forgot to mention this in my first post, but Moonstone was the young man you saw who was at the library. He was there trying to meet with some of Hakim's contacts. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> With your normal vision, you can see the hail vividly through the window panes on the train car. You have a keen eye and you've seen these unnatural storms before.<br /> <br /> And then you open your eyes behind the Lie, letting the Supernal truth shine through. The mundane drifts to the background, abruptly muted in comparison. <br /> <br /> The very first thing you notice is that, unlike with your normal vision, the storm clouds outside are suffused with bright light. Mana crackles in the air, forming bolts resembling lightning, through the clouds hanging ominously over the city. In contrast, the hail somehow looks even darker, as if black holes have congealed into orbs to crash down from the sky. <br /> <br /> Wherever the hail hits the train car, you see electricity escape from its cables and dissipate with a hiss. You don't feel it in your body, but you can <i>see</i> the kinetic energy of the train weakening ever so slightly as the electricity in the car dims.<br /> <br /> The other thing that draws your attention is a young man sitting on the opposite side of the cabin. You see an aura of energy flare around him, and briefly perceive a strange warping sensation as if he were shrinking and expanding. It's disorienting, but you're able to stay focused on him. Without knowing how, you instinctively know that he has just cast a spell using Time magic. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> You are not affected by Moonstone's nimbus tilt because your Resolve exceeds his spell potency. I wasn't sure if you get to identify the Arcana used or not, so correct me if I'm mistaken. At Gnosis 1, you can only keep active Mage sight in effect for 1 minute before it begins to cost willpower. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T23:11:58-07:00","id":930191,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> [<b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None]<br /> [<b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10]</div> <div align=\"center\">[<b>Conditions:</b> Grieving (Guilty) | <b>Tilts:</b> None]</div> </div> <br /> It was overwhelming! It was like I was caught in a crashing tide of...pure energy? That's the best way I can describe it. Rivers of electricity flowed above, sending fingers down to the wheels to create motion that ebbed against the dull stuff of the train and passengers. The sky was filled with raw creation in the form of heavenly bolts and waves of movement, as if Zeus himself was preparing a strike. But instead of lightning, hail had rained down. The black hail I saw in my mundane sight was strange enough, but seeing them in my newfound Sight, they were even stranger. They were like raining sinkholes that tore into the electricity of the train's cables, which in turn dissipated the motion of the train itself. Clearly, the train was going to stop and I'd probably be late for work.<br /> <br /> Those thoughts were torn away by a sudden flash of golden sand in the corner of my eye and a timed crackling of energy around me, like it was a ticking clock. Turning to the source, I found it to be one of the passengers, though they stood out among the others. The other passengers were muted to my senses, irrelevant, but this one glowed with an inner light like mine. It wore a different nature, but it rang from the same place of my magic. This passenger was Awake like me. The sands swirled around him, distorting his image like a funhouse mirror does. Every ripple was precisely timed to a constant beat, or should I say a constant tick?<br /> <br /> The spell he was casting was definitely related to time. Is time one of the Arcana they talked about? Or part of one? I don't know. As fascinated as I was by it all, keeping my Sight open was taxing. Maintaining it even a little longer would be a Herculean task, so I reverted my senses to the mundane before then. Back in the real world (more like the fake world if I'm being honest with myself), I was still fixed on the time mage.<br /> <br /> {spoiler]Peripheral Mage Sight<br /> <br /> If Moonstone looks back at Phoenix's staring, Phoenix will reflexively divert his gaze somewhere else, most likely the window[/spoiler]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 07-12-2016, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T00:55:23-07:00","id":930233,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> (Active Sight: Mind, Space)<br /> (no spells)</b><br /> </div> Knowledge. True, Supernal knowledge, available with a thought and an act of will. Literally at his fingertips, thanks to his little homespun mudra. He squeezed his knees and smiled wide and giggled a little and took a deep breath. Just another weirdo on the train.<br /> <br /> Unlikely to die. That's good! Meet other mages. That's...value neutral. He'd met other mages that day already. Maybe there were more Consilium members on the train. They probably weren't anyone with malevolent intent, or he'd have &quot;better&quot; odds of dying. And even if they were, he was likely to survive the encounter. So, no reason to be anything but optimistic. Cautiously optimistic!<br /> <br /> Buff kid on the other side of the train, staring at him, visible in the reflection of the window Moonstone was staring out of. Creepy. He turned his head a little and glanced back at the guy and said out loud: &quot;Train's gonna stop soon. In this weather, I mean. Am I right?&quot;<br /> <br /> If Marlin was listening at all, hearing his voice would confirm it: this was the same chess-player and book-buyer he'd seen before. He looked back out the window and shoved his hands in his jacket pockets. &quot;Just being friendly.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then he opened his third eye. Metaphorically. Like metaphysically zooming out, his body and his thoughts and the other passengers and the train car and the train tracks and the storm clouds became points in Space, connected to each other, but none any more individually significant than a given black hailstone. Utter Pandemonium. Moonstone quoted to himself: &quot;Hell is empty, and all the devils are here!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Turning on Mind/Space sight and looking out at the hailstorm.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T01:53:01-07:00","id":930243,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; +1 to Perception rolls; 1 week duration)<br /> Mana: 10/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Black hail? Hva faen?</i></span><br /> <br /> He smells the tension in the air - the fear and worry. It forms a knot in his stomach; he grits his teeth, trying to draw in what's around him<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Faen... I'm scared... What </i>is<i> that?</i></span><br /> <br /> Then the lights start to flicker. The fear grows rougher, more primal inside of him, as people start to get up. The murmurs and scuffles create a din that mixes in with the hail, hammering against the windows and the building.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Deep breaths...</i></span><br /> <br /> One breath. Two. He draws in his environment - <i>revels</i> in it - as he remembers the forest and the mist, the shadows that threatened him from all angles. His hairs stand on end, but this time, it's <i>his</i> doing. His shadow shifts momentarily into that of a lynx, ready to react. With a small grin, he turns to face the room - now, he's prepared.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx casts Life 2 &quot;Heightened Senses&quot;, using his 2 Free Reaches to Instant Cast and Advanced Duration, with no other modifiers. With 2 Successes, he now has +1 to all Perception rolls for 1 Week or until cancelled.</span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418019\" target=\"_blank\">Heightened Senses \u2192 2 Successes</a>. And this time, I got the formatting right!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-14-2016, 12:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T06:36:15-07:00","id":930301,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> </div> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Mana: 10/10<br /> <br /> Ragnar's eyes widen as he looks out the window at the definitely-not-natural, <i>black </i>hail. Suddenly, the car seems like the least of my problems.<br /> <br /> Ragnar briefly debates reaching out for magic and doing something, but he decides against it. No sense in using magic if he has no clue what this is. <br /> <br /> The flickering of the lights agitates the class further. <i>We could have a panic on our hands. </i>He turns to face Dr. McCallister. &quot;Dr. McCallister, perhaps was should take a moment to see if there's any danger from the weather?&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning back to the window, he takes a moment to center himself, closes his eyes, and then opens them again, in that special way he learned to do after that day. <i>I have to know what the heck is going on. </i>He focuses to see the subtle flow of time, and the threads of fate that seem to coalesce around some people more than others. To truly <i>see</i> what is going on. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I activate Active Mage Sight with Fate and Time.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T06:45:37-07:00","id":930304,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>None</i><br /> [Mage Sight: Mind, Space]</div> <br /> <i>More magic, but closer; here, in the train? Could one of the other passengers be..? That young man </i>was <i>interested in the occult books...</i><br /> <br /> Binder breaths deeply, flaring his nose, trying to get a better handle on the source of the scent. The action itself does nothing, but the intent deepens his focus, opening his perceptions to Pandemonium.<br /> <br /> Despite everything going on around him, he can't help but spare some mental bandwidth for his son that goes something like: <i>Forest? In school, right. I'm so fucking glad that this stuff didn't start happening during the summer.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">@rwknoll: You interpreted correctly! &amp; thanks for the additional details!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T07:24:21-07:00","id":930318,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> [Mage Sight: Death, Matter]</div> <br /> Dr. Asphodel looks at Simon, then at the girl getting up to leave. &quot;H-hold on. N-nobody's going out in th, uh, that hail just yet, 'm'not letting y-you get hit by so-some golfball-ass ice ch-chunk.&quot; A few students give a weak, nervous giggle. &quot;Si-Simon, hold down th'fort. I'mma, I'm g'check outside quick.&quot; She opens her inner eyes, scuttling with deceptive speed toward the door...<br /> <br /> And then she stops, the prickling flaring up. With the jerky speed of a bird of prey, her head snaps around toward Oscar.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Active Mage Sight is up. I hope I'm doing this right!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T13:43:46-07:00","id":930505,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone and Binder</b><br /> As soon as you open your true Eyes, the world changes in front of you.<br /> <br /> You can see very clearly now that the storm is clearly made of pure magical energy. Through the lens of your Path, you can sense the minds of about 10-15 people in the train car and know instinctually that <i>all</i> of them are wide awake. But it's not your Mind sense that shows the most about this weather. As you look out at the Highstorm, for a brief moment, you think you see out of the corner of your eye <i>something</i> flash down on the street below. If you didn't know any better, it looked like a door made of the same shadowy substance as the hail falling against the train. Whatever it is, you sense a spatial warp around it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can each roll Int+Occult</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> The world seems dull by comparison as you let the Fallen World override your vision once more. Even without your Mage Sight, however, you can definitely see that the train is slowing down.<br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone, Binder, and Phoenix</b><br /> You hear a male voice make an announcement on the overhead speaker system, but it's cutting in and out. <i>&quot;Ladi-- ----men, we're hav-- some technic-- ---culties. Ple--- -ain calm and -------.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Then the speaker cuts out. The lights flicker, and then shut off entirely, flooding the train with darkness. After a shudder and a squeal, the train screeches to a halt, thankfully just as it pulls up to an exit platform. You notice that the lights are flickering or gone entirely on the platform, too.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You are currently under the effects of the Poor Light environment tilt. All visual-based Perception rolls are currently at -2.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> Your newly activated Mage Sight reveals waves of magic emanating from the storm hanging over the city, and from the hail clanging against the wall and windows. Through the lens of your Path, you don't perceive the storm or hail to have any direct impact on the threads of destiny or temporal warps. Glancing around the room, nothing along those lines jumps out to you, either.<br /> <br /> What you do see, however, is a shadow around one of the male undergrad students temporarily flash into the shape of some cat-like creature with long pointed ears. The man's nature appears, for just a moment, to be part animal, and you feel an echo of primary energy surge through you for just a moment. You can instinctually tell that he just cast a spell from the Life Arcanum.<br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> It's probably comforting to know that as you study the room with your Mage Sight, your Death sense indicates that everyone in the room does, in fact, have a soul and is currently alive. By studying the storm, you see that the clouds are filled with energy, but beyond that you're not sure what it might be. You are sure, though, that the hail is not causing any significant structural damage to the building itself.<br /> <br /> As your gaze passes over Oscar, you watch him use Awakened magic from the Life Arcanum. You temporarily feel a surge of primal energy pass through your body, and his soul flashes brightly for just a moment, but otherwise you notice no harmful effects to yourself.<br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar, Dr. Asphodel, and Lynx</b><br /> The lights dim, flicker again, and then shut off. Lynx can hear the air conditioning shut off with his heightened senses. Several students scream or shout in surprise, and more than a few jump to their feet and try to walk towards the door. &quot;I think we can go over the syllabus on Thursday,&quot; someone yells out sarcastically.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You are currently under the effects of the Poor Light environment tilt. All visual-based Perception rolls are currently at -2.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T14:45:49-07:00","id":930533,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Effects: Active Mage Sight (Fate, Time)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</div> <br /> Ragnar stands for a moment in total shock as he processes what he just saw. Oscar... just did magic. He reached out and called upon the powers of Life to affect himself. It's a profoundly happy moment for Ragnar, who has never encountered another magic-user before. He feels the urge to approach Oscar, to hug him, to celebrate that neither of them are unique, that they have a connection... <br /> <br /> He shakes his head. That can wait a minute. There are more important issues. The class is on the verge of panicking, and that's not going to help what could be a dangerous situation. He and Dr. McCallister need to take charge of the situation before the class gets any more agitated. <br /> <br /> &quot;Okay everybody! I know we're having some wild weather right now, but panicking is not going to help the situation. You need to stay calm and listen to Dr. McCallister. She'll tell you what to do.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I roll to calm the class down. Manipulation+Empathy+Status (UChicago)=5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418277\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T15:15:10-07:00","id":930543,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; +1 to Perception rolls; 1 week duration)<br /> Mana: 10/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The lights shutting off alongside the quiet din of the air conditioning fading tells Oscar that the electricity likely went out. The increasing discomfit of his fellow students appear to reach a high when the sarcastic comment rings through the air; then the TA's voice cuts through the budding chaos, and in the minuscule moment of quiet's beginning, Oscar takes a deep breath.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Thanks, Mr. Collins. One moment's all I need...</i></span><br /> <br /> He spots the door and briskly moves towards it. With his hand on the handle, he prepares to open it, senses on the ready...<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx does a Perception roll to draw in the environment, but garners no successes on his roll.</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418288\" target=\"_blank\">Perception roll, 5 dice: \u2192 0 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-14-2016, 12:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T16:08:20-07:00","id":930569,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> (Active Sight: Mind+Space)</b><br /> <br /> The train shuddered to a halt. Moonstone barely paid attention, except to tell the car: &quot;What did I tell you?&quot;<br /> <br /> As for the Real world outside the train: how little we know.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Intelligence 1 + Occult 4: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418302\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>. Moonstone doesn't know the world of magic as well as he thinks he does. Actually I should have applied a -2 to that roll because I have Active sight up just to see the shadow door, and I believe it's a roll unrelated to scrutinizing or casting magic. I'd like to turn that into a dramatic failure for a beat, if possible. Mistaken information?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T16:45:54-07:00","id":930587,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> [<b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision]<br /> [<b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10]</div> <div align=\"center\">[<b>Conditions:</b> Grieving (Guilty) | <b>Tilts:</b> None]</div> </div> <br /> Damn, the guy somehow noticed me. Ah well, not like it matters a whole lot. What really worries me is the storm outside. It's magical in nature, so maybe another mage is casting it? I don't think it was that other guy, as his spell was related to time, not storms. Wait, could it be...Anubis? I saw a storm just like this one when I was on his tail before. In fact, I think the other mages referred to it as the Deathstorm. So maybe Anubis was killing others with it before, which would mean he's now after me.<br /> <br /> Then the power starts cutting out on the train, making me a sitting duck in darkness. That won't stop me though. I've got magic of my own now, so I wave my hand across my face. To anyone else, it simply looks like I'm brushing the hair out of my eyes, but what I'm really doing is crossing my tattoo over my vision, focusing the symbol to enhance the potential of my senses to see past the dark.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Improv cast Nightvision p. 141; 2 free Reach, spent on Instant casting and Advanced Duration; No penalties, but increased primary factor Duration to 1 day; Dedicated Tool used as Path Tool for +1<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418307\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis + Forces + 1 = 4 dice \u2192 2 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Now unhindered by the failing light, I look throughout the entire car, keeping watch for Anubis or anything else that might pose a threat.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception check through the whole car, focusing on any threats or danger (keep in mind he does have the Danger Sense Merit), I don't believe the roll is penalized now that darkness doesn't affect him, but correct the roll if I'm wrong.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418323\" target=\"_blank\">Wits + Composure = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 07-13-2016, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T17:11:55-07:00","id":930602,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Effects: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception Rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 10/10<br /> </div> Seeing Oscar move towards the door, Ragnar releases his focus on his Mage Sight and moves to intercept him. &quot;Oscar, isn't it? I know you may be freaked up, but you really have to stay here and wait for Dr. McCallister's instructions.&quot; He then leans in close to Oscar. &quot;You just used magic,&quot; he whispers, &quot;didn't you? Something to affect your body, I think. I can use magic too, that's how I knew. I know this storm isn't normal. It's got magical properties, but I couldn't tell what kind. Listen, if you're willing, you and I can take a look at this ourselves. But I think we should wait until Dr. McCallister lets the class leave.&quot; <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T17:50:35-07:00","id":930617,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> To your pleasant surprise, a number of the students stop moving and turn to you concernedly. It's hard to see their faces, and several kids mutter annoyedly as they bump into each other in the dark. It takes a moment before someone realizes they can use their phone flashlight for a little illumination, but it's still pitch black outside. A number of the kids are still lined up by the door, but no one is bolting yet. You're not sure how long they'll listen to you, though.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I assumed you turned off Mage Sight before making the roll, but even with a -2 you'd get 1 success.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You know from walking into the class earlier that the door you're standing by leads into a short hallway, which procedes to a main lobby, a set of stairs, and the main exit to the building. You can't hear anything noteworthy through the door, even with your heightened senses, mostly because of the loud din in the room. The sound of hail clattering against the windows is still loud to your ears.<br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> As you study the shadowy door precisely 15 feet along the platform, down stairs to the ground level 25 feet below, and 37.5 feet around the corner of the nearest building, you distinctly recall a conversation with one of Hakim's acquaintances who told you about portals to the Abyss. He told a chilling story about these doorways, which sound <i>exactly</i> like the one you're seeing, in which near-omnipotent supernatural monsters break into the Fallen World and feed on nearby victims to harvest their Essence. He never quite told you how far away they could reach...Did something just move in the shadows by the door?<br /> <br /> Another thought pops into your mind: How unlikely is &quot;unlikely&quot;, exactly?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Take a Beat for the dramatic failure on the occult check. You gain the Spooked condition (p. 318).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Your vision changes again, but in a much different way; despite the darkness suffusing the train car, you can see everyone on the train relatively clearly. A middle-aged mother comforts her young girl, but her own face looks concerned. One athletic man in the corner, who looks to be in his mid-20s and is wearing a leather jacket, shifts in his seat nervously, eyes flickering towards the door. A few other people seem undisturbed but clearly annoyed (&quot;This is bullshit man!&quot;). You don't see any clear threats...for the moment.<br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> If you still have Mage Sight active, you see a flash of energy form around a young man, probably 20 years old, who's staring intently outside the window of the train car and at the other people in the train. His eyes seem to crack, as if leaking energy. You instinctively know it's some kind of Forces spell he cast on himself.<br /> <br /> If you don't have active Mage Sight on, you don't see anything in particular but have another odd sense of something supernatural happening near you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T20:29:41-07:00","id":930683,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> (Active Sight: none)<br /> (Conditions: Spooked)</b><br /> <br /> Okay. Okay. So <i>he</i> isn't going to die, but <i>everyone else</i> might. And it's because the monsters on the other side of the nightmare door can smell his magic, and they're going to try to eat him and the other mages that he's going to meet. So, you know, more or less, he just doomed everyone on the car to be harvested for Essence. All because he Awakened.<br /> <br /> &quot;Nope! Too much. That's enough. Stop the train, I want to get off- oh, it has, good.&quot;<br /> <br /> Moonstone, frantically talking to himself in line with the general disquiet on the train, returned his sight to the Fallen world (can't let the monsters know he sees them!) and stood up and gracefully crossed the dark train to the interior door and attempted to open it. Surely <i>all </i>of the power can't have gone off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T20:36:57-07:00","id":930689,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>None</i><br /> [Mage Sight: Mind, Space (ends in this post)]</div> <br /> Binder is mildly surprised to see that it's <i>not</i> the young man he recognized, but rather someone else entirely, casting a spell. He tries to keep cool and not stare, allowing his Mage Sight to end.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Just a quick post before bed<br /> <br /> To see if Pheonix notices Binder noticing him!<br /> Composure + Subterfuge = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418420\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes!</a><br /> <br /> Furthermore, that Int + Occult check that was called for earlier:<br /> Intelligence + Occult = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418424\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T21:56:52-07:00","id":930715,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> [<b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision]<br /> [<b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10]<br /> [<b>Conditions:</b> Grieving (Guilty) | <b>Tilts:</b> None]</div><br /> Scanning the room, I see no obvious threats, just people being concerned over the train shutting down. Nothing out of the ordinary, except for the Deathstorm.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Contesting Binder's Composure + Subterfuge roll<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418438\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Empathy 2 = 5 dice \u2192 1 successes</a><br /> <br /> Not really focusing on Binder since he doesn't appear to be a threat, so Phoenix doesn't even notice a bit</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Then, that one time mage suddenly gets up from his seat and heads straight for the door.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Reading Moonstone's emotional state<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418441\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Empathy 2 = 5 dice \u2192 0 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Guess he's in a hurry, but I doubt he's gonna get far. He is a fellow mage though, so maybe we can put our heads together to get outta this mess. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Maybe we should wait for the staff to help us out,</span>&quot; I suggest as I approach, letting him know I'm coming up to him. Then I lean in to whisper &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Though truth be told, I don't think they can, you and I both know this is no ordinary storm. I saw you cast that spell before, that's why I was staring at you. I'm a mage like you, so I'm thinking if we work together, we can work this out.</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T23:38:52-07:00","id":930734,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> (Active Sight: none, Active Spells: Telepathy [concentration/scene duration], Conditions: Spooked)</b></div> <br /> It's dark and confusing and Phoenix can't quite tell what's up with the time mage, except that he's in a hurry to leave.<br /> <br /> Moonstone tensed up when staring-guy came over to the door, but visibly calmed down with his whispered explanation. Thanks to his divination, he was noticeably not surprised. Whispered back: &quot;Understood. We're going to meet at least one more.&quot;<br /> <br /> He closed his eyes and rested one hand on the overhead bar and the other hand on the man's shoulder, and his thoughts bloomed.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Mind 2 Telepathy, touch range. 1 reach to instant cast, 1 reach for scene duration (although it ends if I stop concentrating or touching him), 1 reach to let both of us send and receive thoughts. 2 Paradox dice, going to Release if one happens because I don't know any better. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418463\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1+Mind 2, -2 for +1 Potency to get past Withstand, +2 for Concentration yantra, +3 for spending a Willpower. 6 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418464\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thoughts from an unfamiliar source crept into Phoenix's mind. A voice like the time mage's in a more feminine register was narrating, with some stray ideas and vague feelings slipping through. His thoughts were like messy flyaway hair next to a clean crew cut:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;<span style=\"font-size:9px\">(all gonna die like He did - pop the door pop the door - this guy's gotta be the first one)</span><br /> <b>Do not be afraid. I am thinking at you, but I am not reading or taking. </b><span style=\"font-size:9px\">(i don't think so at least)</span><br /> <b>I saw a dark portal on the street below us. It is related to the storm. </b><span style=\"font-size:9px\">(it's an Abyss door and monsters are gonna come out)</span><br /> <b>I feel that we need to leave the train. We are not safe in here. </b><span style=\"font-size:9px\">(or anywhere)</span><br /> <b>I can squeeze us through this door, but it is obvious magic. I can also make us </b><span style=\"font-size:9px\">(small - ignored - quiet)</span> <b>unseen.<br /> Think back and I promise I will hear it. I feel that we should not speak of magic in detail out loud. </b><span style=\"font-size:9px\">(fuck me i hope this works)</span>&quot;</i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T05:23:35-07:00","id":930783,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; +1 to Perception rolls; 1 week duration)<br /> Mana: 10/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The constant noise from his fellow students leaves Oscar with a frustrated sigh - despite Simon's attempt to quell the turmoil, it seems a temporary solution at best.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Panicking isn't going to help right now. I'll give Mr. Collins a hand.</i></span><br /> <br /> &quot;Everybody,&quot; he calls out loudly, putting emphasis on his accent - fluent, rather British too - &quot;Everybody, let's try to calm down! I know it's scary, but take some deep breaths! I'm sure everything's going to be fine, okay? We'll make it through together.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx attempts to calm down the room with a presence and empathy roll, and gets 3 successes.</span></b><br /> <br /> He makes sure to block the door - <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Hallway's probably safe, but...</i></span> - as he waits to see if the room calms down... Then Mr. Collins approaches him. He's momentarily startled - yet at his words he feels glee build inside of him.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Other people can do magic too!? Oh hells yes.</i></span><br /> <br /> &quot;I did, yeah... heightened my senses. Everybody's too loud, though, I can't sense much. I just wanted to know if something's in the hallway, but I wasn't thinking of leaving, don't worry. And how could you tell that storm's... y'know...&quot; Oscar does an exaggerated gesture and a soft whooshing sound.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418511\" target=\"_blank\">Empathy roll to calm down classroom, 6 dice </a><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418511\" target=\"_blank\">\u2192</a><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418511\" target=\"_blank\"> 3 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-14-2016, 12:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T07:35:58-07:00","id":930837,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (-2 to vision-based Perception)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 10/10</div> <br /> Ragnar struggles to explain his sight, but comes up short and shrugs. &quot;It's kind of hard to describe. Sometimes, when something...&quot; he shrugs again. &quot;... Weird is going on, I get this sense. Like, somebody's playing chimes somewhere. And if I focus my sight, I can see things. Like a third eye or something, I guess; choices and alternate paths, and the flow of time.&quot; He looks Oscar in the eye, suddenly serious. &quot;I took a look at the storm. It's not changing how things are going to play out, and time doesn't seem to be stopping, or going backwards, or anything bizarre. But I've got a feeling we have different specialties when it comes to magic, because I can't do anything like that sense-heightening thing you did. Did you notice anything?&quot; <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T10:15:57-07:00","id":930919,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> Before anyone else even moves, you scramble up to the door of the train car, but it doesn't slide open. However, you can tell that it might open with a hard push, and there's a clear sign indicating to push open in the case of emergencies.<br /> <br /> When you attempt to cast your spell, you can sense yourself <i>reaching</i> in some way, straining to push the limits of your Mind magic. But it works without a hitch, and you can feel the tendrils of energy carrying the surface thoughts back and forth between the two of you.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Anyone on the train can try and force the door open by rolling Strength + Stamina (no modifiers).<br /> <br /> If you attempt to cast any obvious spell, on your next roll add 1 paradox die due to cumulative bonuses, add 1 die due to the presence of Sleeper witnesses, and give the overall paradox roll the 9-again quality.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> Just before you lower your Mage Sight, you <i>do</i> notice the man you recognized cast a Mind spell on the other mage in the train standing next to him. For a split second, he seems to shrink and then grow before your eyes in a disorienting way. To your Supernal vision, you see some kind of faint connection form between their minds as they look at each other. It fades as your Mage Sight fades.<br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> If you hadn't already sensed that Moonstone was a mage, perhaps you would have been surprised when he casts a spell on you. You hear a voice in your head -- this mage's voice -- although it's a foreign feeling that is somewhat unnerving.<br /> <br /> <b>Lynx and Ragnar</b><br /> Perhaps it's because he's slightly older than most of the American students, or because of how his voice cuts through the buzz of noise in the room, but Oscar's words and presence catch even more of the other students' attention than the graduate TA's did. The students grumble a little, but they form a semblance of a line leading up to the front door and don't try to bolt. Most of them have pulled out their phone flashlights at this point, adding enough light to the room that it's quite easier to see -- especially to Oscar's currently heightened senses.<br /> <br /> As the two mages begin to converse about magic, a young woman standing near you -- the same one who interrupted class to point out the storm -- looks up from her cell phone and gives a puzzling look to each of you in turn. Despite the ambient noise in the room, she seems like she might have overheard you talking to each other. &quot;Wait, what are you talking about?&quot; she asks pointedly.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The penalty to visual Perception rolls in the classroom is down to -1.<br /> <br /> Despite giving a -1 penalty due to the commotion in the room, someone rolled well to hear you: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418572\" target=\"_blank\">Eavesdrop (Wits 2 + Composure 2 - 1)</a>: 2 successes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12046\" data-vbnamecard=\"12046\">Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon</a>, this is a minor request, but can you do me a favor and not put quotation marks around your inner dialogue? Or, alternatively, do what crapcarp does and use a colored font for your spoken text? I keep mistaking that for spoken words. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Formatting 07-13-2016, 01:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T10:34:49-07:00","id":930931,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR </b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (-2 to vision-based Perception)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 10/10</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ragnar turns to the girl. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Ah. Well. This is awkward.</span> </i>&quot;It's nothing, just a tabletop game we're trying to put together. Sorry about that.&quot; Turning back to Oscar, he says, &quot;We'll talk about it later.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I roll to persuade the girl that we were talking about a fictional game. Manipulation 3 +Subterfuge 0+Status 1= 4-1=3 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418622\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":".  Changed my roll from Persuasion to Subterfuge-based 07-13-2016, 02:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T10:45:51-07:00","id":930935,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Because you're trying to lie, rather than just change her mind, I instead want you to roll Manipulation + Subterfuge + Status (UChicago) contested by her Wits + Empathy. Because you don't have dots in Subterfuge, it's at -1; however, you get another chance to try and succeed.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418594\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 2 + Empathy 1</a>: <b>1 success</b>.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T11:31:00-07:00","id":930950,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 4/5. Mana: 10/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -1)</b></div> <br /> <br /> Oscar feels a tinge of exasperation - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Faen... excitement got the best of me...</span></i> - but the exasperation turns to relief as Simon attempts to smooth things over. Oscar nods in quiet agreement, trying not to give anything away with a small smile.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: </span><span style=\"color:#800000\">Lynx attempts to confirm Ragnar's lie by acting naturally, and gets 3 successes.</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Dice pool for Subterfuge attempt: Composure (3) + Subterfuge (-1) + Willpower (+3), total dice 5. </span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418632\" target=\"_blank\">Subterfuge roll to fool the girl </a><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418632\" target=\"_blank\">\u2192 3 successes</a><br /> <br /> @rwknoll: I put thoughts in italics, and actions in bold - is this better? I'm still trying to figure out the best way to format everything...</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-14-2016, 12:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T12:29:57-07:00","id":930982,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx and Ragnar</b><br /> The girl has a blank look on her face in response. She rolls her eyes and looks back to her phone, where she's already back to scrolling through her Twitter feed. With his sensitive hearing, Oscar hears her mutter something under her breath about &quot;nerds.&quot; She's still standing near you, but seems to have bought the ruse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T13:13:47-07:00","id":931002,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix)</i><br /> Willpower: 6/7</div> <br /> <br /> <i>They're </i>both <i>mages? I'm worried about this storm, and that door seems tantalizing, but finding out more about these guys is more important. Need to make sure I don't loose them in the crowd, and for now I want to observe them before approaching...</i><br /> <br /> Binder concentrates, picturing what he want: a visible thread connecting him and his subjects. It has little application to the spell, but he reaches into his messenger bag, past a couple library books, and grabs the hilt of the brass knife hidden within. Part of his summoning's altar furniture, in the couple weeks since Binder has discovered the additional focus it gives him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Locate Object </i>(Space 1)<br /> 2 Free Reach; spending for instant speed, sensory range, duration, scale, and the option to follow outside the spell's area.<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 3 - 2 (dedicated tool) = 1 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418700\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes!</a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Willpower 3 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418701\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes!</a><br /> Potency 1, Adv Duration Day, Adv Scale 5 subjects</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The spell winds into place and Binder, smelling his own magic, suddenly realizes that if he can sense magic, they probably can, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-13-2016, 04:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T13:39:14-07:00","id":931009,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> (Forgot to add this part earlier, sorry). As you glimpse at the shadowy door appearing down the stairs and around the corner of a nearby building, you remember something you read out of a book. It was something that a customer brought to you and shared, saying that they thought you might find it interesting. Most of it seemed obscure and a little farfetched, but every now and then a section gave you pause. One part that you remember reading talked about &quot;doors&quot; to other realms, that some people could use to travel to other dimensions or lands. Now that you have Awakened, and can see this door in front of you with your Mage Sight active, a part of you believes that maybe there was a hint of Supernal truth in that book -- which makes you wonder a bit more about what else was in there. You know it's still back at your bookstore, somewhere.<br /> <br /> Your spell takes hold, giving you a precise sense of how far away they are, as they tug on you like a mental compass.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm still learning, but I'm surprised this doesn't have a Withstand attribute. It strikes me as the kind of thing someone might not always want cast on them. I'll leave it as it is now, though.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone and Phoenix</b><br /> On the periphery of your Supernal senses, you each detect some new magical effect forming in the vicinity. You're not sure what it was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T05:32:27-07:00","id":931286,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> [<b>Active Sight:</b> Forces, Prime (ends after post) | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Supernal Vision (ends after post)]<br /> [<b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10]<br /> [<b>Conditions:</b> Grieving (Guilty) | <b>Tilts:</b> None]</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> At least one other mage? Maybe Anubis isn't targeting just me. But that thought got thrown out the window when the time mage started talking to me in my head. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><i><sub>(Whoa, personal space, bud!)</sub> So we're telepathically communicating? <sub>(More like the boundaries between all minds are lifted from ours in particular, allowing us to share our communicated thoughts)</sub></i></span>&quot; my thoughts swim to his mind, &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><i>Good idea, wouldn't want the Muggles to know. <sub>(or Anubis) </sub>The Abyss? Oh, that. That's a really bad thing for us, so yeah let's get outta here. Before using magic though, let's see if I can't open the door myself.</i></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Before I try, my blood starts flaring again, something's up. Maybe it's coming from one of these other mages, so I focus on the Aether again, the flood of power just as fresh as before. That, and the last time was quite taxing on it's own, so I only keep my Sight long enough to see a spell that's been cast on both of us, but I don't know who. Damn, just missed them, and I can't open my Sight again without seriously pushing myself. Although, I do know of one spell that could tell me. It was once my magical sense, transformed into magic itself when I was reborn. I project the sense outwards, though it takes a bit of effort due to my other spell and trying to see through all the other passengers, so I force it through and cross my tattoo over my vision for good measure.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Praxis cast Supernal Vision p 166; 2 Free Reach, spending 3 on instant casting, spell above limit, and advanced Scale; -2 for 10 subjects; +1 Yantra from Dedicated Tool; 1 Paradox die, containing<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418928\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox 1 = 1 die \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418929\" target=\"_blank\">Wisdom 7 = 7 dice \u2192 4 successes</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/418927\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Forces 2 + 3 WP + 1 Dedicated Tool - 2 Scale Factor = 5 dice \u2192 3 successes!!!</a><br /> <br /> Resistant wound is represented in bold; Taking Condition for exceptional success (represented with the exclamation points)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The spell starts to slip from my grip, but I manage to pull it back under control with my heart, which horrendously pounds in protest. I grunt a little and instinctively grip my chest. It feels like someone put it in a big vice grip and started squeezing. While it ended in a second or so, it hurt like hell. That definitely ripped a few veins open, though the damage isn't too serious, I hope.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 07-14-2016, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T05:43:48-07:00","id":931290,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: None<br /> Tilts: Poor Light, -1 visual Perception<br /> </div> She notices Simon talking to Oscar about something---she can't make it out, but she wonders if perhaps... but that'd make three of them in one room. Coincidence, or something more? She'll get back to her thoughts later, though.<br /> She pulls out her keyring, turning on its flashlight. &quot;H-h-here's wh'we're gn'do. I-I-I'll go out and se-see if it's, ah, safe enough to let y'out just yet---'f not, might have t-t-t'keep you, uh, here til it calms down, s-so ke-keep that in mind. Til I-I come back, stay h-here. Simon, y-y-you're in charge while I'm out, h-hopefully not long.&quot;<br /> <br /> She starts to skitter toward the door, a herky-jerky rhythm of legs and cane making her faster than most would expect.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T09:52:49-07:00","id":931419,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 4/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -1)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> With Dr. McCallister's arrival and consequent display of authority, Oscar, who stands closest to the door, commits to courtesy and opens it for her.<br /> <br /> &quot;Be careful, Doctor,&quot; he murmurs when she passes him by. As the Doctor moves to exit, Oscar diverts his senses into the hallway.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: With the door now open, Lynx attempts another perception roll (prior to activating Mage Sight) to see if anything's in the hallway, and gets 1 success.</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">If Simon's right, and this storm's supernatural, does that mean there might be something in the shadows...? If only I could converse with Simon without anybody listening in. If only I could... He said third eye, didn't he? Flow of time and decisions? Is that something like a... a sixth sense?</span></i><br /> <br /> He mulls Simon's words in his head for a couple of seconds. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">We're both magic. He says to focus his sight... but there are so many other senses... ...!</span></i><br /> <br /> The sensation rushes to him - the touch of the mist-filled forest, the tension of shadows lurking, the memory of being both prey and predator... Before him, just out of reach within the fog, is the familiar shape from when he Stirred to life. The touch of mist prickles on his skin - he tastes the forest on his lips - smells the indescribably alluring scent of... of...<br /> <br /> He opens his senses to the Primal Wild.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx activates Mage Sight for the first time. He expends 1 Mana to activate Fate alongside Life and Spirit as he doesn't know how to control it. His sensory experience draws equally from sight, smell, and sound.</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Dice pool for Perception attempt: Wits (3) + Composure (3) + Heightened Senses (+1) - Poor Light Tilt (-1), total dice 6. </span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419001\" target=\"_blank\">Perception roll to sense if anything is in the hallway \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-14-2016, 12:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T11:06:41-07:00","id":931468,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 10</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ragnar allows himself a mental sigh of relief. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bSaved by the prof. I need to be more aware of who's around me when I start talking about magic. </span></i>He is surprised by the quickness with which Dr. McCallister heads for the door. <i>Not so frail after all. </i><br /> <br /> He briefly glances at Oscar, and notices that he has a focused expression, like he's examining things that others can't see. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Is he using his third eye? </span></i>Suddenly, Ragnar feels the urge to show off to Oscar, prove his magical ability to him, impress the younger man. He decides to use a particular trick he learned, an ability that allows him to really help people's luck. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bYou can play around with biology, big guy? Well, how about somebody who can play around with luck?</span></i><br /> <br /> Ragnar mentally reaches out for the threads of fate and luck that bind all people, specifically the ones that attach to himself. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Let's make me the man with the golden voice, eh?</i></span> He reaches out and tugs on the strings, putting a little extra effort into it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I cast my Exceptional Luck Fate 2 Praxis on myself for a 9-Again boon; I use the free Reach to make it Instant casting, and then another Reach to give the boon the 8-Again quality.<br /> <br /> Paradox 1= 1 die -&gt;<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419033\" target=\"_blank\"> No success</a><br /> <br /> Exceptional Luck: Gnosis 1+ Fate 2+ WP 3= 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419035\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes! </a><br /> <br /> Using the chart for spell-casting rolls, I decide to give Ragnar the Inspired Condition, since the spell went quite well, and he wanted to cast the spell to impress Lynx in the first place.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ragnar suddenly feels like his body has aged 20 years, but the strings of fate respond well to his touch, and he is suddenly filled with the knowledge that he's probably going to have the class's undivided attention when he opens his mouth. He turns to face the class.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, guys! Dr. McCallister is going to step out for a moment to make sure everything is fine! In the meantime, please return to your seats. You can talk quietly amongst yourselves until Dr. McCallister returns.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I attempt to exert authority over the class and settle everybody down. Presence 2+ Persuasion 2+ Status 1= 5 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419042\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> I spent a single point of Willpower to fuel my spell, but this was recouped thanks to the Exceptional success on the casting roll, and I now have the Inspired Condition. This will be noted in my next IC post.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":".  Accounted for the recouped Willpower from the Exceptional success 07-15-2016, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T04:22:17-07:00","id":931918,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> (Active Spells: Telepathy w/Phoenix [ends during post], Emotional Urging [Potency 3, scene/concentration duration]. Active Sight: None. Active Conditions: Spooked, Poor Light)</b><br /> </div> Less focused thoughts and images drifted back: <b><i>&quot;Lifting boundaries = yes precisely. Smart kid! I am <u>Moonstone</u>. Let me try first. </i></b><i>(hanging up now-)</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> He lifted his hand off the magician's shoulder and the spell faded at once. Not the first time he'd communicated telepathically, but definitely the first time he'd controlled it. Exciting! Magic is easy and cool and makes him feel powerful. Now, let's try this big bar that says to push it in case of emergencies.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Strength+Stamina=4 dice, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419231\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> With a bit of elbow grease and shoulder work, anything is possible. He calls out to the people in the car: &quot;We'll be safer outside on the platform. Stay happy. Help is coming.&quot;<br /> <br /> And as he talks, he forms an image of himself in his mind: capable, respected, trustworthy, Liberty Leading the People. It looks like Hakim. He projects the image outward with his voice.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Improvising a Mind 2 spell, somewhere between Emotional Urging and Psychic Domination. Not a direct command, but creating a feeling of &quot;follow the leader in a calm, orderly fashion.&quot; The instinct that makes people defer to whoever takes responsibility in a crisis situation. Primary factor Potency, Withstood by either Resolve or Composure. Subject of the spell is everyone in the car, including Binder (because he's just another passenger, of course) but excluding Moonstone and Phoenix. Final Potency will be 3, so it affects people with 2 or less [Resolve or Composure].<br /> <br /> Spending my 1 free Reach on instant casting. +1 Reach for sensory range, +1 Reach for advanced duration, +1 Reach for advanced scale. Base dicepool is Gnosis 1 + Mind 2 = 3. Spell factors: -2 for +1 Potency, -2 for 10 subjects. Yantras: +2 for Concentration. +3 for spending 1 Willpower. Total dicepool = 4.<br /> <br /> Going to attempt to contain any Paradox. Dicepool: +3 for 3 Reach, +1 for earlier Paradox roll, +1 for Sleeper witnesses = 5 dice with 9-again. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419244\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>.<br /> Rolling Wisdom to contain it, 7 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419246\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a> Hoo boy. I take 1 resistant bashing damage, as well as whatever Paradox Condition 3 remaining successes gives me.<br /> <br /> Anyway, here's that spellcasting roll with 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419248\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes.</a> Spell takes effect with Potency 3, scene duration (or until I stop concentrating).</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T11:49:45-07:00","id":932124,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> You eagerly cast your spell, trying to study the train car before anyone leaves. But as you do, you can sense that the magic fueling your night vision muddles your mortal mind's ability to call upon the Supernal as clearly; it's as if the current of magic swirling around you makes it harder to sense the Aether. You reach through it, forcing your Imago into place - and you can instantly tell that <i>something</i> tries to push back.<br /> <br /> Reflexively, with a knowledge that you didn't realize you had, you sense the dangers of Paradox and pull the danger into your body. Your heart aches, causing you to gasp briefly as you clutch at your chest, but a part of you knows that somehow the damage is greater than what might have happened if you hadn't tried to contain the Paradox yourself.<br /> <br /> The feeling fades, and just like that, the Supernal truth shines from among the crowd. And there, shining like a beacon, is a man in the crowd that you know is another mage. Your soul quietly sings to you, calls out to you with senses you can't describe. You see that he is not on the Path to the Aether, as you are; his is the Path to Pandemonium. You perceive a scarlet red haze and black incense swirl around him, and briefly smell sulfur. But you can also tell that like you, he is a relatively inexperienced mage: his raw ability to channel the Supernal realm is fairly comparable to yours.<br /> <br /> No other beings on the train give off an aura of the Supernal realm.<br /> <br /> Your instinctive ability to contain the Paradox, and your success with identifying another mage exactly as you intended, fill you with a sense of pride and accomplishment. You can use magic. You feel like you could do <i>anything.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As discussed, you take 1 resistant bashing damage; recover 1 spent WP; and gain the Inspired condition, which will grant an Arcane Beat upon resolution.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> You look into the hallway and are met with darkness. You see a few students ahead of you with phone flashlights out, coming out of another classroom down the hallway and across from your own. There are three windows on the left side of the hallway that look out into the streets on the ground floor, one story below, but it's pitch black out.<br /> <br /> Between the commotion in the room and the time it took for you to get past the throng of students, as well as the time between when the sky grew dark and when the lights went out, it's been about 5 or 10 minutes altogether. The hail sounds like it's still falling. Otherwise, you see no sign of danger.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> With your keen eyes and ears, you clearly see students walking out of a classroom on the opposite end of the hallway. Through the darkness, you glimpse that they look nervous but not frightened per see. You also faintly catch words from the other instructor drift towards you, saying to &quot;head down to the ground floor and stay inside.&quot; The hail is still falling from the sky.<br /> <br /> All of that information pales in sharp contrast to your <i>true</i> senses, as you reach out to study the Fallen World through the lens of the Primal Wild.<br /> <br /> There is a certain beauty to the storm, which you can see now is clearly a magical phenomenon, but your connection to the Primal Wild doesn't necessarily tell you much about the storm itself. Through a nearby window, you can see hail striking the ground, but it does not appear to weaken or sap the life essence of the plants. But now that you have opened your Sight, you see <i>beyond</i> the Fallen World, through an invisible veil to a shadowy realm Beyond. Where the hail strikes that shadowy curtain, it sometimes fades, leaving hairline cracks. Other pieces of black hail pass through the membrane, and those ones create an audible sizzling sound that's so loud it makes you wonder why no one is covering their ears in pain. There is an acrimonious smell, like acid rain burning the air. There are spirits floating there, which you've seen everywhere since you Awakened, and they seem to flee wherever the hail breaks through that curtain.<br /> <br /> You feel some Supernal energy pass from the personal well that you know as your soul, and you can sense the flow of destiny between and around those in the room, which you perceive as a faint odor emanating from each person and mixing together. You know that this sense is less familiar to you, as it hails from a different realm than the Primal Wild, but otherwise it's hard to take anything away from this particular situation.<br /> <br /> As you study the room, two things draw your attention. One, there is a young woman standing by a window and facing the storm with a curious expression. To your Spirit Sight, however, she evokes a smell of fresh rain falling on a dry night. There's no better way to describe it. She seems diaphanous in some way, as if her flesh fluctuates between solid and immaterial; the closest thing you have ever seen that it reminds you of is some kind of spirit. She's clearly human, and very much alive, but yet...something else.<br /> <br /> The second thing that draws your attention is Simon. Time seems to hasten around him, and the eddies of time catch you in it. You feel your muscles briefly weaken, as if you are leaping ahead in age for just a few moments; you can tell that he has just cast a Fate spell on himself, but this seems to be some kind of unintended consequence of watching his spellcasting in action. To your active Fate Sight, those mingling odors from the students pause and swirl more tightly together as he speaks. You hear a lion's roar echo behind Simon's words as all of the students heed his request.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You can sense, for the briefest of moments, a kind of strain as you reach to force the Imago of your Fate spell into being. The Fallen World itself seemed to be pushing back, but you slapped it silly and told the universe who was in charge.<br /> <br /> You open your mouth to speak, and somehow happen to say <i>exactly</i> what these students needed to hear. One student happens to finish a text just as you start to open your mouth, and it's a pure coincidence that this is the first time he's bothered to pay attention to the room for the last 10 minutes. Another girl is busy talking to a friend, but is interrupted by a cough <i>just</i> before you speak, giving her curious friend a chance to listen to you instead. At hearing your words, their grumbling ceases and they politely make their way back to their seats, some perhaps surprised at how authoritative you seem as a TA.<br /> <br /> None of the students seem to notice, but it brings a smile to your face watching the students' fates briefly align with your intent. Having their rapt attention feels <i>so</i> good that you feel like you could do anything, now.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain the Inspired condition as discussed, which will grant an Arcane Beat upon resolution. You also gain a WP back, as you already noted.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> It takes a little bit of elbow grease, but you're able to manually force the door open. Fresh air passes into the train, and you can more clearly see large balls of black ice falling to the platform around you.<br /> <br /> Emboldened by your mundane and magical success, you flex your creative ingenuity and try something new. In the process, you reach far beyond what you've tried before -- and suddenly you sense a terrible danger.<br /> <br /> You don't know how to describe it, but the universe <i>shifts </i>in response to your willworking, and it has its eyes on you. Instinctively, this time you try to fight back, quelling the Paradox arising from your efforts to shift reality. But you're new to this, and you don't quite know how to masterly grapple with the weight of the Lie. It...bleeds into you, shifting your aura, tainting it.<br /> <br /> You suddenly have the sense of an unseen eye, lurking in the shadows, watching you, <i>waiting</i> for something. You hear a throaty laugh from Beyond, followed by a chilling silence.<br /> <br /> As the words roll off your tongue, though, people look up at you and find themselves nodding in agreement. The little girl being comforted by her mother looks up at you and wipes away a tear, then manages a weak smile. The girl's mother looks at you and also smiles in relief.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I want to modify your spell a little bit here before we resolve it.<br /> <br /> First, I think all spells need to have only 1 Withstand trait. As a Mind spell and overall trying to urge their will in a subtle way, let's go with Resolve as the Withstand trait.<br /> <br /> Second, I don't think this spell would qualify as obvious magic, so having Sleepers doesn't enhance the Paradox roll. So, I want to make it only 4 dice and no 9-again quality. That turns it into only 2 successes on the Paradox roll. You negate one with your Wisdom roll, leaving only 1 success instead of 3.<br /> <br /> You gain the <b>Abyssal Nimbus </b>condition (p. 116). Until the end of this chapter or in-game day, you gain the Resonant condition for Abyssal entities, and your nimbus takes on qualities of the Abyss. It also affects anyone who Scrutinizes your nimbus or someone affected by your nimbus tilt.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T12:40:04-07:00","id":932137,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 3/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -1)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">This is...</span></i><br /> <br /> Oscar shivers and winces slightly - his senses opened, he feels as though they are afire. He struggles momentarily to observe the storm, yet in time, for all its mystery, it <i>is</i> beautiful. His face falters slightly as he watches his spiritual kin dodge the hail, as though it is dangerous to them, and the beauty lessens considerably. His nose twitches at the peculiarity of...<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">...Destiny? Wait, destiny has its own smell?</span></i><br /> <br /> ...But the seamless mingling of the odour leaves him both wanting and calmed. He blinks slowly, his environ unimportant to the sensation that permeates his flesh, his mind, his very being.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">This must be what Simon meant. Doesn't feel like I've got a third eye, though... but... wow...<br /> <br /> ...Who's that?</span></i><br /> <br /> The mysterious woman grabs his attention for only a moment when weakness washes over him - only a moment, but enough to leave him baffled. He turns to Simon, his expression a mixture of surprise and glee - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Oh </span></i><span style=\"color:#800000\">hells<i> yes</i></span> - and his hairs stand on end with the leonine sonority that accompanies Simon's authority.<br /> <br /> Yet the chill of awe fades swiftly, as he returns his senses to the inexplicable woman. He tries to gauge her and measure her intent - yet, his perception exposed to the Wild leaves him doubting.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx attempts to gauge the woman's motive and intentions with an Empathy roll - &quot;would approaching her be a bad idea?&quot; - but he garners no successes.</span></b><br /> <br /> The woman proves to be inscrutable, and he frowns momentarily - then he remembers the TA next to him. He gives Simon a soft nudge with his elbow.<br /> <br /> &quot;Mr. Collins,&quot; Oscar murmurs as quietly as he can - the pangs and sizzle from the hail makes him struggle to moderate the volume of his voice - &quot;What's with the lady over there?&quot;<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx tries to draw Ragnar's attention to the woman without rousing suspicion, and gets 1 success.</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Dice pool for Empathy roll: Wits (3) + Empathy (3) + Speciality (Motives) (+1), Active Mage Sight (-2), total dice 5.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419342\" target=\"_blank\">Empathy roll to gauge the woman's motive and intention \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> Dice pool for Subterfuge roll: Composure (3) + Subterfuge (-1) + Willpower (+3) Active Mage Sight (-2), total dice 3.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419345\" target=\"_blank\">Subterfuge roll to alert Ragnar covertly \u2192 1 success</a></span><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419345\" target=\"_blank\">.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":".  Fixed a broken link. 07-31-2016, 07:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T12:52:51-07:00","id":932146,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> The girl's expression is hard to read, mostly because she's not even looking your way at first. When Simon speaks, you do notice that she lingers a little longer than several of the other students. She takes a seat in the back row, eyes still turned to face the window with a small frown on her face. As far as you can figure, she's just another student. She has some of the course texts sitting on the table in front of her, anyway. She's Caucasian with blond hair and, you can see with your heightened senses, bright blue eyes. You don't know her name.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.boldsky.com/img/2015/07/23-1437641201-college1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> No one seems to be paying too much attention to you right now, and thankfully you've learned your lesson and do manage to keep your voice down. You do notice, though, that now you're the only undergrad student left standing in a room of 40 people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T13:02:03-07:00","id":932156,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate (ends in this post)<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 3/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -1)</b><br /> </div> <br /> Oscar bristles, resting one hand on his head. He tries to close his senses to the Primal, and does so with a slow, deep breath. His view of the classroom returns to the dark and the dull. <br /> <br /> &quot;Thanks for reassuring us all, Mr. Collins,&quot; he sighs with a smile. He pats Simon on the back, letting his hand linger a second on his shoulder, and then he moves back to his seat.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T13:35:15-07:00","id":932176,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL<br /> No Spells Active<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual Perception at -1, alleviated with flashlight [I think])</b></div> <br /> <br /> Viv frowns out the window, then scuttles back to her classroom. She raps her cane on the floor as she comes in, drawing attention as she holds her light to shine on herself so she's most visible. The quiver of her hand makes it look just a little eerie.<br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;A-A-Alright, everybody, we, uh---we're'na be heading t'th'groun' fl-floor. Everyone w-with a light of s-some kind, use it---'n'f y'got a spare, share w'whoever doesn' h-have any.&quot;</span> She squints and peers through the room, light scanning over the students, tracking til her eyes land on Simon and Oscar.<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> &quot;Mr. C-Collins and... uh, M-Mr. Valewood, i-if you could h-hang back w'me an' hel'make sure th'room's s-s-s-secure once e-everyone's out. R-rest of you, single file, be careful, 'n d-d-do wh'th'other instructors tell y'out there. Gr-ground floor, sit tight.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> She stands by the door, pointing her light at the floor there to help the students as they file out. Even in the darkness, her sharp green eyes glint as she peers at her TA and student---and, unless she's damnably wrong, her fellow... mages? Wizards? What are they, really?<br /> Her fellow weirdos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T13:36:27-07:00","id":932178,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 10/10</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ragnar feels rather pleased with himself. The spell went off better than he had anticipated, and within full sight of Oscar, who it seems did notice the spell with his Sight. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Was that the first time Oscar saw something with magic? </span></i>He feels a flash of deep satisfaction. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bI just taught somebody how to do something related to magic. And all of these students listened to me and did exactly what I asked them to. </span></i>A thought enters his mind: what if this is what he is meant for? To teach others, to guide them, to lead them? The implications rattle Ragnar, but something about the idea feels so <b><i>right</i></b>. At the very least, he wants to be able to feel the joy he felt when Oscar followed his advice again. And something about the way that Oscar's hand lingered on his shoulder thrills him in a way that he hasn't felt in a while. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Oscar...?</span></i><br /> <br /> At Oscar's words about the girl- <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Mr. Collins? Ah jeez, that's my father, Oscar.</span></i>- Ragnar turns serious again. The blond student in question looks innocent enough, if a little distracted by the storm, but Ragnar gets the feeling that Oscar is talking about the young woman in a <i><b>magical </b></i>sense.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'll take a look,&quot; he whispers to the Norwegian man. &quot;Go back to your seat and play it cool. Just... stay on guard. I have a feeling this day could get a lot weirder.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ragnar then turns his attention to the student. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Okay, then. Let's take a look at you, miss.</i></span> Focussing himself, Ragnar opens himself up to the stream of Time and the strands of Fate once more... but this time, he reaches out a bit more. Partly inspired by Oscar, Ragnar ponders that, just as all living things are bound to each other by threads of Fate, so too are they bound to each other by the web of Life... and where there is a stream of Time, that must also mean that there is a fabric of Space with which to make a universe. Opening himself to the realties of Fate and Life, Space and Time, Ragnar examines the blond student with his Sight.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I activate Active Mage Sight, spending two Mana to use both Life and Space, and examine the student. That puts me at 8 Mana.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> At that moment, Dr. McCallister returns, and Ragnar's attention is diverted. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Wait, why does she want Oscar and I to stay behind. Does she suspect? </span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":".  Edited to take account of Dr. Asphodel's actions 07-15-2016, 05:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T18:28:42-07:00","id":932298,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Inspired (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Magic may be a powerful force, but an equally powerful will can control it. If only I Awakened sooner...<br /> <br /> The mage sticks out like a sore thumb, but not in the way I expected. He doesn't shine outward with an inner light like mine, or even a magical aura like Moonstone's. No, his aura whispers to me through the connections that bind people and their thoughts together. It speaks of iron chains and the imperfections that keep them there, in a place that most would conceive to be Hell. Although, it wasn't Hell in the true sense, but more like Purgatory. He had a connection to the realm as strong as mine, so he's probably newly Awakened like me.<br /> <br /> Before I can relay the info to Moonstone, he &quot;hangs up&quot; on me and opens the door himself. As he speaks to the other passengers, the words I hear cause my ears to heat up. He probably cast a spell on them, given their positive reactions.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Rolling to see if Phoenix notices any distress from Moonstone due to being afflicted with Paradox<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419427\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Empathy 2 = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Though his reaction isn't so positive. &quot;You alright?&quot; I ask concernedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T01:56:50-07:00","id":932441,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Emotional Urging [Potency 3]<br /> Conditions: Spooked, Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 5/8 | Mana: 10/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The creatures behind the door are laughing. Laughing at <i>him.</i>They see him, and they are going to hurt him, and everyone else inside the train, even the other magicians. The divination has gone horribly wrong, it only drew their attention, They are <i>inside him</i>, he wasn't strong enough to keep Them out and They are <i>in </i>his magic. And on top of all that, he has a piercing migraine behind his left eye- he clenches his teeth and puts a palm over his forehead.<br /> <br /> But he has to keep his focus, or the magic will die. He maintains his concentration on the Imago, continuing to imagine himself as capable and strong and in command, and making the other people imagine him that way too. The other magician shows concern, and Moonstone quickly answers back, clearly scared and in pain: &quot;Yes. I'm fine. Nothing is wrong. But we need to go now.&quot;<br /> <br /> He raises his bandaged-and-gloved hands theatrically for the people in the car. &quot;This is the plan. It's safer for everyone to stay in here for now. We're going outside to fix this. Watch each other.&quot;<br /> <br /> He finds that he can't say anything more detailed or inspirational, or the Imago will slip and all will be lost. If Phoenix says anything more, Moonstone hears him, but says: &quot;No time. I'm going. Catch up.&quot; And turns around and rushes out alone onto the platform in the black hailstorm, pulling his ballcap back down over his eyes and clutching his bag close. He keeps concentrating on the Imago to keep the passengers calm, and opens his third eye to Pandemonium again, this time for good. He's going all the way down to the door to look it in the eye, he has to. And hopefully, whatever else Phoenix has to do, Moonstone won't be alone for long.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending 1 Willpower to activate Mind and Space Sight for the remainder of the scene. That's a reflexive action so my Concentration spell stays active for now, but if I take an instant action or take any damage, the spell will end. Moonstone is going across the street to where the shadowy door is, and I plan to scrutinize it when I get there.<br /> <br /> Does running off alone into a nightmare hailstorm to investigate the door count as resolving the Spooked condition? And does taking initiative like this in general count for my Bold virtue?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-16-2016, 05:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T05:32:58-07:00","id":932475,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 3/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -1)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dr. Asphodel</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Mr. C-Collins and... uh, M-Mr. Valewood-</span>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>As he's walking to his seat, when Dr. McCallister calls his name, he turns his head to look at her. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dr. Asphodel</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">i-if you could h-hang back w'me an' hel'make sure th'room's s-s-s-secure once e-everyone's out-</span>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oscar frowns momentarily, not breaking his stride. He grabs his bag, snaking between the gathering students, and then moves to the outskirts of the crowd. <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">I get Mr. Collins staying behind, but... why me? Did she overhear our conversation...?</span></i><br /> <br /> Wordlessly, Oscar watches his fellow students slowly flow out of the room, patiently waiting for the three of them to be alone. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T06:31:36-07:00","id":932487,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You feel a rush of excitement again as your Mage Sight opens once more. You again see the swirling tides of Fate and Time around the storm and the outdoors as you did previously, but now your Supernal vision is a kaleidoscope of sensations, feelings, and colors. You sense yourself expend some energy inside of you that you didn't notice before, but it's clear to you now.<br /> <br /> Even through the darkness, you can see -- no, <i>feel</i> -- the life sustained within the plants and trees outside the building. The hail has no effect on the flora outside, showing that it must only be draining electricity where it strikes. But with your newly opened Space Sight, your vision settles on something unsettling: at a distance away from you that you can instantly judge, down on the ground floor along the wall of an academic building across the sidewalk, you see what you can only describe as a doorway of shadow. It seems half closed, and it's naked to your mundane vision, although that might just be because it's dark outside.<br /> <br /> At Oscar's urging, you turn your sight to study the girl, all four Arcana blending together.<br /> <br /> Fate and Time come to you most naturally, but reveal few things that seem noteworthy. She has no exotic destiny or doom hanging over her, nor telltale signs of any odd flow in the current of time surrounding her and everyone near her. You know a split-second before anyone else what she's about to do as she turns and calmly walks out of the room with the other students. Your Space Sight allows you to know exactly how long her stride is, but even your mundane vision would tell you that she's athletic and probably a fast walker.<br /> <br /> To your Life Sight, though, you do perceive an odd quality about her. You feel an aura of energy pulsing around her that makes your heart skip a beat and echoes in your blood. She isn't just healthy or devoid of illness; she is so <i>full</i> of life that it makes you want to take a step back. Otherwise, she seems like any other college girl.<br /> <br /> Holding your Sight active like this begins to drain on you. You sense that keeping it up much longer will take significant effort.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can leave Active Sight on for maybe a few more seconds, and then you'll need to spend WP to keep it active for the rest of the scene if desired.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx, Ragnar, and Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> The last few undergraduate students gather their belongings and trail out of the room. They have confused looks about why you're not coming with them, but don't stop to ask -- most just want to get out of the room and back to their dorm rooms or homes. The door closes behind them, and the three of you are alone in the room. The darkness is back in full force.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Poor Light tilt is back to -2 now that everyone is gone. A few phone lights isn't enough to brighten the room like 40 did.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You're glad that you're able to put on a good enough face to keep the passengers feeling comforted, but you're definitely feeling the stress of this moment. You are painfully aware that now would be the time that Hakim would comfort you and use Mind magic to ease your emotional distress. His absence is tangible.<br /> <br /> Your vision is again filtered through the Supernal; this time you push with your mind more forcefully, and you know that your Sight will stay open. The darkness of the Highstorm takes on an even more ominous quality when viewed from the Path to Pandemonium. You think you hear faint whispers from the edge of your hearing, but when you look around, you only see shadows.<br /> <br /> As soon as you step onto the platform, the black ice starts to hit you. And where it does, you hear a soft <i>hiss</i> and feel like hands are clawing at you, pulling energy away from you. Although you can cross the platform to an awning and get partway down the covered stairs in a matter of seconds, it feels like an eternity. There are a few people huddled together under the awning complaining about the storm, but otherwise the platform is empty at the moment.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I think being Spooked and Bold are too incompatible to gain both at the same time, and I don't think taking a few steps before Phoenix (who is probably inclined to follow you) is a meaningful enough action to regain all WP from your Virtue. But I think it's in the spirit of the Spooked condition. So, it resolves and you gain a Beat -- so you can still gain an Arcane Beat from resolving a magical Condition this scene, but otherwise no more from mundane Conditions.<br /> <br /> Can you put the new persistent condition in your posts to remind me to keep an eye on whether it's active/passive or invoke it if needed?<br /> <br /> In addition, you lose 1 mana as the black hail strikes you. Roll Wits + Occult.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-16-2016, 10:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T12:06:10-07:00","id":932588,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Emotional Urging [Potency 3]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 5/8 | Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <br /> Keep it together keep it together keep it together.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits 2+Occult 4, 6 dice, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419588\" target=\"_blank\">1 success </a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T14:05:09-07:00","id":932630,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You have a sinking suspicion that the hail carries an Abyssal quality. Something about the way the Abyss is worming its way into your nimbus might be causing the hail to affect you more directly. Of course, it could be simply the effect of the hail striking any mage; it's hard to guess on your own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T14:19:05-07:00","id":932633,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Emotional Urging [Potency 3]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 5/8 | Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <br /> It would make sense. The Abyss is the death of magic and all that's worth protecting in the Fallen world, including the very Mana stored in his Pattern. Also, not a lot of black hail coming from totally mundane sources.<br /> <br /> He rests against the awning for a second, catching his breath. Can he see the shadowy door from here well enough to scrutinize it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T14:44:43-07:00","id":932640,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">No, you can't see it from this angle. You need to finish going down the stairs (which have a covered awning overhead) down to the ground floor, and then to the left of that building and part way down the block. After you leave the stairs, the sidewalk is only covered sporadically, so you'd have to risk more hail.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T14:52:19-07:00","id":932642,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Inspired (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</span></span></div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moonstone suddenly bolts out, almost like he\u2019s running away from something. I wonder if the Abyss stuff has anything to do with it. Guess I\u2019ll find out soon, for I pursue him. He finally stops to catch his breath over at the awning of the platform.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201c</span></span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You don\u2019t look fine,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201d I state once I\u2019ve caught up to him, \u201c</span></span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Does this have something to do with what you talked about on the street below?</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201d</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T15:01:50-07:00","id":932644,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> Your nightvision magic makes it easy to follow Moonstone across the platform and part way down the stairs despite the unnatural darkness at this time in the afternoon. The hail hurts a little because of how large it is, but you manage to make it to the awning quickly enough that it's mostly just a nuisance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T15:11:45-07:00","id":932646,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Emotional Urging [Potency 3]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 5/8 | Mana: 9/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> He's breathing hard, still trying to hold the Imago in his mind, clutching his bag for dear life, and just nods when the other magician comes under the awning. &quot;Yes. Maybe.&quot;<br /> <br /> He points down the block in the direction of the invisible portal. &quot;The door is right over there. But when I ran through the hail, it <i>burned </i>me. Or, sapped me. It ate some of my-&quot; would he know the word? &quot;do you know what Mana is? Some of my energy. Did it eat yours, too? You would have felt it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Moonstone lowered his voice, looked over his shoulder. Whispers at the edge of his perception. But Phoenix seemed trustworthy. He was one of the good ones. &quot;Listen: when I said those words in the car, I uh- I let something in. From Outside. Only a little bit. Something <i>smelled </i>me. I didn't mean to! But it can see me, and I think the hail is attracted to that. I- <i>we-</i> need to get to that door before it comes through, or <i>something</i> comes through, but we have to get through the hail again to reach it. I've been trying to think- maybe I could try a working so that I'm only stepping in the right place at the right time, but I don't know- can you do anything to ward off bad weather?&quot;<br /> <br /> He rubbed his forehead, still nursing that migraine. &quot;I don't know whether I'm thinking straight right now. I might be panicking. Sorry. But I <i>know </i>that door is connected to this storm, and if we get to it, we can try to keep something worse from happening. But I need protection from the hail to get there. Can you help me, uh- what is your Shadow Name?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T15:31:40-07:00","id":932655,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> Everyone else on the train seems to take the man's words at face value, which maybe isn't so surprising. But your peripheral Sight tells you that something else magical happened, suggesting that his urging was magical. For a brief moment, you feel your emotions swirl inside you, and thoughts pop into your head that you should just follow along with everyone else. Be a part of the crowd. Heed the man's advice.<br /> <br /> But you're a mage, and you're made of stronger stuff than that. The thoughts quickly fade, leaving you to act as you think best. Your Space spell trails after the two mages, telling you exactly where they are -- across the platform and part way down the covered stairwell.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I wanted to make it clear what was going on with you here. How would Binder act in this situation?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T16:44:37-07:00","id":932671,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Inspired (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">The door is right over there. But when I ran through the hail, it burned me. Or, sapped me. It ate some of my...do you know what Mana is? Some of my energy. Did it eat yours, too? You would have felt it,</span>&quot; Moonstone asked, heaving.<br /> <br /> \u201c<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Yeah, I know what that is,</span>\u201d I answered, \u201c<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I\u2019m not even surprised it would sap yours, this isn\u2019t ordinary hail. I saw them as...sinkholes when I looked with my Sight, that\u2019s the best way I can describe them. What I am surprised at is how it didn\u2019t drain any from me, though.</span>\u201d<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">Listen: when I said those words in the car, I uh- I let something in. From Outside. Only a little bit. Something smelled me. I didn't mean to! But it can see me, and I think the hail is attracted to that.</span>\u201d he explained.<br /> <br /> That might explain why the hail\u2019s draining him, but not me. If the hail\u2019s being caused by the Abyss, and it\u2019s seeped into him from before, it could be destroying his magic from the inside. Damn, the Abyss is dangerous!<br /> <br /> \u201c<span style=\"color:#008080\">I- we- need to get to that door before it comes through, or something comes through, but we have to get through the hail again to reach it. I've been trying to think- maybe I could try a working so that I'm only stepping in the right place at the right time, but I don't know- can you do anything to ward off bad weather?</span>&quot; he requests, rubbing his forehead, &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">I don't know whether I'm thinking straight right now. I might be panicking. Sorry. But I <i>know </i>that door is connected to this storm, and if we get to it, we can try to keep something worse from happening. But I need protection from the hail to get there. Can you help me, uh- what is your Shadow Name?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> \u201c<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Phoenix,</span>&quot; I answer, &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">And I can certainly try, though I\u2019d have to really push it.</span>\u201d<br /> <br /> It\u2019s a little risky, but nothing ventured, nothing gained. After placing my hand on his shoulder, I focus my mind\u2019s eye on the spell, imagining a whirling bubble that diverts the hail away from him. I have to force the spell through the interference of my \u201cmagical night vision goggles\u201d, so I use my free hand to \u201cmime\u201d the barrier around him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Improv casting CT \u201cHail Bubble\u201d, a Forces Shielding spell that protects Moonstone from the hail, making it flow around him kinda like what you see <a href=\"https://youtu.be/JQHxCw0J9-A?t=3m33s\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, except with the hail. PSF Duration.<br /> <br /> 1 free Reach, spending 3 on spell above limit, instant casting, and Advanced Duration; No penalties, but Duration increased to 1 day; Using Dedicated Tool for -2 on Paradox; containing any Paradox<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419679\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox 2 - 2 Dedicated Tool = Chance die \u2192 1 success</a> (Of course it succeeds)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419681\" target=\"_blank\">Wisdom 7 = 7 dice \u2192 1 success</a> (At least it\u2019s contained)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419683\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Forces 2 + 3 WP = 6 dice \u2192 4 successes</a><br /> <br /> So can I resolve Inspired for an exceptional success on the spellcasting roll?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> Does the color teal fit Moonstone as a character? It just seemed like it did to me, but I can always change the color if you feel like it should be different.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":".  Forgot to add the last part of Moonstone's dialogue 07-16-2016, 08:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T17:24:28-07:00","id":932687,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Emotional Urging [Potency 3]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 5/8 | Mana: 9/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;If it didn't drain you, then my theory was right. It feels the Abyss in me. That means the storm has the Abyss in it too. The Law of Sympathy, fundamental principle of magic: like attracts like. Delusional magical thinking in Sleepers, Supernal truth for us. That's why we were on the train together. Isn't it lovely to see the real world?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone can see the bubble forming around him as Phoenix forms the Imago. He extends an arm outside the protection of the awning, and the hail does not touch him.<br /> <br /> After a few seconds of watching in awe, he turns around, smiling and giggling like he's Phoenix's age. He takes the hand on his shoulder into both of his own and practically shouts: <span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>&quot;Thank </i>you!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Absolutely elated. Working with a mage again! Going into the trenches with a magical ward on his back! Ride that mood swing! <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Come on, let's see what we're up against!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Leading him by the hand, or trying to, Moonstone runs out into the black hailstorm and is unharmed (hopefully). The door awaits.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Teal is just fine! I'll use it from now on.<br /> <br /> That's an awesome visual reference, and using a clip from Atlantis in a Mage game is too perfect, hahaha.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-16-2016, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T19:16:33-07:00","id":932733,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> No Spells Active<br /> </div> When everyone leaves, she pauses. Turning her phone-flashlight on the two men, she breathes. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Mr. Valewood, I sa-saw what you did. I-I-I know wh, uh, what y'are. S-S-Simon, I-I think you saw, a-and y-you're one... one too.&quot;</span> She sighs. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;P-please, no... denying it, th-th-that's just g'look... silly. W-we just need t'talk, uh, a-a-about... w'ever we are.&quot;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T20:42:06-07:00","id":932771,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: Active Mage Sight (Fate, Life, Space, Time)<br /> Conditions: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception checks)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 Mana: 8/10</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar blinks rapidly, both from the suddenly light in the room and from Dr. McCallister's revelation. Three magic-users in the same class? How lucky can he be? <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>No, not luck. Fate.</b> </span></i>Ragnar relinquishes his focus on his Sight, and allows his field of vision to narrow down to the world of the mundane and tangible. He quickly glances around the room and at the door to make sure they are alone.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I relinquish my Active Mage Sight. I also roll Wits+Composure to see if I notice anybody in the room or in the doorway. <br /> <br /> Wits 2 + Composure 2 - Poor Lighting 2 = 2 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419750\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Not seeing anybody, he decides to play it safe and lowers his voice so as to not echo into the hallway. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Dr. McCallister, at the risk of sounding insane, if you saw what we did, then that must mean that the three of us of magic uses. </span>As briefly and concisely as he can, Ragnar summarizes the events that immediately preceded his Awakening, and the abilities that he has acquired since then.He looks at the others. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>\u200b</i>&quot;I don't know what you guys can do, but Oscar has used magic to enhance his physical senses, which is something I can't even attempt.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He turns to Oscar slightly. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I took a look at that girl. Something's off about her. She isn't sick or injured, but..&quot; </span>He shakes his head. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;She's healthy. Almost <i><b>too </b></i>healthy, like she's brimming with life. But I think we can afford to let her wait. I saw this... thing.&quot; </span>He walks to the window and points to the spot where he saw the... door. He involuntarily shivers at the memory. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;It's almost like a portal. I don't know to where, but...&quot; </span>He shudders once again. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;This sounds crazy, but when I looked at that thing, it just seemed <i><b>wrong</b></i>. Like it shouldn't exist. Whatever's up with that girl, whatever made that portal or could come through that portal is a much bigger problem.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He turns back to the other two. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;If anything bad comes through that portal, I don't know if anybody else will be able to see it. And even if they can, we might be the only ones able to stop it. So I think we need to get down there and see what's up.&quot; </span>He pauses, debating something for a moment, and then presses ahead. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;By the way. Do you guys have... other names? I got one during my... thing. It's Ragnar. Do... you guys have one? I feel like it's something we should be able to share with at least each other.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-16-2016, 11:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T21:52:06-07:00","id":932785,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> Perhaps you're more cautious because of Moonstone's current emotional state, or maybe you have a healthier fear of what it would mean for the Abyss to enter you. You strain your will to make your Imago snap into place, and you know it will risk Paradox, but you're ready for it. Your heart skips another beat and you're winded for a moment due to painful chest tightness. But your spell takes effect as intended -- even better than you intended, actually. For creating a spell on the fly, you <i>excelled.</i><br /> <br /> Unlike your other spells, this one is very much obvious to the naked eye, even for someone without your Sight. When Moonstone takes a small step onto the curb to test it, the black ice bounces off the shield with an audible clatter as if striking a building, leaving a clear sphere around him that the ice cannot penetrate. Given your past as a Hunter and your own experience with Awakening, a part of you does wonder if seeing this magic would really mess with someone's mind, or draw unwanted attention. No one else appears to be out in this storm, though.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yes, you can resolve Inspired. Gain an Arcane Beat from the condition resolution, 1 WP from the exceptional success, and your choice of one of the benefits of another exceptional success.<br /> <br /> No Sleepers observed the spell, but I'm going to rule that it's obvious magic. In 2E, that means it is subject to Dissonance at the <i>end</i> of the scene (compared to Unraveling of spells due to Disbelief in 1E, which was an extended roll beginning as soon as Sleepers observed vulgar magic). Still, if a Sleeper witnesses the obvious effects of the spell, it constitutes a breaking point for them (p. 298) and an act of hubris for you (p. 88).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>OOC: </b>I would like to pause the action for this scene and see if Binder chooses to follow or not. He could very easily catch up to you (and sense the new spell via periphery Sight) before you head to the Iris, if he chooses to. If he doesn't comment in the next few days, we'll assume for now that he stays on the train or follows at a distance. </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You don't see any movement at or around the door, but it's pretty dark to tell. As far as you know, it's quiet, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-17-2016, 09:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T05:07:35-07:00","id":932868,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Web of Life (Life 1; Potency 1, Concentration duration; Starts and ends in scene)<br /> Willpower: 3/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Mr. Valewood, I sa-saw what you did. I-I-I know wh, uh, what y'are. S-S-Simon, I-I think you saw, a-and y-you're one... one too.&quot; </span>She sighs.<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> &quot;P-please, no... denying it, th-th-that's just g'look... silly. W-we just need t'talk, uh, a-a-about... w'ever we are.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> With light in his face, Oscar is momentarily befuddled, the light working against his senses - but his lips widen into a grins as her small speech - slow as it is - ends.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Whatever we are? I like that.</span></i><br /> <br /> He glances from Doctor McCallister to Simon, catching the man looking around. Oscar follows through, and allows his senses to flow into the room.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx uses his sense of hearing to listen to any presence that would not be him, Dr. Asphodel, or Ragnar, and gets 2 successes.</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">Dice pool for hearing-based Perception Roll: Wits (3) + Composure (3) + Heightened Senses (+1)</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419802\" target=\"_blank\">Hearing-based perception roll to determine if the three of them are alone \u2192 2 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yet in spite of his sharpened senses, in light of this mysterious black storm, and of having found two others like him... Oscar's euphoria of freedom - of having found another like him! - is tinged with concern.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">This is the kind of situation where we have to be careful, isn't it?</span></i><br /> <br /> He closes his eyes and starts breathing. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Deep breaths.</span></i> Slowly, he lets himself out of his skin. His shadow shifts into that of a snake, whose tongue flickers curiously in its brief appearance. His senses crawl along the floor and up the walls - they pass through Simon and Doctor McCallister. They fly out into the hallway. Oscar's nose twitches every so slightly, and he licks his lips, tasting the air for other humans. He barely can hear Simon as the young man starts talking.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx casts Life 1 &quot;Web of Life&quot;, specifically looking for human beings, with Advanced Scale factor, and Concentration as a Yantra. He gets 4 successes.</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">Dice pool for Life 1 &quot;Web of Life,&quot; specifying humans as type of organism: Life (3) + Gnosis (1) + Concentration Yantra (+2)<br /> <br /> Free Reaches 3: 1 spent on Instant Cast, 1 spent on Advanced Scale factor, 1 spent to avoid Paradox as he has Heightened Senses active. He takes no penalties, so his spell resolves at Potency 1 and basic Advanced Scale (Large house or building)</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419814\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Life 1 &quot;Web of Life&quot; \u2192 4 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Aaahh... How exhilarating...</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">I took a look at that girl. Something's off about her. She isn't sick or injured, but..</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Simon's voice is distant. Oscar feels his concentration slip, the thrill tugging on him to stay where he is.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">She's healthy. Almost too healthy, like she's brimming with life.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> His spell ends. He bristles and glances at them both, a little irritated.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Action: Lynx ends his &quot;Web of Life.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div></span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Too healthy? She seemed like she was more than human. I should probably tell them.</span></i> As he's about to open his mouth, however...<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">But I think we can afford to let her wait. I saw this... thing.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">..It can wait.</span></i> He listens carefully, patiently.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">By the way. Do you guys have... other names? I got one during my... thing. It's Ragnar. Do... you guys have one? I feel like it's something we should be able to share with at least each other.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Other names?</span>&quot; Oscar replies uncertainly. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Not really, no. Should I have one?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-17-2016, 09:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T06:38:22-07:00","id":932882,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You strain with your ears like a cat, listening through the silence for any possible sign of footsteps or intrusion. You hear nothing but hail against the wall and the breathing of the other mages in this room.<br /> <br /> When you cast your spell, you can sense yourself <i>pushing</i> to force your will into place because of your other spell -- it's kind of like trying to talk while reading a book. You can do it, but it takes extra attention. But Life magic seems to come very naturally to you, and your Imago snaps into being.<br /> <br /> A vision of the classroom and the building appears in your mind, and you take a deep breath through your nose. You perceive each life as an odor that you instinctively recognize as human. You detect yourself and the other two in this room, but no one else and none in the hallway or in other rooms on this floor. You perceive a mixture of human odors wafting up from downstairs, where a small crowd gathers in close proximity by what you assume to be the exit. The closest person is pacing back and forth in an area that you recognize as the bottom of the stairs.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Could you put the &quot;Action: xxx&quot; part in the Spoilers with the rest of your OOC info? I think it would make the post easier to read.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T14:18:02-07:00","id":933051,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix), Incognito Presence (self)</i><br /> Willpower: 4/7</div> <br /> Feeling the weight of the Moonstone's words, Binder weighs his options as the two mages run off into the unnatural hail. He'd been hoping to follow them under cover of the crowd, but it seemed like the crowd wasn't going anywhere. He knew another way to follow them unnoticed, but the effort may begin to look less like careful curiosity and more like ill-intentioned stalking.<br /> <br /> <i>I do want to check out that door,</i> Binder rationalizes to himself, <i>so I'll do that, and if it happens that they're doing the same, then it's a happy coincidence, isn't it?</i><br /> <br /> Binder begins building a pair of Imagos. First, he wants to be overlooked by any bystanders, to have a little more freedom in how he looks and behaves. Again, he focuses on the knife in his bag, drawing some stability from the imprint of his nimbus.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Incognito Presence</i> (Mind 2)<br /> 2 Free Reach; Spending for instant speed, Advanced Duration, and 1 beyond spell control<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 1 + 1 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) = 0 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419924\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes!</a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 + Willpower 3 = 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419925\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a><br /> Potency 1, Adv Duration Week</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The spell settles over him, and Binder pulls the knife from his bag with the confidence that no one will notice anything strange. He carefully moves the knife around his body, visualizing it cutting the threads that bind him to conventional space and distance.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Ground-Eater</i> (Space 1)<br /> 2 Free Reach; Spending for instant speed, Advanced Duration, and 2 beyond spell control<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 2 + 2 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419929\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes! </a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantra 1 + Willpower 3 - (+2 Potency) 4 = 3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419930\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Despite his effort, Binder feels the spell slip from his grasp and wither away before it can take hold.<br /> <br /> <i>Ugh,</i> he thinks, a little winded. <i>Really don't feel like doing that again. Well, nevermind.</i><br /> <br /> Binder heads out through the hail, towards the strange door, relying on his spell to keep him safe from notice.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T16:05:19-07:00","id":933118,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone</b></div> <br /> Something stops him before he moves out of the safety of the awning, a prickling of his connection to other minds. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Hmm.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm just gonna roll my Clash of Wills against Incognito Presence real quick since I have Mind Sight up. Gnosis 1+Mind 2: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/419965\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> I think Binder has +2 to this roll because of his spell's weeklong duration.<br /> <br /> &quot;Mages may spend Willpower to bolster the contested roll,<br /> and are always aware when their spells are clashing. Spells with<br /> Advanced Durations and Potency are more enduring in a Clash.<br /> Day-long spells add +1 die to the Clash roll, weeklong spells add<br /> +2, month-long +3, and year-long and indefinite effects add +4.<br /> Advanced Potency adds +1 die.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also thanks for joining us!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T20:03:53-07:00","id":933217,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix), Incognito Presence (self)</i><br /> Willpower: 4/7</div> <br /> Binder's spell bristles at the risk of discovery, but Moonstone is unable to pierce the obfuscation.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Clash of Wills! Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 + 2 (weeklong duration) = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420025\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a><br /> <br /> And of course I'll be joining you! I'm just sorry I couldn't post earlier this weekend!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T20:17:14-07:00","id":933221,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> You're starting to get the hang of all this magic stuff, because you find that you're able to force your Imago into existence despite having other spells interfering with your concentration. Other people on the train look in your direction and their gaze just slides off of you. They move around you instinctively as you walk off the train, but no one even takes a second look, and you know that they won't remember seeing you. You do wonder if cameras or surveillance equipment can be duped, too, but fortunately the power is out on the train anyway. <br /> <br /> A thought creeps into your mind when you consider how else you could use this magic. You could commit murder, pickpocket someone in broad daylight, or just walk right past a gang fight, and no one would notice you. A small part of you wants to try, just to prove you can. <br /> <br /> Emboldened by your success, you strain even further to cast yet another spell, but you lose your focus as the effort takes a tax on your body. <br /> <br /> As you approach the two mages, for just a moment, one of them tries to look at you -- but like the others, his eyes slide right off you. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I don't believe Phoenix gets a roll on Clash of Wills because none of his active spells or Sight would conflict with the spell. Is that right?<br /> <br /> What does Binder do?</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You thought you saw something, but you looked and didn't see anyone. The door is just around the corner from where you're standing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-17-2016, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T21:07:21-07:00","id":933241,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> I strain to create the bubble like last time, and that same vice grip presses me again, but I still manage to push through. I've gotta stop straining myself like this, can't be healthy. Moonstone giddily grabs my hand and practically skips out into the storm. Looks like someone's having fun.<br /> <br /> Right before he's out, he suddenly stops, my feet bounce about to keep myself stable from the tugging. Looks like he's listening for something. Magical, perhaps? My senses just went off, too. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">What's up?</span>&quot; I ask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T21:41:57-07:00","id":933258,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> <br /> He bit his lip, scanned the crowd, pushed his ballcap out of his eyes. <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;Swear to Aion I felt something lurking. Somebody's stray thoughts hiding from me. Probably I'm being paranoid like always. Don't wanna make a scene around people by shouting for 'em- just keep your eyes peeled. Come on, it's just around the corner.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T05:35:51-07:00","id":933375,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix), Incognito Presence (self)</i><br /> Willpower: 4/7</div> <br /> Binder goes down the steps, past the mages, and around the corner to investigate the door.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T06:30:35-07:00","id":933391,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 WP: 4/4 </div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar's face grows a little warm at Oscar's words. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;I just... um... assumed that you guys got second names when you got your powers.&quot; </span>But wait... isn't there something about names and magic...? <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to recall lore about the use of true names and their use in magic. Intelligence 4 + Occult 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420138\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T13:30:53-07:00","id":933558,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You are intimately familiar with your own Awakening, and simply talking about magical names evokes that memory keenly for you. Your experiences at the Watchtower of the Lunargent Thorn on the Path to Arcadia taught you that names have meaning through their symbolism -- or perhaps, symbols give names meaning. Thus, you spoke your True Name, and thus Ragnar became true.<br /> <br /> Based on the intuitive knowledge you have gleaned through your Awakening, you know that names build connections, and magic can manipulate or modify that connection to a number of ends. You suspect that creating a new magical identity might help a mage create symbolism, a new symbolism than their given name, and thus create other connections.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder and Phoenix</b><br /> You study the wall, but don't perceive anything of note with your mundane vision. However, on the periphery of your True Sight, you feel <i>something</i> calling to you -- and it's very close by.<br /> <br /> The street appears empty at the moment. No one else seems to want to be out in this freak storm.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can choose to activate your Active Sight. For anyone who has spent more than a few turns with Active Sight on this scene, that will require a Willpower to make it stay on. You can choose to use Focused Mage Sight and attempt Revelation or Scrutiny at Opacity 5 (p. 92-93) if you so choose, but remember that it's a non-reflexive action, so doing so would end any concentration-based spells.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> There it stands -- right there, as if crawling out of the brick wall. To your Active Sight, it's plain as day: a powerful spatial warp, which seems to claw at the Fallen World like a living creature. Its borders are moving, but you couldn't begin to try and describe the way it moves in any English words you know. Colors, and a blackness dark as night, darker than the ice falling from the sky, swirl around the door.<br /> <br /> A wise part of you knows that if you study the door more closely, using your Sight, you might be able to learn more. But the door has a weight of age to it, a sharp quality, that suggests it may be far beyond your current knowledge. Then again, you suspect that you wouldn't be the first mage to try something that others deemed impossible.<br /> <br /> You hear that same quiet, throaty laugh that you heard earlier. It seems to emanate from the mystical doorway. A part of you wants to scream. Another part of you wants to laugh, to cry, to move closer.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may use Focused Mage Sight attempt Revelation or Scrutiny at Opacity 5, if you so choose. Don't forget that using Scrutiny costs 1 WP to activate.<br /> <br /> I would also like you to roll Resolve + Composure.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T17:06:18-07:00","id":933650,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Focused Sight: Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 4/8 | Mana: 9/10</b></div> <br /> He can't focus on the Imago any longer. His thoughts swirl with the image of the door, and his concentration breaks. It's a wonderfully freeing sensation of letting go. The passengers on the train will have to fend for themselves.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Resolve 4+Composure 4, -2 dice for being in Active Sight and rolling something unrelated to magic: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420334\" target=\"_blank\">6 successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Moonstone is in his element. He is achingly, painfully sane. He could look <i>through</i> the door, couldn't he? Just one step and he'd see beyond the wall. But- no. Not without testing the water. That would be Unwise. He hears himself saying to any minds listening: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I can see it. I'm in control. I'm going to look now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He reaches into his messenger bag and pulls out a cracked hand mirror. It's cold and real and not at all comforting in his hands, but the sharpness is grounding. It reminds him what's real and what's fake. He turns and stands with his back to the wall, ignoring the black hail clattering against Phoenix's shield, and he looks back through his mirror like a sharpshooter lining up a trick shot.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's do this. Entering Focused Sight with Space and spending 1 WP to initiate Scrutiny, which puts me at 4. Gnosis 1+Space 2: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420340\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a> this turn. I have 2 more free rolls before failures risk polluting the Mystery.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T17:59:22-07:00","id":933666,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Active Sight:</b> Forces, Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> From the perspective of my mundane senses, there's no door. Just an ordinary brick wall getting pelted by the black hail. But there's something calling me from there, so I lift open my Sight once more. I've withstood the Aether's power before, it shouldn't be too awfully hard to do it again.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending a WP to open Active Sight for the rest of the scene.<br /> <br /> As a side note, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> the hail doesn't pelt against the shield, so much flows around it. Not saying you don't have edit your previous post or anything, just thought you might wanna know.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T18:14:05-07:00","id":933671,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <br /> <br /> The memories of his Awakening grant understanding to Ragnar. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;'Ragnar' is my True Name, I </span><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">guess you can say. When I...&quot; </span>he pauses. Surely there's a simpler way to refer to what happened? He casts around in his mind, and finally hits on 'Awakened.' Yes, that works nicely. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;... Awakened, I said the name, and it became reality. I was born Simon Collins, but that's not really who I am any more. But don't call me 'Ragnar' in public.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Also, even if you don't have other names, I think it might be a good idea for you guys to come up with aliases. A name has implications and connections, and if anything that I've read in mythology about names and magic is true, people could possibly use your name to impact your connections. So throwing your birth name around when other magic-users are around might not be the best idea.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T20:23:47-07:00","id":933721,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> Through the finely focused lens of Space, you study the maw into impossibility and are not afraid. Something in you snaps, and you ignore the siren's song; the throaty laugh echoes as a growl, then fades to your ears. <br /> <br /> You try to study the doorway to nothingness, but it perplexes you in a way that nothing else ever has. Your Awakened soul aches to know more, and you feel a thirst for knowledge and success with this task -- or more aptly, a kind of hunger. But the truth eludes you for now. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Gain the Steadfast condition. Remember too that you can spend mana to gain successes, as long as the actual roll succeeds. Am I correct in assuming that you're only using Space to view? Because you get penalties for trying to use multiple arcana when doing Focused Sight, but you also might be able to learn more. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Within a moment of opening your Sight once more, the doorway appears to your eyes. Through the lens of Prime and Forces, you can clearly see that the doorway is somehow connected to the storm raging around you. The doorway is pitch black, but tendrils of lightning crackle around its edges. <br /> <br /> You know that you could try to learn more, and you feel like you want to -- you crave it. But another part knows that doing so might be too difficult for your current understanding of magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Corrections 07-19-2016, 12:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T00:46:34-07:00","id":933768,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Focused Sight: Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (passive), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus, Steadfast<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 4/8 | Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <br /> As if he would stop now. Moonstone peers more deeply into the mirror- <i>hungry</i> is right.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yep, only Space. When I think portals and doorways, I think Space.<br /> <br /> If it's okay, I'm going to roll a couple times in a row since I'm just going to keep doing this same action. If not, I can strike my other actions.<br /> <br /> Turn 2 of scrutiny: spending 1 willpower and 1 mana. Gnosis 1+Space 2+WP 3, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420437\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a> becomes 3 with Mana.<br /> Turn 3: 1WP and 1 mana, 6 dice. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420438\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a> becomes 2 with Mana.<br /> <br /> Currently I'm at 5 successes, and I have 2 willpower and 7 mana left. I've used up my free rolls, further scrutiny rolls risk polluting the Mystery if I fail them. Divergent becomes Active as Moonstone gets burned out from the exhaustion and excitement.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:00:55-07:00","id":933817,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You pour your will into studying the door, using the mirror to enhance your focus. You strain, and strain, and push yourself like you've never done before. All thought of time, or fear about failure, is forced from your mind as you dedicate sheer willpower to cracking open this Pandora's box.<br /> <br /> On a whim, you send out thin streams of mana, that energy welled up within your soul, into the doorway. It swirls in an intricate pattern, glimmers, and then fades to nothingness. But in the process, you think you gain a better understanding of the inner workings of this magical phenomenon. You know that if you were to continue, it would start to get easier; you're a quick study.<br /> <br /> But the process is incredibly taxing. As the initial rush of excitement wears off, you feel a weariness settle into your bones. You notice that your breathing is ragged. You feel like you missed a night of sleep, and your head is aching from the strain.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'll allow you to do multiple turns in a row, as we're not in initiative, but Phoenix and Binder can both have a few turns before you can take any more instant actions.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder and Phoenix</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can attempt Revelation or Scrutiny if you wish, now at Opacity 4.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:32:23-07:00","id":933838,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix), Incognito Presence (self)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 8/10<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> It's a little strange to be investigating something alongside two people who don't know you're there, but Binder puts that aside and focuses on the door.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending 1 willpower to reactivate mage sight, then a WP and a Mana for a turn of scrutiny (Space).<br /> Gnosis 1 + Space 2 = 3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420517\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. (2 total)<br /> <br /> Ugh, shouldn't have used all that WP casting spells.<br /> <br /> 2nd attempt: 1 WP, 1 Mana<br /> Gnosis 1 + Space 2 = 3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420518\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> I'll spend my last Willpower on a Revelation attempt so I'm not rolling a chance die.<br /> Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + 3 (Willpower) - 4 (Opacity) = 2 - &gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420520\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-21-2016, 09:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:49:57-07:00","id":933847,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For that 2nd attempt, you said you were spending 1 WP but didn't actually add anything to the roll. Reroll that if you're indeed using WP, as if you get even 1 success on the roll, you'll drop Opacity to 3 (due to the mana you spent). If you do, reroll an extra d10 for your Revelation roll.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T06:59:03-07:00","id":933849,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (on Moonstone and Pheonix), Incognito Presence (self)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 8/10<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Oh weird, I could have sworn that I read yesterday that each scrutiny action cost a Willpower, but looking at my PDF now I can't find that anywhere...<br /> <br /> Adding three more dice to my second attempt: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420524\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a> (2 successes total)<br /> <br /> So then, adding one more die to my Revelation attempt: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420525\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-21-2016, 09:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T16:42:06-07:00","id":934172,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Focused Sight:</b> Prime (goes to Active at end of post) | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 3/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Rolling Perception to see if Phoenix notices Moonstone's condition.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420639\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 - 2 Active Sight = 3 dice \u2192 0 successes</a> (Neeewpe!)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The door becomes clearer, as if it's daring me to learn its secrets. Okay then, I'll bite!<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Focused Sight with Prime to Scrutinize the door, spending a WP and a Mana on the first roll<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420648\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 3 WP = 6 dice \u2192 2 successes</a> (making 3 so Opacity falls to 2)<br /> <br /> Gonna save WP this time and spend another Mana.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420651\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 = 3 dice \u2192 0 successes</a> (Dammit)<br /> <br /> Alrighty, trying again, no WP and 1 Mana.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420652\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 = 3 dice \u2192 0 successes</a> (welp, I knew my luck was gonna run out at some point...)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Damn, that is one tough cookie to crack...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T18:01:36-07:00","id":934219,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Focused Sight: Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (active), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus, Steadfast<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 7/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> It's getting easier. The magician barely conceives of himself as an <i>I </i>right now, there's no self before the endlessly refracting mirror of Pandemonium. It's a dangerous way to think of magic: not the peace of enlightenment, just emptiness and confusion. Who was it that said a wizard is made of madness, sadness and magic?<br /> <br /> But the door is still there. Moonstone reads the signs of Phoenix's scrutiny in his mirror, and someone else's too. He worms through the burrow after them.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's do this. Treating the Mystery as having Opacity 2 now. Any failures will add 1 to Opacity.<br /> <br /> Turn 4 of my scrutiny. Gnosis 1, Space 2, +3 from willpower, spending 1 Mana. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420668\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a> Resolving my Steadfast Condition to turn that into a single success, +1 from Mana. Should be at Opacity 1 now.<br /> <br /> Turn 5 of scrutiny: same dicepool of 6, 1 WP, no Mana this time. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420669\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes.</a> That should take us to Opacity 0. I've got 0 Willpower and 6 Mana.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Okay now. Balance the blade. Deep, ragged breaths, try to keep them steady. He forms an Imago of the mirror spiraling out all the myriad possible reflections of the next few seconds, and tilts until he finds an angle he likes.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Time 2 &quot;Choose the Thread&quot; on myself, Duration 1 turn, Potency 2. Gnosis 1, Time 2, +1 for my Path Tool: 4 dice total. I have 1 free Reach that I'm using for instant casting, +2 to apply the effect to spellcasting and other supernatural rolls (presumably including Revelation). 2 paradox dice base, +2 for earlier paradox rolls in the scene. Going to contain any that I cause.<br /> <br /> Paradox, 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420672\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes.</a><br /> <br /> Wisdom, 7 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420673\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes(!!!)</a> Poor mad sad magical Moonstone.<br /> <br /> Well, let's roll the actual spell at least. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420674\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a> I get to make my next roll twice, and choose which result I prefer. The spell cost 1 Mana for casting with a common arcana, I now have 5 Mana.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> They are looking back at him from the mirror, prowling in the dead time between reflections like a panther in the jungle. Moonstone gasps, sweats, almost loses his grip on the mirror. His voice is hollow and obviously strained: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I'm going to show it to you. Both of you. I'm going to show you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Attempting Revelation on this baby, Opacity 0. Gnosis 1 + Space 2 = 3 dice. I get two attempts at this thanks to Choose the Thread.<br /> First attempt: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420679\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a><br /> Second attempt: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420681\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a> Splat. Good thing I risked all that Paradox!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T01:39:57-07:00","id":934351,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls)<br /> Willpower: 3/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b><br /> <br /> <br /> </div> Oscar grins at the sight of a flustered Simon, yet his mention of <i>Awakening</i> and the importance of <i>names</i> makes his grin rather fixed as Oscar sinks into thought.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">I guess you could say I woke up... though I'd describe it as... climbing out of a void?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">My Awakening was wordless,</span>&quot; Oscar says slowly, rubbing his beard. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Though...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Names have implications and connections? ...Oh! I get it!</span></i><br /> <br /> Oscar fiddles with his his shirt, unbuttoning the topmost, as he pulls out a small silver pendant, hung around his neck by a leather cord. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">This,</span>&quot; he smiles, gently fingering the pendant, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Day after I landed, I had an itching to get this. Found it at a local jeweler's, just knew they had this exact necklace. I didn't actually know what I was looking for, but my instincts took me there.</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> He holds it out. The silver reflects beautifully in the light of their mobile phones, and the keen eye sees the intricate design of a lynx perched on a rock. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">It's this sort of thing you're thinking of, right? Something important to your Awakening? Well, the one that helped me out of that abyss was a lynx, so...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">It has a good ring to it.</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">You can call me <b>Lynx.</b></span>&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T06:46:42-07:00","id":934457,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Dr. Asphodel<br /> No Spells<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light</b></div> <br /> Viv tilts her head, looking at Simon---no, <i>Ragnar</i>, and not Oscar but <i>Lynx</i>. Almost abruptly, she lets out a breathy, wheezy cackle-giggle; the rickety, twitchy professor moves unevenly as she laughs. It's not a mocking one, though, and she's smiling when she looks up.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Y-you boys... w-w-well, I'd be lying i-if I didn't say my n-new name was a li'l comic-b-bookish.&quot;</span> She slips her phone into the front pocket of her plaid button-up, extending her non-cane hand to the other two. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Y-you c'n call me D-Dr. Asphodel, 'f'y'like. I c-came out the other side of death, 'n I got a lot more l-living t'do.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T07:14:21-07:00","id":934473,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Lynx...&quot; </span>Ragnar's memory flashes back to the sight of Oscar's shadow shifting into that of a long-eared feline- <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i><b>a lynx, of course</b></i>- </span>and flashes Oscar- no, Lynx- a grin. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;It suits you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> At Dr. McCallister's words, his mind flashes to an image of a vast underground field filled with the shades of the dead. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Yes, Dr. Asphodel will do well.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> Ragnar looks to the door. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Now. I'd like to take a look at that portal thing before anything nasty comes out of it. You guys with me?&quot; </span>He heads towards the door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-20-2016, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T07:31:25-07:00","id":934484,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder, Moonstone, and Phoenix</b><br /> Each of you pours your soul into your attempt to tear into this Mystery. The very air crackles around you from the intensity of your scrutiny. It's like Schrodinger's cat, but magnified: the very act of observing this particular Iris, with all three mages resonating in concert, changes its quality.<br /> <br /> You feel an incredible hunger for knowledge, an obsession for understanding the secret lying right before your eyes and your Sight. But it's not enough; in turn, you each find yourself falling short of the epiphany you crave, despite your desperate attempts to claw at the Supernal truth. Your efforts to do so are incredibly taxing, threatening to crack your sanity.<br /> <br /> You long to continue. You lust for that knowledge, hanging just beyond your fingertips. If you just strain a <i>little</i> further...But is it wise to do so? Does it matter?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm giving each of you an Arcane Beat for the drama of this scene, and for your efforts to scrutinize the Mystery.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> The strain on your mind, on your very sanity, temporarily blinds you from the gravity of what you are attempting. You overextend yourself, but you barely notice.<br /> <br /> The Abyss does.<br /> <br /> You angle the mirror to find the perfect angle, to line up your metaphysical strike against the Iris with Time. When you do, <i>something</i> moves from the door. A cloud of energy black as night seems to break off from the door, swirl around you, and infect the cloud of magic hanging around you. Cold and clammy tendrils wrap around your head and pierce into your mind, and refuse to let go. As you study the mirror, instead of your reflection, you see countless scenes flash by that you can't take your eyes away from -- scenes of your failures, your bone-deep shame, of pitiful weakness.<br /> <br /> The whispers, the quiet laugh you heard lingering in the air around the Iris, turn to moans and screams that you can't shut out.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain the Abyssal Imago condition (p. 117). For the next day or until the condition resolves, you <i>must</i> spend at least 3 reach on each spell you cast or it automatically fails and provokes an enhanced Paradox roll.<br /> <br /> You would also instinctively know that you can scour either or both Abyssal condition from your pattern by taking 1 resistant lethal damage per condition. Otherwise, you can gain an Arcane Beat if you let the condition resolve by lapsing.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder and Phoenix</b><br /> While you attempt to scrutinize the Iris before you, you watch the black energy spin off and infect Moonstone further. His nimbus grows darker, mirroring the pitch black energy swirling around the Iris, and &quot;glows&quot; with an unholy anti-light as he attempts and fails to cast Time magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-20-2016, 04:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T07:50:34-07:00","id":934493,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (Moonstone and Pheonix)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 8/10<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> Binder recoils, Moonstone's state snapping him out of the near-reverie he'd been examining the door in, then reaches out for the young man in concern, reflexively dropping the spell concealing his presence.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Oh shit, are you okay?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Belatedly, Binder realizes this might not be the smartest course of action, that the energy infecting the other mage might be some sort of demonic possession, but he pushes that thought aside. If that's the case, he'll deal with it, but right now the mage might need his help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-21-2016, 09:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:34:25-07:00","id":934576,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration: Does a lot. Best to actually read text in book.)<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Asphodel? Not sure if I get the reference...</span>&quot; Oscar mutters to himself. He looks over to Ragnar, who makes the motion to leave.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Now. I'd like to take a look at that portal thing before anything nasty comes out of it. You guys with me?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well, I'm not leaving either of you alone during this storm,</span>&quot; Oscar says, rubbing his beard. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Before we go, though, I'd like to do some magic on all three of us. Magic to ... to master our bodies, I guess, is the best way to describe it? I'm not the best with words...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Oscar holds out his left arm. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'll need to touch you, I think, so if you just grasp my arm...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Okay, deep breaths... </span></i><br /> <br /> He breathes in the Primal Wild again, seeing in his soul himself and his two newfound companion; he sees them as he breathes life into their collective pattern. The thrill courses through his blood, ambition rising in his act - ambition that leads him to stretch further than he has ever done with his magic.<br /> <br /> Then the chill grazes his soul.<br /> <br /> He feels... - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">The void? I thought... but... I had cast it away...</span></i> - as it clings to the edges of his spell, threatening to taint it. He grasps his pendant with his right hand, in an attempt to find solace. A faint growl emerges in his throat, almost daring it to try. Yet its abhorrence frightens him; he exerts his will in an attempt to finish the spell faster. The spell forms and is cast, and the threat slinks away ... though in the aftermath, he stands distraught, clutching the silver lynx tightly.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">... What was that...?</span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\"> Lynx casts Life 2 &quot;Body Control.&quot; He casts it once Dr. Asphodel and Ragnar grasp his arm; if neither of them accept the spell, he still casts it.<br /> <br /> Potency: 2.<br /> Advanced Scale, 3 targets: Himself, Dr. Asphodel, Ragnar.<br /> Duration: 1 Week.</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Life 2 &quot;Body Control&quot;: Life (3) + Gnosis (1) + Willpower (+3) - Potency 2 (-2).<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 2 Free Reaches: 1 spent on Instant Cast, 1 spent on Advanced Duration factor. 2 Additional Reaches: 1 spent on Advanced Scale factor, 1 spent because he has Heightened Senses active.<br /> <b>Base Paradox dice pool:</b> 2. He uses his Dedicated Tool to reduce Paradox dice by 2.<br /> <b>Final Paradox dice pool:</b> 0. If he gains Paradox, he releases as his instincts tell him not to accept it into his pattern. </span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420914\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Roll for Paradox</b>, 0 dice \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Total dice pool for Life 2 &quot;Body Control&quot;: </b>5 dice. </span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420916\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Roll for Life 2</b> &quot;Body Control&quot; \u2192 2 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a>: Is this formatting ideal? Too clunky?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6498_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6498\" data-vbnamecard=\"6498\">Haberdasher</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8026_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8026\" data-vbnamecard=\"8026\">Beans</a>, you don't have to accept the spell.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:54:47-07:00","id":934594,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You can instinctively sense that your current spell provides some interference as you try to force your will into being. You have a vague feeling of being watched on the periphery of your senses that cause the hairs on your neck to rise like hackles, but the sensation passes without any disturbance.<br /> <br /> You feel your breathing and heart rate slow in a controlled fashion, to barely a quarter of their original speed, but you feel as alive and energized as before.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The format looks fine to me. Whatever helps you keep things sorted well. also don't need to list the specific effects of each spell in the header at the top of your post; it's more helpful for me to know what you have active, and potency and duration of each active spell.<br /> <br /> If they so desire, Dr. Asphodel and Ragnar can Withstand the spell using Stamina.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T13:27:55-07:00","id":934684,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar hesitates for a brief moment, but takes Lynx's arm anyways. He is briefly struck by the thickness of it before he feels Lynx cast the spell on the three of them. He is struck by a rush of wild, primal energy, which he felt emanating from Lynx previously. Except this time, it's directed at <i>him</i>, and he's a little unsure of how to react. Ragnar's body begins to tense at the spell- unsurprising, since it's the first time he's aware of that somebody's cast a spell on him- but he wills himself to relax, to <i>submit</i>, to the working of the other man's will.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>So this is what Life magic feels like. Wow. </i></span>He marvels as he feels the magic worm itself into his body. He looks at Lynx, grinning like an idiot. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">\u200b&quot;Okay, that? Was just effing <b>cool</b>.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Ragnar accepts the spell and chooses not to resist it.<br /> <br /> He also attempts to quickly figure out the spells' affect on his body. Wits 2 + Science 2 + Specialty (Biology) 1 = 5 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/420971\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T13:36:09-07:00","id":934688,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting</b></div> <br /> Shaky arm reaching out, the professor takes a hold of Lynx's and shivers a little as the magic flows into her. Her jittery body feels a little more in control, and she smiles crookedly.<br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;N-n-not bad...&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T15:09:38-07:00","id":934724,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration: Does a lot. Best to actually read text in book.)<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm glad you think so,</span>&quot; Lynx smiles back at Ragnar - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Seems the spell was a success... that's good...</span></i> - and he nods in appreciation at Dr. Asphodel's words. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well then. We have a portal to investigate, so... lead the way.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T17:29:33-07:00","id":934807,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (active), Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus, Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 5/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> Everything is terrible! Some of the reflections of warped postcognition that Moonstone sees in his mirror:<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <i>A bruised and tired young Vietnamese woman in a hospital bed, being prompted to sign some paperwork while a nurse holds her newborn. An adolescent girl furiously shaving her head in the bathroom as her parents pound on the locked door. Watching a 9th grader threaten to do terrible things to another 9th grader, walking away and saying nothing. Pawning Mom's jewelry for drug money. A dance instructor shoving her finger in his red and puffy face and telling &quot;Amelia&quot; that she is lazy, ungraceful, and too fucking fat to be in this Intermediate Ballet II classroom in anything but a tree costume. Homeless in Chicago, getting the shit kicked out of him at the bus terminal. Being fired as a Wal-Mart greeter (incompetence+customer complaints, &quot;too friendly&quot;). Realizing that he is never, ever going to have children.<br /> <br /> Improperly preparing the wards for a summoning ritual, being severely injured by the angry spirit along with the rest of the Knights, Askia refusing to heal him magically: &quot;That scar is your idiot tax. That's what this costs you personally.&quot; Rose of Sharon rolling her eyes and waving off an incident where he embarrassed the cabal in front of a Consilium gathering: &quot;No one was expecting better from you.&quot; Practicing with a blade in the mirror the way Ghost Dog taught him, and sternly giving himself imagined instructions: &quot;Now remember, Moonstone, when you're on the battlefield, Hakim is what matters. <b>You don't matter.</b>&quot; Bowing his head obediently: <b>&quot;I don't matter.&quot;</b> Talking and humming and singing to himself, alone in the sanctum, pretending he's a mage. The facial expressions at the individual moments when each of the Knights decide that he is not going to Awaken.<br /> <br /> Watching Hakim court various women and laugh and smile and be happy with them. Feeling shame and physical pain at how poisonous his jealousy is. Sitting on the edge of Hakim's bed, half-dressed, ugly crying. Hakim saying: &quot;You make it hard to love you.&quot; Hakim saying: &quot;You aren't thinking straight right now, that's your symptoms talking.&quot; Hakim saying: &quot;Just because I say something once doesn't mean I feel the same way forever.&quot; Hakim saying: &quot;There need to be boundaries between us.&quot; Hakim saying: &quot;I do not love you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Most of these he remembers as he watches them, but there's one extended scene that he doesn't remember at all:<br /> A closed door behind which he and Hakim are having a mild argument about some regrettable thing Hakim did that escalates quickly into Moonstone screaming and shattering picture frames. Hakim is kind and patient and increasingly scared as he fails to explain the situation and calm him down. A blade is shoved through the closed door, followed by the door being pushed open and Moonstone stalking out alone, breathing hard and clutching an ornate enchanted sword and streaming tears. He swings in a frenzy, tearing at the walls of the sanctum, slices wide and deeply cuts his own arm and yelps and falls to his knees. Ghost Dog rushes in, shouts something. Hakim stumbles through the door, clutching his abdomen, and says <b>&quot;Undo today.&quot;</b> Ghost Dog chants in the High Speech, draws his own blade, and deftly cuts through Time-</i><br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Moonstone (eyes wide, transfixed, panicked) suddenly hurls his mirror against the brick wall. The other magician appearing out of thin air makes him jump and push away from the wall. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;NO! I am not okay! I exposed the door in the bricks, but I pushed too far, and now it's <b>in</b> me! It's in the mirror! Oh God, all my glass is breaking and now the shard's in my soul and I can only see ugly things!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Under Mind Sight, it would be clear that his thoughts are disordered and scratchy, standing out like poison under Life Sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T18:49:36-07:00","id":934847,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">RAGNAR<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Alright. Let's go. But first...&quot; </span>Ragnar walks to his backpack and pulls out the silver knife he carries in its sheathe within. He unsheathes it carefully and displays it to the others. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;I got this after I Awakened. I'm not sure what exactly to call it. But when I use it, my magic seems to be... more stable. Less likely to slip away from me. If either of you have something like this, I suggest you keep it handy. This could get nasty, and I don't think we want our magic going awry if something bad happens.&quot; </span>He starts for the door. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Now. Let's try to figure out what exactly is going on here.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Ragnar's silver knife is basically a Celtic sgian-dubh, but with two-edges instead of one (representing the two-edged nature of magic), and no saw teeth near the handle. The knot work design of the handle also has some thorn and leaf motifs, evoking the Hedge. This is about as close of an image as I can get.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://www.ukcrossbows.co.uk/image/cache/data/products/knives/fantasy/celtic-sgian-dubh-3-600x600.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ukcrossbows.co.uk/image/c...-3-600x600.jpg</a></div></div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-22-2016, 08:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T19:45:05-07:00","id":934859,"title":"","content":"DR ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: &quot;Body Control&quot; Life 2<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting<br /> <br /> Dr. Asphodel skitters after him to the door, nodding. She taps her cane on the floor. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;A-alre'had this, b'... same thing. I f-feel more'n control, I guess.&quot;</span> In the dim light---and if they looked before the power went out---the head appears to be ivory in a simple Derby shape. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Gotta b-b-be careful'bout th-thi-th-this...&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T20:11:49-07:00","id":934867,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Locate Object (Moonstone and Pheonix)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 8/10<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> Moonstone's outburst, if anything, makes Binder appear calmer. It's not the same as a seven-year-old's tantrum, but the combination of relative youth and violent emotions calls up Marlin's practiced fatherliness. The concerned reach turns into a placating gesture. At the same time, the sight of Moonstone's disordered mind draws his interest. It would be so easy to just reach out and... tidy it up. Untangle it a little. <i>And he'd probably thank me afterw-</i> <i>No! No, that's </i>not <i>how we do things! Going unnoticed, making sure someone stays asleep, that's one thing, but this crosses a line!</i><br /> <br /> Binder forces calm into his voice. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Okay. I know it doesn't seem like it right now, but it's going to be alright. I can see a little of what you're feeling right now, and I think I can help. Do you want that? Do you want me to help you <i>calm down</i>?</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-21-2016, 09:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T20:24:08-07:00","id":934876,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> <br /> Magician + stable presence + Calm Down = very yes. That sounds about right. That's what's supposed to happen right now. He looks over at Phoenix, just to make sure he's still there, and nods. <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;Yes, I do. You can come in. Quick. Please.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T23:08:24-07:00","id":934926,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Focused Sight:</b> Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I'm going to show it to you. Both of you. I'm going to show you.&quot;</span> Moonstone declared.<br /> <br /> Both of you? Who-?<br /> <br /> A flush of chilling void bursts forth and draws into him, seeping into his very being. This is that Paradox thing they mentioned, isn't it? The Abyss lashes out at mages who can't control their magic.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;NO! I am not okay! I exposed the door in the bricks, but I pushed too far, and now it's <b>in</b> me! It's in the mirror! Oh God, all my glass is breaking and now the shard's in my soul and I can only see ugly things!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> I'd criticize his hubris, but his stress clearly shows he gets the message. I let the other mage from the train calm him down. He followed us, but it looks like he only wants to help, and was probably curious about the door same as us. So I focus myself on the door, it's secrets laid bare. I need to know of any threats that might come through, of course. Moonstone talked of Abyssals, those terrible monsters out to get us. I've never seen an Abyssal, though. Do they look like anything, or do they only have a form because that's how our minds process it? I must know <b>if these Abyssals are going to be a threat, how much of a threat, how many, and how to deal with them. That! Is! All! No more!</b> <sub>(but no less...)</sub><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Focusing Sight with Prime again to make a Revelation and spending a WP on it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421105\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 3 WP = 6 dice \u2192 3 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T06:47:59-07:00","id":935032,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Clear Thoughts (Moonstone)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 8/10<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> Binder gently waves his knife before the young man's face, not cutting the unruly thoughts so much as trimming or grazing them. 3 passes, then he reaches out and places his palm on the man's forehead. He can feel the tracking spell burdening his mind, so he cuts it loose and lets it fade.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Clear Thoughts</i> (Mind 3)<br /> 1 Free Reach; Spending for instant speed and Advanced Duration<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 1 + 3 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421131\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes!</a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 + Yantra 1 = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421132\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes. </a><br /> Potency 1, Duration Week</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">There,</span>&quot; he says, once he's sure the spell is in place. Under his sight, it looks like a nicotine cloud with eyes sleepily drifting around Moonstone's head. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">I'll leave it up for as long as I can spare it, or until you want me to take it down.</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 07-22-2016, 08:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T21:05:34-07:00","id":935442,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Asphodel, Lynx, and Ragnar</b><br /> After preparing as much as possible for any potential threats, at least as much as you newly Awakened mages currently know how to prepare, you agree to cautiously investigate the magical door Ragnar observed down past the courtyard by a nearby building. <br /> <br /> Between your conversation and introductions of the magical sort, a few more minutes have passed -- probably 15 since the hail started falling -- but the storm is still in full force outside. The scheduled end of today's class period passed a few minutes ago.<br /> <br /> With Lynx's Life magic, he is able to sense that there are fewer people downstairs. Some have assumedly gone to a student lounge in the building, while others very likely left for their dorms or homes. The doorway, Ragnar senses, is leeching out of a brick wall on the far side of the building opposite the humanities building, in a small alley-like alcove. You didn't notice anyone wandering around outside, and it's still pretty dark. You may be able to get out of the building unseen if you're careful.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Trying to move this scene along without pressuring anyone into any specific action. If you do approach the Iris and do want to scrutinize, use Opacity 5 and treat it as shared Opacity for purpose of this specific Mystery (as I did with the other one in this scene).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> ...And then you blink, and the traumatic visions in front of you are gone. All you see is the door, still giving you this hunger for more knowledge, and your shattered mirror on the floor. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You temporarily lose the Divergent condition you created. You can still do Revelation with Space magic or any other Arcanum you like at 0 Opacity. FYI, since you didn't Withstand or resist the Mind spell at the time of its casting, as far as I can see per RAW you can't later change your mind or &quot;will it away.&quot; You either need to dispel or Binder needs to release it.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> And the truth, as they say, shall set you free. <br /> <br /> To your focused lens of Prime, your careful scrutiny of the door finally reveals information you nearly missed earlier. You know beyond any doubt that the hail, the storms, and the Iris are interrelated. Perhaps surprisingly to you, you can tell from the threads of magic subtly surrounding the door that no mage could have created it, because it's not actually a spell. That defies your current knowledge of the Supernal; a powerful spell could conceivably mimic the effect, but even when studying the Iris with your keen Prime Sight, you see no evidence of a nimbus reflected in, or imposed on, this doorway. <br /> <br /> You can also see now that the Iris is...dynamic in some way. Before, you witnessed the ways that mana was pulled into the portal, and it very much reminded you of how that hail seemed to pull energy only from Moonstone. Now, you see echoes of the Abyss in Moonstone's nimbus and saw a black streak of pure negative energy break off from the door to latch onto him in some way. Before you thought that maybe the Iris went to some Abyssal realm. After all, that's what Moonstone claimed, isn't it? But with your closer look, you see that the black energy is actually <i>superimposed</i> on a portal that seems somehow analogous to Space magic. It's like a thin, oily film covering a pure screen. <br /> <br /> It all clicks. The portal isn't precisely some link to some Abyssal realm. Moonstone's aura is <i>luring</i>, or attracting, something that resonates with him and it's hijacking the portal as a medium to make the connection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T06:32:21-07:00","id":935569,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> <br /> </div> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Let's get going. Most everybody's scattered, but I think we should try and move separately. An exchange student, a TA, and a professor might attract more attention walking together. I'll go first. Give me a couple minutes get downstairs and set up, I want to try and look forward in time and see how this could play out first.&quot; </span>With that, Ragnar heads out of the room, turning off his smartphone light and keeping his bag-with knife within- slung over his back. He scans the hallway for a few seconds to see if anybody is staring around, and then starts walking towards the stairs, trying to look as inconspicuous as possible. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar tries to scan the hallway to see if anybody is standing around or watching him. Resolve 2 + Composure 2 - Poor Lighting 2 = 2 dice -&gt; damn, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421378\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> Ragnar attempts to move down the hallway towards the stairs and downstairs without drawing attention to himself. Dexterity 3 + Stealth 1 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421379\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> End of scene for Ragnar? If so, I'll wait until Beans and Kvitebj\u00f8rn post to have Ragnar cast Time 1 Divination in the foyer.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T13:13:38-07:00","id":935761,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You don't see anything of note in the hallway. It seems clear and quiet at the moment.<br /> <br /> You go downstairs and slip past a small crowd of students, heading towards a side exit that leads into the street. A few students are running around, some with umbrellas, trying to cut between buildings for other classes or to head home. No one seems to pay any attention to you, not any more than they would anyone else walking around. On the first day of classes, you're not sure most students in Dr. McCalister's class were even paying close enough attention to recognize you as the TA.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">It's still considered the same Scene for purposes of spell duration, beats, etc. But we're not in initiative currently, so if you want to cast a spell or take another action, go ahead.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T13:37:18-07:00","id":935780,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Clear Thoughts (Moonstone), The Outward and Inward Eye</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 6/10 Health: /OOOOOO<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> Once he sees that Moonstone seems steadier, he'll turn his attention back to the portal for a final attempt at Revelation.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Gnosis 1 + Space 2 - Opacity 0 = 3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421444\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes...</a> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Frustrated at his lack of insight into the door's nature, Binder attempts a spell that he hopes will at least show him what lies beyond. He focuses his mind and draws on his knife.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>The Outward and Inward Eye</i> (Space 1)<br /> 2 Free Reach; Spending for instant speed, 1 beyond spell control, and 2 for the option to see through spatial warps.<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 2 + 4 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) - 2 (spending 2 Mana) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421447\" target=\"_blank\">1 success </a><br /> Wisdom 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421448\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes!</a> +1 Resistant Bashing!<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantra 2 (Concentration) = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://http://orokos.com/roll/421450\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T14:04:00-07:00","id":935797,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration: Does a lot. Best to actually read text in book.)<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 9/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b><br /> </div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well,</span>&quot; Lynx says as he looks to Dr. Asphodel, Ragnar stepping out of the room, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'll go next. Don't linger too long, okay? I really don't think we should split up much.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He smiles and bristles, his body easing up as he eventually walks after Ragnar. Unlike the man in front of him, Lynx isn't overly cautious in his advance. He absentmindedly fingers his exposed pendant on the way, and, when at the stairs, waits with his descent until Ragnar's reached the bottom. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T15:11:55-07:00","id":935827,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar stops when he gets to the door. He takes a moment to ponder his next course of action. He told the others that he wanted a couple minutes to try and look ahead in time. Forewarned is forearmed, of course. Standing beside it, looking out the window, as if at the storm, Ragnar begins to concentrate. He briefly considers what information he wants and then begins casting his spell. He mentally reaches out, considering the chain of events that have led him to this moment, and then with the aid of magic, looks ahead at the path events will carry him on? He feels his very being strain to see what the future holds. But he feels so alive at this moment. His success in the classroom spurs him to further success, and the ease with which he tugged the metaphorical strings of fate gives him insight on how to follow the thread of time into the realm of that which is to be.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>If we step out into the hail, will it harm us? Is something going to come out of that portal while we're investigating it? </i></span>And then, he adds, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Will investigating the portal lead to us meeting more magic-users?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts Time 1 Divination as an improvised spell. He is using concentration as a yantra. He uses his two free Reaches to add two levels of Potency to the spell, and an additional reach to get specific answers. Since he got Inspired from casting Exceptional Luck previously, I'm going to resolve the condition now, since he's kind of on a high about it.<br /> <br /> Paradox 1 = 1 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421457\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>. I'm getting lucky on these Paradox rolls!<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + WP 3 + Concentration 2 - Potency (3) 4 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421458\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. No exceptional success, but at least I get an Arcane Beat!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-22-2016, 06:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T16:32:26-07:00","id":935851,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus, Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: BOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 5/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> He can see Binder's spell forming- the Imago and Nimbus look different, but the effect is familiar. It's like he had a pounding hangover and the music and the lights just got turned down real low. He feels everything less intensely. It's not bad.<br /> <br /> Moonstone takes his ballcap off, blinks, rubs his forehead. His voice is obviously calmer and slower. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Thank you...hey.&quot;</span> He snaps and points his finger: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;You. I've seen you. You're the bookstore guy- is it okay if I say your name? I'm 'Moonstone' right now. He's Phoenix. Figures we would run into you. You must be the other mage from my divination. The three of us will be meeting more soon, too. Just so you know.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He looks at Binder and Phoenix and his shoulders slump. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Sorry. I wish you hadn't seen that. That's not how I always am. I, uh- I lost family recently, and I feel like I've been sleepwalking all week. My Pattern is frayed. You don't need to keep the spell up forever. Once I stop and get my strength back, I'll be able to manage it on my own.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Matter-of-factly: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I was panicking. I caused a Paradox, and it's poisoning my Nimbus. I'll need to be more careful with my spells for a while, until I can get rid of it. But I'm not possessed, and as far as I know, we aren't standing next to some kind of hellmouth. In fact, let me just make sure.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> While Phoenix scrutinizes and Binder works a Space spell, Moonstone opens up the full panoply of his magical senses. This time with a stronger sense of self to anchor him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's just attempt Revelation while we've got the chance. Spending 1 Mana to add Time to my Active Sight, then switching to Focused and attempting Revelation with Mind+Space+Time. 3 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421474\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-22-2016, 07:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T16:56:12-07:00","id":935859,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Active Sight:</b> Forces, Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Nightvision, Hail Bubble (CT)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>BB</b>OOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I don't think this portal leads to the Abyss, Moonstone,</span>&quot; I state once he's managed to calm down a little, &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">More like the Abyss used it as a medium to get to you.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> So the Deathstorm and this portal are interrelated, and the portal wasn't made from a spell. So maybe the portal is leaking out some kind of energy that creates the Deathstorm? In any case, it's unlikely that Anubis, or any mage for that matter, created the storm or this portal. So where does it lead? Without thinking, I put my hand against the portal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T06:27:00-07:00","id":936055,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> No Active Spells<br /> Conditions: Poor Light</div> <br /> Viv waits til the other two are well down the stairs before she starts her descent, squinting after them. She keeps her ears perked especially, due to the fact that she may well be called on by some student or other instructor---authority comes with responsibility, and it can sometimes have its downsides.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T20:04:43-07:00","id":936875,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">*Start of New Scene*</span></b></div> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> The door continues to confuse and frustrate you. Perhaps this experience will become easier for you with time, but for now, you struggle to see through the door or fathom its nature.<br /> <br /> You draw on your knowledge and fledgling control over the Space arcanum, and in doing so, you gain a thrilling sense of awareness all around you that takes your breath away. You can see through your eyes, but in a dizzying fashion, you can see yourself from every other angle simultaneously. You can look around the corner of the building and still see the people sitting on the bench at the top of the stairs by the train platform. You can see Moonstone and Phoenix's faces fixed in concentration as they study the Iris.<br /> <br /> More importantly to you in this moment, you can see into the very portal in front of you -- but you still struggle to fully understand what you're seeing. You can sense that the portal does not connect to any realm on Earth, but you know nothing of this strange place you can see. It's clearly not the Shadow, the realm of spirits, and it doesn't share the same feeling as the Astral realm you briefly journeyed to when you Awakened.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Per that spell, it explains Distortions and where they lead, which are Space Irises that connect to other places on Earth. I'm ruling that you need access to at least 1 dot of Prime magic to understand more about this particular type of Iris.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You stop before crossing the courtyard, in sight of the small alleywhere you saw the magical door before, at least while your Sight was open. You can't see it exactly right now, but you suddenly feel like you're rolling a pair of dice and aren't sure what the numbers will show -- a sense that somehow tells you that something magical is nearby.<br /> <br /> You dip your finger in the river of Time and study its flow. As you form questions in your mind, the answers come to you with brief flashes of the future.<br /> <br /> An image of hail falling and hitting you as you cross the courtyard, and of Lynx and Dr. Asphodel as they cross after you. <i>The hail will not hurt you or the mages with you, not in your current condition.</i><br /> <br /> A flash of bright moving colors muted by a cloud of black, swirling on the wall. <i>Nothing will exit </i>through <i>the portal when you study it.</i><br /> <br /> An older man, eyes filled with worry. <i>Studying the portal will lead you to one other mage, who will lead you to more.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your Peripheral Sight tells you that something magical is nearby.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You wait a few moments to make sure no one pays too much attention to you, but it doesn't take long. Everyone is either leaving for home, talking to a friend, or checking out their social media feeds on their phone. You're just another face in the crowd. You are able to reach Ragnar without drawing any additional attention. Some hail hits you, making your skin sting, but it doesn't seem to do anything special to you that you can see or sense.<br /> <br /> You make it to the back alley behind the adjacent building where Ragnar stands. You don't see any kind of door like he's described, but <i>something</i> is giving off that odd smell that you are learning to associate with the supernatural.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your Peripheral Sight tells you that something magical is nearby.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> A student or two stop by to apologize for leaving class, but you quickly assure them you'll pick up where you left off during your next class on Thursday afternoon. With only a little effort, you're able to catch up with Lynx and Ragnar near where the door is supposed to be. You don't see anything, not exactly, but you have a crawling sensation in your skin that tells you something supernatural is nearby.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your Peripheral Sight tells you that something magical is nearby.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> For just a moment, you have that sensation like you're on the top of a roller coaster about to begin its first descent -- and then you start to plummet towards the ground. The world shifts around you as you blink...<br /> <br /> ...And you open your eyes with an involuntary gasp. Your skin prickles with invisible pins and needles, almost like when your leg falls asleep and it's waking up. You're sitting upright in a thick, uncomfortable wooden chair. You're in a small room, maybe 10 feet across in each dimension. The walls look to be made of hewn stone; a hallway leads away from the room and turns to the left after a few feet. A small oil lantern is lit in the corner, and there is a desk beside you with ink, a short quill, and a few books. You are alone.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your Nightvision spell stays active, but your Hail Bubble spell ends immediately, which Phoenix would sense. You may roll Wits+Composure for perception.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You give yourself fully to your Sight, and this time, the door sings its secrets to you.<br /> <br /> The information is overwhelming, filtered through three arcana simultaneously. You do not sense any aspect of Mind in this portal; other than confirming that it does not lead to the Astral Realms, which you've only heard about in passing from Hakim, you learn little from that arcanum. To your Space Sight, you can see trails of mana and magic swirling away to another realm, far beyond any Earth you know. It isn't a shadowy portal to the Abyss, that much you can tell. There is no Key, no special passcode or requirement that you can sense. It's as if the door is awaiting to be opened. With your Time Sight, you learn something confusing that you know is true but cannot understand: the portal has existed for precisely 17 minutes, and simultaneously has existed for <i>millennia.</i> How can something be that new and yet that old? How can anything have <i>two </i>ages?<br /> <br /> While you contemplate this information, Phoenix suddenly vanishes before your eyes. As he does, the shield protecting you from hail also abruptly vanishes. A few more pieces of black ice strike your skin and <i>burn</i> even worse than before. The blackness around the Iris bubbles in response, as if threatening to burst. There are a few awnings nearby that might offer some modicum of protection, or the covered stairwell back towards the train platform.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Lose 2 more mana from the hail.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-26-2016, 05:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T05:52:35-07:00","id":937019,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Steadfast (Arcane Beat) | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>EDIT:</b> Phoenix ended Nightvision and bashing wound has been healed.<br /> <br /> <b>OOC:</b> A few questions:<br /> <br /> 1) Wait, why would Hail Bubble end? As far as I know, once a spell is cast, assuming there's nothing like a Concentration Yantra or similar, the spell continues until its Duration ends, is dispelled, or the caster ends it. If that's incorrect, could someone let me know the page where it says otherwise, please?<br /> <br /> 2) Is the room adequately lit or would Phoenix suffer Poor Lighting if Nightvision is taken off?<br /> <br /> 3)Is this a scene change? </div> </div> </div>Okay, <i>not</i> the brightest idea touching the portal. Gotta keep my curiosity in check. Oh well, it's done and I'm...wherever this place is. I let the mundane world sink back in to get my bearings.<br /> <br /> Hewn stone room, wooden chair, quill pen with ink, books, and an oil lantern, did I wind up in the past or something? Time to find out, so I stand up to take a good look around the room.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Turning off Active Sight.<br /> <br /> General perception check in the room (so he's not leaving it yet).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422029\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 = 5 dice \u2192 2 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 07-25-2016, 11:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T08:51:09-07:00","id":937112,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar nods his head. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">So the hail won't hurt us, nothing's coming out through the portal, and we're going to meet another mage. Sounds like a win-win-win to me. </span></i><br /> <br /> The feeling of taking a gamble on something pulls at Ragnar. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Magic? </span></i>He opens himself to Fate and Time, giving himself over fully to his Mage Sight. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar uses Active Mage Sight with Fate and Time. I forgot that I had uses two Mana earlier to examine the student, so I corrected that here.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T20:59:28-07:00","id":937452,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> Before you close your Sight, you notice a white dazzling light shining off every surface of the room, from every brick and even the objects lying on the table. The very air seems to hum with Prime magic; it calls to you, and you feel like you could tap into it. Even once your Sight fades, you hear faint whispers of chimes, a quiet melody that you know as a peripheral sense of the supernatural. <br /> <br /> To your mundane vision, as you study the room more closely, you notice some odd facts. First, there is a glint of yellow gold shining from near the books; upon closer inspection, you see gilded runes embedded in the book covers. To your astonishment, you know what they mean, to a degree -- some are beyond anything you can comprehend, but some of the text is legible through what you can only assume is some kind of Supernal enlightenment. The runes you can read hint at complex mathematical formulas and philosophical debates. <br /> <br /> You notice that the room seems to be some kind of study. The only furniture is the desk, but there is a small mat on the floor next to an unlit piece of something resembling incense and a rune carved in the stone that you read as &quot;Truth.&quot;<br /> <br /> You hear a rumble through the stone ceiling, echoing softly through the hallways, that sounds like thunder. Otherwise you hear nothing moving or making any particular noise.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">All spellcasting rolls for Prime spells may use an environment Yantra at +2 and do not cause Paradox.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> With your renewed Sight, you see the door again, boring out of the wall. Upon closer inspection, you realize it's not entirely black; it looks like two superimposed swirls of magic. You see an array of bright colors, swirling like a kaleidoscope, and then an inky cloud of black as dark as midnight. You feel a sense of deja vu at the sight of the image you foresaw moments ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T21:17:22-07:00","id":937463,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Light, Abyssal Nimbus, Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: OOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 3/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> He's about to say something, and then Phoenix puts his hand on the portal and he's gone. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;There he goes,&quot;</span> Moonstone observes to Binder, magically calm as can be. It's easier to focus with his Mage Sight dropped.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;That confirms one thing I saw: there's no lock on this portal, no password, no secret name. One can simply step right through as Phoenix has. Where it leads, I haven't a clue- apparently not the Abyss. Or <i>when</i> it leads. This door has existed for 17 minutes, and also for thousands of years. These statements are both equally true. I suspect we are being hoodwinked. Or we have stumbled onto one of those impossible things that Alice contemplated before breakfast.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <i>Hiss, pop.</i> He cringes and recoils as the black ice strikes his skin again. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;And the hail is eating my Mana again. Which suggests that magic dies when it goes through that portal. Meet me under that awning to plan our next move?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Fractured mirror in hand, he runs like hell down the alley to the nearest little awning over some store's delivery entrance and presses himself flat against the wall as best as he can.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Dexterity+Athletics to evade the hail and get to cover ASAP: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422236\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Safely in some sort of cover, he decides to do something about that fearsome black boil on the portal before it pops: cleanse his Nimbus. He grips his mirror tight and closes his eyes and instinctively shreds his own Pattern, and after a few seconds he cries out from abdominal pain and coughs and sputters and pukes up blood and bile onto the pavement.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Using my 1 Pattern Scouring per day to remove Abyssal Nimbus and take 1 Lethal damage, and gain 1 Arcane Beat from the experience I believe.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He wipes blood off his lips onto his gloves and weakly says: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I meant to do that.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We got ahead of ourselves. You are...a Warlock? A fellow Mastigos? Do you know these words? You danced with the devils in the black spiral labyrinth and all that?&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-26-2016, 12:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T04:01:01-07:00","id":937541,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate (activated this post)<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 8/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">There's the odour again.</span></i><br /> <br /> The hail leaves Lynx uneasy as he catches up to Ragnar. Instinctively, he keeps his eyes and nose in the direction of the smell. He checks to make sure Dr. Asphodel is following behind him (and is pleased that she is), and then directs his attention to the mystery at hand.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">There's </span></i><span style=\"color:#800000\">something<i> here, isn't there? I can't see it with mundane eyes... will I be able to do with my Primal senses?</i></span><br /> <br /> Lynx takes a deep breath and closes his eyes. He reaches out to taste the Wild; his nose prickles and his ears do a simple twitch. He bristles as he opens his senses to the Primal Wild.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Huh...it felt easier to do this time. Great! I'm learning!</span></i><br /> <br /> He opens his eyes again with a small self-satisfied smile.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx activates Mage Sight. He spends 1 Mana to activate Fate alongside Life and Spirit as he still doesn't know how to control it. His sensory experience still draws equally from sight, smell, and sound, though also a weak sensation of taste.</span></b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-27-2016, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T15:12:27-07:00","id":937792,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You sprint over to an awning, which provides just enough cover that the hail doesn't hit you directly. If you move much more in any direction, though, you'll be hit again.<br /> <br /> You're not sure how you thought of it, but you reflexively know precisely how to expel the Abyssal influence from your nimbus. The sensation is not unlike sticking a knife under your skin and yanking out a severe sliver, except it's far less precise and much more painful. It's a good thing that Binder's spell keeps your mind in check, or you'd probably be struggling to contain your fear.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Because you took your next action to immediately move, you don't need the Dex+Athletics roll. And yes, you gain 1 Arcane Beat from resolving a magical condition.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You force open your Sight once more, which feels like a lizard might as it peels open the protective nictitating membrane covering its eyes. In doing so, the shadowy door appears before you. Your senses are bombarded with information that you are still trying to understand how to process.<br /> <br /> To your Life Sight, sniffing the area immediately around you and in front of the door evokes a stale smell, or maybe like a pond filled with standing water -- not death or rot, but no dynamic growth or motion. Through Fate Sight, you sense a dazzling array of colors hidden behind a pitch black veil, both of which swirl in opposing directions on the wall.<br /> <br /> Like earlier, your active Spirit Sight reveals the Gauntlet between this world and the Shadow, and you see hail sizzle as it burns through the Gauntlet in some places. Now that the storm has gathered here for longer, through the holes left by hail, you see some dark spirits with mandible-like mouths and red eyes gathering in the area. They seem to be cautiously feeding on the hail that has fallen through to the Shadow. The spirits smell rancid to you. The Gauntlet slowly reforms within moments, preventing the spirits from crossing into the material world, but you know they are still there.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You are welcome to attempt Revelation or Scrutiny if you wish, using Opacity 5. I'm going to use the same modified Opacity rules for this particular Mystery, just as I did with the other group, and then we'll use the correct rules for all later Mysteries.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Updated description of Lynx's Sight into the Shadow. 07-27-2016, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T15:40:25-07:00","id":937803,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">RAGNAR<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar notices Lynx walk up senses Lynx walk up beside him, and catches him close and open his eyes again. He feels the same feeling of joy and satisfaction that he felt earlier. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>I taught him how to do that. Me. </i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I've taken a look into the future,&quot; </span>he whispers, not turning his head to face Lynx. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Pushed myself a little to try and get some specifics, but it's all good news- I think it is, anyways. I'll wait until Dr. Asphodel shows up to tell you guys. In the meantime...&quot; </span>he smiles faintly. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I'm glad I got to be the one who taught you how to use your Sight. Seeing anything interesting?&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T07:01:01-07:00","id":938083,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate (ends this post)<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 8/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Lynx shudders at the smell, tensing with a small step backwards - but curiosity leaves him no choice, as he keeps his senses peeled on the veil. He approaches the phenomenon slowly, sniffing it deeply.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx attempts a Revelation Roll, but gains no successes.</b><br /> <br /> Revelation Roll to reveal the phenomenon of the Veil: Gnosis 1 + Spirit 2 + Willpower (+3) - Opacity (-5), total dice 1.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422512\" target=\"_blank\">Revelation Roll </a></span><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422512\" target=\"_blank\">\u2192 0 Successes</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He grits his teeth as he steps back from the veil, careful to keep his distance, as he gleans nothing at all. His eyes linger on the spirits instead.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Those don't look all that friendly to me.</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">There's this...veil. Stale, and quiet, and... empty. Lifeless. There's also this swirl of colours there, trying to go two separate ways,</span>&quot; Lynx says quietly. He then points to the spirits.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">There are spirits around here.</span> <span style=\"color:#800000\">A little like...insects? Mandibles and glowing red eyes. They smeill rancid, and they're feeding on the hail. I don't think that's good for them. Gut tells me that, at least, but I don't really know...</span>&quot; Lynx shakes his head. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">It doesn't feel right. I don't like it.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks at Ragnar as he mentions the Sight; he notes the man's smile. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Sight?</span>&quot; He scratches his beard. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I think I'd describe it like a... well. I can see it, yeah, but I smell it too! Hear it, taste it, feel it on my skin! I guess it's more like Sensing rather than just Seeing. Is it different to you?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He observes Ragnar for a moment, then he grins. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I still appreciate it. I don't think I'd have figured it out on my own. I'll admit I'm pretty new to this...</span>&quot; He holds his hands out, as though touching the Wild, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">To magic. <i>Faen</i>, but this Sight or Sense strains me over time. One moment...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> With a slow breath, he closes his senses to the Primal Wild.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Action: Lynx ends his Mage Sight.</span></b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-27-2016, 10:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T07:18:46-07:00","id":938091,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Clear Thoughts (Moonstone)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 6/10</div> <br /> Binder makes a face as he also takes shelter under the awning, staring up at the storm. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Warlock sounds about right. I summoned a demon, it pulled me into hell, taught me magic, then spat me back out again. There wasn't a lot of dancing, though. I'm not familiar with a lot of the terms you're using, though. Paradox? Nimbus? Abyss? Mana?</span>&quot; He shakes his head. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">I know what those words mean, but the context is foreign. Sounds like you kids are the more experienced ones here.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> The older mage looks back toward Moonstone, face going sympathetic. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Hey, about before. It sounds like you're going through some tough times, and it's only natural to get wound up when that happens. I know we don't really know eachother, but if you need someone to talk to, I'm willing to be that person. But, uh,</span>&quot; he looks pointedly at the bloody vomit, &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">are you sure you don't need to go to a hospital?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">@Caladriu: Feel free to just be like &quot;Now's not the time for a long explanation&quot; or like &quot;Moonstone explains the terms he used&quot; rather than typing out a full explanation of stuff (unless you want to, lol).</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T11:31:54-07:00","id":938238,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar nods his head at Lynx's mention of the veil. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Yes, that's what I saw. A portal all different colors like a kaleidoscope, and a black veil in front of it. I think I picked up on the veil in the classroom.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Spirits</i>? Flying around us?&quot; </span>The news rattles him. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Probably shouldn't be surprised, but still...&quot; </span>Ragnar stifles an involuntary shudder. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;If I had known they were around, I could've checked to see if they would attack us. What you said about them eating the hail is interesting. If it didn't nourish them, I don't think they would eat it. But if it's in any way related to that veill, it probably has some nasty side-effects. Short-term gain, long-term harm. Like eagles eating fish laced with DDT.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He furrows his brow and tilts his head at Lynx's description of his Senses. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Interesting. We seem to have similar abilities, but the way they manifest are completely different. You experience it as sensory stimuli. I notice it as... connections, I guess. Everything is connected. The strings of fate, flow of time, the web of life, the fabric of space. But for you, it's about nature: scents, animal features.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Ragnar attempts to figure out the significance of his and Lynx's magic manifesting in different ways. Wits 2 + Occult 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422537\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T12:01:47-07:00","id":938256,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> It doesn't take a lot of reasoning to figure out that each mage might have a slightly different Sight. You've only met two mages so far, at least that you know of, and they seem to have different approaches to magic. As to why, or what makes them different, you aren't really sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T14:57:10-07:00","id":938345,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Light, Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 3/10</b><br /> <br /> &quot;I just got <i>out </i> of the hospital.&quot; He flexes his fingers, feeling the bandages under his gloves. &quot;I'll be okay. It hurts, but I was purging something negative from my body. But thank you for asking.&quot;<br /> <br /> His thoughts are clear, but he's still mentally and physically exhausted. &quot;The words I use- don't worry for right now. This isn't the time or place for initiation into the Mysteries. I don't know Phoenix's story yet, but I've been part of this world for a long time, and there's a common vocabulary that many people use who practice true magic in America. Lots of proper nouns in Greek and Latin and Sanskrit. I'm just now realizing how much of it was just <i>words </i>to me until recently, when I had an experience like yours. I doubt I know much more than you do of the Art itself. Aion knows I've never summoned a demon. But from what you said, and seeing how you work magic- they call magicians like us <i>Mastigos.</i> Binders and mentalists.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As for the other thing...&quot; protracted sigh, half-slump down the wall. &quot;I want to talk to someone about it. Badly. But...I don't think I can right now. I'm sorry. My...er, <i>mentor,</i> I suppose, passed this week. His name is Hakim, he's a magician like us. But I couldn't work magic when he was alive. He helped me manage my illness, so...&quot;<br /> <br /> Grasping delicate hand gestures, visibly looking for words. Finally he just lays a hand on the man's shoulder and smiles. &quot;I appreciate you working that spell for me. Thank you. Really. It's been a very difficult couple of days, trying to process everything and not being able to think as clearly. Maybe we can talk more after this storm, if you still want to listen.&quot;<br /> <br /> Instinct says hug, but that doesn't seem appropriate. He just lets his hand trail back down, and looks back at the far wall with worry. &quot;For right now...if I stay out in the hail, it's going to sap more of the magic in me. I don't know what will happen if I run out. And it wouldn't be right to leave Phoenix to his fate.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glances down at the awful pile at his feet. &quot;<i>I</i> could go through. You could use my blood sympathetically to see where I went. It's just following my mystical breadcrumb trail. Or cut a curl of my hair. I wouldn't ask you to dirty that lovely knife for me...you didn't see anything in the portal, did you?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-27-2016, 05:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T15:52:52-07:00","id":938404,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Active Spells: <i>Clear Thoughts (Moonstone)</i><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 6/10</div> <br /> Binder shakes his head. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Nothing that I understood. I don't think it goes someplace...</span>&quot; he searches for a way to describe it, &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">on this plane of existence? But, if you want to go through, I think I can manage that.</span>&quot; He chuckles. &quot;<span style=\"color:0025ab\">Let's go with the hair idea, though.</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T16:56:17-07:00","id":938434,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone </b><br /> <br /> &quot;I can't blame you for being squeamish. Thyrsus are the Path of Blood, not us.&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes his ballcap off and pulls a frizzy black curl from over his left ear. &quot;All yours. What you're going to do is...I've seen what you have in your store, you must have an idea of the concept of Sympathy. There's truth to that. My hair is a piece of me, and when you work magic on it, it's as if you're working magic on me, even when I'm far away. You're going to borrow that thread of sympathy to me that this lock of hair has, and make it part of you for a moment. Once you have a connection to me, you just picture me and you'll see me. It will make sense when you try it. Trust me.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T17:32:50-07:00","id":938448,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Cloak Nimbus (+4 CoW)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>OOC:</b> Forgot to ask this in a previous post, but would it be reasonable to assume he would sense the Iris near him or not before he took off his Sight? I mean, since he went through, would he still sense the presence of it say, behind him or something?<br /> <br /> For now, I'll assume that the Iris isn't around anywhere he could sense. If it is and he knows where it is, then I'll change this post to suit. </div> </div> </div>Looks like I'm in some kind of study, and an Awakened one at that. If anyone comes in and sees me as a mage, they'd probably think I was an invading enemy. Magic's pretty powerful here, possibly a place of power? Not sure, but if it is, then there's my motive. However, if I look like a Sleeper...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Cloak Nimbus p. 167<br /> 1 Free Reach, spending 3 on instant casting, Advanced Potency, and Advanced Duration<br /> +2 environment Yantra<br /> -4 for Duration to last 1 week, raising to 1 month as PSF<br /> 2 Paradox dice, -2 using Dedicated Tool, containing any Paradox<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422616\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox 2 - 2 DT = 0 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422617\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 2 Environment Yantra - 4 Spell Factors = 1 die \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <br /> Resolving Steadfast to make it 1 success instead and getting an Arcane Beat.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I manage to cover my inner light. Hopefully, it'll be enough against any mages here. Now, time to go looking for a way out. My only lead is the hallway, so I cautiously thread forth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T21:32:02-07:00","id":938584,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: You wouldn't have sensed or seen an Iris. The entire room has a faint magical aura to it, which you already saw, but nothing else currently triggering your Peripheral Sight. </div> </div> </div>You mentally prepare to cast your spell, and when you channel your Prime magic, you brace yourself for the potential rebound effect that you know comes from overextending yourself. But this time, it never comes. You press the arcanum, advance your magic, and <i>there is no push back</i>. Your Prime spell simply does not risk any paradox. This surprises you so much that you nearly forget how to cast your spell, but you force it to snap into place by sheer power of will. <br /> <br /> You turn the corner and see a long hallway. Two closed doors are on the left side of the hallway, which curves out of sight to the right ahead of you. A few more lanterns are burning, held out from the wall by steel rings, creating more ambient light. The hallway is quiet. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Gain 1 Arcane Beat from resolving the condition. Your Prime spell doesn't risk paradox, even for overreaching, so you do not roll paradox at all.<br /> <br /> You may roll Wits+Composure for perception.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T06:03:20-07:00","id":938765,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting<br /> ACTIVE MAGE SIGHT ON</b></div> <br /> The doc opens her Awakened eyes wider, glimmering like lead and bone behind her glasses. She comes up behind the boys soon, and though she can't see the spirits (unless they also somehow resonate with Death, I guess---probably not), she can tell that something's up.<br /> <br /> Eyes darting to take in whatever her sight <i>can</i> unveil, she whispers in a shaky hiss. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;W-w-wh's going o-on?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T06:36:12-07:00","id":938790,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar takes a breath to collect his thoughts. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Lynx and I have taken a look at the portal. What I saw from the classroom is actually some sort of veil in front of the actual portal. And apparently,&quot;</span> he gives the sky a wary look, <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;Lynx saw some spirits feeding on the hail. Which confirms that the hail is at least partly supernatural. We don't know for sure, but the hail and the veil may be connected. The spirits may be getting some sort of nourishment from the hail, but I can't imagine that it's not going to have long-term consequences for them.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He gives a satisfied smile. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;And now for the fun part. I looked forward in time, and I think it's all good news. I saw us walking out into the hail unharmed; it won't hurt us in our current condition. I saw the portal behind the veil; nothing is exiting through it. And...&quot; </span>his whisper becomes excited. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;I checked to see if we would meet other mages. If we investigate the portal, we're going to meet another mage. He's an older guy. And he's going to lead us to others.&quot; </span>He gives the others a smile.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;We're finally going to get some answers about who we are and why it happened.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T07:22:28-07:00","id":938820,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> When you open your Sight, you see what you can only describe as a doorway or portal. It seems to have bored a hole through the brick wall of the building you're staring at. Upon closer inspection, it almost looks like <i>two</i> portals: One is shimmering and slowly swirling, the other is a midnight-black oily cloud that seems to bubble in front of the first portal. Your lens through the Matter Arcanum confirms that, like you saw with the hail earlier, the portal is not harming the structure or integrity of the building. To your Death Sight, you do not sense any undead presence in the portals, although the black oily cloud evokes a sense of something alive but not quite living.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T06:11:12-07:00","id":939480,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Cloak Nimbus (CoW +4)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> My hands gird me against the corrupting influence of the Abyss as I cast the spell, and yet I don't feel any. My spell forms without trouble. That...is new. Is this place not on Earth? Like an alien dimension or something? Seems like Earth, though. Maybe I should check outside if there's a sun or moon or something. I cautiously explore the hallway, peeking into the doors as quietly as I can.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception check and quietly opening the doors.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423009\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 = 5 dice \u2192 3 successes</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423010\" target=\"_blank\">Dexterity 3 - 1 Untrained = 2 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <br /> I'd like to make the last roll a dramatic failure.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T12:28:24-07:00","id":939707,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 8/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: </b><b>Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> Lynx takes in Ragnar's words, but says nothing. He keeps his eyes where the rift is, rubbing his beard. He doesn't turn around to face Dr. Asphodel when she arrives - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ragnar's better with words than I am</span></i> - though when Ragnar breaks the exciting news, Lynx looks up with budding giddiness.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">More mages?</span>&quot; He says, his voice brimming with excitement. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">And going in won't hurt us? Well, if Time says it's fine...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Before the others can say a word, Lynx straightens his shoulders, and walks straight into where he saw the shadowy door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T13:09:31-07:00","id":939733,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar blinks in surprise as Lynx walks outside. Then he looks at Dr. Asphodel, shrugs his shoulders, and says, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Shall we?&quot; </span>And with that, he walks outside after Lynx.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T20:21:23-07:00","id":939930,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Light, Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 3/10</b></div> <br /> With a lock of his hair (presumably) cut for sympathy, Moonstone pats Binder on the shoulder. &quot;See you on the other side. Hopefully. Better than staying in the cursed hailstorm.&quot;<br /> <br /> He tucks his (even more cracked) mirror into his bag, steadies himself, opens his true sight to see where he's going, and rushes through the hail to leap headlong through the Iris, and hopefully not splat against a brick wall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T05:55:02-07:00","id":940058,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</div> <br /> Dr. Asphodel blinks, sighs, and shrugs. She scuttles after the boys, a little wary but hoping that three... whatever-they-ares like themselves can take on a problem if it arises.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T22:09:12-07:00","id":940471,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> When you pause to listen, you hear a louder rumble, which this time sounds clearly like thunder. Wherever you are, some kind of storm seems to be here, too. <br /> <br /> You peek into the first room by quietly pushing the door open. It looks very similar to the room you were in earlier, except this one also has a small cot, suggesting that it might be used as some kind of living or resting quarters. <br /> <br /> As you open the second door, the hinge catches and the door seems to be stuck. You push just a little harder, and the door suddenly jerks open. Your grip on the handle slips and the door smashes against the wall with a loud clatter. In the otherwise quiet chambers, the noise carries down the hallway. You suddenly feel a chill as a breeze stirs the air, coming from further down the hallway. <br /> <br /> The room behind this second door looks like a storage closet, including a broom, a simple gardening hoe, and more quills and inkwells.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Take a beat for the dramatic failure.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx, Ragnar, and Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> You all take a step right into the Iris. Immediately, you feel a pulling sensation...<br /> <br /> ...and your world is a turbulent, confusing kaleidoscope of darkness and movement. You realize that you're disoriented, but more alarming, when your mind clears you realize you're all <i>underwater</i>.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I need each of you to roll Dexterity + Athletics. If you fail, roll Stamina + Composure. You also have the Poor Light tilt here at -2 perception. You may roll Wits + Composure for perception, using this penalty.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> The hail crashes into you, sapping even more of your mana. It burns, although perhaps not as much as it did a few moments ago...odd.<br /> <br /> You touch the Iris, being pulled through, and...<br /> <br /> You experience a foul, gut-wrenching nausea and the sensation of breathing in a cloud of noxious fumes. It's jarring and painful, but only for a second. <br /> <br /> ...and then you blink, and you're in a very strange place. You're lying on a cot in a small room, drenched in sweat like you've just run ten miles. There are a few books stacked on a desk next to you, an oil lantern lit in the corner, and a quill and inkwell next to what looks like parchment paper. The walls are made of what looks like hewn stone. The door to your room is cracked open, peering into an adjacent hallway. <br /> <br /> You realize with dread that your emotions are suddenly rushing back into you. Whatever happened, walking through that Iris seems to have stripped away Binder's magic calming your mind. <br /> <br /> You suddenly hear a loud clatter very close by, and feel a gust of wind pass a moment later.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Lose 1 more mana. Your Divergent condition returns in the active state.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> Moonstone vanishes before your eyes as he passes into the Iris. When he does, the black cloud clinging to the Iris suddenly dislodges itself, breaking away and collapsing into a puddle on the ground. You feel a rising sense of something supernatural happening. This doesn't surprise you, because the black puddle is starting to rise up from the ground. It levitates and congeals into a perfectly spherical ball, although slimy droplets occasionally ooze off off it and fall to the ground beneath it. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: I forgot if you have active Sight or not currently because it's not clear from your header on your last post, but you would see this even with your mundane vision now. </div> </div> </div>You also distinctly sense something snapping, as you feel your Mind spell protecting Moonstone suddenly unravel the moment he disappears. You do have a piece of his hair held firmly in your hands, and his brief instructions on how to somehow use it to reach him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-31-2016, 01:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T04:33:44-07:00","id":940567,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 8/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilt</b><b>s: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">...!</span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx attempts the Athletics roll, presumably to stabilise, and gets 1 success.</b><br /> <br /> Dice pool for Athletics roll: Dexterity (2) + Athletics (2), total dice 4.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423342\" target=\"_blank\">Athletics Roll \u2192 1 success.</a><br /> <br /> <b>He then attempts the Perception roll, and gains 1 success.</b><br /> <br /> Dice pool for Perception roll: Wits (3) + Composure (3) + Heightened Senses (+1) + Poor Light Tilt (-2), total dice 5.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423343\" target=\"_blank\">Perception roll \u2192 1 success</a></span><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423343\" target=\"_blank\">.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Is this how Time works? It knows we're able to swim? That sounds... dumb. I thought Ragnar said it'd be safe.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Or... did he say '</span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">if we </span></i><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">investigate</span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>'?<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Well, this is a </i>hands-on approach<i> if I ever saw one.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> He never said anything about it actually being safe to enter, did he...?</i></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">...</span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-31-2016, 07:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T06:01:50-07:00","id":940592,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> <br /> </div> The first thing that pops into Ragnar's mind is an emphatic, <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Fuck! </span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>Look before you leap next time, Ragnar. Yeah, Lynx kinda barreled in, but still... Who's the bigger fool, the man who rushes in, or the one who follows him?</i></span><br /> <br /> He flounders for a moment, and he tries to will his arms to plow through the water and his legs to start kicking. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to stabilize/swim: Dexterity 3 + Athletics 2 = 5 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423348\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bHis eyes begin casting around in the dark, desperately searching for the surface of this water, or any sort of light source. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts a perception check: Wits 2 + Composure 2 + WP 3 - Poor Lighting 2 = 5 dice -&gt; damn, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423349\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T07:00:04-07:00","id":940606,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> As you frantically try to orient yourself in the water, your mind replays the conversation Ragnar had. You realize that he said the <i>hail</i> would be safe, and that nothing would exit through the portal while you investigated it; he didn't say anything about entering the portal. <br /> <br /> Your head suddenly breaks above water, and you take a deep breath. Your eyes, still heightened from your spell, are able to see through the darkness. You're floating in a small pool in what appears to be an underground cavern. Water quietly drips from stalactites on the ceiling. <br /> <br /> The edge of the pool is only a few feet away from you. There is a large archway in the cave that looks unnaturally smooth and angular, centered over a dark hallway that leads away from the pool.<br /> <br /> You don't smell or hear anything that suggests anyone is nearby. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You thrash in the water, trying to stabilize yourself. After a moment you let your reflexes take over, and you feel the buoyancy of the water guide you towards the surface. Your hand touches air, and you quickly move to get your head above the water so you can breathe deeply. <br /> <br /> Your eyes haven't adjusted, and it is very dark in here. The air feels humid on your face. You hear Lynx catching his breath in the water beside you. Dr. Asphodel is still in the water somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T07:34:53-07:00","id":940617,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar sputters for a moment. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Well. If I had known we were taking a swim, I would've packed a swim suit.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> The darkness is disorienting, and he tries to focus on the source of Lynx's breathing to give himself a point of reference. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Lynx, what do you see? I can't make anything out. The air feels humid. Is this some sort of swimming pool?&quot; </span><br /> <br /> Things have <i>not </i>gone as he thought they would. Investigating the portal was supposed to lead them to another mage. But was stepping through it the right way to investigate? Ragnar gathers his magic to himself, and mentally dips his hand into the stream of time once more.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> <i>\u200bAre we still on the right path to find that mage? </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts Time 1 Divination as an improvised spell. He uses one free Reach to make the spell Instant Casting, and another free Reach to get specific Answers. Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + WP 3 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423365\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> His mood becomes more somber when he realizes that he can't hear Dr. Asphodel. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;If Asphodel doesn't surface in a couple seconds, we need to pull her out. I'll tag both of us with that luck manipulation spell, and then we'll look for her. Stay within arms-length of me so that I can keep tagging us with it. If Dr. Asphodel is struggling, that should be enough to help her out.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T08:49:27-07:00","id":940633,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting<br /> Health: 7/7 | WP: 4/5 | Mana: 10/10</b></div> <br /> Dr. Asphodel walks into the porta<i>WHARRGARBL</i><br /> <br /> Well, now she's underwater. Not even just in it, under it. Probably a good deal of it. She nearly panics, but by force of will she keeps her head and instead swims hard for the surface, managing to keep her grip on her very important cane (though she has it on a lanyard in any case).<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">DEX 2 + Athletics 2 + 3 dice from spending 1WP = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423392\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux, whoa!</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As she swims, she tries to look around in the murky water, squinting through the glasses that stay on her face by... probably sheer luck.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">WIT 3 + CMP 3 - 2 (Poor Lighting) = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423395\" target=\"_blank\">2 sux</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T09:18:39-07:00","id":940645,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 8/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b><br /> </div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">You're okay!</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx huffs as he stabilises, sighing in relief. He glances around with a growing sense of excitement, and he answers Ragnar: &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">It's a cave. Got spires from the ceiling, that's the dripping you hear, and...&quot; He swirls a bit in the water. &quot;Land's right over here. And there's a large archway here too. And a hallway. Can't hear anything except us, or smell anything unusual.</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> He floats towards Ragnar, and lays a hand on his shoulder. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">This way,</span>&quot; he murmurs, guiding the man towards the edge of the pool. He keeps his eyes fixated on finding the good Dr. Asphodel. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Here's the ledge. Hope she's up soon.</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T10:24:25-07:00","id":940680,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None. Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent [active], Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> Everything is terrible again. He's sick and sweating and miserable and may have been unconscious for some unknown amount of time. And no immediate sign of Phoenix, either.<br /> <br /> Keep it together. A magician is never lost. And a stoneworked place like this, with parchment and quills and medieval trappings, frankly feels more like his element than the subway did. He looks in his cracked mirror, tilting it in all directions, and envisions himself seeing from all directions as well. But he can't focus, the chattering and whirling in his mind makes it harder to form a clear Imago for the spell. Better push harder to make it work!<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting &quot;The Outward and Inward Eye&quot; [that name's a mouthful], or some improvised effect similar to it. My intent is to see what's outside this room in all directions and get a mental map of this area, see around the corners and through the floors, that sort of thing. I'm turning on my dungeon minimap.<br /> <br /> 2 free Reach, one for instant casting, one for scene duration. Abyssal Imago means I have to spend 3 more Reach on top of that, giving me 3 paradox dice. Going to contain any I get. 3 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423404\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.<br /> <br /> Wisdom to contain: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423405\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. 1 bashing damage for me.<br /> <br /> Actual spellcasting pool: Gnosis 1, Space 2, +1 for path tool. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423406\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. It's Potency 1, duration 1 scene.<br /> <br /> As I do that, I'll also activate Mind and Space sight for a second, just to see whether any other minds are in the area.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T04:08:00-07:00","id":941131,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> Upon casting your spell, you receive another voiceless response that you feel is correct in your gut. The answer is similar to before, and seems even more firm than earlier. <i>You will meet another mage once you leave this place. He will lead you to others. </i>The message conveys a sense of urgency.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> You're panicked because you had no expectation of being underwater, but after a moment, you find the mental strength to focus. You instinctively and gracefully swim towards the surface; just before you do, you see Lynx and Ragnar floating near the water's edge, and you manage to slow your descent just enough to keep up your appearance of frailty.<br /> <br /> Perhaps it's because of your newfound knowledge of Death and shadows, but your eyes adjust quickly to what appears to be the faintest light coming from down a naturally formed hallway in some kind of cavern formation. Your group is floating in an underground pool.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> As you cast your spell, you feel your willworking be stretched and pushed further than you would like, as a taint of Abyss battles inside of your mind and warps your Imago. However, the spell still works as intended, to your relief.<br /> <br /> To your briefly opened Sight, you do sense a mind in the hallway -- and some other presence that you cannot quite see, but your Space Sight indicates something <i>moving</i> towards the other being. When your spell enhances your vision, you can see into and around the hallway from every angle. To your relief, you see Phoenix, who's peering into another room adjacent to yours.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Abyssal Imago requires that you use a minimum number of reach equal to the successes it scored, so 3 total -- not 3 <i>extra</i>. That means you only have 1 extra reach, and it's your first paradox roll in the new scene. So, you end up getting 0 successes on the paradox roll, so no damage.<br /> <br /> FYI, this means that you would've had an extra reach to spend on the last spell. Feel free to indicate what you would've used it on -- the simplest is just advanced an factor for something (e.g., duration).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You sense something supernatural -- or maybe two things? Your Periphery senses are detecting something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-01-2016, 10:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T06:20:46-07:00","id":941152,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Active Mage Sight (Fate, Time)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ragnar breathes a sigh of relief when he hears Dr. Asphodel break the surface. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Well, this didn't go the way any of us planned, but it worked out okay. The good news is, we're still on track to find that mage. We're going to meet him when we leave this cave, and then he'll lead us to others.&quot; </span>His voice is confident: stepping through the portal hasn't altered the event he saw.<br /> <br /> Ragnar hauls himself out of the water. He gives the others a sheepish grin. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Sorry about this. I should have mentioned that I hadn't asked what was on the other side of the portal. Otherwise, we could've been a little more prepared.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> \u200bLooking around the cave, he pulls out his smart phone and prays that it is still functioning.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;Can either of you guys dry us off? Not sure showing up on some mage's doorstep sopping wet will leave a good impression.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bNow. What's the situation here, and where exactly is </span></i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">here<i>? </i></span>Ragnar briefly engages his Sight, turning in a full circle before allowing his Sight to turn to normal. Then, reaching into his backpack, he pulls out his knife, unsheathes it, and stands with one hand outstretched, his knife pointing like the needle of a compass. He reaches out for the magic around him, but instead of turning his attention to the strings of Fate or the stream of Time, he turns his attention to the fabric of Space itself. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bI've never tried anything related to distances and space, but let's give it a spin. </span></i>He closes his eyes, picturing his car and his present location, and asks, <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>How far away is my car? </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to use Locate Object (Space 1) to determine how far away his car is. He is invoking his Dedicated Tool as a Path Tool Yantra, and is also using the Concentration Yantra. He has one free Reach, which he uses to make the spell Instant casting.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Space 1 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 = 5 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423565\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-01-2016, 12:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T07:47:55-07:00","id":941182,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You pull out your phone, and realize that the display is off. Thankfully, when you hit the power button, the display shows, but you don't have any signal. Whether that's due to the water or your location, you can't say.<br /> <br /> Your Active Sight does not provide anything of immediate use, but it does offer some information about the area. None of the other mages beside you exhibits any new threads of destiny, so at the very least, coming here has not dramatically or supernaturally altered their future. As for Time, you sense something but have a hard time describing it. It's almost like this area has a sort of timelessness to it. Time is passing here, and yet at the same time, it seems...frozen.<br /> <br /> The other thing that your Sight suggests is that there is a faint magical aura permeating this place -- in every rock, in every water droplet, the hallway itself. However, your Arcana in your Sight are not able to reveal what that might mean; it must fall under the purview of something other than Fate or Time.<br /> <br /> When you cast your spell, drawing on the Space Arcanum, you feel your Imago slide into place -- but you learn nothing. Despite your efforts, you are entirely unable to sense your car. You're not sure what to make of that.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Tell me if I'm reading this right, but I think Locate Object only works on objects that are within the area of the spell when you initially cast it. So, for example, you could increase the scale to include an entire house and instantly know that an item you're seeking is hidden behind a false wall in the bedroom. To locate a specific object at sensory range, you'd have to target it sympathetically, and would probably be a Ruling spell like Scrying (Space 2). Even if it would be an Unveiling spell (Space 1), the spell fails due to the nature of where you are located.<br /> <br /> Also, can you include a section in your header like the other players to let me know when you have Sight active and which Arcana you have included? Thanks.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T07:54:37-07:00","id":941188,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting<br /> WP: 4/5</div> <br /> Dragging herself out of the water, she shakes herself and allows herself to shiver. Grumbling, she squints around and wipes her glasses off, clothes clinging uncomfortably and outlining just how scrawny she is.<br /> The darkness makes her wonder if she might have something to do here; after all, she's discovered (through experimentation) that her strongest magical skills can do things with shadows. She puts on Active Mage Sight, wondering if this might be a job for Dr. Asphodel.<br /> ... She reminds herself not to think that sentence again, given she's an adult and not a goddamn 9-year-old playing superhero. Chrissakes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T09:12:51-07:00","id":941221,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Whew!</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> Lynx makes sure he's the last one to climb up from the pool. He remains seated on the ledge, legs in the water, as he flops onto his back. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm glad you're both all right.</span>&quot; Lynx rubs his beard, staring at the ceiling. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">That was my fault, though. If I had paid attention to what you said... I'm sorry.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Becoming pensive, he gazes around the cavern, allowing his instincts to take over momentarily. He opens his senses to the Wild again - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">This is getting easier and easier...Ah, it feels wonderful!</span></i> - letting his ears and nose do the majority of the work. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx opens his Mage Sight to Life, Spirit and Fate, spending 1 Mana since he still doesn't know how to control it. All senses as usual.</b></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T11:58:06-07:00","id":941316,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> As your mundane vision dims to the world around you, your Sight opens -- and your breath catches in your throat at the sight before you.<br /> <br /> This place -- this world? -- is <i>suffused</i> with Death.<br /> <br /> The water behind you, the hallway ahead of you, even the very walls of this place are filled with a residual element of Death magic. Your Periphery had detected a faint magical aura in this place, but now your Death Sight shows you what you were missing. Vague, amorphous ephemeral shapes are <i>everywhere</i> here. There are some frozen in place on the walls, some lining the hallway...even some in the pool behind you.<br /> <br /> You've seen at least one ghost since your Awakening, but haven't spoken to or interacted with it. But these beings you see don't quite resemble ghosts. They resemble something almost like a shadow of a ghost, if such a thing could exist -- a memory of a ghost. Between the humid air and the shadows, you feel a distinct sense that you are walking in a large mausoleum. This is sacred ground.<br /> <br /> Your Matter Sight reveals additional information that, while less startling, is equally unnerving. You can tell that most of the cavern is a natural formation. The archway over the walls, however, and the ground on the hallway leading away from the pool, appear made of a material that you have never seen. While it looks like stone to the naked eye, you find yourself unable to quantify its strength or quality; dark swirls of shadowy energy flow in the stone-like ground. It does not appear harmful, but is rather a reflection of this place's quality.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">All spell casting rolls for Death spells may use an environment Yantra at +2 and do not risk Paradox, regardless of how many reaches you use.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You take a deep breath in through your Sight. You can tell from a single whiff that regardless of what else has happened, there are no changes in yours or the others' odors of destiny -- being here has not caused a dramatic change in your future. Otherwise, the senses you are learning to associate with Fate magic feel no different than when you were standing in the classroom.<br /> <br /> Your scent and hearing of Life magic, normally your most potent supernatural senses, feel unusually muted here. You detect no other living beings within your immediate surroundings, save for some mold and mushrooms growing on the rocks around the pool. Interestingly, those mushrooms feel like they have some kind of energy stored within them. Upon closer study, you can tell that they have no toxins or poisons, marking them as safely edible.<br /> <br /> Your Spirit Sight does not reveal any spirits in Twilight, but you do see faint, vague shapes of energy frozen in place all around the walls and in the pool. You can't tell what they are, but they must be at least tangentially related to spirits, or your Sight wouldn't detect them. To your Spirit Sight, the energy in this place smells faintly of incense and sweet spices, and you think you hear a very quiet and low-pitched hum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T15:23:10-07:00","id":941445,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar notices the distant expressions on Lynx and Dr. Asphodel's faces. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Judging by the mile-long stares, I'm guessing you guys are using your Sight or Senses. Before we get going, let's exchange notes. When I got out of the water, I took a quick scan. This place is... weird. Time is passing normally, and yet...&quot; </span>he shakes his head. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;It's the weirdest thing. Either of you ever read </span><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>The Lord of the Rings</i>?</span> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Where the Elves lived, time still passed, but their homes were kind of out... out of sync, I guess. With the rest of the world. Nothing had changed for thousands of years. Like they didn't know that time was supposed to bring change and decay. That's the closest I can describe it.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">OOC: Yeah, Ragnar's a big ol' nerd, haha. Probably the first of many literary references out of him. Being the patterns/connections guy, he's probably going to be big on comparing Mage stuff to scientific phenomena and events in books and plays to ground himself.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-01-2016, 11:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T17:14:38-07:00","id":941523,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>DR. ASPHODEL</b><br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting<br /> </div> Dr. Asphodel gives a weak, breathy laugh as she shivers from the chill of the water. <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;'S-see, this is, uh---this is Deathtown USA right h---right here, boys. Death an'... uh, 'n weird matter. N'... ghosts of ghosts, kinda.&quot;</span> She coughs, shaking herself off again with an uneven ripple of movement. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;I-I don't see, uh, 'xactly a way out 'r anythin', b-b-but w-we c'n prolly find one t'gether...&quot;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T17:38:58-07:00","id":941547,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: Life, Spirit, Fate (Ends this post)<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b><br /> <br /> </div> <br /> Lynx, still on his back, breathes slowly and takes in the vague scent of incense and spices, gently murmuring in tandem with the hum. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I don't know much about Time. I did read Lord of the Rings, some ten years ago, so I barely remember anything about it. It was also in Norwegian, and trust me, Norwegian translations are rubbish. Mushrooms over there,</span>&quot; he adds and gestures to the rocks, while he pulls his legs out from the water. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Edible too. And they've got this energy in them.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He sits up and bristles, letting go of his Primal Senses. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">There's a hum as well. I think. Low-pitched and quiet. And there's some sort of...shapes frozen against the walls and in the water.</span>&quot; He gets up and stretches his shoulders. He then shamelessly takes off his shirt, and starts to wring water out of it when he glances at the both of them. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I don't suppose either of you know some sort of spell or magic that'll let you create light, do you? Only I'd like to study the mushrooms, and it'd be easier to pick them if I could see them properly. And unless there's some sort of tunnel at the bottom of this pool, I think the only way out of here is the hallway,</span>&quot; he points to the dark hallway past the angular archway. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Maybe that archway should be studied while we're at it. It's too smooth. Too...angle-y. I don't like it.</span>&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T20:22:42-07:00","id":941636,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 5/10</div> <div align=\"center\"><i>No Mage Sight</i></div> <br /> Binder eyes the sphere of shadow suspiciously. <i>As much as I'd like to prod it, I need to reestablish contact with Moonstone.</i><br /> <br /> Drawing on his own intuition, the lessons of Pandemonium, and Moonstone's instructions, Binder creates a plan of action. First, like Moonstone said, to make the hair's sympathy his own. He forms his Imago, using his knife to cut the hair's sympathetic thread in order to bind it to himself.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Borrow Threads</i> (Space 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach: Spending for instant speed<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantra 1 = 4 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423567\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes. </a><br /> Potency 1, Duration 2 turns</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Binder casts, and feels the spell go into place, but then realizes its having no effect. Despite his success, the spell isn't <i>strong</i> enough. <i>OK.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Borrow Threads</i> (Space 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach: Spending for Instant speed<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantra 1 - Factors 2 = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423569\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes.</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Binder grits his teeth. <i>This isn't working. The link is too solid. I need something else.</i> He wracks his mind, trying to find something else to hang the Imago on. Something occurs to him: himself. This... persona that he's been forging. He'd even been thinking of himself as it away from his family. A Binder of demons. But more than demons can be Bound.<br /> <br /> <i>I Bind you to me, Moonstone. I Bind you. I Bind you.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Borrow Threads</i> (Space 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach: Spending for Instant speed<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantras 2 - Factors 10 = -5<br /> (Potency 6, Duration 2 turns)<br /> Withstand is 5 for Connected.<br /> <br /> -5 puts me just barely at &quot;a chance die, but still castable.&quot; But since I'm not risking paradox, and as far as I can tell, there's no penalty for successive attempts when casting spells, I'm just going to roll until I get either a success or a dramatic failure! If I should alter any of this, let me know.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423698\" target=\"_blank\">3 </a><br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423699\" target=\"_blank\">9</a> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423700\" target=\"_blank\">5</a> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423701\" target=\"_blank\">SUCCESS!!!!</a> Phew! Now I have two turns to use it haha <br /> <br /> Dammit, now I'm just realizing that it's not Connected Sympathy at all - it's Strong. Welp, already made the rolls.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The brute force pays off - the spell succeeds. Binder suddenly feels very, very close to Moonstone. As though they were extensions of eachother. But he can also feel the spell slipping, it's short duration fading immediately. He slices his knife through the air, cutting through the space that seperates him from Moonstone.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Scrying</i> (Space 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach: Spending for instant speed, advanced duration, to swap primary factors, to use sensory range, and to upgrade from sensory to sympathetic. Spending 1 Mana to use sympathetic range.<br /> Attempting to Contain: Paradox 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423703\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes..</a>. <br /> Wisdom 7 -&gt;<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423704\" target=\"_blank\"> 0 successes </a><br /> Oof. That'll be a nice Paradox Condition.<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantras 1 - Factors 2 = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423706\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a> <br /> Potency 3, Duration 1 scene<br /> <br /> Well, I still technically have 1 turn to use that sympathetic connection, but I should probably see what Condition I get before trying again.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T20:33:57-07:00","id":941646,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar's mind short-circuits a little at the sight of a wet Lynx taking his shirt off. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>Um... ...oh.</i> <i>Well then. </i></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;W-well. I did get a degree in biology back in undergrad. Trying to examine Life with my Sight... it, um, leaves me worn out in a weird way. I'll see how rusty my mycology is. Lynx, use your Senses, you seem to have a good grasp on me- I mean <i>Life.&quot; </i></span>His face suddenly feels like it's been sunburnt.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> <i>For f</i><i>uck's sake, man. </i></span><br /> <br /> Trying to recover, Ragnar hurries past both Lynx and Dr. Asphodel-without making eye contact with either of them to the spot where the mushrooms grow along the cave wall. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Brilliant, Ragnar. You just outed yourself in front of a professor and a student. All because you get flustered over a guy taking a wet t-shirt off. Shit shit shit shit... </span></i><br /> <br /> Kneeling down, Ragnar shines his smartphone's light on the mushrooms. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;So, uh. Lynx. How 'bout we take a look at these mushrooms here.&quot; </span>And then his face flushes once more at the unintended innuendo.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> <i>Kill me. </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to study the mundane biology of the mushrooms. <br /> <br /> Intelligence 4 + Science 2 + Specialty (Biology) 1 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423707\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T20:52:39-07:00","id":941656,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent [active], Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10</b><br /> <br /> Moonstone takes a second to get his bearings magically, gazing into his mirror to read the truth. Not looking at his reflection so much as the pattern of the cracks, like oracle bone divination.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I misunderstood how Abyssal Imago works, then. I guess it's not as punitive as I thought- I thought it was meant to make you just &quot;waste&quot; Reach, not force you to spend it on productive ends. Assume I spent the third Reach on advanced potency, giving me a bonus if anyone tries to dispel it.<br /> <br /> Anyway. Improvising a Space 1 Knowing effect: &quot;where am I?&quot; Where exactly is my current location relative to the alley next to the stopped train? Am I in Chicago? Am I on Earth? Magically turning on my GPS.<br /> <br /> 1 reach for instant, +2 for being above my spell tolerance at gnosis 1. That's 1 over my free reaches for a 1 dot spell, and I've made 1 paradox roll in this scene already, so it's 2 paradox dice. Gonna contain again. 2 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423708\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> Spellcasting pool: gnosis 1, space 2, +1 for path tool. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423710\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a> yay.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> With that sorted, and having a nagging feeling through Space sight that there is a scrying window on his back, he pokes his head out the door to get his eyes on Phoenix in the next room.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;There you are! You're alive! And so am I!&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T02:08:04-07:00","id":941773,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2)</b></div> <br /> Lynx raises his eyebrows, letting Ragnar past without any interference, as he looks to Dr. Asphodel. He rubs his beard, his face painted with concern, as he studies Ragnar's reaction. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">I take my shirt off and he... Oh. Right.</span> <span style=\"color:#800000\">He fancies me? Or is it boys in general?</span></i><br /> <br /> He wrings his shirt a little more, grimacing down at the marine-coloured buttoned clammy nightmare of a shirt, and he attempts to air it a little bit before resigning to reluctance. <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">I really don't want to put this shirt on, but Ragnar...</span></i><br /> <br /> Sighing, he hangs the wet shirt over his shoulder and waddles over to Ragnar. He kneels down next to him to look at the mushrooms in the phone's light. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I didn't mean to make you uncomfortable,</span>&quot; Lynx murmurs as he leans down to smell the mushrooms (and moss or mould, if it's there), and he tries to observe them from a different angle. He allows himself to glance at Ragnar's face too, and he flashes a small smile. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I guess my manners are just rubbish.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx attempts a Science roll to study the mushrooms, and gets 2 successes.</b><br /> <br /> Dice pool for Science roll: Intelligence (2) + Science (2), total dice 4.</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423743\" target=\"_blank\">Science Roll \u2192 2 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T06:53:50-07:00","id":941913,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Cloak Nimbus (CoW +4)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> Oookay, not my best moment. The chilling air suggests a draft, guess someone heard and they're coming to investigate. I can probably talk my way outta this, but if not, that broom might be useful in a scrap, so I stay within arm's reach as I look down the hallway.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:teal\">There you are! You're alive! And so am I!</span>&quot; Moonstone greets, startling me a bit.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Oh, uh-yeah, we're alive,</span>&quot; I state, that was kinda awkward, &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Um, I think we stumbled into a mage's house or something, who I may or may not have alerted our presence to. Did that other mage follow you in?</span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T09:05:47-07:00","id":941990,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None | Attempting to Activate Spell: Discern Composition<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</div> <br /> <br /> Managing not to laugh at the clumsy charm of the situation, the Doc scuttles over and bends down.<br /> <br /> &quot;I-I-Interesting... fungi. Not a mycologist m'self, but, uh... lessee'f I can't, uh, lookit this floor&quot;<br /> She holds her glasses with one hand, her cane with the other, and focuses her eyes on the stone floor. Leaden stars glint behind her pupils if you look at just the right angle, and her green eyes are briefly like the cold precision of expertly cut emeralds.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Discern Composition to try to analyze this stone floor.<br /> 2 Matter + 1 Gnosis + 1 Tool (Cane) + 1 Tool (Glasses) = 5 dice --&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423789\" target=\"_blank\">2 sux.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8026,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","user":"Beans","date":". 08-02-2016, 12:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T09:22:45-07:00","id":942002,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> You stare at the hair in your hand, and attempt to bend its sympathetic connections to your will. After multiple, frustrating attempts, your Imago finally breaks through the natural resistance of Moonstone's connection to the hair sample, and you feel your own direct connection to him strengthened.<br /> <br /> While you cast these spells, out of the corner of your eye, you notice something strange. A tentacle-like projection suddenly lashes out from the black sphere, striking a piece of ice on the ground. It absorbs the hail and pulses with energy. You also notice the ground where it struck begin to vibrate. Suddenly, a few pebbles break away from the concrete and begin to drift into the air, unnaturally defying gravity.<br /> <br /> When you strike at the air and weave your will to target Moonstone, you realize that you have overstretched yourself. The world <i>lurches</i> around you, and something shoves back; dark energy is infused into your very being, infecting the nimbus glowing around you with a black essence.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, the hail that had previously bounced off you harmlessly begins to sizzle your skin, and you feel some of your own energy dissipate. More importantly, the black orb rotates and begins to float directly towards you.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain the Abyssal Nimbus condition, which includes the Resonant condition to Abyssal entities. You lose 1 mana from standing in the hail. You'll need to move out of the hail on your next round or risk losing more.<br /> <br /> You are now in initiative. I won't make you roll, but you'll need to limit your posts to one instant action. You can still move up to your speed and take an instant action in the same turn. You can take your action before anything else happens.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar and Lynx</b><br /> As far as you can tell, the mushrooms look ordinary. They smell ordinary. Your gut and knowledge of mushrooms tell you that this kind should be safely edible. There are three mushrooms growing along the edge of the pool.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Your Space spell gives you an intimate knowledge of this realm, and your location in relation to other realms -- after all, directions and spaces are subjective. As best as you can understand it, your magic reveals that you are not on the Earth you know. In some ways it feels like the Fallen World, but there is something distinctly different in this place's location. Your mind perceives it as another dimension of what may or may not be the same universe you know. You are <i>definitely</i> not in Chicago.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">FYI, I think you only need 1 reach per spell you cast <i>after</i> the first at Gnosis 1, so you still only technically spent 2 reach on that spell. But you did the paradox roll correctly, so it's a moot point.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> You attempt to discern the quality of the stone floor in the hallway, perhaps hoping that the Matter spell would unveil the secrets of this place where your Matter Sight failed. Your spell works, and you can feel your magic swelling out from you and attempting to pierce the truth about this stone. When you do, you realize that your Matter Sight didn't fail; this material simply <i>doesn't exist</i> in any way or form on Earth. Your mind, even with your magic, cannot fathom what this material is. According to everything you know about physics, even your fledgling knowledge of the Matter Arcanum, this material shouldn't even exist. But there it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-02-2016, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T11:31:36-07:00","id":942110,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent [active], Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10</b></div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Did that other mage follow you in?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone shook his head in the negative. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Not yet. I went through first to see if it was safe. I'm expecting him, though.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He looked over his shoulder, lowered his voice: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Another mage's house, huh? A Sanctum, probably. Fun fact: we are not on Earth right now. Not ours, at least. I checked. With magic. Wherever this sanctum is, it's in some kind of otherspace. I say we look around some more, I've got a spell to keep any ambush at bay.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Assuming they are not in immediate danger, he grabs the gardening hoe as a means of self-defense and heads back down the corridor, generally exploring and getting a sense of the place and any interesting rooms nearby.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 08-02-2016, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T12:39:28-07:00","id":942159,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar returns Lynx's smile with a small one of his own. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;No, not your fault. I just get easily distracted by- by guys,&quot; </span>he says with a certain firmness. No point denying it now.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;I'm fine now, I just hope I didn't make you uncomfortable or anything.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He turns his attention to the mushrooms.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;So. These mushrooms. They seem perfectly normal. Edible even. Mycology wasn't my concentration, but maybe you can see more with your Senses. I could, but like I said, trying to see with Life is draining for me. Fate and Time are my wheelhouse. But Life and Spirit seems to be yours.&quot;</span></div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Lifting his head, he looks over to where Dr. Asphodel is standing. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Dr. A, see anything interesting? Geology's not really my thing. Got any idea what this stone is?&quot; </span></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T13:29:06-07:00","id":942198,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration); Analyse Life (Life 1; Potency 1; Concentration duration)<br /> Willpower: 1/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm just worried, that's all. Should I put my shirt back on?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx returns his nose to the mushrooms, shifting a little as to better accommodate his frame. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">My Senses told me they were edible, and that they had some sort of energy in them... So I don't really... know...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> His voice trails off as he gazes at the mushroom. He rolls onto his side so that he sits comfortably (or as comfortably as the locale allows), and sets to rub his beard a little more.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Almost dry...<br /> <br /> So. Ragnar's got an affinity for Time, and he's asked Time questions, so... can I do the same? Can I ask Life?</span></i><br /> <br /> With deep breaths, he tries to reach out for magic again, careful to keep that horrid feeling away from his insides. Gently, he navigates through the forest of his soul, his metaphorical hands shying away the moment the nauseating sensation is felt. As the spell dawns on him, he leans forward, laying a finger on the head of the mushroom.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">So... uh. Hey there, Mr. Mushroom. Could you tell me about yourself?</span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx attempts to cast Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot; on the mushroom(s) as an instant action through touch, and gains 5(!) successes!<br /> <br /> He wants to gain the Inspired Condition, with this current Mystery as the Inspiration. If that's too broad, feel free to limit the Inspiration.</b><br /> <br /> <b>Potency:</b> 1.<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Mushroom.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Concentration.<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Concentration (+2)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot;: Life (3) + Gnosis (1) + Concentration (+2).<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 3 Free Reaches: 2 spent on Spell Control, 1 spent on Instant cast.<br /> No Paradox dice.<br /> <b>Total Dice Pool for Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot;:</b> 6 dice.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423829\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot; \u2192 5 successes.</a><br /> <br /> (OOC: I realise there's an error in the Description of Analyse Life on Orokos - it's supposed to be +2 on the Concentration Yantra, not +3; the roll's otherwise correct, with 6d10.)</span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T13:39:00-07:00","id":942212,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You channel your will into your sight, and focus it on the mushrooms. You gain a powerful sense of detailed information about these mushrooms, more than what your Life Sight provided. These mushrooms have the same qualities as a regular mushroom you might cook up and put in a salad or casserole; by studying their form, you know with confidence that eating them will have no negative consequences on your body. On the contrary, they seem brimming with life, which is noteworthy for the otherwise muted sense of life in this place.<br /> <br /> At the same time -- and you're not really sure how this could be -- the mushrooms have a supernatural quality. There is an energy welled up inside of these mushrooms, integrated into the very essence of their cells, that reminds you in some way of the energy, the mana, welled up within yourself. The information, and the process of learning it, fills you with awe.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Sure, works for me. You gain the Inspired condition. You'll gain an Arcane Beat when it resolves.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T14:06:16-07:00","id":942227,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: 8/8 I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> </div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar gives a slightly nervous laugh. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;No, you're fine.&quot; <i>Damn fine. I mean really, who expected all that under that shirt? </i>&quot;Besides, a wet shirt's so awful, forcing somebody to wear one ought to be against the Geneva Conventions. I'll survive. I was just... pleasantly surprised.&quot; <i>Understatement of the century. </i></span><br /> <br /> After Lynx casts his spell, Ragnar motions to the mushrooms.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;So. I'm guessing these aren't your garden-variety mushrooms?&quot;</span><br /> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T14:19:03-07:00","id":942230,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None (Discern Composition just ended)<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</div> <br /> The Doc cricks her neck. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;W-well, boys, I think I sl-slightly, uh, better un'rstand the, uh, this place. 'S made of Death an'... Death 'n bullshit, 's what it is. Thi-t-t-this, uh, this stone stuff just... does' make physics sense. Shouldn' exist, does. So, uh. 'S bullshit.&quot;</span><br /> She shrugs.<br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Magic is th-the weirdest science.&quot;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T14:47:14-07:00","id":942243,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration); <br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Excitement spreads through Lynx as he lets go of the mushroom, the flow of information ended. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Magic is the weirdest science? Yeah... it's that, and so much more!</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">They're filled with... with Mana? Closest analogy I can find. Mana mushrooms. Safe to eat too.</span>&quot; He studies the rocks carefully, using his fingers to find the roots of the mushrooms. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm going to bring these with us. Let's see if I can gather them without damaging them too much...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx ends his Analyse Life spell. Then, Lynx is going to try to pick the mushrooms carefully and bring them with him, but he garners no successes.</b><br /> <br /> Survival roll to pick Mana mushrooms: Dexterity (2) + Survival (2), total dice 4.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423842\" target=\"_blank\">Survival roll \u2192 0 successes.</a></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">So the stones shouldn't actually exist?</span>&quot; Lynx asks as he tries to gather up the mushrooms, though in the darkness his attempt is clumsy. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm not sure if that's worrisome or wonderful.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T16:14:26-07:00","id":942302,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> Despite your clumsy efforts, the mushrooms are plucked from the ground easily. They look the same as they did a moment ago.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You don't need to roll to harvest them...just pick them up. Nothing earth shattering here, folks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T19:23:28-07:00","id":942410,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 1/5</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Ghosts all over the place, rocks made of a material that doesn't actually exist, and actual magic mushrooms. Can this get any weirder? </i></span>Ragnar shakes his head in bewilderment.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Alright, let's see if I can get some clarity here. </span></i>Gathering magic to himself, Ragnar takes his knife in both hands and holds it over his head, blade pointing in the air in a gesture of triumph. He imagines the knife becoming tangled in the strings of Fate that bind him, and then he draws the knife straight down to rest a few inches from his face, pulling the strings of Fate with it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts his Praxis Exceptional Luck (Fate 2) on himself to gain the 9-Again boon. He uses his free Reach to increase the boon to the 8-Again boon. He is using his silver knife as a Path Tool Yantra, and the Concentration Yantra.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Fate 2 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423878\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>, exceptional success! That gives me a point of WP, and I'll take the Inspired Condition again so that I can resolve it for another Arcane Beat, since we're in another scene. Ragnar is now also under the effect of his nimbus tilt, which penalizes his Strength rolls by 1. I'll update my stats with this information in my next post.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Once again, the threads of Fate are quite receptive to his manipulation, and Ragnar is filled with a sudden inspiration and pride at his spell-casting. With luck on his side, he turns his thoughts to the cave.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to figure out information about the cave. <br /> <br /> Intelligence 4 + Occult 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423940\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>, with all 1s no less. This cave is not giving up its secrets easily.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-03-2016, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T08:27:04-07:00","id":942728,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 4/10 Health: XOOOOOO<br /> <i>No Mage Sight</i><br /> Conditions: Abyssal Nimbus (ending this post)</div> <br /> Eyes widening at the orb's approach, Binder darts backward under the awning. Hastily, he tries to remember what Moonstone had done earlier. Purging something negative from his body?<br /> <br /> Binder reaches inside himself to where that new, dark energy is infecting him, grabs ahold, and <i>tears</i>.<br /> <br /> It hurts. He tastes blood. But he keeps pulling until something gives.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Binder scours the Condition from his pattern, taking 1 resistant lethal wound.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T17:32:43-07:00","id":943150,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Cloak Nimbus (CoW +4)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 7/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">Another mage's house, huh? A Sanctum, probably. Fun fact: we are not on Earth right now. Not ours, at least. I checked. With magic. Wherever this sanctum is, it's in some kind of otherspace. I say we look around some more, I've got a spell to keep any ambush at bay.</span>&quot; Moonstone explains.<br /> <br /> Some kinda otherspace, huh? A little concerning, but far too interesting to pass up. He takes the gardening hoe, I take the broom.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Alright, let's explore,</span>&quot; I approve. Might as well, since we need to find a way back anyways. I join Moonstone going down the corridor, checking any rooms Moonstone doesn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T07:46:11-07:00","id":946163,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You weave the threads of Fate and temporarily Rule over them. You feel a pulsing of energy in your veins and a sense that for a brief time, you could do <i>anything</i>, even something extraordinary.<br /> <br /> You spin around the room and study the chamber. You feel luck shifting as you glance at different parts of the room in a seemingly random way, but you know that there is something greater tying this place together. Your mind races to connect the dots...but even with your supernaturally enhanced luck, even with your best preparation, this place defies your attempts at logic and intuition. Nevertheless, the experience of shifting Fate leaves you feeling inspired.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Sure, gain a WP and the Inspired condition, which will be in regards to understanding this chamber -- you can choose to resolve the condition to make a mundane roll related to this domain to give it the opportunity for an exceptional success on 3 successes rather than 5. Your Nimbus tilt only relates to others watching you, you can't trigger it on yourself. We're also not in combat or initiative, so the effects would be fairly brief and inconsequential for now.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You cough up blood and spit it out of your mouth. The act of tearing the dark energy out of you <i>hurts</i>, but as soon as you rip the last tendrils from your Nimbus, the hail stops sizzling on your skin.<br /> <br /> The black sphere pauses, hovering in midair as if considering its next move. More pieces of concrete begin to vibrate and rip themselves out of the sidewalk; they start to float around the orb and swirl around it in complex patterns.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, the orb moves forward with surprising speed. A black tendril of energy strikes out at you. It brushes against your left leg, which burns where the tentacle connects.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425112\" target=\"_blank\">Attack (4) - Defense (3) = 1 die</a>: 1 success. You take 1 bashing damage. It's your turn. Also, please roll Wits + Composure for a perception roll (no penalties).<br /> <br /> Something I hadn't thought about until now is how to handle reflexive actions in combat, such as activating Mage Armor or Dodging. Include in your next post whether you would take any reflexive actions such as these, and we will modify my post if necessary.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix and Moonstone</b><br /> You proceed down the hallway, continuing to explore this place. The hallway turns to the left and continues straight for several yards, but this section has no doorways. You also have not seen any windows or larger rooms in this area. As you walk, you notice that the hallway begins to incline slightly, and you can tell that you must be slowly ascending now.<br /> <br /> There are more lanterns fixed to either wall at regular intervals. You feel another gust of wind, and the candles flicker from the motion. Suddenly, a feminine voice echoes in the hallway around you, speaking to your very soul. It reverberates as if humming with power.<br /> <br /> <i>WE THOUGHT TO RULE THE HEAVENS</i>, she whispers. <i>WE BELIEVED WE COULD CONTROL TRUTH.</i><br /> <br /> <i>WE WERE WRONG.</i><br /> <br /> As if you had any doubt, your Periphery echoes at her words, suggesting the presence of something supernatural.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T07:58:17-07:00","id":946168,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 1/5<br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"left\">Ragnar grits his teeth slightly in frustration. This is a puzzle if ever he's seen one. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Come on, Ragnar. Figure this thing out. Think. <b>Think!</b></span></i>He continues to apply his mind to the mystery of the cave. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>A cave filled with ghosts... crawling with necromantic energies... composed of a type of stone that shouldn't exist according to physics or geology... connected via some sort of magical portal to the UChicago campus... What is going on with this cave?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar once again attempts to puzzle out the mysteries of the cave with mundane brainpower. I'll resolve the Inspired Condition so that I can get an exceptional success at 3 instead of 5 successes, and also gain a beat. <br /> <br /> Intelligence 4 + Occult 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425117\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>!</div></div> </div> </div><br /> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:28:18-07:00","id":946183,"title":"","content":"<b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 4/10 Health: X/OOOOO<br /> Mage Sight: <i>Mind, Space</i><br /> <br /> Binder reflexively pulls up his Mage Sight, checking to see if this thing has a mind he can affect.<br /> <br /> <i>As much as I don't relish touching that... </i>thing mentally, if it doesn't have a mind that cuts a lot of my options...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Haven't yet done my instant action for the turn, since I can do this reflexively and the result will determine what I do next. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:28:29-07:00","id":946184,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You study the area further, trying to piece together your elementary knowledge of the supernatural with your Supernal intuition and natural intelligence. Like a detective, your brain churns through the information and deduces the only logical conclusion. This place can only be an alternate dimension, a place between the Earth you know and some other realm that does not -- or perhaps used to? -- exist. The doorway you entered was a portal to this dimension, bringing you to another place that defies the rules of nature and physics. From what you've experienced in the short time since your Awakening, it even seems to defies some of the Supernal laws you are beginning to understand. As a student of all knowledge, the act of figuring out this part of the puzzle is invigorating.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Actually, because you gained the Inspired condition by getting an exceptional success on a spell, you gain an Arcane Beat. As a result of <i>this</i> exceptional success, which you got from a mundane roll, gain the Steadfast condition, which will grant a regular Beat upon resolving (unless you've already earned a Beat by resolving a different condition by that point).</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:37:38-07:00","id":946189,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> As you open your Mind Sight to your immediate surroundings, you can sense that this being in front of you has some kind of emotions or mental capability -- but it's dramatically different than a human mind. This being is neither awake nor asleep, but it is clearly agitated very focused. You guess that you might be able to influence it with the Mind Arcanum, but how effective that might be is hard to tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T12:26:41-07:00","id":946368,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 4/10 Health: X//OOOO<br /> Active Spells: <i>Psychic Domination</i><br /> Mage Sight: <i>Mind, Space</i></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I guess I should also make that perception roll, huh?<br /> Wits 2 + Composure 4 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425151\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes!</a><br /> <br /> I'll hold off on dodging or using Mage Armor for now.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Binder visualizes his mind becoming a net, encircling the thing, commanding it. <i>I am the Binder. I bind you to my will.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Psychic Domination</i> (Mind 2)<br /> <b>Reach: </b>2 Free; Spending for instant speed, sensory range, advanced duration, and for complex command.<br /> <b>Paradox </b>(containing): 2 + 1 (prior risk) vs Wisdom 7 = 3 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425153\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425154\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> successes! Taking 1 resistant bashing wound.<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras</b>: Shadow Name (reflexive)<br /> <b>Factors: </b>Potency 3+1=4 (Withstood by Resolve), Duration 1 (Scene)<br /> <b>Spellcasting</b>: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 + Yantra 1 - Factors 2 = 3 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425155\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a><br /> <br /> Fingers crossed that it has a Resolve/Resistance of 3 or less</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i>Leave this place,</i> Binder orders mentally, <i>go back from whence you came and do not return!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T13:29:35-07:00","id":946412,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> The black orb, this Abyssal creature or whatever it is, pulses with energy as you exert your will and attempt to bind it to your will. The creature pushes against you...and then your Mind spell breaks through. For a brief moment, the orb expands and contracts erratically, its perfect spherical shape undulating. Then, it congeals back into a sphere and shoots itself in a direct line away from you as fast as possible, crossing the street and colliding with a brick wall.<br /> <br /> You catch your breath for a second as the creature moves away from you. As you do, you realize that the hail is suddenly slowing down, and nearly stopping altogether; just as abruptly as the storm clouds formed, they are now starting to dissipate.<br /> <br /> You also hear a scream. Across the street, three teenage girls walk around the corner and stop. One of them points at the black orb; another pulls out her camera to take a picture. As they do, the orb lurches forward, lashing out at them with a black tentacle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:39:07-07:00","id":946467,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 4/10 Health: <b>X//</b>/OOO<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <br /> <i>Dammit, you stupid thing, that is </i>not<i> from whence you came! This isn't how I wanted to do things, but I can't let you attack bystanders.</i> Since it didn't have the effect he hoped for, Binder drops his previous spell. He attempts to stand somewhere that he can see the creature but the girls can't see him.<br /> <br /> Binder slashes his knife before him, visualizing it slicing apart the creature's mind.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Psychic Assault </i>(Mind 3)<br /> <b>Reach</b>: 1 Free; Spending for instant speed and sensory range<br /> <b>Paradox </b>(containing): 1 + 2 (prior risk) - 2 (tool) vs Wisdom 7 = 1 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425209\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425211\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> success. Taking 1 resistant bashing wound.<br /> That feel when you roll the same on 1 die as on 7.<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras</b>: Knife (reflexive, dedicated)<br /> <b>Factors</b>: Potency 3<br /> <b>Spellcasting</b>: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 = 4 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425215\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 08-09-2016, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T18:10:30-07:00","id":946595,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent [active], Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10</b><br /> </div> Moonstone raised a hand and stopped when the voice whispered. He mumbled to Phoenix: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Did you hear that too? Or am I going crazy again?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He opened his third eye just for a moment, looking around with Mage Sight for any obvious effect nearby. Advancing further up the hallway (with garden hoe at the ready), he spoke up and hoped the voice could hear him: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Who? Who is we? Whose heavens? What truth?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He had an inkling. But maybe if it spoke again, he would see something with the Sight this time.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T21:27:08-07:00","id":946732,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Active Sight:</b> Forces, Prime, Mind | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Cloak Nimbus (CoW +4)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 6/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> I immediately stop when the voice echoes through the hallway, instinctively brushing away mundane reality from the Aether.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">Did you hear that too? Or am I going crazy again?</span>&quot; Moonstone asks.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Nope, I heard it, too,</span>&quot; I confirm. Whatever produced the voice, it likely has some kind of mind, so I spread my senses to find conscious thought as well.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Turning to Active Sight and spending a Mana to include Mind</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T11:06:31-07:00","id":947103,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar's mind reels at the realization of this cave's nature. It's crazy... but being a mage, crazy things should be common place by now.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Guys... I think the reason why those stones shouldn't exist, and why it's full of Death energy...&quot; </span>He struggles to find words that don't sound like something out of a sci-fi film, fails, and throws his hands up in exasperation. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;This is another dimension! It sounds crazy, but I think this is some sort of... liminal realm. A world-between, if you will. That portal connects our world to this place, and this is like a hallway to a different world. One that may not even exist anymore, or in any meaningful sense, anyways. I haven't been a mage for a long time, but still...&quot; </span>he frowns at the cave walls. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Something about this place is different. Like it's working under different laws- including magic.&quot; </span></div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> He grips his knife closer to himself as he looks down the passage. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;If we plan on heading further in, I think we need to be extra careful.&quot;</span></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-09-2016, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T12:47:13-07:00","id":947170,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You open your Sight, and you faintly see the outline of a figure floating before you. It's...hazy. That's the best word you can summon to describe what you see. The figure is amorphous to your Sight.<br /> <br /> The information that your Mind Sight reveals is particularly confusing. This...being...does not appear to be thinking, per se. But it clearly moved towards you and Phoenix as you continued through the halls, as if drawn to your presence, suggesting that it has -- or perhaps had at one time -- sentient thought.<br /> <br /> Your mundane vision, still enhanced by your Space spell, allows you to see up and down the hallway in all directions. As far as you can tell, there are no other creatures or threats lying in wait.<br /> <br /> You hear the feminine voice again. It appears to be coming from the figure. <i>REALITY IS FRAGMENTED. WHAT HAVE WE DONE? THE LADDER HAS TORN.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Immediately upon opening your Sight, you see a presence floating before you. Through your kaleidoscope of Arcana, it shifts in colors and form, but from your Prime Sight you can tell that this ephemeral presence is a woman. She has long hair, intricately woven into a thick braid that stretches nearly down to her ankles. She wears a simple white dress with a silver rope tied around her waist. You realize that the woman's face has no emotional expression, and her eyes stare off to the distance with an unfocused gaze. She does not blink.<br /> <br /> From your Mind Sight, contrary to what you predicted, this being has no clear thoughts or mind that you can sense...and yet the presence clearly moved here only moments ago.<br /> <br /> When the woman speaks, you notice that her lips do not move, nor does her face change expression in any way.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Should you desire, either of you can attempt Revelation or Scrutiny on this presence. Opacity is 3, and is unique for each of you.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T13:54:27-07:00","id":947206,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b><br /> </div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well, I'm not going to rush ahead like an idiot again,</span>&quot; Lynx chuckles with a small smile; he carefully cradles his many mushrooms.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">What do these taste like?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Do you two have any ways to protect yourselves? Or us as a whole? My gut tells me it's not wise sticking around here for too long, so unless the exit is underwater, it does seem like there's only one way to go... Even if these mushrooms are magic, I can't imagine they'll sustain us for too long.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T15:49:35-07:00","id":947280,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Focused Sight:</b> Prime [Peripheral after post] | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Light Under a Bushel [ends after post]<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 0/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This &quot;woman&quot; is incapable of thoughts, yet was drawn to us and speaks to us, like a...<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I think the woman is some kinda magical recording,</span>&quot; I posit.<br /> <br /> I don't think mages would leave a recording floating around if they still lived here, so I uncloak my magic. Now, let's see what this recording is talking about.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ending Cloak Nimbus and Focusing Sight with Prime.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> Alright, now for the actual rolls, but first a spell.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Light Under a Bushel (Prime 2, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BxveHUKxwBU9ejlGcDYtN3hZTWs/view\" target=\"_blank\">Signs of Sorcery Demo, p.4</a>)</b></u><br /> <b>Reach:</b> 1 Free - 3 used for instant casting, Advanced Duration, and sensory range<br /> <b>Paradox (containing):</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425848\" target=\"_blank\">Over-Reach 2 - 2 Dedicated Tool = 0 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <b>Yantras:</b> None<br /> <b>Factors:</b> Potency (PSF): 3 (-2); Duration (Adv): 1<br /> <b>Spellcasting:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425849\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 3 Willpower - 2 Factors = 4 dice \u2192 2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Now I can make 3 extra rolls before risking to increase Opacity. Now spending the last WP for Scrutiny. Rather than make multiple rolls, I'm gonna roll all the dice ahead of time and take the results of every three dice to see how many successes each roll gets and go from there, spending Mana to increase successes as needed because on p. 93 it says &quot;The player accrues successes, and can choose to spend Mana in order to add more, up to the normal per-turn limits of the character\u2019s Gnosis.&quot;. Here goes nothing:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425850\" target=\"_blank\">Extended Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 = 3 dice for 6 times</a><br /> <b>Results:</b> 4, 3, 2 | 5, [10, 8], 2 | 1, 9, 3 | 9, 6, 5 | 9, [10, 1], 1 | 5, 6, [10, 8]<br /> First roll - Failure<br /> Second roll - 2 successes, increased to 3 with 1 Mana, Opacity reduced to 2<br /> Third roll - 1 success, increased to 2 with 1 Mana, Opacity reduced to 1<br /> Fourth roll - 1 success, Opacity reduced to 0<br /> Ignoring other rolls<br /> <br /> And now for Revelation. And since Phoenix isn't under any pressure and has about 15 turns before the minute is up, I'll brute force it with multiple rolls until I get at least 1 success.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425852\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 = 3 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425854\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425855\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a><br /> <br /> (Heh, even if the rolls were being reduced by 1 each time the third roll would still succeed)<br /> <br /> Whew, that was a journey.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 08-10-2016, 08:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T11:51:45-07:00","id":948721,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR. ASPHODEL<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</div> The Doc shakes her head. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">B'sides, uh, th-th-the cane? Not, uh, not really...&quot; </span>She shrugs. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Sorry t'say, kinda... uh, frail. 'N yeah, we reall-r-really need to get out of here, before people wonder where w-w-we were...&quot; </span>She frowns. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Jus'need t'find another portal... if it takes us back, 'n not somewhere else.&quot;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T15:04:14-07:00","id":948885,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar nods at the others. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Alright. Let's get going.&quot; </span>Holding his knife tightly and shining his smartphone's light for illumination, Ragnar heads off down the passageway. Recalling Lynx's spell, he wills his body to stop producing bodily odors. Figuring that trying to see things coming in the darkness might be difficult, he decides to keep an ear out for anything up ahead. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar tries to stay aware of any sounds coming from further down the passage way. <br /> <br /> Wits 2 + Composure 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426117\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T11:26:12-07:00","id":951218,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> The black sphere emits a piercing screech and violently shakes as you assault it with your magic. It clearly had an effect.<br /> <br /> The black cloud reforms into a perfect sphere, and lashes out another tentacle at the nearest girl. The other two yell and stumble backwards, but the third loses her footing and drops her camera. Rather than hitting the ground, her camera floats towards the black sphere and orbits around it. The girl screams again as her clothes ripple, and then she starts to slide towards the orb.<br /> <br /> You feel a pulse of energy on your Periphery as the tentacle lashes onto the girl; the orb seems to pulse in time as it &quot;feeds&quot; on her.<br /> <br /> As you watch, you also notice that it is getting brighter out. The clouds overhead are definitely thinning. The orb suddenly retracts its tentacle, spins in place, and then quickly floats away down an adjacent, covered hallway between two buildings.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Your Sight explodes with colors you've never seen before and couldn't begin to describe. You intensely study the woman, watch the way that her form stands as your strands of mana swirl around her. You study the primal energy making up her supernatural being.<br /> <br /> Your mind suddenly reels in shock and understanding.<br /> <br /> At one point in your life, you heard stories about the aftermath of the atomic bomb in Hiroshima. The force of the blast was so powerful that near the center of the city, it atomized people and flash-burned the afterimage of their shadows directly into the concrete where they had been standing.<br /> <br /> As close as you can tell, this &quot;woman&quot; is no recording -- she is the supernatural afterimage of a violent magical trauma. This is not a ghost, or a spirit, or any kind of supernatural entity. Nor is it alive, or in any way conscious. Instead, she is a remnant, a shadow, a glimpse out of the corner of the universe's eye. The revelation is all the more chilling when she &quot;speaks&quot; again. <i>WHAT HAVE WE DONE?</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> 