uot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T05:19:01-07:00","id":951613,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3(-1)/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> Ragnar looks at his phone with skepticism. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Well, I don't know if it was in the water too long, but I can give it a try.&quot; </span></div> <div align=\"left\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar attempts to photograph the archway with his phone. I assume that there's no roll needed, but I'll still keep the action in a spoilers box.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He answers Lynx's question with a tight smile. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Hey, we're only in an alternate dimension that's filled to the brim with necromantic energies. What could possibly go wrong?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Gathering himself for a moment, Ragnar reaches out to the forces of magic, and dips his finger into the stream of Time once more to study the ripples. As he does, he asks, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;If we continue down this path, will we run into hazards at any point? If this passage has any side tunnels or forks, is there a specific route we must take to find the elder mage?&quot;</span> Once again, Ragnar pushes a bit more of his will into the spell.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts Divination (Time 1) as an improvised spell. He has two free Reach, one of which he spends to raise the Potency from 1 to 2 so that he can ask an additional question, and the other he uses to gain the Reach option to ask more detailed questions and receive more detailed answers.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 + Willpower 3 - Potency 2 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427227\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T06:03:04-07:00","id":951632,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> You run past the girls, who are frantically trying to help their friend to her feet and yelling something about how they &quot;can't believe this crazy shit.&quot; The hallway you run into turns to the left, and you find yourself at a dead end by a locked gate. This looks like some kind of entrance to a residential building overhead.<br /> <br /> The black orb spins in front of you, hovering by the door. It turns, as if studying you -- even though it clearly doesn't have any discernible &quot;eyes&quot; -- and lashes out with its tentacles. You feel a &quot;pulling&quot; sensation as the tentacles try to drain energy from your soul.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The creature will make a contested roll to activate one of its Numina: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427232\" target=\"_blank\">Power (2) + Finesse (2) + WP (3) = 7 dice</a>: 5 successes. I need you to roll Stamina + Resolve + Gnosis. Also, please make a Wits + Composure roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> Your phone seems to be functioning. You still don't have any signal. You're able to take the picture, which even shows up normally when you look at it in your photo gallery.<br /> <br /> You feel Time shift around you, and you study it intensely. After a pause, the now-familiar, voiceless sense of Time responds to your queries. <i>This place poses no threat to you. You will not be injured.</i> And then again, after a brief pause: <i>You do not need a specific route to find the mage. He will find you, after you leave this realm.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T06:33:08-07:00","id":951655,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 3/10 Health: <b>X//</b>/OOO<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Resolve 3 + Stamina 2 + Gnosis 1 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427244\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Wits 2 + Composure 4 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427245\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T06:50:42-07:00","id":951670,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> You gasp as the tentacles rip energy away from you. You feel your personal reservoir of mana dry up as the creature saps your strength, and it ripples with energy.<br /> <br /> As this happens, you notice your shadow faintly on the wall to your right. The clouds outside have broken and the sun is finally starting to break through. The black orb hovers a little closer to the wall on your left, which is relatively more shaded.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yikes! You lose all 3 of your remaining mana. It's your turn.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T07:57:03-07:00","id":951712,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None (Serendipity)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar tilts his head at the information. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Huh. There's no danger here whatsoever. We'll meet the mage when we leave. Speaking of which...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar reaches out for magic once more, this time for the threads of Fate. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">What is the quickest route to a portal out of this place? One that isn't under a few feet of water, preferably.&quot; </span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts Serendipity (Fate 1) as an improvised spell. He uses one Reach to change the Primary Factor to Duration, and then spends the second free Reach to bump the Duration to Advanced (one hour/scene) so that he can follow the route of the spell to the nearest portal.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Fate 2 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427257\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>, and the first time I've ever seen a 10 re-roll as a 10!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-17-2016, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T08:04:11-07:00","id":951716,"title":"","content":"<b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 0/10 Health: <b>X//</b>/OOO<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:blue\">Urk-</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Binder attempts to stand in the sunlight as best he can, and slashes his knife at the thing again.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Psychic Assault </i>(Mind 3)<br /> <b>Reach</b>: 1 Free; Spending for instant speed and sensory range<br /> <b>Paradox </b>(containing): 1 + 3 (prior risk) - 2 (tool) vs Wisdom 7 = 2 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427258\" target=\"_blank\">0</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427259\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> success.<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras</b>: Knife (reflexive, dedicated)<br /> <b>Factors</b>: Potency 3<br /> <b>Spellcasting</b>: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 = 4 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427260\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T13:27:11-07:00","id":951969,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> As you finish your casting, you feel a slight change in the air pressure. A breeze forms from nowhere, ripples around the cavern where your group stands, and blows away from you down the hallway.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> The orb recoils violently again. Black ooze spills from it as it bumps against the wall. As you watch with your Sight, however, you see a halo of dark energy surround the orb. The orb pulses outward, slowly pulling itself back together. The entity lashes out again, this time with two tentacles, trying to wrap up each of your arms.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427338\" target=\"_blank\">Power (2) + Finesse (2) + WP (3) - Defense (3) = 4 dice</a>: 2 successes. You take 2 more bashing damage, unless you reflexively Dodge.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Forgot that you had Active Sight 08-16-2016, 04:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T14:12:17-07:00","id":952012,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent [active], Abyssal Imago<br /> Health: XOOOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10</b></div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Some kind of magical recording...let me knock on wood a bit.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone works his favored spell again, flexing his gloved fingers and counting possibilities as he gazes into his cracked mirror.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's move this along. Casting my Praxis, Time 1 Divination.<br /> <br /> 2 free Reach. 1 for instant casting, 1 for more detailed questions. +1 Reach for going past my spell control. 1 paradox die, +2 because this is my third paradox roll this scene. 3 paradox dice, gonna contain it: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427345\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Oh yeah and +1 Reach for sensory range means 1 more paradox die: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427349\" target=\"_blank\">no successes</a><br /> <br /> Wisdom contain roll: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427346\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>, oh for god's sake. I take 1 resistant bashing and another Paradox Condition. I'm just gonna start releasing my Paradoxes at this point, I'm tired of facing personal consequences for my indiscriminate use of magic!!!<br /> <br /> Anyway here's the spellcasting roll. Gnosis 1, Time 2, +1 for magical tool. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427350\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Two questions for the echo: <i>What is the most beneficial thing that this entity can do for Phoenix and I? </i>And, <i>What will I personally do in the immediate future that leads to that outcome?</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T14:39:39-07:00","id":952040,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 0/10 Health: <b>X//</b>///O (-2)<br /> Mage Sight: Mind, Space</div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:blue\">Nope, not feeling good about this any more. Ow.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Binder will cautiously retreat back into the sun-lit street. He'll attempt to keep an eye on the orb, but will prioritize his safety.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Man, spending willpower. That would be nice. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T06:10:28-07:00","id":952459,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> Tempted by curiosity and a thirst to know more, you gaze into your mirror and cast your spell. You pierce the fog of Time with your will and glimpse the future. But as you do, even in this realm unlike the world you know, the universe pushes back against you hard. It catches your breath as you try to contain it, but the strain cracks your resistance.<br /> <br /> You glimpse...<i>something </i>move swiftly across the mirror's surface, and hear that deep throaty laugh again. You suddenly have the feeling of being watched.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain the Abyssal Backlash condition. The next spell you cast that risks Paradox will add 2 dice to the Paradox roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Even as you form the first question in your mind, the formless figure you can see through your Sight emits a terrible shriek. You see it dash away, further along the hallway and up the slight incline in the direction you haven't gone yet. In the mirror, you see bursts of movement and light that reveal you running down the hallway. Along with them, you perceive the voiceless sense of Time speak to you. <i>She can show you a glimpse of Truth, a warning to be heeded</i>. And after a single heartbeat: <i>Follow</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You back up, reeling in pain. Your head is a bit hazy, and you know that if you take much more of a beating, you could risk falling unconscious.<br /> <br /> But thankfully, your instinct was right, and the black orb does not follow. You can't see it from around the corner. You can, however, see the teenage girls next to you. The girl who was attacked is sitting on the ground, assumedly numb with shock. Her friends are trying to comfort her and get her to walk, but she's just sitting there shivering with fear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T16:08:01-07:00","id":952815,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 0/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> Not a recording, an afterimage from a magical disaster. I guess these guys wanted to climb this ladder to the heavens and becomes gods, or something like that, and it backfired big time. The classic story of a rise and fall. One thing bugs me, though: what did she mean by reality is fragmented? Did they break the world in some way? I want to learn more, have to in fact, but I'm too tired to keep the Aether from slipping away.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">Some kind of magical recording...let me knock on wood a bit.</span>&quot; Moonstone replies. Don't like the sound of that, considering who it's coming from.<br /> <br /> This guy is practically leaking with the Abyss! I would've put him up against the wall for some words, were it not for the afterimage shrieking and retreating down the hallway, judging from the sound. Understandable, considering the Abyss is anathema to magic. The words'll have to wait, right now I need see where this thing's headed. I give chase, following the shriek.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T17:07:15-07:00","id":952855,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">DR ASPHODEL<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</div> <br /> As Ragnar works his magic, she looks around in the gloom. Especially now that she's aware of it, she can feel the Death in this place. She wonders just what sort of person this 'elder mage' is going to be when they find him.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T19:28:05-07:00","id":952927,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast, Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"left\">Ragnar briefly tenses from the breeze, but then realizes that is was caused by his spell, and smiles slightly as he relaxes. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I just worked some magic to find the quickest way out of here. Follow me.&quot;</span> With that, he continues down the tunnel, following the direction of the air. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>This should last long enough for us to reach a portal out of here. </i></span></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T06:58:25-07:00","id":953139,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix (and Moonstone, if he follows)</b><br /> You chase after the woman, bolting along the hallway as quickly as you can manage. The hallway continues to slope upwards for several more yards, then leads to the base of a short staircase. Racing up the stairs brings you to a large set of double doors, seemingly made out of polished onyx. The doors are cracked just slightly, and you hear a faint cry from the &quot;woman&quot; beyond the doors.<br /> <br /> When you push the doors open, you see a long corridor made from the same material as the door. Upon closer inspection, the material seems unlike any stone or building material you have ever seen. On your Periphery, you feel a faint, ubiquitous sense of energy pulsing in this room.<br /> <br /> As you take your first step through the door, the walls begin to glow with millions of pinpricks of light, arranged in dazzling displays that you recognize as galaxies and constellations of stars. The view is breathtaking.<br /> <br /> The woman's voice echoes quietly through the room. <i>WE THOUGHT TO RULE THE HEAVENS</i>, she repeats. Her voice sounds forlorn.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may each roll Wits + Composure.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar, Lynx, and Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm going to assume for now that all three of you continue along this path. If anyone would do otherwise or wants to take actions along the way, feel free to do so.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> You follow the draft forward, passing underneath the unnatural archway and stepping onto the smoothly polished stone-like material that fits no description of any building material you have ever seen before. Where your feet touch the stone, you feel a faint pulsing of energy, and the floors emit a pale, swirling green light that softly illuminates the area. Each step also creates a quiet bell tone, like wind chimes moving from a soft breeze.<br /> <br /> After a few moments, you feel another draft moving forward. The light from the floors reveals an opening in the cave wall ahead of you, leading to another hallway. The corridor slopes down, gently at first but at an increasingly steep incline, and you have to move slowly to avoid slipping in the dark on the moss underneath your feet. You lose your sense of direction as the corridor drifts right, curves around, then left, but always descending.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, the corridor levels out and turns into a flat surface again. More green light appears beneath your feet as you find yourself yet again on that strange polished stone surface. After walking for several minutes, the corridor suddenly opens up into a large cavern with a smooth dome ceiling. The walls in here are again made of natural, rough stone, but the floors have that same polished look and create light as you walk. All around the large room, perhaps 200 feet across in each direction, you can faintly make out other openings leading to other hallways.<br /> <br /> Each opening to this cavern, including the one you walk through, have a path leading forward to a raised dais in the center of the room. A small candle flickers on the table besides what appears to be a large stone bowl and several other small objects that you can't make out at this distance.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may each roll Wits + Composure, at no penalty.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T07:26:13-07:00","id":953153,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>RAGNAR</b></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Steadfast (resolved at end of turn), Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0(+1)/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <div align=\"left\">Ragnar allows the wind current to guide him through the cavern. The sound of bells with their footsteps and the swirling light fills him with a sense of awe, and he can't help but let out a small, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Whoa...&quot; </span><br /> <br /> Upon reaching the domed cavern, he frowns slightly at the sight of the table, which stands out like a sore thumb. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Unless this is the dimension of specifically placed furniture, I think somebody's been here before.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If I'm reading the rules properly, I can resolve my Steadfast Condition for a regular beat, despite the fact that I resolved Inspired earlier for an arcane beat. So I'm going to go ahead and do that now, for an exceptional success on three successes instead of five.<br /> <br /> Wits 2 + Composure 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427860\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. Close, but no cigar.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-18-2016, 12:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T07:41:57-07:00","id":953165,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> Through the faint chimes and the sound of your group's footsteps, you think you hear a distant rumbling. The sound feels out of place from everything else you've heard since swimming out of the pool. It's a very faint sound, so quiet that you aren't even sure if you're hearing it correctly. As you strain your ears, though, it does seem to be getting slightly louder. You're not sure what to make of it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yep, gain a Beat! You can gain 1 Arcane Beat and 1 regular Beat per scene from resolving conditions.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T08:02:47-07:00","id":953180,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 0/10 Health: X////// (-3)<br /> [Pattern Scoured: -1 Str] [Unconscious]<br /> </div> <br /> <i>I have to do </i>something<i> to help her. It's my fault she got attacked...</i> Binder sways a bit. <i>Hard to focus. Gotta try.</i><br /> <br /> Binder reaches into himself, trying to pull strength from somewhere.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Scouring Strength for 3 Mana!<br /> <br /> Casting <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=952503#post952503\"><i>Mind over Matter</i></a> (Mind 2)<br /> Mana: Spending 3; 1 for Reach option, 2 for paradox mitigation<br /> Reach: 2 Free; Spending for instant speed, advanced duration, and option to stay conscious.<br /> Paradox (containing): 1 + 4 (prior risk) - 2 (tool) - 2 (mana) vs Wisdom 7 = 1 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427865\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427866\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <br /> Taking 1 Resistant Bashing wound, rolling Stamina 2 to stay up -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427867\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes! </a><br /> <br /> Yantras: Knife (reflexive, dedicated)<br /> Factors: Potency 3, Duration Scene<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 - 2 (wounds) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427864\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> <br /> Might as well turn that failure into a dramatic failure for an Arcane Beat, if that's alright?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It doesn't work. Binder bites back pain and frustration, the edges of his vision darkening. He stumbles back across the street, towards the portal, with the hope that he'll be found by the other mages if they come out there.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Not sure if I'll need to make another Stamina roll to get there; if I do, I got <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427869\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>, so that'll mean that I pass out before I get there. Also, marking a Beat for &quot;interacting&quot; with an ephemeral entity.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T08:25:54-07:00","id":953192,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> It's funny, in a way. You're only just starting to scratch the surface of your Awakened potential, and even though you know you're only scraping the very tip of the iceberg, magic has made you feel so incredibly <i>powerful -- </i>like you could take on the world.<br /> <br /> And yet, for all that potential, you find yourself losing your grip on consciousness because of your body's frailty. Apparently, even mages aren't invincible. You collapse beside the girls. Your last thought before falling unconscious is a fervent hope that the monstrous entity attacking you doesn't kill you while you sleep.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For the dramatic failure on the spellcasting roll, take the Shaken condition (p. 317), which will become active once you awake, and gain an Arcane Beat. You also gain an Arcane Beat (rather than a regular Beat) for a significant interaction with an ephemeral entity. (It's an Obsession, not Aspiration, so you get Arcane Beats for those.)<br /> <br /> Can you add a line to your post header that includes your Beats/Arcane beats, like the other players do? Thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T09:28:15-07:00","id":953239,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Whoa is about right.</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Unless this is the dimension of specifically placed furniture, I think somebody's been here before.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Do you think there is an actual dimension of specifically placed furniture?</span>&quot; Lynx asks as he approaches the dais, his nose and ears on alert.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx attempts the Perception roll, and gains 1 success.</b><br /> <br /> Dice pool for Perception roll: Wits (3) + Composure (3) + Heightened Senses (+1), total dice 7.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427893\" target=\"_blank\">Perception roll \u2192 1 success.</a></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T13:30:52-07:00","id":953391,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> Your keen senses pick up a very faint rumbling sound. You can't tell where it's coming from, but you didn't hear it a few minutes ago. You're not sure, but it seems to be getting slightly louder as you strain your ears to hear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T16:42:37-07:00","id":953486,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 0/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> My blood quickens as I enter the black hallway. I'd look around a little more actively, were it not for me being so mentally exhausted. Looks like I can get quite the view without seeing the Aether any way. Four days a mage, and already I'm walking in space. What's next, chatting up the alien overlord? Ah well, come what may, I slow my running down to a quick walk as I take in the new surroundings while in pursuit.<br /> <br /> <i>WE THOUGHT TO RULE THE HEAVENS</i><br /> <br /> Oh I'm sorry, did I say it was a recording? I meant to say broken record.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception check<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427998\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T00:03:09-07:00","id":953697,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Imago (3 Reach), Abyssal Backlash (+2 Paradox)<br /> Health: X/OOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 2/5 | Arcane Beats: 2/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Moonstone hurries along after Phoenix and the echo, tucking his mirror into his bag along the way, and vaguely hoping that Binder follows their trail okay once he makes it through the portal- he should have been here by now!<br /> <br /> And then they're in the star chamber with the impossible floors, and he just stops and stares at the constellations in every direction and from every angle at once. Without thinking, he says out loud to the echo: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Atlantis.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits+Composure: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/428091\" target=\"_blank\">3 success</a><br /> <br /> Also I'd like to roll Intelligence 1+Occult 4 (Awakened Magic), my profession skill with 9-again, to see whether all this rule the heavens/punished for hubris stuff is sounding familiar and especially if there is anything I should say to the echo to demonstrate awareness, or things I should be looking for on the starmap. What's going on here? <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/428094\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a>, let's make that a dramatic failure for a beat. Turns out Sleepwalkers don't get the full story on the Lord Xenu space opera stuff about the Time Before.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T13:30:14-07:00","id":957156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: Sorry for the delay. I just started a new job this week and I've been busy getting my new apartment set up! </div> </div> </div><b>Phoenix</b><br /> You're a pretty perceptive and intuitive guy. You can tell that aspects of some of these constellations and galaxies look like highly detailed representations of astronomical phenomena visible from Earth -- and others are probably not. It's like this hallway shows all of the universe. Your mind, even your Awakened mind, struggles to comprehend it all.<br /> <br /> You can tell from the sound of her voice that the &quot;woman&quot; is moving farther down the hallway. You could be hearing things, but you also think you faintly hear a distant, rumbling sound.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Even with the stars moving around you in a brilliant and complex display of light, you can feel the wall as you brush your fingertips along its surface. For all its glamor, you know that this is a kind of illusion, basically magical wallpaper. You're able to follow the woman's voice with ease while still taking in the sights around you. You also distinctly notice, albeit faintly, a distant rumble. You're not sure where it's coming from or what might be causing it.<br /> <br /> As you move along the hallway and study the stars, your mind tries to take everything in. You've done more than your fair share of studies on the fables of the hubris that led to the Fall of Atlantis, at least from books that Hakim loaned to you or allowed you to read from his private collection. Based on this obscure information, you make a startling realization that you are convinced must be true: You aren't just learning about Atlantis, you've <i>found it.</i> Somehow this portal must be a bridge across the Abyss. You're not just seeing the aftermath of the Fall, you're breaking through it! And, based on what you read, that must mean you've gained considerable arcane power just by being here.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Sure, gain a Beat.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T16:25:39-07:00","id":957908,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The sound of rumbling fills Ragnar with a little apprehension, but he recalls the impression he got from his earlier spell. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">This place doesn't hold any dangers. Is that a waterfall, or something? </span></i>Feeling safe enough to approach the dais with the table, Ragnar leans forward to examine it, observing the craftsmanship and instruments it carries.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar examines the table to learn whatever he can from it. <br /> <br /> Wits 2 + Investigation 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/430417\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div></span><br /> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T02:01:07-07:00","id":958117,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Do you guys hear the rumbling too?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx glances around the room, counting the number of openings, wondering from which one the sound originates. He then advances to one of these doorways - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Let's check out the one to the left of the one we came out of.</span></i> - and gazes into it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T12:39:22-07:00","id":959373,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: Mind/Space. Active Spells: Outward Inward Eye [see in all directions, scene duration, potency 1: advanced]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Imago (3 Reach), Abyssal Backlash (+2 Paradox)<br /> Health: X/OOOO | Willpower: 0/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 3/5 | Arcane Beats: 2/5</b></div> <br /> Oh yeah, huh, he probably <i>is</i> in Atlantis, isn't he? That would make a lot of sense, given how wild the past few days have been.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Phoenix,&quot;</span> he says to his companion, barely keeping his voice calm, <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I believe we are in a place of very, very powerful magic. When I scrutinized the portal, it was both new and unthinkably ancient all at once. We are outside of time and destiny. The threads have not yet been severed here. The ladder has not yet fallen. We are before Paradox and before sin. Watch.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He plants his feet and points at the phantom woman, using his cracked mirror like a wand. Forming an Imago is still difficult with the Abyssal whispers and the gnawing at his psyche, but he knows it's no threat here, he just pushes the extra distance to make the spell conform to his desires. To boost his confidence, he tries to speak in an austere and commanding voice, although the effect is something like a kid wearing his dad's suit. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Stop. I am Moonstone, Awakened of the Iron Gauntlet, sworn to Pandemonium. You are lost and confused without a sovereign, and so I claim your fealty by right of, <i>uh, </i>my...Awakened will. Obey.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Mind 2 &quot;Psychic Domination&quot; on the phantom woman, or trying to.<br /> <br /> Three tasks for her to complete: &quot;Acknowledge my sovereignty over you.&quot; &quot;Tell us exactly where we are right now.&quot; And, &quot;Lead us to the center of this place.&quot; Potency 2.<br /> <br /> 1 free Reach on instant casting. +1 for scene duration, +1 for sensory range, +1 for a complex task, +2 for 2 additional tasks. 5 paradox dice from Reach, +3 for this being my fourth Paradox roll in the scene, +2 from Abyssal Backlash. 10 paradox dice total. Of course I'm going to release any Paradox, containing hasn't gotten me anywhere so far, and besides, I'm in Atlantis, Paradox isn't real! 10 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/431323\" target=\"_blank\">6 successes.</a><br /> <br /> So that's fun. 6 Paradox Reach for the ST and yet another Paradox Condition for Moonstone, who is outdoing most Scelesti at this point. Spellcasting roll: Gnosis 1, Mind 2, +1 from Path tool, +2 from concentration duration, -6 from Paradox: chance die. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/431326\" target=\"_blank\">failure.</a> I would be remiss not to make that a dramatic failure (for an Arcane Beat) given the circumstances, so let's do that.<br /> <br /> Does this whole situation count as fulfilling my Vice (Naive) or my Virtue (Bold)? I could see either one in this case. Also I'm pretty sure this counts as &quot;failing to contain a severe paradox&quot;, which is a Wisdom sin.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T23:54:19-07:00","id":963578,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You approach the dais and examine the table. The large stone basin has a dark, murky liquid resting in it. There is a small knife sitting on the table that appears to be made from a jagged, black stone. A large book is propped open on the table; upon closer inspection, it is written in complex symbols you've never seen before but somehow it seems familiar. It evokes the feeling you get when you're trying to remember something important but the details escape you. <br /> <br /> A sudden gust of wind enters the room from somewhere. It circulates in the room, gently at first but growing in intensity as it begins to whip at your clothes. The rumbling is definitely louder now, loud enough that it's very obvious and easy to notice, and you feel the floor begin to vibrate underneath your feet. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You gaze down the closest alternative hallway leading into this room. It's dark, but with your heightened senses you can make out that it looks very similar to the hallway you and your companions used to travel to this room. Based on what you've seen here, you guess that the hallways are probably all connected, but it could take hours or days to investigate them all.<br /> <br /> The rumbling grows even louder. You can't pinpoint a direction because it seems to be coming from every direction at once. The floor and walls begin to shake, and you need to place a hand on a nearby wall to keep your balance. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Sorry I took so long to reply to your post. I needed some time to think about how to best use those Paradox reaches, and what impact it might have on the story. You gave me a lot to think about!<br /> <br /> First, I do think your Vice applies well here. You may gain a WP for acting in line with your na\u00efvet\u00e9. However, choosing to release a severe Paradox does provoke a degeneration roll at the Understanding level. Because this is an act of hubris in line with your Vice, roll 2d10 rather than 3.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You speak with extreme confidence and excitement about your revelations of this place. After all, you have pre-existing knowledge about the Fall from your lessons with Hakim; how could you be wrong? And so you weave your magic, ignoring the dark feeling welling up inside of you and pushing far beyond your reach of control. You try to force your Imago into place, assuming some kind of control over this woman.<br /> <br /> In an instant, everything goes wildly wrong.<br /> <br /> The Mind spell collapses, snapping back and giving you a splitting headache that assaults your already weak mental fortitude. More importantly, your efforts to reach beyond the Lie to enhance your spell cause a tear in reality so large that...<i>something</i> forces its way through it. The brilliant display of stars and constellations dim, and then entire galaxies depicted in the room start swirling into a pitch-black vortex. From the impossible darkness, a humanoid creature emerges, with long, sinewy arms that end in talons. You feel a chill pass down your spine when the creature emits the deep, throaty laugh you heard earlier.<br /> <br /> You feel a pulse of energy and see the &quot;woman&quot; move closer to you. To your Sight, her form solidifies and she almost seems for a moment to approximate a conscious mind. <i>YOU HAVE DOOMED US ALL! BEWARE THE ANUNAKI! YOU MUST--</i><br /> <br /> The woman's words end abruptly in a scream as the creature of pure darkness reaches out a hand and pierces her with its claws. You don't understand how it could be possible, but the woman's form falters and liquifies, collapsing into the nothingness in front of you. <br /> <br /> The rumbling sound grows much louder, and the floor begins to vibrate. The creature stares at you unconcernedly and smiles. It's hard to look at, because all light around the entity swirls as if looking into a kaleidoscope, but you clearly see it smile. Its mouth has far too many teeth. It begins to glide towards you. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For the dramatic failure on your spell casting roll, take the Shaken condition. For the Paradox, you gain the Abyssal Backlash condition again but with +6 on your next Paradox roll. All 6 Paradox reaches were spent on the Abyssal entity. I'm giving you a bonus Beat for singlehandedly creating and allowing me to introduce a creature that is likely to drive the main plot, or at least a prominent subplot, for a period of time.<br /> <br /> Oh, and roll initiative!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T00:55:44-07:00","id":963590,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Lynx feels his legs tremble twofold - <span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Faen, not liking this. Deep breaths, deep...</i></span> - as he looks over to Dr. Asphodel and Ragnar with a quiet whimper in his throat. He hurriedly moves back to the centre of the room with the dais, keeping his senses peeled in all directions, though there is a noticeable shiver of fear accompanying him. He calls out, slightly shakily,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;Dr. Asphodel! Hurry over here, we shouldn't separate!&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx attempts a Wits + Composure roll to notice any danger and other incoming relevancies, and garners 1 success.</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/433856\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Wits + Composure \u2192 1 success.</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T10:35:27-07:00","id":963776,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity, Divination (this round)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <div align=\"left\">Ragnar's head snaps up. As the wind picks up, he starts to get a sickening feeling that something very wrong has happened. He head turns back to the table, and after a moment's hesitation, he seizes both the knife and the tome, and places them in his backpack. He turns towards Lynx and jogs over to him. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Something just happened, and I don't think it's good. I'm going to try and find out what.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> Ragnar closes his eyes, and opens them again, now looking at Fate and Time. After briefly examining his surroundings, he allows his vision to refocus on the mundane. Taking a deep breath, he grips his silver knife close to him. Once again, he dips his mental finger into the stream of time. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>Is there danger if we remain in this place? Is there now a hazard between us and the portal out of here?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar uses Active Mage Sight with Fate and Time to examine the room, and then dismisses it. He then attempts to cast Divination (Time 1) to see if whatever has happened has created a hazard. He uses one free Reach to cast a spell beyond his spell limit, and the other free Reach to bump the Potency up to 2 to ask an additional question. He then spends an extra Reach on the Divination option to get specific answers.<br /> <br /> The additional Reach creates the risk of Paradox. Ragnar uses his knife as a Yantra to try and lessen the Paradox.<br /> <br /> Reach 1 - Dedicated Tool 2 = chance dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/433961\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. So despite his best effort, there's still a Paradox that he has to deal with.<br /> <br /> Ragnar chooses to contain the Paradox, since he doesn't know what it is and wants to spell to stay under his control. Wisdom 7 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/433962\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. So the Paradox is contained, but he take a point of resistant bashing damage. If he has to spend any Mana to accompany that contain roll, he does so.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Concentration 2 + WP 3 - Potency 2 = 6 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/433963\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 09-05-2016, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T15:17:34-07:00","id":963940,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Imago (3 Reach), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox), Shaken<br /> Health: X/OOOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 2/5</b><br /> </div> Aw jeez. Typical Moonstone. Causing the Fall of Atlantis to repeat itself in front of his eyes. He's a burden and a fool. He wraps his arms around himself in sheer terror as the entity shreds the illusory woman, and dearly desperately wishes Hakim was here. Which he isn't.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wisdom roll: 2 dice. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/434070\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. I stay at Wisdom 7 and gain an Arcane Beat for making an Act of Hubris roll.<br /> <br /> While we're here, let's roll Initiative. d10+7=<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/434080\" target=\"_blank\">12</a><br /> <br /> And I'm gonna dismiss my Outward and Inward Eye spell so I don't have to deal with that Reach anymore.<br /> <br /> If possible, I'm also going to reflexively scour my Abyssal Imago condition for 1 resistant lethal damage and 1 Arcane Beat? I don't know whether there's a limit on how many times I can do that per day.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Okay. Moonstone is responsible for this. He can fix it. <i>Don't close your eyes, don't turn away.</i> He raises the hoe he scavenged earlier and urges Phoenix: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Run.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> And he proceeds to run like mad, trying to push past this thing and flee down the dark corridor in the direction the woman was going.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T07:43:15-07:00","id":964285,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Dr. Asphodel<br /> Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Poor Lighting</b></div> <br /> Hearing her companions, the doc swiftly skitters over, wary of the shaking and the wind. She glances around, squinting in the poor light. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;W-w-we... w'need t'get out of here. W-w's happening n-now?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T15:23:12-07:00","id":965296,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 0/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">What the fuuu-</span>&quot; the rest of my words droop out unformed. How could I form them? This...<i>thing</i>, just came out of the Abyss, and Moonstone brought it here. Words aren't enough to describe how much I wanna <b>wring</b> that dick's little neck! It's not my responsibility to clean up the mess he made. I should just let him die, he brought it on himself. Just let the idiot die from his own mistake, I don't owe him my life or anything. There's a good chance I'll die fighting that thing anyways, so I shouldn't.<br /> <br /> Except I am.<br /> <br /> No question about it. As much as that idiot <i>should</i> die for his mistake, he can't learn from it if he's dead. Besides, fighting monsters is my job. I shift into a stance, wielding my broom as a staff.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/434681\" target=\"_blank\">Initiative 5 + 8 = 13</a><br /> <br /> Would fighting the big bad Abyssal to give Moonstone a chance to get away count for his Compassionate Virtue? Fighting a Rank 3 Abyssal with nothing more than a broom and weak magic seems pretty damn detrimental.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 09-07-2016, 06:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T11:49:46-07:00","id":967438,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> The rumbling is growing, so loud that it practically deafens anything else your ears can detect. The floor, the walls, everything in this room is shaking as if threatening to collapse. However, you can't see any specific thing that could be causing it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You quickly glance around the room with your Sight. The place seems to be changing before your eyes, but it's hard to comprehend. Before the rumbling, this place had a sort of timeless quality to it; that hasn't changed, per se, but there now seem to be ripples in the movement of time around you that weren't there before. The ripples share the quality of Time that you perceived when you used your Sight in Chicago. You don't have time to study the room with your Sight more, because you only look for a brief moment.<br /> <br /> You feel a sense of certainty around you as you finish your spell. A vision of the very near future flashes around you: an athletic older man in his 50s or 60s, with short white hair and a closely trimmed beard, looking at you with concern in his eyes. <i>There is no danger. The way out is before you now.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx, Ragnar, and Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> The rumble grows to a deafening roar. As it does, you feel an odd sensation throughout your bodies, a tingling sensation at first that begins to feel like a fire in your bones. The room...shifts, as if ripping apart. You hear a ripping sound, and in the middle of the dais you see a burst of light and a view of the alley where you first entered the portal. You feel yourself lurch, and then...<br /> <br /> ...you find yourself collapsed in a heap by the alley, each of you resting against the others. You have a headache, partially worsened by the bright light suddenly shining down on you.<br /> <br /> As you try to orient yourself, a man looks down at you concernedly. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Are you alright?&quot;</span> he asks. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I knew I'd find you here, but I didn't know what condition you'd be in...&quot;</span> Ragnar recognizes him as the man he has been seeing in his divinations.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.mens-hairstyle.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Cool-Older-Men-Hairstyles-8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Before you take any actions or reply, please roll the following:<br /> <br /> Ragnar: 2d10, then 1 chance die<br /> Lynx: 1d10, then 1 chance die<br /> Dr. Asphodel: 1 chance die</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You bolt past the creature as fast as your legs can carry you. The realization of what you've done, what you've risked to yourself and Phoenix through your inability to contain the Paradox, washes over you like a wave of guilt and terror. You frantically try to rip the Abyssal contamination out of your soul. You do so, but it <i>hurts</i>, causing you to cough up blood as you run.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You do gain 1 Arcane Beat for risking a degeneration roll. You can scour the condition but I don't think you can gain the Arcane Beat for resolving it because you've already done so earlier in this scene, right? I haven't looked back in the thread recently. If you would rather wait until a new scene to scour it, and thus get the Arcane Beat, you can ignore the damage for now.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Despite the anger welling up in you at Moonstone's idiocy, you somehow find compassion and pity as well. Perhaps he didn't know what he was risking, but you do know what's at stake here, and you make the incredibly brave -- or stupid -- decision to stand guard for Moonstone's sake.<br /> <br /> You hope that it doesn't get you killed.<br /> <br /> The impossibly dark, shadowy, ominous creature smiles and extends a tentacle-like arm. It stretches around you and squeezes you, trying to crush your bones.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yes, I'll say that this activates your Virtue. Gain all WP back.<br /> <br /> The creature rolls higher initiative: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435706\" target=\"_blank\">Initiative</a>: <u>1d10+14</u> = <b>20</b>. It will act, and then it's you and then Moonstone.<br /> <br /> From your character sheet, it looks like you have Defense 7. As I mentioned earlier in the post, if you want to reflexively activate your Mage Armor, Dodge, or do something else to modify the attack results, let me know before you act.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435734\" target=\"_blank\">Attack (14) - Defense (7)</a>: <u>7d10o10h8</u> = <b>2</b> successes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435919\" target=\"_blank\">Extra attack dice</a>: <u>1d10o10h8</u> = <b>2</b> more successes for the correction as discussed on OOC thread, to a total of 4 successes overall. With your Forces Armor, you reduce that to a total of 2 bashing damage.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-12-2016, 07:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T12:03:09-07:00","id":967449,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"