:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T12:58:50-07:00","id":967475,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Poor Light (Visual-based Perception rolls at -2); Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 1 dice \u2192 <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435743\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a><br /> <br /> Chance dice \u2192 <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435746\" target=\"_blank\">Dramatic failure</a><br /> <br /> My first beat?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T07:07:51-07:00","id":967907,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> Forces | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>B</b>BBOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 3/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> It's smiling at me. This...thing, this abomination is smiling at me. It's not a smile I can see, but I can somehow sense it, as if the creature wants me to know about it. My disgust distracts me enough to leave an opening that it seizes. It lashes out with what I can best describe as a tentacle and constricts me. Fortunately, my instincts respond in time to raise a shield of sorts (more like armor, really) that minimizes the pressure. However, the tentacle still manages to crush, the pain jolting through my entire body.<br /> <br /> I manage to break off the tentacle's grip with the help of my magic armor and good ol' grit. My arms now free, I swipe the broom square into its &quot;head&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/438194\" target=\"_blank\">Strength 3 + Weaponry 3 + 3 WP - 6 Defense = 3 dice \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 09-20-2016, 04:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T07:21:13-07:00","id":967915,"title":"","content":"Dr. Asphodel<br /> Conditions: Poor Light<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Chance die --&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/435945\" target=\"_blank\">NOPE</a><br /> I get a beat, I guess!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T17:49:54-07:00","id":968276,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Imago (3 Reach), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox), Shaken<br /> Health: X/OOOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 3/5</b><br /> <br /> An idea forms through the fog of terror and confusion. <i>Hide. </i>Moonstone reaches under his jacket and pulls the hood of the Cloak of Night over his head...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will indeed wait until next scene to scour the Condition, I think you're right. I'm going to spend my action this turn activating my Artifact's Shadow Flesh effect. 7 dice to activate Potency 1 Shadow Flesh with Duration 5 turns. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/436118\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> &quot;The mage transforms the subject\u2019s body and all her personal<br /> possessions into a mass of moving and animated shadows. The<br /> mage may choose to make the subject a three-dimensional or<br /> a two-dimensional shadow. Three-dimensional shadows still<br /> have no apparent mass or substance, and cannot interact with<br /> physical objects. Two-dimensional shadows may move through<br /> cracks and crevices, though are still bound by the laws of gravity<br /> and must remain touching the floor, even if moving on walls.<br /> The subject retains all of her Attributes and Skills, but may not<br /> take physical actions other than to move, though she can still cast<br /> spells. She is immune to attacks or damage, but not Supernal magic,<br /> while in her shadowy form. She is effectively invisible in natural or<br /> supernatural darkness, though she can see in them herself.&quot;<br /> <br /> Moonstone turns into a two-dimensional shadow, immune to attacks (but not Supernal magic), no physical actions, still capable of spellcasting.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ...and melts into an inky puddle on the floor, which hurries to the exit of the room. Is there a way out? Was that corridor leading somewhere important?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 09-25-2016, 04:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T07:02:48-07:00","id":970662,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>*NEW SCENE*</b></div> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You feel as if you have just woken up from a strange dream. You remember going into the portal with Lynx and Dr. Asphodel, but everything after that is hazy and dark. An image of dark corridors and a cavern flashes very briefly through your mind, and then fades. The man makes eye contact with you and looks at you concernedly, and it triggers an echo of a memory of a divination you cast. <i>He will find you...</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Make a perception roll (Wits + Composure).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> Your thoughts are hazy, as if just waking from a dream. You remember going into the portal, but very little after that. You catch a brief scent, or a memory of a scent, of stale air and remember the echo of water dripping. Otherwise, you have no memory of what happened in the portal.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">These rolls are different than normal. You do not gain any condition or a Beat. (Also, remember that you only gain a Beat from a failed roll if you had a normal failure and voluntarily chose to make it a dramatic failure.) However, make a perception roll, using your bonus from your spell.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> You remember going into the portal with the others, but nothing after that. You feel like you have just woken from a dream, but you can't understand why; you have no memory of where you have been or what happened to you in the portal. The effect is unnerving.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Failing a chance die roll is still just a regular failure, unless you roll a 1 (you rolled a 6). However, you can choose to take a Beat and make it a dramatic failure if you wish. Let me know if you want to do that, otherwise these results stand.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix and Moonstone</b><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Initiative:</b><br /> Abyssal entity -- Attacked<br /> Moonstone -- Ran and activated Cloak of Shadow<br /> --&gt; Phoenix -- Waiting on your response about the spell, per my OOC post, so you can take your turn. </div> </div> </div><b>Moonstone</b><br /> You melt into a puddle of shadow, which is an unnerving experience but one that fills you with relief as you slip away from the fighting.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;