 putting there. Upon checking it, you find a small, perfectly round pebble that fits in the palm of your hand. It feels slightly warm to the touch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T12:32:10-07:00","id":970833,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Imago (3 Reach), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox), Shaken<br /> Health: X/OOOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 3/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits+Composure: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/437282\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Also going to scour Abyssal Imago now that it's a new scene and take the damage and arcane beat.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 09-25-2016, 04:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T18:08:27-07:00","id":971037,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Poor Lighting (-2 to all vision-based Perception rolls)<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> </div> <div align=\"left\">Ragnar blinks at the man. That place... was it even real? The memories seem to pass away like fragments of a dream, like water slipping through his fingers. The sight of the man stirs a memory, almost like an echoing voice, of a spell he cast. He seizes onto it with all his will, as his mind still struggles to center itself. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;You found us. I knew you would. I cast the spell to see the future and you were there waiting for us.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Ragnar makes his perception roll. Wits 2 + Composure 2 + WP 3 = <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/437323\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. All those dice, only one success. Ah well.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 09-18-2016, 08:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T01:16:19-07:00","id":971822,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Lynx groans and flops to his side. He gazes upwards at the sky, trying to draw in his surroundings. He feels the lingering thrill of the dream, trying to relive it, to remember... Then he spots the elderly man.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Oh. There's an elderly man here.</span></i><br /> <br /> He shifts and sits up in one motion, stretching his shoulders... <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">...Where's my shirt?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm okay, thank you, how are you?</span>&quot; he replies absently with a slight nod to the man. He rubs his beard, then scrambles up on his feet easily with the help of his <i>body control</i>, absorbs his surroundings, and focuses on Dr. Asphodel and Ragnar.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Ragnar? Dr. Asphodel? Are you hurt?</span>&quot; He kneels next to them in turn, giving them cursory examinations as his senses instinctively sink into those of Life - and Life only - to make sure they're okay. During his examination, he glances at the man with his exposed senses, drawing in his scent, his breath, his essence, and when his observations are done, he lets go of the Primal Wild.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Lynx activates Life Senses momentarily, checks Ragnar, Dr. Asphodel and the man, and then turns his Senses off.</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">He's learning!</span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T05:21:26-07:00","id":971889,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You hear and see Phoenix is not running after you as you instructed. He is instead turning to face the monster alone, with nothing but a broom. You see it wrap a tentacle around him and squeeze, trying to crush him. It seems to be enjoying it. <br /> <br /> Ahead, you see an exit to this room: a cracked door that opens to reveal a tall spiral staircase leading up and away. The rumbling is growing so loud and the floors are vibrating so much that the room seems to be threatening to fall apart. <br /> <br /> You rip the Abyssal energy from your soul. It hurts intensely, but you feel cleaner somehow. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> The older man studies you curiously and smiles. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;You did well, then. I was led here by my own Fate spell. I knew if I came here in time, I might be able to find you all. My name is Mathias. I have so much more to tell you, and to ask you...&quot;</span> He frowns again, his face pained with worry. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;But we must go, and quickly. I don't know the full story, but there is another group of fledgling mages not far from here in incredible danger -- and the city may be as well.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Mathias studies his watch. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;The power is back on, so that means the next train will be here...yes, in just a moment.&quot;</span> He looks at each of you and asks, <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Please, come with me!&quot;</span> He motions for you to follow and points down the street. The nearest train stop is about a block away. Mathias looks both ways out of the alley and then begins to jog towards the train station. <br /> <br /> Despite the distractions, you notice something odd in your pocket, a narrow object with a sharp end. Inspecting it reveals a small knife with a steel hilt and a blade made from a jagged, black stone. It looks familiar somehow...maybe something from the dream?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You breathe in the smells around you and study your companions closely. They give off their natural scents, with no whiff of anything that suggests toxins, disease, or serious injury.<br /> <br /> The man appears similarly healthy and uninjured. If anything, he is more healthy than you would expect for an average man of his apparent age.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T10:44:15-07:00","id":972007,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: Serendipity<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar's emotions feel like a firecracker. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Fate spell? Does that mean he became a mage like I did? </i></span>A thousand different questions spring to mind, but Ragnar decides they can wait. There are far more pressing matters than his curiosity, justified as it may be. He also notices the knife, with its blade of black, obsidian-like stone and steel handle, and keeps the knowledge to himself. He'll have chances to investigate it, and its significance, once they have completed this task. For now, Ragnar follows Mathias, fixating on him as a guide in both a literal and figurative sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T12:30:40-07:00","id":972646,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 0/10 Health: X/////O (-2)<br /> [Pattern Scoured: -1 Str]</div> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits 2 + Composure 4 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/437933\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes.</a> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T05:56:34-07:00","id":973067,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar, Lynx, and Dr. Asphodel</b><br /> As you start to follow Mathias, you nearly bump into another man who turns the corner into the small street right in front of you. He turns and studies each of you, then glances over his shoulder and looks with a confused frown at Mathias, who hasn't realized yet that you've been interrupted. The man turns back to Dr. Asphodel, politely ignoring the rest of you.<br /> <img src=\"https://thumbs.dreamstime.com/x/happy-middle-aged-man-standing-folded-hands-16594303.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;There you are, Dr. McCallister,&quot;</span> he says in relief. <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;I've been looking for you. There was an incident with one of the students from your class -- nothing serious, just some scared kids running into each other in the hallway after the power went out -- but I need you to help with a few things back in the building.&quot;</span> He sighs and chuckles. <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;Someone said they saw you heading over here, so I thought I'd try and catch you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr. Asphodel blinks and flashes a smile. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;O-of c-c-course, D-dean G-gray. Le-let's get b-back. J-just helpin' Simon here wit' o-one of the o-other st-students,&quot;</span> she replies quickly.<br /> <br /> Although you are new to this class, you know that Dr. Thomas Gray is the Dean of the Humanities Division at the University of Chicago. He teaches one of the other FYS classes down the hallway from yours. Dr. Asphodel begins walking back towards the academic building with Dr. Gray. She glances over her shoulder at the two young men and frowns apologetically, but nods firmly towards Mathias. The older mage has paused at this point, waiting for the others to catch up with him, but he is clearly trying to get moving.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> At this time, Dr. Asphodel will become an NPC, until such time that Beans decides to come back. </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You look around you and see that you are alone. You're not sure where the other girls went, but you don't see them. You also don't see the creature that attacked you or the other mages you were briefly traveling with.<br /> <br /> You do, however, feel something odd on your Periphery. To your naked eye, you see the wall on the street vibrate where you last saw the portal, causing dust to fall off the building. You know you can't see the portal without your Mage Sight, but something might be happening -- unless there's something else nearby, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-20-2016, 09:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T06:41:35-07:00","id":973099,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 0/7 Mana: 0/10 Health: X/////O (-2)<br /> [Pattern Scoured: -1 Str] [Shaken] [Mage Sight: Mind, Space]<br /> Beats: 0 Arcane Beats: 4</div> <br /> Binder can't help but feel a little snubbed. Pass out trying to help folks and where does it leave you? They leave you lying on the sidewalk.<br /> That being said, being taken to the hospital would've been <i>really</i> inconvenient, so it's no sense being too upset about it.<br /> <br /> He eyes the vibrating wall while keeping his distance, then pulls up Mage Sight to get a better look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T03:21:12-07:00","id":973740,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Ah, Professor,</span>&quot; Lynx starts, but as Dr. Asphodel strides away from them, there's a pang of disappointment in his chest.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">We went through this together...</span></i><br /> <br /> The urgency of the moment catches up to him, however. He glances over at the man calling himself Mathias, and with a deep sigh, puts on half a smile as he pats Ragnar on the back.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well, let's not keep your friend waiting.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Yet, as he hurries alongside Ragnar to appease Mathias's urgency, a little part of him feels lost.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">By the way, what's the etiquette on, well,</span>&quot; he gestures to his exposed upper body,. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Bare-chested...ness?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T05:31:40-07:00","id":973772,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar gives Dr. Asphodel an apologetic look and mimes <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I'll call you&quot;</span> to her, and then turns and follows Mathias.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;He's not precisely my friend,&quot; </span>he says to Lynx in a low tone.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;Remember that divination spell I cast before we entered the portal? It told me that if we went through, we would meet this mage. And he's taking us to meet other mages, if I understand him properly.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He sneaks a look at Lynx's chest, and has to resist giving him an up-and-down.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\"> &quot;Well... I'm sure there are one or two bars downtown that cater to a bearded, built, shirtless male clientele- I mean, assuming that's what you're into. Which you may not be.&quot; </span>He frowns a little at Lynx's predicament. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;You were wearing a shirt before we entered the portal. So what made you take it off inside it?&quot; </span><i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Man, I did not expect all that under that shir- wait... </span></i>Ragnar shakes his head, suddenly seized with a sense of deja vu. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Don't tell me I started checking him out inside the portal, too. </span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I realized that, since it's a new scene, Serendipity would have worn off. I'm updating Ragnar's condition log to reflect that.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T06:34:17-07:00","id":973810,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000CD\">So what made you take it off inside it?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Lynx snorts and chuckles, not bothering to keep his voice down. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">We got wet, I remember that much. I don't like wearing wet clothes, so...I guess I took it off and lost it. You don't mind, do you?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He then looks ahead at the man, and keeps a low tone, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">He seems to have good intentions, at least... Do you trust him?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T13:10:24-07:00","id":973991,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;We got wet, I remember that much. I don't like wearing wet clothes, so...I guess I took it off and lost it. You don't mind, do you?</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Wet?&quot; </span>The word stirs up a mental snippet of his head breaking the surface of water, and a brief image of Lynx pulling off a soaking wet t-shirt. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;It's all really hazy. But if you left it... wherever we were, I guess we can't go back. I think I'll survive,&quot; </span>says Ragnar with a crooked smile. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">He seems to have good intentions, at least... Do you trust him?</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar considers the question for a moment, watching the back of Mathias' head as he leads them. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;We just met the guy, so we can't tell one way or another,&quot; </span>he whispers. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;But right now, I don't think we have the luxury of distrusting him. We can do some stuff on our own, but we need answers. And right now, he's the only potential source of them that we have. I'm sticking with him until he gives me a reason to not trust him.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T06:27:56-07:00","id":974366,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> When you open your Sight, the mundane world around you becomes more muted and the portal on the wall appears again before your eyes. The portal appears more unstable than before: The edges appear to be shaking, and there are bright flashes of lightning shooting across the surface. Black tendrils of energy seem to be colliding with the lightning, as if the two energies are at conflict.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx and Ragnar</b><br /> The two of you catch up to Mathias, who offers a smile, but his eyebrows are furrowed with worry. He waves you towards the train station, about half a block away. As you walk, he turns towards you and chuckles, then reaches into a backpack slung over his shoulder. Mathias pulls out a black shirt and tosses it to Lynx. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I forgot to give that to you earlier, sorry. I knew you'd be needing that but wasn't sure why.&quot;</span> Mathias seems like he wants to ask, but just grins instead. The shirt is roughly your size, maybe a little smaller -- it fits tightly in the chest and arms. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Better not to draw too much attention after a Highstorm if you can help it.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Mathias also pulls out three CTA punch cards, gives one to each of you, and holds onto the third for himself. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I didn't know which of you was going to follow, but I knew it wasn't all three.&quot;</span> His voice is tinged with minor annoyance at the mention of not knowing. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I know you don't know me, but please, trust me. I will explain as much as I can and answer your questions if possible.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The three of you arrive at the train station, and Mathias leads the way through. He sticks his punch card in and runs up the stairs to the tracks. The train pulls up just moments later, and he walks on board and takes a seat in a vacant booth on the train. There are a handful of people sitting on the opposite end of the train car, but no one pays you any notice in particular.<br /> <br /> Mathias tries to keep his voice lower, occasionally glancing over at the other side of the train to see if anyone is looking in their direction. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;The crazy weather patterns that happen here, like the one that just ended? We call them a Highstorm,&quot;</span> he explains. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;We mages, I mean. Not all of them are found or reveal themselves, but we have a society here in the greater Chicago metro area of...maybe a couple hundred? Small enough in a city of this size that when we learn about someone who's newly Awakened, that's a big deal.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Anyway, during or immediately after these Highstorms, sometimes...things happen. Doors open up to strange places that we can't remember clearly, only bits and pieces. The mystery behind it all is <i>fascinating</i>, so a lot of us congregate here when one happens. There's danger here, serious danger, so I usually try to...<i>look ahead</i> to see what I might encounter.&quot;</span> He smiles again, and for a moment his excitement overcomes the worry on his face. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;To find three of you here, and know that there are three others we're about to meet, is incredible.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Mathias' tone turns worried again, and his expression darkens. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;But something is going wrong with the others. They're in incredible danger. A monster, or creature, or something...I'm not sure what it is. But there's going to be something coming out. We need to get to them quickly, or they're going to be in grave danger. And even if they're ok...Well, a lot of other people might not be. Today, tomorrow, I don't know, but it's not good.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-24-2016, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T08:50:21-07:00","id":974434,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> Lynx slips into the shirt, shifting uncomfortably as he hurries after the man - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">A little too tight...</span></i> - his ears kept firmly on the man's - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">No, Mathias, that's what he said his name was.</span></i> - explanatory monologue. He rubs his beard on occasion, questions emerging in his mind, as he makes himself comfortable in the seat opposite Mathias.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:teal\">We call them a Highstorm,</span> <span style=\"color:teal\">We mages, I mean. Not all of them are found or reveal themselves, but we have a society here in the greater Chicago metro area of...maybe a couple hundred? </span><span style=\"color:#008080\">Small enough in a city of this size that when we learn about someone who's newly Awakened, that's a big deal.</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">Around a <i>hundred</i> like me and Ragnar? And that's <i>small</i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">?&quot; Lynx asks curiously. &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">So there are even more of us... mages elsewhere? That's <i>amazing!</i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;<br /> <br /> ...</span><br /> <br /> ... He smiles again, and for a moment his excitement overcomes the worry on his face. <span style=\"color:teal\">&quot;To find three of you here, and know that there are three others we're about to meet, is incredible. </span><span style=\"color:#008080\">But something is going wrong with the others. They're in incredible danger. A monster, or creature, or something...I'm not sure what it is.</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Monsters...you mean like the... the...</span>&quot; Lynx rubs his beard again, gesturing with his other hand while trying to find his words. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Like spirits? The ones that are on the 'other side'?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> ...&quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">But there's going to be something coming out. We need to get to them quickly, or they're going to be in grave danger. And even if they're ok...Well, a lot of other people might not be. Today, tomorrow, I don't know, but it's not good.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I hope we get there in time, then!</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> As the train carries on, Lynx glances at Mathias and Ragnar. He tilts his head, and asks, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">So... are you two the same type of mage? Are there actual categories of mages? Only you said you used a Fate spell, and I know Ragnar has also used Fate spells.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">OOC: This was tricky to format.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T10:44:11-07:00","id":974521,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar notices the look that Mathias gives them, and starts blushing. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Nothing happened! I mean, not that I'm opposed to something happening. I mean...&quot; </span>Ragnar closes his eyes. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;We ended up underwater at some point. Lynx took his shirt off. That's it. Totally platonic.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> On the bus, Ragnar sits and listens to Mathias. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Anyway, during or immediately after these Highstorms, sometimes...things happen. Doors open up to strange places that we can't remember clearly, only bits and pieces.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar sits up at that part, keeping the same quiet tone as Mathias and Lynx. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Yes, that matches up with what we experienced. We were all in a first-year seminar class. The storm started up, I took a peek with my Sight, and I saw a portal. But it was... odd. Like somebody put a dark veil over it. We decided to investigate. And we can only remember scraps.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He continues to listen until Lynx speaks up. <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">Like spirits? The ones that are on the 'other side'?</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Lynx here saw some spirits feeding on hail from the storm. It seem like it was... tainted by some sort of energy. Has anybody reported that before?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He sits quietly once again until Lynx mentions their shared magical talents. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;You know, I've been wondering that myself. My magic seems to be tied to Fate and Time. I'm sure we don't have the time to get into details, but do mages have inherent magical proclivities?&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T05:31:54-07:00","id":975007,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> You <i>whack </i>the Abyssal creature squarely between what look like eyes, using all of your might and speed to make the blow count. You feel it connect, and the creature growls. The &quot;skin&quot; you struck seems to turn darker for a moment, and the small mark you had made with your &quot;staff&quot; disappears. It smiles again, and then reaches out its hands.<br /> <br /> Its long, sinewy arms end in talons that suddenly <i>explode</i> towards you faster than you can react, sending a blast of dark energy that rips through your body. It's faster and stronger than a gun, causing intense agony that your supernatural armor can only partially protect against.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The Abyssal entity will use its Blast numina, which currently counts as a +0L firearm, so your Defense does not apply.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439001\" target=\"_blank\">Blast (14d10)</a>: <b>6</b> lethal damage. Your armor absorbs 2 of the damage, so you take a net 4 lethal. I believe that now means you'll need a Stamina roll to remain conscious.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Initiative</b><br /> Abyssal entity: Blast<br /> --&gt; Moonstone: Your turn<br /> Phoenix </div> </div> </div><b>Lynx and Ragnar</b><br /> <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Well, if you think about it, there are about 10 million people in the greater Chicago metro area. A few hundred is a very small fraction. And there are more here than in many other places, because the Highstorms draw a lot of interest,&quot;</span> Mathias explains quietly.<br /> <br /> At the mention of spirits, his frown deepens and he shakes his head. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Not quite like that. Darker, more sinister. They come from a place we call the Abyss. It's...I can't even begin to explain that with the time we have. There will be plenty of time later for existential quandaries, and someone with a lot more knowledge on it than I have can try to tell you all about it. If you're interested in meeting more of my colleagues, anyway.&quot;</span> The statement has a questioning tone, and Mathias eyes you both hopefully.<br /> <br /> Mathias looks at Ragnar with concern. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Look, it's none of my business <i>technically</i>, but I need to warn you: Sometimes people come out of those Highstorms with...things they didn't have when they went in. Items, books, artifacts of minor or even incredible power. It's why so many mages go hunting in the Highstorms.&quot;</span> He bites his lip with worry. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;But a lot of them are messed up. Tainted. Cursed. Be careful with them.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The train slows down, and Mathis stands up. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I...honestly don't know about the spirit stuff. That sounds dark, and might have to do with what we're about to face.&quot;</span> As you look out the window, you see the train arriving near the heart of downtown Chicago. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;There are five different types of mages, at least in terms of how they naturally experience magic. You and I likely share a Path,&quot;</span> he says to Ragnar. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;We'll have to talk more about it later, I'm sorry.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The train slows to a halt, and Mathias quickly moves through the door. He stops on the platform and surreptitiously pulls out a small, silver coin and flips it in his hand. As he does, you both feel a pulse of energy on your Periphery, and then Mathias points to a staircase leading down from the train platform and to the street below. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;This way,&quot;</span> he instructs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-27-2016, 01:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T07:01:43-07:00","id":975031,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> LLLL<b>B</b>BB (Unconscious) | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 3/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> The &quot;crooked man&quot; eats some straw. Then it smiles again, but not quite like before. Before, it smiled like it was about to kill some prey, and that part of the smile's still there, but now there's something new to it. It's as if...it likes its prey to fight back. Okay, now I'm officially creeped out. But before the feeling really starts to sink in, it fires these &quot;talons&quot; straight into me. The armor manages to keep them away from vital organs, but many rip right through skin and muscle, a few even go through the center mass.<br /> <br /> At first, there's no pain, I'm just stunned. Took a few shots before, but nothing like this. Bullets tend to pierce straight through neatly. These talons ripped their way through, snagging and tearing as they went. I instinctively take a hand to swab some blood, gazing at the crimson palm. And that's the pain rolling in now. My legs don't wanna work anymore, so they let me collapse on the floor, leaving me clutching at the wounds. The agony of it all overloads everything, and it all goes black.<br /> <br /> Dammit...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439005\" target=\"_blank\">Stamina 2 = 2 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <br /> Oh, he's out cold. First monster encounter in the chronicle, and the Hunter gets owned. Marvelous.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T15:27:01-07:00","id":975251,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Fate, Time<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar follows after Mathias. He notes the silver coin in Mathias' hand and gives a tight smile at what he assumes is Mathias casting the same spell that he used to seek direction in the other place. He opens his vision to Fate and Time as he goes, scanning the area, searching for any signs of the danger that Mathias mentioned.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar uses Active Mage Sight, invoking Fate and Time. He will keep it active for the time being.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> His hand briefly strays to his pocket, where he still keeps the small black stone knife. A cursed object? Perhaps, but there's no need to bother Mathias about it now. Maybe he'll conduct his own investigations at a later point. He certainly won't risk using it in a crisis situation. If it comes to spell casting, he has his silver knife. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T21:38:57-07:00","id":975824,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox), Shaken<br /> Health: XX/OOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 2/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> No, no, he was supposed to <i>run,</i> not stand and fight! The pool of shadow ripples with indignation. Who does Phoenix think he is? <i>Hakim? </i>Unlikely. Highly, highly unlikely. Although: the timing is rather suspicious. He <i>just</i> passed on, and now here Phoenix was, the unworked but unmistakable embodiment of an Arrow, standing by Moonstone's side when he <i>obviously</i> should have turned and run- <i>idiot,</i> fool of a Sleeper, in over his head- and now he was <i>dead dead dead,</i> or about to be dead and dead and dead indeed, oh god, his thoughts were spiraling away from him again<i>.</i><br /> <br /> All he needed was Time. Time to stop and breathe and think, that's all he's needed since Hakim died, and he hadn't gotten it except for a few precious minutes with Phoenix and Binder- where <i>was</i> Binder?<br /> <br /> Okay. So he can't step outside of Time. But he can make it work for him. He knows the ways.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending 1 Mana to activate Time Armor. Moonstone is still intangible and can only be targeted by Supernal magic (per Shadow Flesh), but when he's out of the shadow he'll have Defense 9 that applies against firearms-like attacks.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As badly as he wants to flow up the spiraling staircase and see where it leads, leave this horrible dream behind and ascend the Star Ladder up and out of this sacred Atlantean space...wrapped in Time, he spends a precious second-minute-hour looking longingly up the ladder...er, the staircase. Just a staircase. Just a ruin. Past is over. Present is now.<br /> <br /> The shadow flows across the floor of the star chamber as quickly as the magic will let it, stretching itself out, creeping beneath the light-eating nightmare beast's own aura of unnatural darkness until the very tip touches Phoenix's bloody and crumpled body. Moonstone thinks: <i>Disappear.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Mind 2 &quot;Incognito Presence&quot; on Phoenix. My goal is to keep the entity from finishing him off, making it lose interest in his body. &quot;This one isn't worth the effort.&quot; I got a little Plan for the next 2 turns or so, let's see if it has time to pan out before we both get eaten.<br /> <br /> 1 Reach for instant casting, and that's all. It's at touch range. No Paradox roll for once! Gnosis 1 Mind 2, +2 for Concentration. 5 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439414\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. Phoenix is veiled for the next 2 turns, or until I take damage or a non-reflexive action.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 09-25-2016, 04:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T08:46:11-07:00","id":975959,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Tainted? Cursed? Guess I'll have to check... whatever it is later.</span></i><br /> <br /> Lynx's nose twitches as he senses the man - <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">No, Mathias!</span></i> - cast his spell. He notes the coin, but keeps his curiosity at bay as he hurries alongside his newfound companion. Instinctively, he keeps fingering his silver necklace, on the ready for... something.<br /> <br /> Anything.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Mathias, what's the nature of the danger we're about to engage?</span>&quot; Lynx asks as he jogs up next to Mathias. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I mean, I assume it's more dangerous than the risk of drowning?</span>&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T23:29:17-07:00","id":977008,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You open your Sight to the colorful, nearly hallucinogenic senses of Arcadia. Bright colors of Fate swirl around you and your traveling companions. You notice that the eddies of Fate swirl more tightly around Mathias, seeming to move with purpose as he walks down the stairwell; you understand it to mean that he has one or more Fate spells active. Your Time Sight is less enlightening for now, as the river of Time appears unaltered around you or this area. You do, however, feel a vague sense of urgency that you didn't notice before, as if something momentous is about to happen. <br /> <br /> When you see Mathias flip his coin again, with your Sight open, you catch a glimpse of Fate magic and a dazzling display of color like a halo around Mathias, the aura that you perceive as his nimbus. It's dizzying and disorienting, but enchanting all at once.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> Mathias surprises you by actually laughing out loud, although his tone is dark. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Son, you'll quickly learn that for mages, a lot of things are more dangerous than the risk of drowning,&quot;</span> he replies. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I believe we will make it in time to see the others come out of the Highstorm portal, but I think some foul creature from the Abyss is going to hijack their way out.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The older man quickly goes down the stairs and peers around at the intersection. He flips his coin again, and you feel another pulse on your Periphery. Mathias looks in each direction but steps to the left at the intersection, revealing a side street that has a few handfuls of people walking at a brisk pace away from you. One person in particular is standing and staring at a blank place on the brick wall. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For purposes of spellcasting and Paradox, there are 6 Sleepers on the street currently in your immediate area, although they are moving away from you.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> As you stare at the portal, your attention is pulled away to your left where you see someone cast a spell. You see a burst of dizzying light around an older man leading two younger men, and feel a thrill of euphoria in your gut.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Your spell takes hold around Phoenix, and the Abyssal entity slowly turns its head to study you exclusively. For the moment, it seems to have turned its attention away from your companion.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, that means its focus is now entirely on you. <br /> <br /> The creature raises its sinewy arms again, and the talons claw at the air. Suddenly, the shadows around the room swirl, forming shapes of incomprehensible horrors, swirling clouds of what look like teeth and knives. Whether the shadows are real or some trick of your mind, you can't tell. The creature looks at you with a sinister smile, and somehow you can tell it is looking you straight in the eyes despite your current form. You feel a pulse of dark energy and a surge of paralyzing fear trying to well up inside of you, as if your emotions are not your own. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm ruling that your current form does not grant immunity to supernatural effects that don't cause damage, as Numina are analogous to Supernal magic. I need you to roll a contested Presence + Composure + Gnosis. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439889\" target=\"_blank\">Awe (14)</a> = <b>5</b> successes.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Initiative</b><br /> Abyssal entity: Awe<br /> --&gt; Moonstone: Roll first before taking your turn<br /> Phoenix: Currently unable to act (unconscious)<br /> <br /> If I'm remembering correctly, Phoenix doesn't get any more rolls to wake up, and needs healing (natural or supernatural) to get back in action. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-27-2016, 02:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T00:07:34-07:00","id":977026,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: Incognito Presence (on Phoenix, 2 turns left/Concentration duration, Potency 1)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox), Shaken<br /> Health: XX/OOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 1/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Presence+Composure+Gnosis, 6 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439894\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. This seems like as good a time as any to resolve Shaken for a Beat and make that a straight failure.<br /> <br /> Preemptive question about Awe: it says &quot;unable to move or speak.&quot; Does that mean I just lose my turn(s), or can I take actions that don't require moving or speaking? Like for instance, it's specifically possible to cast spells while grappled and immobilized.<br /> <br /> Also question about this thing's Withstand. Every spell in the book that specifically targets ephemeral entities is Withstood by Rank, rather than Resistance or another stat. If I wanted to cast a spell on this thing that was normally Withstood by a human stat like Resolve, should I use Rank instead?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 09-27-2016, 03:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T01:19:31-07:00","id":977062,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Heightened Senses (Life 2; Potency 1, 1 week duration: +1 to Perception rolls); Body Control (Life 2; Potency 2, 1 week duration);<br /> Willpower: 2/5. Mana: 7/10</b><br /> <b>Conditions/Tilts: Inspired</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">You're making it hard not to ask questions,</span>&quot; Lynx replies with a light smile, bristling as his Periphery triggers. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I guess I'm a little impatient, only everything's bloody exciting today!</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> As they scurry down the stairs and into the side street, the one gazing at the wall leaves Lynx frowning momentarily. He stops for a few seconds, despite their haste, and looks over the person from both the mundane and supernal perspective, allowing the Primal Wild to, once more, embrace his senses.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Action: Lynx attempts an Empathy roll to see what's up with the person gazing at the wall, and garners 3 successes!</b><br /> <br /> Empathy Roll to discern person staring at wall: Wits 3 + Empathy 3, for dice pool 6.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/439907\" target=\"_blank\">Empathy roll \u2192 3 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <b>Action: After the Empathy roll, he activates Life and Spirit Senses and checks the person out supernally.</b></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 10-01-2016, 06:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T10:44:15-07:00","id":977252,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Health: /OOOOOOO I WP: 1/4 I Mana: 8/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 1/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> </div> <br /> With whatever is going to happen looming in the near future, Ragnar is gripped with a sudden feeling of apprehension. Moving alongside Mathias, he whispers to him. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;Mathias. Before anything goes down, I should tell you. I've never used magic in combat before; I don't even know if I can. I do know one spell really well that enhances luck. Nothing flashy, but it could help. Lynx and I will follow your lead if things get ugly.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T21:21:10-07:00","id":978181,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> Terror grips you and refuses to let go. Even in your shadow form with better relative safety thanks to the cloak, you feel paralyzed with fear as you stare into the eyes of the dark monster in front of you. The Abyssal entity reaches out with a claw and gently caresses you, sending a chill through you, as if considering how it might prefer to consume you whole.<br /> <br /> The creature touches both arms to you, and you feel a pulse of energy pass into you, as if it is somehow forcing itself upon or into you. Your vision doubles as if you are being split in two. The creature smiles darkly.<br /> <br /> The vibration in the room reaches a crescendo, and suddenly the hallway is lit with sunlight, and you see a doorway rip open in the air before you, the monster, and Phoenix. Through it, you see the alleyway where Binder is standing, as well as a group of three people hurrying towards him. The Abyssal creature pulls away from you, then smiles maliciously again.<br /> <br /> You shudder as the world stretches and rips apart...<br /> <br /> ...and then you're in the streets of Chicago, still wearing the cloak, still in a pool of shadow moving along the floor.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm ruling that Awe applies the Insensate tilt. Because it was an exceptional success, it lasts for 3 turns, which the creature spends studying you and preparing to go through the portal. Don't forget that you still have Abyssal Backlash (+6) on your next Paradox roll.<br /> <br /> Like the others, before you take any other action, please roll the following: 1d10, then 3d10 with the 8-again property.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> The sudden, intense shaking forces you into consciousness. You're barely awake, but the adrenaline keeps you focused enough to act. You open your eyes to a sight of the world splitting in two...<br /> <br /> ...and you collapse on the street next to Binder with a grunt.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm ruling that you wake up, but still have all health boxes filled as before, so you can act at the moment but taking more damage will risk falling unconscious again until you heal some damage. You also have the -3 penalty from wound penalties. Before posting any actions, roll 1d10, followed by a chance die.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You can tell that the man is disgruntled, although the source of his frustration is not immediately clear. His focus on the wall is a little odd, as there is nothing your naked eyes can perceive there other than bricks.<br /> <br /> When you open your Sight, you instantly pick up the scent of blood and sweat from this man; you can tell that he has been seriously injured, and recently. On the wall, you see a dark spot of spiritual energy as black as midnight; it reminds you of the hail you saw falling earlier.<br /> <br /> You see a dizzying light glow brightly around Mathias, and feel a lingering sense of euphoria, as he casts a Fate spell. You also see another man appear out of thin air, collapsing beside the man by the wall. He appears very seriously bruised, and has a number of terrible lacerations on his arms and torso.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> Mathias smiles, but you can still see worry lines creasing his forehead. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;That can't be helped, but don't underestimate what a mage can do with proper preparation, creativity, and...a little bit of luck,&quot;</span> he replies.<br /> <br /> The older man pulls out a small crystalline rod, perhaps the size of a large pencil, from his pocket. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;We need to get these people out of the area and keep them away, or they might panic.&quot;</span> Mathias closes his eyes and murmurs a few words in a language unlike any you've ever heard before in your life -- and yet you somehow recognize it, like a long lost memory resurfaced.<br /> <br /> You feel another pulse on your Periphery. You don't immediately see or feel anything odd...until you notice that every Sleeper on the street has just pulled out their phones with an incoming call. A younger man walks by you, and you hear him talking to a friend urgently asking him to meet up because he's having a really rough day. &quot;Absolutely, dude, I've always told you to call if you wanted to talk about anything,&quot; the young man says as he walks briskly away towards the train station. &quot;I just can't believe you're actually taking me up on it. I thought you'd never get around to bringing this stuff up...&quot;<br /> <br /> It's then that you realize all of the Sleepers are quickly leaving the street in various directions. And just in time, too: Looking back towards the adjacent wall reveals a tall, roughly humanoid creature with long, sinewy arms ending in sharp talons. It peers at you and your allies, then smiles, revealing long teeth the size of small daggers. As it stands there, the street seems to darken. You think your eyes may be tricking you, but the shadows around the floor and wall seem to be moving on their own, swirling with activity.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Initiative:</b><br /> Abyssal creature (20)<br /> Mathias (<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/440681\" target=\"_blank\">Initiative</a>: 16)<br /> Ragnar (15)<br /> Phoenix (13)<br /> Moonstone (12)<br /> Binder (12)<br /> Lynx (10) </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-30-2016, 08:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T21:36:48-07:00","id":978191,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight: None | Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Abyssal Backlash (+6 Paradox)<br /> Health: XX/OOO | Willpower: 1/8 | Mana: 1/10 | Beats: 0/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.di