03:17-08:00","id":1047680,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active =&gt; Focused | <b>Active Spells: </b>None<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 5/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats: </b>7 | <b>Arc. Beats:</b> 1</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b><i>&quot;Good God...&quot;</i></b></span>- Ouroboros can feel his own heart skipping a beat at the realization of those two other not beating at all. He swallows and cofs a little before raising his cup towards Desiree- <span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;This tea is delicious, dear. Could you humour this old man and serve me another cup, if is not much inconvenience?&quot;</b></span>- he keeps his chill and flashes a gentle smile that he used to use with his patients. He cannot bear himself to look back at Dante right now, his inquisitive nature demanding that he solves this conundrum on his own. He breaths deeply once and pushes his enlightened 