once more garners no successes.</b><br /> <br /> <b>Potency:</b> 3<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Wolf spirit.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Instant.<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Path Tool (+1 dice).<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Spirit 1 &quot;Know Spirit&quot;: Spirit (2) + Gnosis (1) + Path Tool (1) - Potency (2)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 2 Free Reaches: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 on Spell maintenance.<br /> <br /> <b>There is no risk of Paradox.</b><br /> <b>Total Dice Pool:</b> 2 dice.</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/485801\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Spirit 1 &quot;Know Spirit&quot; \u2192 0 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T14:30:14-08:00","id":1050069,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">RAGNAR</span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Fate, Time<br /> Active Spells: Exceptional Luck (on the mage)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired<br /> Health: BBBBOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 1/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> Ragnar watches in horror as Moonstone falls when the balcony disappears beneath him, but he immediately feels relief as Moonstone turns into a shadow and begins to slide safely down the wall. He looks back at the wizard and grits his teeth. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>Okay, I need to stop this guy from casting spells. His sight doesn't affect his ability to cast. But what about if I reduce reduce his ability to cast spells altogether? That might actually do something. </i></span><br /> <br /> Ragnar raises his knife and gathers the threads of Fate to him again. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Snare his rod, mangle his Imagos, anything! Just do it! </i></span>But the threads of Fate resist <i>hard. </i>He's pushing this spell further than any spell he has ever cast. Already, he can feel the Abyss rising to oppose him. He pours a little bit of his depleted Mana and his will into the casting, begging the Imago to hold. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Work... </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to cast his Exceptional Luck Praxis again against the enemy mage. This time, he will be attempting to inflict a -2 penalty to all of the mage's spellcasting rolls. One free Reach spent for Instant Casting. Two more to make the hex affect spellcasting rolls, and a third for Advanced Duration. Three excess Reaches, Ragnar will spend one Mana to reduce it to two. <br /> <br /> 2 Reach = 2 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/486888\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The taint of Paradox begins to creep into the Imago, and Ragnar wills it into himself. He braces himself for the familiar feeling of Paradox giving him a mystic gut punch. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to contain the Paradox 7 Wisdom = 7 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/486889\" target=\"_blank\">barely</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> His free hand goes to his chest as the pain blossoms, but he powers through it. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Paradox gone. Let's get this Imago situated. </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting roll. 1 Gnosis + 2 Fate + 1 Path Tool - 1 Excess spell + 3 Willpower = 6 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/486893\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He smiles tightly as the Imago falls into place. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>And here's the pitch... </i></span>He stabs his silver knife with venom, square at the blind mage with. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to aim the spell at the mage. 1 Gnosis + 2 Athletics + 3 Willpower = 6 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/486897\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>. Since the guy has Defense 0 right now, that's definitely hitting.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Imago coalesces into transparent, luminous red threads, and flies towards the mage. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Chew on that, asshole!&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar has spent a point of Mana, two points of Willpower, taken a Bashing wound, and inflicted a second Exceptional Luck hex on the enemy mage, which takes the form of -2 to all casting rolls for the remainder of the scene.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-20T13:23:58-08:00","id":1052146,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> The wolf spirit's force of will overpowers yours, and suddenly it stares right at you, growling with renewed vigor. You frantically cast your spell to learn its weaknesses, but in your hurry, your spell falters. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;You and the spirit are both made of the same substance here. Spirit is not the only Arcanum useful against these creatures,&quot;</span> Raven suggests.<br /> <br /> The wolf spirit coils and lashes out at you, trying to rip its claws into your skin. You definitely notice it striking faster than before you attempted to hide. Thankfully, your newly thickened skin protects you from any harm. The wolf growls as its teeth and claws slip off your arm.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Shadow Walk no longer has an effect against the spirit, due to the spirit's Numen.<br /> <br /> Turns out Life Armor is amazing: at Life 3, it gives 2 armor, +2 defense, and you can use higher of Wits or Dex for defense. So that puts you at Defense 7.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/488126\" target=\"_blank\">Attack (12) - Defense (7)</a>: <b>1</b> success, ignored due to armor.<br /> <br /> The wolf spirit currently has Defense 5.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm going to offer you a chance to adjust your rolls/post because you didn't have Opacity information at the time you made your rolls.<br /> <br /> For understanding the nature of vampirism, I'm going to set Opacity 6, but with each level you strip away, I will allow you to gain more information about Kindred's abilities. However, I'm going to say that you can't drop Opacity by more than 1 level for each vampire you study. So you could potentially drop it down to 4 if you keep going here in this scene.<br /> <br /> At Opacity 6, your Revelation roll would be a chance die. If you would not attempt that, you can take your WP back.<br /> <br /> On your Scrutiny rolls, I believe you only threaten to increase Opacity if your failed roll exceeds the number of die in your base pool (3 here), so on your fourth roll, you would gain 6 success and drop Opacity to 5. That resets the number of successes needed for the next level. If you would choose to break it off there and stop, you can cancel your fifth Scrutiny roll and take back 1 mana.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Dante's voice and his conversation with Mrs. Vial fades to a whisper as you intensely focus your Sight on Mrs. Vial and Desiree. The liquid in their veins is pooled, and although their hearts are not moving, you wonder if this liquid is somehow powerful and vital to their survival. After a long minute, you nod to yourself decisively; you can clearly detect an aura of life mixed in their veins. Somehow, it is stolen life energy, likely the source of their undeath. Beyond that, the true nature of these beings eludes you.<br /> <br /> Just trying to study them this way makes your own heart race faster. Your mundane vision focuses just enough to notice Mrs. Vial staring closely at your neck, and she licks her lips.<br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You don't take -1 penalty on rolls for extra spell control, it's just for purposes of reach. You're thinking of Mage 1E rules. Rolling an extra die for your spellcasting roll. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/488135\" target=\"_blank\">Extra spellcasting die</a>: <b>1</b> success, which brings you up to 3 successes. Because this is your praxis, you gain an exceptional success. Regain one WP, and pick another benefit from the table on p. 115 for an exceptional success (e.g., mana refund, increased Potency, beneficial Condition).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Your spell flares into being and flies through the air. The blinded mage starts to turn with a frown, as he senses your spell being cast, but nothing prepares him for dodging it. The red ribbon-like form of your Imago crashes into his chest and he gasps in surprise, clutching at his chest where your spell struck him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Initiative</b><br /> Ragnar (10): Exceptional Luck<br /> --&gt; Phoenix (9)<br /> Moonstone (8)<br /> Mysterious mage (7)<br /> <br /> Phoenix is up.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T06:41:11-08:00","id":1053787,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Lure &amp; Repel (if successful) (Potency: 5; Duration: Scene)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 5 - Arcane Beats: 4</b></div> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">It doesn't hurt, but I can't rely on this... this armour of mine... So how do I get it off my... back... </span></i><br /> <br /> Lynx lets his feathery cloak disperse as stares at the wolf. He touches his necklace as he starts to chant in High Speech. Steeling himself for the wolf's inevitable attack, he forms the Imago in his mind...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx cancels his Shadow Walk as it currently has no purpose. spends this turn preparing the High Speech Yantra. The next turn, unless interrupted, he will cast an improvised Spirit 2 &quot;Spiritual Lure and Repel&quot; to Repel spirits (or at least the wolf spirit). He garners 3 successes.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Potency:</b> 5<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Wolf spirit.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Scene.<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Path Tool (+1 dice), High Speech (+2 dice)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Spirit 2 &quot;Spiritual Lure and Repel&quot;: Spirit (2) + Gnosis (1) + Path Tool (1) + Willpower (3) + High Speech (2) - Potency (4)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 1 Free Reach: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 Advanced Duration, 1 on Changing Primary Spell Factor.<br /> <br /> <b>Base Paradox dice:</b> 2: 2 from Reach, 1 from Second Paradox roll.<br /> <b>Paradox modifiers:</b> -2 from the Shadow.<br /> <b>Final Paradox dice: </b>1.<br /> If Paradox is obtained, Lynx will release it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/490297\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Paradox \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <b>Total Dice Pool:</b> 5 dice.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/490298\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Spirit 2 &quot;Lure and Repel&quot; \u2192 3 successes.</a></span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 02-26-2017, 08:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T13:47:21-08:00","id":1053988,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 1/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Supernal Blindness | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> Okay, looks like Moonstone's fine, at least for now, so I can focus all my attention on this guy. Let's see how you deal with Supernal steel to the face. Can't hit him too hard, though, I need him for info.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Phoenix will attack with his staff, but he's Pulling the Blow so it'll only do 1 lethal. His Intent is to subdue and contain the mage so he can get some information from the guy. Now I'm not sure if that means the Death mage is considered to have Defense 1 (because of Pulling Blow) or not since you said his Defense doesn't apply. I'll just roll the full dice pool and let you decide whether or not to take a die away from it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/489253\" target=\"_blank\">Strength 3 + Weaponry 3 = 6 dice \u2192 3 successes</a><br /> <br /> Looks like doesn't matter either way.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T11:29:18-08:00","id":1054383,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 3/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>LB</b>OOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Sleep of the Just<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div> <br /> Not feeling nearly as reassured as he should, Binder quickly checks that nothing seems out of place, then heads up through the secret door to prepare for his guests.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T09:27:58-08:00","id":1056154,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> As you begin chanting, the wolf spirit snarls and lunges for you again. It bites even harder this time, but still can't break your hardened skin with its teeth.<br /> <br /> It prepares to lunge again, but just as it starts to flex its back legs to leap at you once more, your Imago springs into place. You imagine an aura of spiritual revulsion around you, creating a dread sense of foreboding. The wolf spirit falters, whines, and backs up slowly.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;Excellent, Lynx!&quot;</span> Raven smiles and walks up to you. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;Until you become a Disciple of Spirit, your ability to directly harm spirits will be limited. Against stronger spirits, it may be rest to weaken or trick them, and buy yourself time to escape. It was wise to protect yourself against this one.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Raven turns to the wolf spirit and inclines her head to it with respect. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;But sometimes, you must be decisive, and strike. You could have enhanced your own muscles and grown your strength, and then struck with your bare hands. You must be willing to attack spirits.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Your mentor begins to chant in High Speech, intoning in a deep alto voice. She raises her hands towards the wolf spirit and her voice grows to a crescendo. A torrent of ephemeral energy suddenly appears from her hands and strikes out at the wolf spirit. The wolf spirit barely has time to respond; in an instant, the ephemera washes over the spirit, which explodes outward in a burst of light and smoke. You hear a faint howl, and when Raven's spell ends, the wolf spirit is simply gone.<br /> <br /> Raven shifts to face you with a hard expression. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;I destroyed this spirit. But it is not dead. As long as a spirit has even a shred of Essence remaining when you land the killing blow, it will gradually recover Essence and return when it is restored- days, weeks, perhaps even months later. The same is true of Abyssal spirits, or Gulmoth. To destroy it, you must first sap it of all its Essence. You must remember this. Do you understand?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The wolf spirit uses one turn to attack. <a href=\"http://www.orokos.com/roll/490963\" target=\"_blank\">Attack (12) + WP (3) - Defense (7)</a>: <b>2 successes</b>, ignored due to Life Armor.<br /> <br /> If you're copying the Lure and Repel spell exactly, it forces relevant creatures from entering or remaining within an area equal to the Scale of the spell. With your dice pool and successes you could afford to increase the scale slightly to the size of a small room, and the wolf spirit has a very hard time damaging you anyway. So, it's pretty much a moot point.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You carefully strike your staff at the mage, hoping to harm him but not kill him. But when your staff hits his shirt, it rebounds forcefully, far harder than you could have expected; your hands sting and the staff shakes in your hand as if you just tried to smack a steel wall. The mage isn't even fazed.<br /> <br /> The man sneers and turns around, but his eyes are still blind and unfocused. His fingers twitch on the lead rod in his hand, as if he's contemplating his next move, but he's clearly hesitating. He doesn't seem like he wants to take on three mages singlehandedly.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">He does not gain any Defense because his current tilt causes him to lose all Defense. However, his current general armor rating ignores your damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Initiative:</b><br /> Ragnar (10): Exceptional Luck<br /> Phoenix (9): Attack<br /> --&gt; Moonstone (8)<br /> Mysterious mage (7)<br /> <br /> Moonstone is up.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You don't <i>think</i> that anything was taken or moved, but there are a lot of things in the store. You search around, looking to check whether anything seems off.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Roll Wits + Composure (instant action) to briefly look around the room, or Wits + Investigation (extended action, 1 minute/roll, target = 5 successes).</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T11:23:04-08:00","id":1057670,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none [Cloak: Wards and Signs Potency 4, Shadow Flesh 4 turns left]<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength until evening]<br /> Health: </b><b>B</b><b>BB</b>OOO | <b>Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 0/10 | Beats: 0/5 | Arcane Beats: 3/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> Something tells him that this jerk is going to be looking for a way out of here in the next few seconds. But not before Moonstone gets a taste of his Mind Pattern. The inky shadow circles around the unknown mage, probing and measuring like a blind man feeling an elephant.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's try this one more time. Mind 1 Know Nature, 2 free Reaches on instant casting and sensory range, +1 Reach to learn his Aspirations and Obsessions.<br /> <br /> Paradox: 1 from reach, +3 from earlier rolls this scene. 4 dice, Releasing so I don't die: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/492000\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1, Mind 2, Paradox -2, Willpower 3. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/492003\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a> yaay. I learn his Virtue, Vice, total number of dots in Mental and Social Attributes, Aspirations, and Obsessions. And you get 2 Paradox Reach!</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-04T04:56:40-08:00","id":1057999,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Lure &amp; Repel (if successful) (Potency: 5; Duration: Scene)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 5 - Arcane Beats: 4</b></div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#4B0082\">Excellent, Lynx!</span> <span style=\"color:#4B0082\">Until you become a Disciple of Spirit, your ability to directly harm spirits will be limited. Against stronger spirits, it may be rest to weaken or trick them, and buy yourself time to escape. It was wise to protect yourself against this one.</span> <span style=\"color:#4B0082\">But sometimes, you must be decisive, and strike. You could have enhanced your own muscles and grown your strength, and then struck with your bare hands. You must be willing to attack spirits.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I can't fight,</span>&quot; Lynx protests. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm not very agile. I'm clumsy, actually.</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> He then watches in amazement - and horror - as Raven starts her song, the wolf's howl ringing in his ears as it explodes. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#4B0082\">I destroyed this spirit. But it is not dead. As long as a spirit has even a shred of Essence remaining when you land the killing blow, it will gradually recover Essence and return when it is restored- days, weeks, perhaps even months later. The same is true of Abyssal spirits, or Gulmoth. To destroy it, you must first sap it of all its Essence. You must remember this. Do you understand?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I...</span>&quot; Lynx stutters, trying to take process it. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">That's brutal...</span></i> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I think so.</span>&quot; He lowers his gaze slightly, touching his necklace. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">How do I sap its Essence? Do I need to be a... a Disciple of Spirit to do that?</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> He frowns. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">What are Gulmoth at its core? What is it that makes them... ... evil? You say they're Abyssal spirits, but are they formed by the Abyss, or do they corrupt and possess a spirit? Are they irredeemable? Is the only solution to destroy them?</span>&quot; He offers a grim smile. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Please don't misunderstand... I just want to make sure I don't do something stupid if... when I meet a Gulmoth</span>.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T15:16:30-08:00","id":1059777,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active =&gt; Focused | <b>Active Spells: </b>None<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 5/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats: </b>7 | <b>Arc. Beats:</b> 1</div> <br /> Ouroboros instictively raises his hand to his neck and caress it uneasy. He coughs to catch Dante's attention and asks -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;I mean no disrespect, but are we going to spend much more time here? There were some things I wanted to consult with you and I hoped we could do it today&quot;</b></span> -he tries his best not to sound scared or rude, but to communicate in a clear way he is reaching his limit and that he really wants to leave the presence of those... women.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T09:08:33-08:00","id":1060124,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 3/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>LB</b>OOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Sleep of the Just<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits 2 + Composure 4 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/493699\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T20:43:43-07:00","id":1063103,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You eagerly send your will out, imagining tendrils of shadowy Mind fingers to pluck the information you desire from the hostile mage whose name you still don't know. The spell forms and you feel the familiar hum of energy as you cast it.<br /> <br /> But out of your haste to craft your spell, you unknowingly (or perhaps unconcernedly) invite a touch of the Abyss into your magic. You watch with surprise, and perhaps consternation, as the Mind spell you brought into being shifts at the last moment and unintentionally settles onto...<i>Phoenix.</i><br /> <br /> Your new cabalmate's mind briefly flashes before your mind's eye like an open book. He's mentally sharp, perhaps more than you've given him credit for, and about as aloof and blunt as you might have guessed. His goals and passions seem to overlap with yours, or perhaps run tangential to them; he wants to destroy Alux and join an Order, but he is driven by a desire to hunt down a mysterious &quot;Anubis&quot; who has harmed him deeply. The name doesn't ring a bell for you. Phoenix is also trying to escape the attention of some group who would harm him if they could...Hunters, perhaps?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Spending 2 paradox reach to change the subject of the spell. Rolled to see who it would hit.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone, Ragnar, and Phoenix</b><br /> The mage's face contorts with anger as he realizes he is quite outnumbered, if not necessarily overpowered. He backs up from all of you, then sneers as he points the lead rod in his hands.<br /> <br /> Those of you watching with your mundane eyes feel a tingling on your Periphery and see him fade, then just...vanish. To Ragnar, with your Sight you clearly see him create a doorway of Death magic that gives you a creeping sensation as if your skin is trying to crawl away from your body. It envelopes him and you can no longer sense him.<br /> <br /> The alley suddenly grows silent.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> Raven waves a hand dismissively. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;What are reflexes, but nerve responses and muscle movements? What is clumsiness, but a matter of balance and posture? You are a Disciple of Life, Lynx. Anything living is your domain, your craft.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> At your question about Essence, she smiles wolfishly. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;Now you're thinking. No, even an Apprentice of Spirit magic can cast a spell to siphon Essence directly from a creature. However, they will resist, so it works best with either a strong spell or a weak spirit.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Raven's smile quickly fades to a dark frown as you discuss Gulmoth, and she looks around as if scanning the area for danger. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;They are not spirits at all, but rather entities from another realm, a place of pure chaos and vileness, that simply resemble spirits enough that they more or less respond to the Arcanum as much as a real spirit. You <i>cannot</i> try to reason with them or use them for your own purpose. Even merely attempting to bind them to your will, or trying to use their power, is a treasonous act in the Consilium punishable by death.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Raven grows quiet for a minute, then summons a new portal revealing the park in its mundane form, within the Fallen World. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;Best not to stay too long here,&quot;</span> she suggests in a contemplative murmur. <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;This place can be dangerous, especially to a young Mage.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Take an arcane beat for being exposed to new first-hand knowledge about the world of spirits.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> Dante nods at you and turns back to your hostess with a generous smile. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;My companion here is quite right, Mrs. Vial. We do have some other matters to attend to tonight. I appreciate all of the information that you have shared, and hope that my usual token of appreciation will appease you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dante gives over the briefcase without opening it. Mrs. Vial looks eagerly at the briefcase and licks her lips again, but she smiles wanly and nods. She waves for Desiree to escort you out, who politely says goodbye as you leave the Vial house. <br /> <br /> You have the feeling that something important happened during their exchange, but it feels over your head. Dante smiles at you as you walk away from the old home. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Tell me what you sensed, what you Saw, in there,&quot;</span> he asks. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;I didn't just bring you here to chat with a respectful older woman over a cup of tea.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> Glancing around the store confirms your general suspicions: Nothing of significant monetary value is missing. Nothing appears missing or stolen that you can tell. <br /> <br /> However, there are some books and items that have been moved, mostly just to a nearby location but on the floor. It's like someone was skimming through the shelves, and just knocked objects to the ground. Almost like...the cat you saw? That's odd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 03-15-2017, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T12:27:59-07:00","id":1063373,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: Exceptional Luck (on the mage)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: BBBBOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 1/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Phoenix is flanking Ragnar, and the moving shadow that is Moonstone circles the enemy mage like a shark. He gives the mage a smug look and levels his silver knife at him. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I tried to warn you. We're not going to kill you, but we <i>are</i> turning you in.&quot; </span>One hand stows the obsidian dagger in his pocket and then reaches for his phone. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>The odds of guessing Valentine's number are pretty ridiculous. Good thing I'm an enchanter, right? </i></span><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;Know a guy named Valentine, by any chance? I'm sure he would just <i>love </i>to hear that you tried to murder his cabalmate's new apprentice.&quot; </span>But even as he prepares to form the imago, the stranger gives a nasty smirk and points his lead rod. Death magic pulses around him, and a portal to... <i>somewhere </i>opens and he steps through it.<br /> <br /> Ragnar blinks in surprise. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;What the- &quot; </span>He runs to the stop where the attacker stood and spins around. He looks over at Phoenix. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Where'd he go?!&quot; </span>He looks down at the shadow. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Moonstone. That guy was a Moros: he liquified and solidified the concrete I was standing on. That spell he cast was Death Arcanum. I thought portals and stuff were your department. Where is he?&quot; </span>Much as he's reluctant to admit it, Moonstone knows more about magic than he does.<br /> <br /> Once he reaches a minute with Mage Sight, he dismisses it, allowing his vision to return to the mundane realities of the Lie. He looks over at Phoenix. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Thanks for showing up. I think Moonstone and I could have handled him, but I'm running low on Mana.&quot; </span>He looks back to Moonstone. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;What happened? I know you tried to cast on me, but it felt like it got away from you. I got whacked with... well, I guess whatever it is that you deal with sometimes.&quot; </span>He averts his gaze for a moment. Maybe he shouldn't have been so quick to judge Moonstone's reaction to Matthias. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;How... uh, how did you get here? And why did you end up on that balcony?&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He looks down at the spot where the stranger stood in distaste. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;That guy was the trouble you warned me about, right? Phoenix, he wouldn't happen to be that Anubis guy you're looking for, would he?&quot; </span>He purses his lips and twitches them from side to side in thought. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Think giving Valentine a call would be a good idea? I don't know if this is worth bothering him.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 03-17-2017, 07:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T14:50:58-07:00","id":1063533,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active =&gt; Focused | <b>Active Spells: </b>None<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 5/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats: </b>7 | <b>Arc. Beats:</b> 1</div> <br /> Dante smiles at Ouroboros as both walk away from the old home. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Tell me what you sensed, what you Saw, in there,&quot;</span> he asks. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;I didn't just bring you here to chat with a respectful older woman over a cup of tea.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The old mage coughs and touches his neck again, looking over his shoulder- <span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Yeah, I figured as much...&quot;</b></span>-he pauses to put in order his toughts-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;They are dead... or at least not alive, I am not sure it is such a binary state as most people asume. Their bodies are dead matter, but filled with some kind of stolen <i>life energy</i>. Life energy! I cannot believe I am using such new age terms seriously but I find no other way to accurately descrive what I have seen. There is something undeniabably vital flowing and pooling inside of those animated corpses, like blood does on a regular human being. Is that it? Blood? We have just traded blood for information with some... <i>vampires</i>?&quot;</b></span>-he finds even difficult to bring himslef to pronounce that word aloud, years of rational and scientific experience screaming against the imposibility of it, and yet he had seen the facts with his own eyes.<br /> <br /> -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Anyway, I am sure you have your reasons and even I can see the potential utility of such an informant&quot;</b></span>-a tense silence follows for a minute-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Well, on other order of things, I found an interesting phenomena at a graveyard and I wanted to know if you have ever seen something like that before. Maybe is an anomaly, maybe is something common. I figured you would probably know. There is some kind of <i>gate</i>, I guess I could call it, trough wich I have seen ghost disappear. It remind me vividly of the moment when we helped the ghost in my clasroom to move on, so I wondered if perhaps that is a permanent portal to... wherever it is souls go after death&quot;</b></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T23:42:54-07:00","id":1066146,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight (Mind, Space) | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength until evening]<br /> Health: </b><b>B</b><b>BB</b>OOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 0/10 | Beats: 0/5 | Arcane Beats: 3/5</b></div> <br /> He opens his Mind and Space Sight as the enemy magician disappears. Too late, it turns out, but he looks for anything unusual just to be safe.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Moonstone. That guy was a Moros: he liquified and solidified the concrete I was standing on. That spell he cast was Death Arcanum. I thought portals and stuff were your department. Where is he?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The Warlock rises up out of the shadows like a swimmer out of the ocean, even gasping for air as he pulls the hood back and opens the clasp. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Well, he didn't turn into a Goetic- er, a <i>'dream monster,'</i> so that's a relief. I don't see a portal. Maybe he passed into the ghost world? If I had the Mana, I could trace him with Time, but I seem to have overexerted myself playing the tutor.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar continues thinking out loud while he tries to catch his breath. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;You got whacked with...? Oh- I never thought opening my Mind to others could make it contagious, I'm so sorry Ragnar- I was looking for you, but I couldn't catch your Sympathy, but I found this fascinating Mystery in Milennium Park, and managed to slip myself through a sort of natural portal when I focused on you- don't be overconfident, Phoenix may have saved our lives- god i haven't been so exhausted all week-&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He wearily waves at/thanks/salutes Phoenix, and puts his hand on his brow and groans. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Just call Valentine. I'm running on empty.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He resists the urge for a sorcerous group hug, but only just. Moonstone is a mom at heart, but he's learning to respect boundaries. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Thank Aion you're alright. Impeccable timing, Phoenix, very auspicious- you're a much sharper mind than I gave you credit for, and I would have never known if my spell hadn't backfired. What a fool I've been! I'm not wise enough to teach anyone magic, not by a mile. If I'd known Ragnar would be in danger- well, I did know, but I thought I would be able to help, but I'm not <i>nearly </i>as puissant with Space and Sympathy as I deluded myself into believing- oh, this 'lesson' was a disaster. I'm just glad everyone is safe.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Oh, right, the mystery mage. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Did either of you know who that magician was, or what he wanted? I've seen him bedeviling my master, Hakim, in the last few weeks- coming to his home, even. I kept trying to read his mind, but I can barely hold myself together right now, much less an Imago. This isn't how I imagined my Divination playing out.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone suddenly and strongly feels that he would be no good as an Arrow, not at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T06:45:29-07:00","id":1066276,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Lure &amp; Repel (if successful) (Potency: 5; Duration: Scene)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 5 - Arcane Beats: 5</b></div> <br /> Lynx nods gravely to Raven's words, offering a wry smile in response to her warning about Gulmoths. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I won't try to reason or control a Gulmoth,</span>&quot; he reassures her. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I promise.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He follows Raven into the physical world, stretching and taking in the familiar air. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Thanks for the lesson. What now?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T06:22:10-07:00","id":1066808,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: Exceptional Luck (on the mage x2)<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: BBBBOOOO I WP: 2/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 1/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Just call Valentine. I'm running on empty.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Alright.&quot; </span>Ragnar fishes his phone and starts scrolling for Valentine's number. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bSo if Moros can travel to the... Underworld?... Then what about me?</span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;If I'd known Ragnar would be in danger- well, I did know, but I thought I would be able to help, but I'm not </span><i>nearly </i><span style=\"color:#008080\">as puissant with Space and Sympathy as I deluded myself into believing- oh, this 'lesson' was a disaster.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Not necessarily,&quot;</span> muses Ragnar. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I managed to successfully cast a Space spell. First time I've ever done that. And I learned a couple of important things about fighting with magic: I can cast as long as my Mage Sight is intact, or if I can hear. And even if I can't injure somebody with magic yet, I can still make life difficult for them.&quot;</span> Life-and-death combat might not have been the ideal place to learn that, but hey. Learning on the fly. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Did either of you know who that magician was, or what he wanted? I've seen him bedeviling my master, Hakim, in the last few weeks- coming to his home, even.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar's finger hovers over his phone, poised to call Valentine. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">Well, well. Isn't that interesting? Oh-so-perfect Hakim hanging out with a Mage hooligan. Let's just file that one away for later... </span></i>Moonstone might think that this lowlife was &quot;bedeviling&quot; Hakim, but for weeks? Without getting kicked out or reduced to a smoldering pile of ashes? That sounded less like &quot;annoyance&quot; and more like &quot;accomplice.&quot; But why?<br /> <br /> All of this crosses Ragnar's mind in a split second, but he calls Valentine like nothing's wrong. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Valentine, it's Ragnar. We have a bit of a situation on our hands. I got attacked by a mage. I didn't recognize him from the Consilium. Moonstone and Phoenix helped me fend him off, but he disappeared through some sort of portal with a Death spell. He looks like one of the hipster types hanging around UChi. Seems like a Moros based on the spells he was casting. I tagged him with a couple Fate spells, they're still active on him. If that would be any help in tracking him. Can you find us on your own, or do you need an address?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <i>OOC: Ragnar will give Valentine their general location on the off chance that he can't find them with Sympathy. </i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T18:31:45-07:00","id":1070966,"title":"","content":"<b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> Dante nods along eagerly as you discuss your findings. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Well done, Ophis!&quot;</span> he replies with a warm smile. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;You are closer to the mark on several of those hypotheses than you know. I won't spoil the lesson by filling in all the gaps -- that would defeat the process of learning through effort.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dante further explains, <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;In laypeople's terms, yes, they are vampires. And they are incredibly powerful, dangerous, and knowledgeable. They call themselves Kindred, at least among more of their civilized and social kind. Because they are no longer living, but not technically dead, they can be studied and interacted with the Death arcanum in very unique ways.<br /> <br /> &quot;And I would like to challenge you to study more of them,&quot;</span> Dante says with a smile. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Learn from them. Consider how you can protect yourself from them. But study their culture and their behavior, too, when the opportunity arises,&quot;</span> he recommends. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Mrs. Vial is indeed a very knowledgeable informant. Powerful and dangerous, yes, but also knowledgeable.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dante nods at your question. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Yes! The gates to the Underworld. They form naturally around or in cemeteries, and in some other less common locales. Ghosts use them to pass Beyond. A Moros Mage is truly dangerous near the presence of ghosts, but especially near one of these portals, as you can summon a specter much more alert and powerful than the kinds you have seen. Be very careful not to enter one unless you know <i>exactly</i> what you are doing,&quot;</span> he cautions you. <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;The dead do not take likely to the presence of the living.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> For a time, Dante turns philosophical and lectures you on his theories about the Underworld and the nature of death versus undeath. You have some difficulty following all of his points, but you find that you are thirsty for more supernatural knowledge.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Through your conversation with Dante and efforts to study the Kindred, take an Arcane Beat and permanently add your bonus dot to the Occult skill that comes from joining an Order.<br /> <br /> Please feel free to freeform RP anything else you would like to do this weekend.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> <span style=\"color:indigo\">&quot;For now, young cub, you should rest. Return to your home, and sleep. But continue to practice what you've learned and hone your skills. And I strongly recommend that you begin putting some time and effort into practicing martial arts or some other tactics for defending yourself, both with and without magic. You never know when your life might be on the line. That's what keeps it so thrilling,&quot;</span> she grins excitedly.<br /> <br /> Raven bids you goodbye and slips quietly into the night. The rest of the weekend is yours to spend how you wish.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain access to High Speech. Please indicate in general how Lynx would use the rest of his time this weekend. If you don't have time to post, I will assume Lynx spends it sleeping, recovering, and maybe continuing to toy around with Life and Spirit spells.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar, Moonstone, and Phoenix</b><br /> Within moments of dialing Valentine's number, you feel a swirl of energy hum around you on your Periphery, and the Mage walks around the corner and stares at each of you in turn. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;Tell me everything,&quot;</span> he says with a quiet intensity. He seems concerned.<br /> <br /> As you briefly discuss the attack, Valentine surveys the scene. He frowns when you mention that the man was not seen at the Consilium meeting, and nods when you suggest he is a Moros Mage. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;A very good guess, considering everything you've seen today. He probably entered Twilight,&quot;</span> Valentiner explains. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;It's a state of being, rather than a location per se, usually experienced by ghosts and other ephemeral beings when they are in our world.&quot;</span>.<br /> <br /> Valentine briefly studies each of you with an expression that suggests he is looking around you rather than at you, likely with his Mage Sight. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;You said you were able to cast some spells on him?&quot;</span> he asks Ragnar. He smiles and continues, <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;Good. We'll be able to use that to track him. Let me see...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Each of you feels a faint tremble in your skin, in the air around you, as Valentine casts another spell. But as soon as he does, the smile slips off his face and his expression darkens. He quickly pulls you all close, close enough for physical contact, and you faintly hear him swear under his breath. A wave of energy surges through all of you like an electric current, you feel a brief flash of nausea and a lurching sensation, and then...<br /> <br /> ...You blink, and you're standing a few blocks away from the church from this morning. You're in an alley between two buildings. Valentine quickly casts another spell, rapidly flicking his fingers and spinning his wrists in an odd fashion as he does so. He takes a deep breath and relaxes visibly, then looks at each of you.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;The sympathetic threads connecting you to him were gone. Frayed. Intentionally cut. That requires Adept mastery of Space. The chances of a Moros Mage having that kind of training are very slim, or he would have had no difficulty capturing or killing you all in moments.&quot;</span> He lets that sink in before he continues, <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;That means he is not working alone. I brought us somewhere else quickly and cut all of your ties to that location, which will make it harder for them to find you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Valentine crosses his arms and sighs. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;I don't know how or why he came across your path, but I don't like it. Keep an eye out for him.&quot;</span> To Moonstone, he nods and says, <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;I'll see you tomorrow.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You each gain an Arcane Beat for your supernatural encounter with another Mage and learning about Twilight.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder and Moonstone</b><br /> Later that night, as agreed upon, Moonstone makes his way to Binder's bookstore in La Grange. He finds the front door unlocked as Binder lets him in.<br /> <br /> It's not long before you both hear footsteps and see a lean, scruffy-looking Caucasian man in his mid-30s saunter up to the store. He's wearing a black hoodie with a symbol of a white spade in its center, and a baseball hat cocked at an angle. He takes a long drag from a cigarette and tries to flick it to the ground, but it gets caught on his sleeve in the process. He yelps in surprise and quickly pats his sweatshirt to get it to the ground, muttering <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;OwowowOW!&quot;</span> in the process.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.impericon.com/media/catalog/product/t/h/thestorysofar_spade_hoodie_lg.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Spade stumbles through the front door and turns it into a sort of half-flourish, half-bow. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Tada!&quot;</span> he says. He looks between the two of you and then points at Moonstone. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;You. It's gotta be you, right? Moonstone? The guy who wants to summon a nightmarish plaything and make a pet out of it, yeah? I kid, I kid. </span><span style=\"color:darkslategray\">I'm Spade,&quot;</span> he points a thumb towards the symbol on his hoodie. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Case it wasn't obvious. So. This your place?&quot;</span> He looks around curiously. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Could use a little more privacy.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let me know what you would do on Saturday, if anything, before the following begins.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> On Sunday as instructed by Boomer, you read your slip of paper with the address she gave you and plug it into your phone to follow directions to the meeting site. When you arrive, you find yourself at a run-down gym in such seemingly poor condition that you're not initially sure you're in the right place. Half of the lights in its neon sign are out, but it reads &quot;Striker Fitness.&quot; No vehicles are in the small, unpaved parking lot.<br /> <br /> You walk up to the front door and see that it's not locked. The door leads you down a narrow hallway to an old stairwell heading underground. There's an unlocked padlock on a chain around a set of double doors, which are cracked partially open. You hear echoes from inside.<br /> <br /> When you open the door, you see a very different setup then what you had envisioned. A large boxing ring stands in pristine condition at the center of the room. Every wall has training dummies, bullseye targets, or racks with all types of melee weapons, from katanas and knives to staffs and spears. On the far wall, there is a long firing range with a shelf filled with pistols, shotguns, and rifles.<br /> <br /> Boomer stands in the center of the boxing ring and turns to face you with a boyish grin. She's wearing gym shorts and a tank top, and her bright pink mohawk is pulled back into a makeshift ponytail. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;Glad you could make it,&quot;</span> she greets you. She motions for you to join her in the ring. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;If you don't have any exercise gear with you, there's a locker room around the corner with some spare gear. Get comfortable and then get up here.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Once you're ready, Boomer explains, <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;Today, I'm going to teach you something that will help you defend yourself and your cabal. It's a trick of magic that can help you cast a spell more efficiently and potently. It's called a rote. Usually, each Order will pass some along to new initiates. Although you're not officially part of the Arrows yet, I'd like to think that you will consider petitioning. And as your mentor, I can choose information to pass along, and I think learning this will help you, regardless of whether or not you try to join our ranks.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Boomer starts the lesson by engaging you in a warm-up spar. For being slightly shorter and leaner than you, she is surprisingly agile, but she also packs a pretty good punch.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Roll Strength + Brawl for using the Down and Dirty combat rules.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> After warming up, Boomer spends the better part of an hour teaching you a series of fast, complex hand and wrist motions. She explains that the motions are used to encode the Imago for the spell, like a physical mnemonic device, to allow you to access the spell effect rapidly and effectively. As you perfect the technique, you feel the motions becoming more than just a series of movements, and as she explained, you start to find that the particular spell she's teaching you comes quickly and efficiently into existence.<br /> <br /> After practicing, she nods and walks you over to a practice dummy. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;This spell will let you shape the kinetic energy around your attacks or weapons, even firearms, to make them strike faster and harder. With a single well-aimed strike, you could do as much damage as a bullet,&quot;</span> she explains. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;Try to cast the rote like I showed you, and then punch this fucker with all you've got.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain access to your Kinetic Blow rote. Cast your spell, and then make an unarmed attack roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let me know what you'd like to do for the rest of Saturday.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> On Sunday, you meet up with your academic mentor, Dr. Langley, in his laboratory. He's pleased to meet up with you today and get your help on some transcription for some research projects he's working on. The professor has been reviewing some old items recovered from various sources, some from archaeological excavations and some from auctions or donations, and he can work faster with your support.<br /> <br /> The items he's working on today include some very old documents, some kind of papyrus document that was donated by a patron to the university who supposedly obtained it from the archives at someone's estate sale. It's the kind of chain of transfer that makes it hard for him to verify authenticity of the item, so he's speaking out loud while you quickly type away his words. &quot;I've tried dictation software and it never seems to work nearly as well as you,&quot; he says with a smile.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Please make an Int + Academics or Int + Expression roll for the quality of your transcription work.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> After reviewing the papyrus document, he moves on to some old books with symbols neither of you recognize. But while you're working, your eye catches the symbols on one of the books; although you've never seen it before, you have an immediate gut reaction to seeing it, like a feeling of deja vu. Somehow you instinctively know that they are written in some runic form of High Speech.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let me know what, if anything, you would do here or if you would study any of the objects further.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> Later that night, Mathias arranges to meet you over dinner as planned. You meet in a busy Thai restaurant on the south side of Chicago that he likes, and the ambient noise masks his quiet voice. He expresses concern about your recent run-in with the Moros Mage in Chicago. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I'm sorry I couldn't get there quickly to help, but thankfully Valentine was able to assist you and your cabal. What I don't understand is what he was even trying to do. He could have incapacitated you quickly if he had opted for a surprise attack...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Mathias gives you the chance to ask more questions about the Silver Ladder, and he readily answers them. It's very clear that he is passionate about his Order, and he seems very enthusiastic about giving you the information you need to consider further your interest in joining the th\u00e9archs.<br /> <br /> After dinner, Mathias surprises you by leading you down a hallway in the back of the restaurant to a private room. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;The owner of this establishment is one of our Order contacts,&quot;</span> he explains. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;We can have some privacy here. I want to teach you something that will help you prepare your spells in a different way, to create traps or contingency plans that can harm your foes or help you and your allies at just the right moment.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Mathias begins the process of meticulously and patiently walking you through the physical motions of learning a rote. He explains the arcane theory behind its purpose and allows you to practice. He expects and requires perfection, but he also rewards you with praise as you successfully cast the spell using his technique. He also explains how you can set spells using an Imago in such a way that they end after a condition is met.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I think you've got the gist of it now,&quot;</span> Mathias says with a smile. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Go ahead, try something. Cast a spell that will trigger when you clap your hands.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain access to your Hung Spell rote. Mathias is asking you to cast a spell, pause it using Hung Spell, and trigger it to end using the Conditional Duration attainment.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Formatting 04-19-2017, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-02T07:20:36-07:00","id":1072010,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: BBBBOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar jerks in surprise as Valentine pops in right in front of him. He stammers a little at first, but eventually gets control of himself and recounts what happened. He smiles when Valentine confirms that his spells could link him to the mage, but his stomach turns a little when Valentine's mood turns tense. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Something's wrong. </span></i>He gets a brief whiff of a cologne that smells ridiculously expensive as Valentine grabs him. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;The sympathetic threads connecting you to him were gone. Frayed. Intentionally cut. That requires Adept mastery of Space. The chances of a Moros Mage having that kind of training are very slim, or he would have had no difficulty capturing or killing you all in moments. </span><span style=\"color:#808080\">That means he is not working alone. I brought us somewhere else quickly and cut all of your ties to that location, which will make it harder for them to find you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> With that, Ragnar dismisses his spells out of fear. <hr />For the rest of the day, Ragnar returns to his apartment. He tries to keep the bruises and the scrapes on his leg out of Patty's view. He gratefully falls asleep, his mind churning with thoughts about the attack, and how Hakim and Moonstone factor in to it... <hr />Sunday morning, he meets with Dr. Langley. The older man's compliment makes Ragnar smile with a pride. He cracks his fingers and his fingers hover over the keyboard. Then a thought hits him. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Wait... why not give myself every advantage I can get? </span></i><br /> <br /> He quickly begins weaving an Imago, invoking his Praxis. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to cast his Exceptional Luck Praxis on himself. He has one free Reach, which he will spend on Instant Casting. Gnosis 1 + Fate 2 + Willpower 3 = 6 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/501083\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. He'll take a Boon that grants him the 8-again quality on his roll to transcribe.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to transcribe Dr. Langley's musings. 4 Intelligence + Academics 3 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/501090\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> His fingers fly across the board, without a single mistake. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Magic is a guy's best friend...</i></span><br /> <br /> The manuscript, though... he doesn't understand what the words say, but he knows it's High Speech. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Let's try and copy this down... </span></i>He briefly examines the manuscript with Fate and Time Sight, and then takes pictures of the manuscript. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Let me see if I can dig anything up on my own.&quot; </span> <hr />At dinner with Mathias, Ragnar continues to ponder the riddle of the mystery Moros. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;I'm sorry I couldn't get there quickly to help, but thankfully Valentine was able to assist you and your cabal. What I don't understand is what he was even trying to do. He could have incapacitated you quickly if he had opted for a surprise attack...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> With that, the pieces click into place. An image pops into Ragnar's mind of himself standing on a chessboard, and a hand reaching out of the shadows to place the Moros before him. They fight until Phoenix and Moonstone join him, and then the hand reaches out to pull the Moros back into the shadows. He looks up from his meal with a look of comprehension. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;That's because that wasn't his goal. Whoever is pulling the strings... that Moros, whoever he is, he didn't show up with the intention to kill me outright. It's like a shark when it bites a surfer- it's not necessarily hungry, it wants to see if this weird thing is worth eating. Or pack hunters trying to see if an animal is strong enough to defend itself. When Phoenix and Moonstone showed up, he ran.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> After Mathias responds, Ragnar sits in silence for a few moments. Then he clears his throat. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;So... the Silver Ladder. You mentioned the... Lex Magica, right? Law of Magic. What differentiates the th\u00e9archs from the Guardians, then? Is it like the difference between lawyers and police? The Arrows I get, I think: magic comes through competition, struggle. Not wrong per se, but... I don't think I'm cut out for it. The Free Council... do we get along with them? This use of technology to help with casting spells that they do, it sounds... unorthodox, maybe? Potentially useful, though.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He fiddles with his fork as he considers how to phrase the next question. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Yesterday, there were... people who enjoyed what happened. I could see them smirking, laughing. Even those guys with Cielo. Poseidon, Atlas, Apollo. I'm not sure Moonstone made friends with the ladies though. Luna seemed neutral, but I could tell Cielo wasn't exactly pleased. Estrella looked pissed. Melody too. So what is Poseidon's deal? He's a Guardian, right?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He doesn't mention Moonstone's revelation about the mystery mage and Hakim; he figures he owes it to Moonstone to gather more information before blindly implicating him. What he does do, however, is show Mathias the pictures he took. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;I was helping a professor at UChi with some research this morning. He had this manuscript that he couldn't decipher. I couldn't read it, but I knew it was something in High Speech. Can you tell what it says?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Practicing the strange hand gestures for the Rote takes time, but eventually he gets it down<span style=\"color:#0000cd\">. &quot;So you're saying that this will help me avoid Paradox? Sweet.&quot; <i>Wait a second. Hand gestures to cast a spell? </i>He looks to Mathias with a curious look, his hands continuing to practice the Rote. &quot;Say... Gary Gygax wasn't a Mage by any chance, was he? Because this is some straight-up D&amp;D stuff.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;I think you've got the gist of it now. </span><span style=\"color:green\">Go ahead, try something. Cast a spell that will trigger when you clap your hands.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar stands in the middle of the room, considering his options. Finally, he hits on a simple but practical idea. With his mind, he begins weaving together the Imago of his Praxis. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Sorry in advance.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to cast his Exceptional Luck Praxis. The target will be Mathias, in an attempt to inflict Arm Wrack on both arms. He has one free Reach, which he spends on Instant Casting. Gnosis 1 + Fate 2 = 3 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/501377\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Imago formed and affecting Mathias, Ragnar immediately begins working the Rote, overlaying the Imago of the Time Spell over his Praxis. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to cast his Hung Spell Rote. He has four free Reach, one of which he will spend for Instant Casting, another one for Sensory Range. Gnosis 1 + Time 2 = 3 dice-&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/501378\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He waits a few seconds to check that the spell is working, and then claps his hands, restoring Mathias' arms back to working condition. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Something like that, I'm guessing?&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-03T09:28:13-07:00","id":1072574,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 3/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>LB</b>OOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Sleep of the Just<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1070966#post1070966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Later that night, as agreed upon, Moonstone makes his way to Binder's bookstore in La Grange. He finds the front door unlocked as Binder lets him in.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Hey, come on in.&quot;</span> Binder looks a little lost in thought, and continues before Moonstone can respond. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;This is a weird question, but you can look through time, right? I'm not sure if I'm just being paranoid or not, but would you be able to check something for me? Ugh, sorry, I shouldn't be asking for a favor as soon as you walk through the door.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1070966#post1070966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;So. This your place?&quot;</span> He looks around curiously.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Yeah. I'm Binder; nice to meet you, Spade.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1070966#post1070966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Could use a little more privacy.&quot;</span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;I've got it covered. Door to the ritual space is over here.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">At the very least, hopefully Binder will be able to guide them through the door even if they can't see it.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-10T15:15:02-07:00","id":1076139,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 3/10 | Beats: 1/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Pattern scouring again for +3 Mana and -1 Strength until tomorrow. We gotta get a Hallow.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Moonstone shows up with dark circles under his eyes, barely concealed with makeup. But he puts on a smile as soon as Binder asks for help. As a servant, requests when he walks through the door are second nature. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;For a friend, anything. My eyes are yours. What eludes you?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> When Spade shows up and almost lights himself on fire, he frets: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;oh no, poor thing, let me help-&quot;</span><br /> <br /> His lack of Awakened etiquette (as Moonstone understands it) is a mild shock. The warlock sniffs. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;You have the right of it. My mind is my palace, and I intend to be master of the house. Shall we?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Into the hidden ritual space they go. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Now. Do I need to meditate? Draw a picture? I can return the memories of <i><b>IT</b> </i>to the front of my mind, if it will help.&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-11T23:18:12-07:00","id":1076823,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 0/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], Supernal Blindness | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'm staggered for a bit as the staff bounces away from him. Damn, didn't account for his armor. Just as I'm about to ready another strike, he's gone.<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">What? Wha-what is this? Where did he go?</span>&quot; I stammer, my eyes zig-zagging and my head jolting side to side looking for the guy. Must be a trick, I can see through tricks, so I open my Sight. I don't even care about the overload burning straight through my skull, I see through it and try to find something.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Phoenix does a Revelation on the Moros mage's spell<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/505421\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 1 + 3 WP - 2 Supernal Blindness = 3 dice \u2192 2 successes</a><br /> <br /> Oops, I was actually supposed to do 4 dice because he has Prime 2, so I'll roll an extra die.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/505425\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> <br /> \u200bWould this resolve Supernal Blindness?</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">That coward!</span>&quot; I exclaimed as I punch the wall. That's the second time he got away. I can't seem to catch a break on Anubis. I'm not gonna find him like this, I need to sleep on it for awhile, get a fresh perspective.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">He takes a break for the rest of the day. Recovers 1 WP for a total of 3 (4 before post, used 1 for Active Sight and 1 for Revelation roll, then recovered 1).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bI arrive at &quot;Striker Fitness&quot; with training supplies in tow. Although, this is magical training, so am I gonna need this stuff? Doesn't matter, rather have it and not need it than need it and not have it.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#ff1493\">&quot;Today, I'm going to teach you something that will help you defend yourself and your cabal. It's a trick of magic that can help you cast a spell more efficiently and potently. It's called a rote. Usually, each Order will pass some along to new initiates. Although you're not officially part of the Arrows yet, I'd like to think that you will consider petitioning. And as your mentor, I can choose information to pass along, and I think learning this will help you, regardless of whether or not you try to join our ranks.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">So Defence Against the Dark Arts training, then?</span>&quot; I chuckle. Time to see what an Arrow is like.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/505462\" target=\"_blank\">Strength 3 + Brawl 4 = 7 \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> Well, that could've gone better. I'll post his reaction after I know Boomer's successes, so I'll roll for the Rote spell now.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Kinetic Blow (Forces 2, Corebook p. 143)</u></b><br /> <b>Reach:</b> 4 free; 3 used for instant casting, shifting primary factor to Potency, and applying the Knocked Down Tilt<br /> <b>Paradox:</b> None<br /> <b>Containment:</b> None<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Rote Mudra (Brawl)<br /> <b>Factors:</b> PSF Potency to 3 (-2)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/505470\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Forces 2 + 4 Yantra (Brawl) - 2 Factors = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> And now to hit the sucker as hard as possible<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/505471\" target=\"_blank\">Strength 3 + 4 Brawl + 3 WP = 10 dice \u2192 4 successes</a><br /> <br /> That's a total of 7 lethal damage and knocking it down.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 04-24-2017, 06:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-18T11:22:38-07:00","id":1080446,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 3/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>LB</b>OOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Sleep of the Just<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1076139#post1076139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[CENTER]<br /> Moonstone shows up with dark circles under his eyes, barely concealed with makeup. But he puts on a smile as soon as Binder asks for help. As a servant, requests when he walks through the door are second nature. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;For a friend, anything. My eyes are yours. What eludes you?&quot;</span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;When I got here, the door was unlocked and there was a cat inside. It doesn't seem like anything's missing, and I can't detect any other minds or active spells, but I'm still worried.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ---","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-19T20:50:14-07:00","id":1081270,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You're an ace at transcription today. Your mind moves at record speeds, and as Dr. Langley speaks, it's almost like you can anticipate his words and begin to type them moments before he finishes his sentences. Your hands and mind have never been this coordinated, and everything comes naturally to you.<br /> <br /> A thought passes through your mind as you type: It's easy to see how some people could become dependent on, or even addicted to, this kind of power.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">In reviewing the Mage 2E book more, I realized that you would instinctively be able to read High Speech, so you actually would understand the words. What's neat is that you can actually write or &quot;insert&quot; High Speech into any language, and it will just look like gibberish to any Sleeper who can read that language.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> In studying the old book with runes, you glimpse a few of the symbols and the meaning behind them comes naturally to you. <i>They come like shadows,</i> it reads. <i>Beware their hunger.</i> Dr. Langley moves the page before you can read more. &quot;I don't think I've seen a language like this before,&quot; he says excitedly. &quot;The symbols look to be pictorial, something like Egyptian hieroglyphs, but I don't see anything familiar from that era that matches these.&quot; He further describes the symbols and apparent quality of the book at length for you to transcribe while he handles the object with care.<br /> <br /> Examining the book with your Sight reveals little in regard to its threads of Fate. The book does seem to have a...timeless quality to it, however. You can't tell more without studying it further with magic, but there seems to be a temporal distortion around this book, as if it has been ripped out of the stream of Time.<br /> <br /> Dr. Langley allows you to take a few photos of the book, but doesn't let you hold it. &quot;We'll need to make sure that we don't harm the quality of the document,&quot; he explains, carefully setting the book into a storage box for future study.<br /> <br /> ---------------------<br /> <br /> Mathias nods slowly as a frown spreads across his face. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;All the more reason to stay on guard and keep an eye open for trouble. I don't know if it was chance or on purpose that led him to find you, but either way, I don't like it. Just be careful.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> For a time, Mathias lectures you further on the various Orders and differences in their philosophies. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Actually...I think your analogies are closer to the truth of the matter than you realize,&quot;</span> he chuckles and nods approvingly. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;At least about the Guardians. But th\u00e9archs aren't just limited to interpreting and discussing our laws for magical society; we are the caretakers of the Law, and with it, the voice of reason to shepherd our society on to better things. The fact that we even <i>have</i> an Awakened 'society' is thanks to the work of the Silver Ladder.<br /> <br /> &quot;Our mission is one of elevation, of continual improvement, and of further enlightening and leading both Sleepers and Mages. Many Orders will argue that they're trying to bring about the same thing, but the Silver Ladder is the one most closely associated with unity among all Mages. We seek to guide all Sleepers towards Awakening, because we know that doing so would usher in an era of unimaginable productivity and harmony.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He talks briefly about how the th\u00e9archs get along with the other Orders, noting that <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;some Orders confuse our efforts to guide and lead as attempts to control, which has led to tension with the Guardians,&quot;</span> he admits. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Most of what you witnessed was related to our current political climate. Guardians are tasked with the important burden of ensuring that magic is not misused, especially in the presence of Sleepers, where the Paradox created could threaten the lives of many people. Th\u00e9archs attempt to inspire Sleepers to Awaken, sometimes with more obvious approaches, and so the Guardians and th\u00e9archs are often at odds with each other. Poseidon and the others...well, it's mostly just a matter of taking advantage of an opportunity to revel in a th\u00e9arch's misfortune.&quot;</span> Mathias' tone indicates that he has said all he will on this subject, and he changes the topic shortly after.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">So in reviewing the rules for Hung Spell and the Conditional Duration attainment, I think you might have it backwards.<br /> <br /> By casting Hung Spell, you can then cast additional spells that are essentially &quot;paused&quot; in regards to their remaining duration. You don't need sensory range here because <i>you</i> are the subject, and you're basically granted &quot;slots&quot; of additional spells you can cast now and have ready to use but paused.<br /> <br /> Conditional Duration allows you to make a spell last longer without increasing spell factors or using extra reach, but to do so, you set a trigger that causes the spell to end when it happens. So you could curse someone and set it to end as soon as they apologize to you, for example.<br /> <br /> If you combine this with Hung Spell, as Mathias is suggesting, the way it works is that you cast Hung Spell using a desired condition, then cast the &quot;trap&quot; spell you want to go off. When the trigger happens, the second spell is no longer paused and takes full effect. So for example, you could cast a spell that curses someone and lies dormant and only triggers on the first person who injures you. Only problem to remember is that &quot;dormant&quot; spells still count towards your total spells for purposes of spell control and reach costs.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> With Mathias' coaching, you create a &quot;net&quot; of Time magic and then infuse it with a Fate spell to curse your mentor. You see your second spell perfectly frozen in time from the moment you form the Imago. When you clap your hands, the Time spell unravels, causing the Fate magic to spring around Mathias, and his arms suddenly fall limp to his side. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Excellent!&quot;</span> he says encouragingly. <span style=\"color:green\">&quot;Very well done, Ragnar. You are doing very well for being so newly Awakened. I think you have excellent potential.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Added a picture of Spade to my precious post, FYI.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Spade gives you a lazy salute, then turns to follow you as you walk through the store. His eyes are rapidly scanning the room, and you remember that despite his odd behavior, this Mage is still a respected and competent member of the Adamantine Arrow.<br /> <br /> His eyes slide right past the door to your ritual space, until you point it out to him, which makes him grin. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;That's smart. Good thinking, guy.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> After Binder leads you upstairs, Spade folds his arms and turns to you. For a change, Spade seems more serious. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;You don't really need to do anything, although it'll be easier if you focus on the concept of what you want to summon. You want to bind your fear of the Gulmoth, yeah? Then you gotta let yourself be <i>afraid</i> of him. Let me know when you can manage that.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Spade doesn't actually give you much time to reflect on that, however; he probably assumes that you don't need to dig very far into your mind to find that memory.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;We're going to be taking a bit of a shortcut,&quot;</span> Spade begins to explain. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Normally the best way to meet up with a Goetia from your own Oneiros...&quot;</span> He pauses, realizes he has no idea how to explain this to you, and runs a hand through his hair with a loud sigh. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;The Astral Realms. It's like if your soul was a place, and there were even more layers to it that represent all of humanity, the world itself. You actually both have been there, whether you remember it or not, when you first Awakened. You normally enter it when dreaming in a spot fueled by magic. A hallow or something.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Spade reaches his hand into his pocket and pulls out a playing card, which he reveals (unsurprisingly) as the ace of spades. The card seems ordinary to the naked eye, but Spade continues, <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;This is a soul stone. An object with someone's soul kind of...pressed into it, or impressed upon it. When you use one of these bad boys, you can travel the Astral. Or, even easier, make a Goetia travel the Astral plane.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The odd Arrow mage has both of you sit down in a comfortable seated position on the floor. He looks at you and Binder, shrugs, and mutters to himself, <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Eh, screw it, that's all they really need anyway.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> You and Binder suddenly feel a dizzying, lurching sensation. Your head spins and your eyes instantly feel sleepy, and then...<br /> <br /> ...You blink. Everything seems the same. Binder and Spade are both still there. But this room itself seems more transient, a thought you have just before Spade suddenly vanishes and reappears on the ceiling upside down. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;You're dreaming now,&quot;</span> he says nonchalantly before &quot;teleporting&quot; himself back to the ground by force of will. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;You're physically asleep, back in the sanctum, but we're sharing a dream. We won't take a real jaunt into the Astral tonight -- too complicated when you haven't had time to learn more about how it works, and certainly not my responsibility to teach you that stuff -- but it's going to help us with this little journey.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Spade looks at you and nods. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;Alright. Time to see that fear.&quot;</span> He cracks his knuckles, stretches his neck, and turns to face you. On your Periphery, you distantly hear a crack of thunder and smell sulfur.<br /> <br /> The thoughts and memories come with minimal bidding. As they do, the landscape and tone of this place both change rapidly. The world freezes and then shatters, like a broken mirror, and the cracks begin to spread through the room. Darkness gathers, forms a shell and then a mound, creates...<i>IT.</i><br /> <br /> Alux.<br /> <br /> A howl fills the room, which now looks more like a prison or a cage, with the Gulmoth at its center like a black maw of swirling energy and shadows. It lifts into the air, flying, like it has in your nightmares. Your thoughts feed into your feelings, which further feed the thoughts and imagination again and again. Fear threatens to consume you.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Spade seems almost apathetic, entirely unconcerned about Alux. He whistles idly as he strolls past the Gulmoth, nodding at it as if waving to an acquaintance on the street. He looks back and forth between you and the Gulmoth, studying it. And just when you feel like you're about to buckle at the knees and vomit from the sheer intensity of your fear...Spade raises a hand and casts a spell. The Imago crystalizes into place, and you hear a loud chime.<br /> <br /> Your mind's representation of Alux suddenly shrinks, down to about your size. It hovers in the air, toothsome and light-consuming, but decidedly...different. Copied. An embodiment of your fear, rather than the source itself. A feeling wrapped up in an ephemeral entity.<br /> <br /> That's when you realize that you don't feel afraid anymore. You test yourself, thinking of Alux, and...nothing. You're able to remember it, sure, and consider ways to harm or destroy it. But that knot in the pit of your stomach is simply...gone. Instead, you have an awareness of the Goetia, a curious sensation of a bond to it. In fact, just thinking about the Goetia causes your senses to shift, and for a moment, it's like you're seeing out of its &quot;eyes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;I summoned your Fear, or its living representation. Plucked it straight out of your Oneiros and brought it here.&quot;</span> He puts the playing card in his hand back into his pocket. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;And then I bonded it to you. Gotcha a little pet, it seems. Don't forget to feed him. He'll still be with you when you wake up.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You immediately feel intense agony in your eyes as you force your Sight to open once more and try to rip away the shroud of Mystery surrounding his spell as he casts it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I am bending the rules here to let you try this in this particular situation, but technically Revelation is an instant action, so you wouldn't be able to attempt it reflexively. You also need to subtract 3 for Opacity; however, with your WP and total dice pool of 4, that still leaves you with 1 success. So yes, you can resolve your Condition.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You only have a moment to glimpse the spell as the hostile mage casts it and disappears. With your Sight, you know not only that it was a Death spell, but that it used the Weaving practice -- this mage is at least a Disciple of the Death Arcanum. You also were able to study and memorize the unique aura or Nimbus that forms around each mage when they form an Imago for a spell. You think you might be able to look at other spells and tell his apart from others'.<br /> <br /> -------------------------<br /> <br /> Boomer just rolls her eyes and smacks you playfully on the shoulder. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;Yeah, something like that,&quot;</span> she says dryly.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/508193\" target=\"_blank\">Str + Brawl</a>: <u>5d10h8</u> = <b>1</b> success.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You and Boomer each hold your own during the warm-up spar. She nods before you move on to casting spells or learning the rote. Once you're ready, you cast your spell, and you find that you can form the spell with ease, thanks to Boomer's close tutelage. The practice dummy is made of rubber, but when your fist collides with it, the rubber seems to bend and <i>shatter</i> from the sheer force of your blow. The dummy flies across the room, ripped into pieces.<br /> <br /> Boomer whistles approvingly and grins. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;You have no idea how many of those we go through,&quot;</span> she nods at the remnants of the dummy. In a more sobering tone, she adds, <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;If that were a person, the average human would be dead from that strike.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 04-20-2017, 12:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T14:50:01-07:00","id":1083192,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b> isn't a big fan of sharing his nightmares and anxieties, but with two strapping Mastigos men with him, it feels safer. Seeing Binder watch and Spade casually walk around inside his terror-dream is surreal. But once the Alux-idea is bound and gagged, he can appreciate the absurdity of it.<br /> <br /> &quot;I feel different already. Just knowing this is <i>possible</i> is so liberating! I can conquer my own mind!<br /> <br /> Knowing that it's a lucid dream, he conjures Pandemonium's iron chains to wrap around the embodied Fear, then shatters them with a wave of his hand, makes them into a dog collar, and a Christmas sweater, and a candy-pink bubble. He's cracking up. It doesn't become a manic episode, though. He's safe here. And with more training and practice, he can make his mind and soul an Astral fortress with all his scattered thoughts as his subjects.<br /> <br /> &quot;What's the line- bound in a nutshell, I could be a king of infinite space! And this little devil is the first step. Thank you, Spade! I'll see the real thing laid low just as quickly, mark my words!&quot;<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Before they leave Marlin's shop for the night, Moonstone extends his awareness throughout the bookstore and projects it back in time. Maybe there's a clue to this cat business.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Time 1 Postcognition. Reach: instant, advanced scale, +1 for scene duration, +1 to speed/rewind the vision. 2 paradox: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/509893\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a> Contain: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/509895\" target=\"_blank\">3 success.</a><br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1+Time 2+Tool 1. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/509897\" target=\"_blank\">2 success</a><br /> <br /> Spell goes off for 1 Mana with Potency 2 to overcome Temporal Sympathy. Moonstone speeds through the events of the day inside the bookstore, stopping and zooming in when he sees the cat and however it got past the lock.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 04-24-2017, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T11:07:33-07:00","id":1084583,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 3/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>LB</b>OOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Sleep of the Just<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1081270#post1081270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:darkslategray\">&quot;... and certainly not my responsibility to teach you that stuff...&quot;</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Binder takes everything in with wide eyes, taking careful note of the terms and concepts Spade lists off. The incomplete explination sparks off dozens of questions in his mind, but he takes the hint; Spade isn't here to teach a seminar. Instead, he files them to ask the mage who actually agreed to be his teacher. Goetia, Oneiros, Astral, Hallow, Soul Stone... We're dreaming, but the Astral is related to the soul?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T05:02:35-07:00","id":1085420,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> &quot;Summoning&quot; the objects you desire takes no more than a thought -- although keeping your thoughts focused here is difficult. These objects are simple enough that it's not a challenge, but you get the feeling that asserting your will over a dream-state might require a bit of finesse and practice.<br /> <br /> Spade snickers. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">'Kid, I like you. You've got class. Be careful here, though,&quot;</span> he cautions in a more serious tone. <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">'Goetia can be pretty damn strong, especially on their home turf. Maybe do some of your homework before trying to take some jaunts into the real Astral Realm, okay? Oh, and just to be clear, this little fella isn't bound permanently. Should last about a month or so. Did what I could.&quot;</span> He shrugs.<br /> <br /> Spade opens the floating door standing beside the two of you -- wait, was that door always there? -- and steps through into nothingness. You feel a yanking sensation as you suddenly are pulled towards the door, swallowed whole by darkness, and...<br /> <br /> ...you blink your eyes open. You're back in the ritual space in Binder's sanctum. You feel groggy like you just woke up from a weird dream. Probably because you just did.<br /> <br /> As your mind clears, you feel an unseen presence hovering around you. You can't see it with your naked eye, but your skin tingles as if someone is staring at you. Opening your Sight to Pandemonium even briefly reveals the small Goetia hovering next to you, exactly as you saw it in the shared dream. It's your fear of the Abyss personified, but you can feel its emotions and general disposition. It studies you cautiously, as if trying to decide how it feels about you.<br /> <br /> At Binder's request, you anchor your consciousness to this building and look into its recent past. Visions of the day fill your mind. The store is quiet during the day, as Binder hadn't been working and the store was closed. Early in the evening, however, something catches your eye. There's a back storage room with a small window. You see a mangy-looking calico cat leap to the window from a nearby tree, somehow managing to balance itself on the window sill. Binder must not have locked or secured it, because the cat pushes its face at the bottom of the window and pushes up, and with a bit of effort, the window slides up just enough for the cat to squeeze in and enter the storage room.<br /> <br /> The stray cat wanders the store. It seems to browse the aisles curiously, nudging its way past the books, knocking a few things onto the ground here and there. But you can tell that it isn't quite aimless in its wandering; the cat seems to systematically walk up and down all of the various aisles in the store.<br /> <br /> You see Binder unlock and open the front door. The cat bolts, meows as it passes the mage, and disappears in the nearby bushes.<br /> <br /> -----------------<br /> <br /> As planned, you call Valentine on Sunday and arrange to meet. When you ask about where to meet, he tells you, <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;No need. I'll find you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> At noon sharp, you head to the front door of your apartment and are preparing to leave when you hear a knock on your door and feel goosebumps suddenly raise on your arms. You open the door and...it opens right into the familiar foyer of Valentine's mansion. Valentine smiles cordially as you walk across the threshold into his sanctum. <br /> <br /> As you pass him, Valentine tilts his head and looks around the room. He blinks and widens his eyes slightly, then comments, <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;A Goetia following you? Oh, I see. A familiar would make sense. Well done. I assume you had help, but even still, they can't be bound in that way against their will,&quot;</span> he explains. <br /> <br /> Valentine asks you to describe the entire trip to Chicago again, even though you already have briefly before. When you finish, he pauses, then asks you to describe it again but in even more detail. He prompts you to bring up memories of things you saw, what the weather was like, everything -- and then he has you start over. By the time he has finished, you feel like your throat is parched but you're surprised at how much you able to recall. <br /> <br /> Valentine nods and smiles. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;Excellent. If you want to rule your mind, you need to know that it's very unruly by nature, at least without some proper mental training.&quot;</span> Your mentor shifts topics quickly, however. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;It's clear that you are a skilled and insightful Mage with strong potential. To help you continue to advance your craft and your knowledge, I would like to teach you how to harness the power of High Speech.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Over the course of the early afternoon, Valentine walks you through a similar explanation that Lynx received from his mentor, teaching you about what High Speech is, how to channel it into your magic, and the benefits of doing so. He is critical and requires every ounce of your focus, but he is not unkind or rude, simply perfectionistic. More importantly, his pedagogy works for you, and you quickly gain knowledge of how to incorporate High Speech into your spells. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;I think we are done for now,&quot;</span> Valentine nods. <span style=\"color:gray\">&quot;I'll leave you with a word of caution. We still don't know who that Mage was or his purpose. Tread lightly and pay attention to anyone acting odd.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You gain access to the High Speech merit from your Order initiation.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> You might not know as much about the lore or theories of the Astral plane as Moonstone, but you're able to latch onto and retain Spade's descriptions. Definitely something to talk to Falling Blossom about. As a Mastigos and Mystagogue, she's also likely to be familiar with the Astral Realm.<br /> <br /> Spade says to you, <span style=\"color:darkslategray\">'I know you were more of an audience member than participant here, but you're a Mastigos too, yeah? Lucid dreams can be your friend. You can practice your magic while you sleep. Pretty neat trick.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ------------------<br /> <br /> During that night, perhaps because you spent so much time thinking about it during the day, you find yourself having a vivid dream -- and you know it's a dream. Was this what Spade was talking about? You're at your store, and you know you're asleep, but you also feel like you're wide awake. <br /> <br /> And then you hear a knock at the door. <br /> <br /> You peer through the window by the front door, and to your surprise, you see Falling Blossom waving to you. She's partially muffled by the door, but you hear her ask, <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;May I come in?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> When you open the door, your mentor smiles and shakes your hand. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Good evening, Binder. I suspect that you've figured this out already, but you are dreaming. There are ways to enter someone else's dream, and I wanted to meet you for our first lesson. However, I did not discuss this with you before, and I will not intrude without your permission. If you ask it of me, I will leave now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Assuming you are comfortable with her staying, Falling Blossom takes a seat in a chair next to a row of book shelves and invites you to sit as well. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;In case you are not already aware, you can enter a state of lucid dreaming with a spell, or simply by willing it as you fall asleep. You can practice magic here, although you should be warned that doing so can still provoke Paradox. Of course, Sleepers do not perceive Awakened magic the same during their dream as during the day, but reckless casting can still have dangerous consequences.&quot;</span> She frowns, studying you. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;One of the first things many Mastigos should learn is how to utilize Space magic to understand and take advantage of Sympathetic ties. We have these bonds with people, places and things that are significant to us. One of your most important tools in your arsenal of Space magic is the ability to observe other subjects in other locations, outside the range of your mundane senses. We call this scrying. And I am going to teach it to you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Falling Blossom explains the benefits of casting rote spells and the system of using one, by encoding the Imago in specific physical motions passed down from mentor to student. She teaches you a series of complex but rapid physical motions to do so for a scrying spell. While she does, she also explains why your precious scrying attempts were so difficult. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;You need to use your own Sympathy to the subject. Having a lock of their own hair or a personal momento helps only if you can successfully borrow its Sympathy to its owner. A simpler way to reach a desired target is to give them something of <i>yours</i> and to target that object directly. As you grow in your magical skill, or when trying to observe subjects with whom you are already more intimately familiar, scrying will be much easier.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> After she has drilled the rote in and appears sufficiently confident that you have mastered it, she smiles and relaxes into her chair. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;That is only the beginning of what the Mysterium can teach you. If you wish, I can visit you periodically like this during your dreams. Your mind can learn and work while your physical body sleeps. And sometime this week, we do want you and Lynx to visit one of our Athanaeum together.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You unlock your Scrying rote spell.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 04-29-2017, 08:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T07:00:42-07:00","id":1089753,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 0/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> My eyes widen as far as the dummy shatters. I completely destroyed that thing! I don't even know what to say, I just look at my fist as euphoria rushes over me. I feel like I can break anything, anyone. Nothing can stop me.<br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#ff1493\">&quot;You have no idea how many of those we go through,&quot;</span> Valentine says, I can't help but laugh, <span style=\"color:#ff1493\">&quot;If that were a person, the average human would be dead from that strike.&quot;</span> <br /> <br /> \u200bAnd the ride's over now, kiddies. It was fun while it lasted. I look at my fist again, only this time my thoughts turn to the consequences. Yes, I could very well kill anybody with this spell, and other spells could give me wealth, fame, power, whatever I damn well pleased. I could rule the world.<br /> <br /> And that thought terrifies me.<br /> <br /> There's a reason my dad hated magic and planted that seed in me: It's so easy to misuse, so tempting to just...shatter whatever is in your way. Magic is a force, and a very powerful one at that. I...I really need to stop and think. I'm tired, anyways. Speaking of...<br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Say,&quot;</span> I turn to Boomer, <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;Do you know how to recharge Mana?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T05:53:10-07:00","id":1091920,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> Boomer nods to you at your question. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;There are a couple, yeah. Sometimes just making a perfect Imago or crafting your spell <i>just right</i> will create personal mana. Some spells that come naturally to you, called a Praxis, are easier to do this with, so some mages cast those to recharge. Prime magic lets you move mana around from other people or objects, with the right spell. But there are also some places you can go where mana naturally springs up, or things you can do to generate mana from your own body.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> She briefly explains how you can temporarily sap your own strength or physical vitality to generate mana, and tells you the basics about hallows and tass -- mostly just to introduce the topics. She pulls a small protein bar out of her workout bag and hands it to you. <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;I transferred some mana into this. Eating it will give you a little bit of mana. I bring them to a workout, I like the symbolism of it. First one is on the house,&quot;</span> She grins. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Eating the power bar restores 1 mana.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> Near the end of your meeting with Falling Blossom, there is a point where she abruptly pauses and looks around the &quot;store&quot; in your dream. She stands up and looks around, walks over to the front door, and peers out. After a moment of silence, she turns back to you and apologizes. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;I am sorry for being distracted. I thought I felt...Never mind. Mages can be a paranoid lot,&quot;</span> she laughs softly, although it sounds forced. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Now, where was I? Oh, yes, the Athenaeum...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Perhaps it's because of what Falling Blossom just said, but you have a distinct feeling of being watched. It fades shortly before your lesson ends. After Falling Blossom leaves, you slip back into the peaceful, dreamless slumber of deep sleep. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Everyone except Binder and Ophis</b><br /> On Sunday night, you each have a vivid nightmare. For Moonstone, the dream is disturbing, but simply not frightening -- even though you know you should feel terrified.<br /> <br /> You're in the alley again. You know which one. How could you forget?<br /> <br /> Looking directly at the creature is difficult. Anywhere that it touches the creature's skin, sunlight splits and collides together again, creating impossible pockets or bubbles of prismatic visions in the air around it. Some of the light seems to <i>sizzle</i>, creating pockets of shadow on the wall and street.<br /> <br /> The Abyssal creature raises its arms into the air and emits a terrible, inhuman roar. The light around it grows darker.<br /> <br /> You try to fight, to run, to do anything, but it's like your hands are glued to your sides and your feet are made of lead.<br /> <br /> Alux grows larger in your field of vision, reaching down to consume you. And just before he does, you swear you feel someone watching you. A man laughs faintly in the distance, and your world goes black.<br /> <br /> <i>Flash</i><br /> <br /> You're in the alley again. You know which one. How could you forget?<br /> <br /> Looking directly at the creature is difficult. Anywhere that it touches the creature's skin, sunlight splits and collides together again, creating impossible pockets or bubbles of prismatic visions in the air around it. Some of the light seems to <i>sizzle</i>, creating pockets of shadow on the wall and street.<br /> <br /> The Abyssal creature raises its arms into the air and emits a terrible, inhuman roar. The light around it grows darker...<br /> <br /> <i>Flash</i><br /> <br /> You're in the alley again. You know which one. How could you forget?<br /> <br /> <i>Flash</i><br /> <br /> <i>Flash</i><br /> <br /> <i>Flash</i> <i>Flash</i> <i>Flash</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>* NEW SCENE *</b></div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> When you finally wake up, the first thing you notice is that you're covered in sweat. Your bed sheets are twisted and mostly on the floor. Even now as you are awake, the horrific dream of Alux threatens to flicker through your mind. Your whole body is sore, exhausted, spent. You feel like you spent the whole night in that nightmare.<br /> <br /> You look at your clock. It's just after 6 am on Monday, September 12, 2016. Something Moonstone said on Saturday sticks in your mind: Alux will return on September 17. <br /> <br /> Looking at your phone, you see that you have a missed call from Boomer and a text. It reads:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:deeppink\"><i>Got a lead on that energy we chatted about. Something weird in La Grange. You and your gang should check it out. Call me.</i></span><br /> <br /> Speaking with Boomer, you learn that there have been reports of mana springing up in one particular neighborhood in La Grange Park, the suburb immediately adjacent to La Grange proper. She has heard that there is an unusually high amount of tass being found in the area, but it's not stable.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:deeppink\">&quot;Tass is the solid form of mana. Normally it comes from a hallow, and seeps into objects nearby. If it's edible, you can eat it to harvest the energy, which is the most useful form. Otherwise it sticks around in stones, bricks, whatever else is nearby. But this tass I'm hearing about isn't stable. You can harvest it, but it's not sticking around, so no one I know is really interested in checking it out. If it's not coming from a hallow, and you can't keep the tass to store it for later, it doesn't have much value to most mages except as a quick recharge. But I know your group was looking for mana, so I thought of you.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> She gives you directions to where she had heard about this odd phenomenon. It's around Edgewood, Malden, and Woodlawn Avenues, just southeast of the Salt Creek Woods.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> After a relatively peaceful night of sleep, at times broken by waking up with thoughts about ghosts and death, you wake to your normal alarm. You notice that you have a text from Dante. It's fairly vague, intentional on his part of course, but says that he has been hearing rumors of some odd ghost activity in La Grange Park, by a neighborhood next to Salt Creek Woods. He doesn't know specifics but said it could be interesting for you and your cabal to investigate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Formatting 05-13-2017, 08:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T08:18:56-07:00","id":1091954,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 5 - Arcane Beats: 5</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Ow.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Oscar stares up at the ceiling from the floor, clutching his head - he's rolled out of bed, tossing and turning. His body feels heavier than it has before, soaking wet with sweat, and whenever he closes his eyes, his mind's eye is blinded from the flashes. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">What...?</span></i><br /> <br /> With a deep breath, he envisions his body jolting awake, weaving an imago to keep his breath steady and the ache at bay.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx casts Life 2 &quot;Body Control&quot; and garners 1 success. </b><br /> <b>Potency:</b> 3<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Self.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> 1 Week.<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Dedicated Tool (+1), High Speech (+2)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Life 2 &quot;Body Control&quot;: Life (3) + Gnosis (1) + High Speech (2) + Dedicated Tool (+1) - Potency (6)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 2 Free Reach: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 on Advanced Duration.<br /> <b>Total dice pool:</b> 1 dice. </span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/516312\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Life 2 &quot;Body Control&quot; \u2192 1 success.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Feeling relief, Oscar sits upright as he reaches for his phone. &quot;<i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Burde snakke med noen, men...</span></i>&quot; As he looks through his almost empty list of contacts, he grimaces. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Note to self, <i>husk \u00e5 sp\u00f8rre de om de </i>forbanna<i> telefonnummerene deres.</i></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Translation:</b> </span>&quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I should talk with someone, but... Note to self, remember to fucking ask the others for their phone numbers.</span>&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Man, you alright in there? Heard something fall.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Nightmares,</span>&quot; Oscar replies to Ewan through the door. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">You using the shower?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Nah, I'm off for my morning run, you wanna join?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">No thanks. Have a good run.</span>&quot; Tossing his blanket onto the bed, Oscar sits down on the edge of it and rubs his temples. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">How do I ... Wait...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He rummages through his clothes for the calling card Valentine gave him, and when he finds it, he studies it for a moment. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">I'd rather talk to Ragnar. Or Phoenix. But...</span></i> He considers carefully, spends fifteen minutes drafting a message, and once content, sends it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx sends a text to the phone number Valentine gave him:</b></span> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><i>Had</i></span> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">horrible nightmares. Related to that encounter we had in the alley. Is this normal? Yours, your friendly neighbourhood cat.</span></i>&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He then tosses his phone aside and makes for the shower.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 05-13-2017, 11:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T12:53:56-07:00","id":1092060,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You breathe in Life, invigorating your body and easing the tension in your muscles almost instantaneously. Your body simply obeys your will and recovers from the strain it experienced during the night. <br /> <br /> You see numbers for Valentine, Mathias, and Boomer in your phone. You send your message to Valentine, but he doesn't respond right away. By the time you send it, Ewan has already left and you have the apartment to yourself.<br /> <br /> Taking a warm shower further helps to relax your body and your mind. After a leisurely shower, you check your phone again and see a brief message back from Valentine:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:gray\"><i>Probably. Not surprised after what you've been through. Try to take it easy this week.</i></span><br /> <br /> He obviously doesn't seem too concerned. You do remember while reading his text that your syllabus included Ragnar's cell phone. You also have a contact number for Ouroboros Ophis, although you're not sure if the instructor gave a work number or his personal cell.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'll leave it up to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a> to indicate whether Ophis would be the kind of course instructor to give out a cell phone on his syllabus or not. Many TAs I knew in grad school would, so I'm making an assumption for Ragnar.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T13:59:52-07:00","id":1092089,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 5 - Arcane Beats: 5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Well, that's not very helpful.</span></i><br /> <br /> Oscar grumbles as he looks for his syllabus - his room's a mess after the last week, but eventually he finds it folded in one of his books. He mutters Ragnar's name - &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Collins, Collins... there it is.&quot;</span> - and once he finds the associated number, calls immediately.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T15:39:50-07:00","id":1092122,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar is aware the whole time that he's having a dream, but that doesn't lessen the fear he feels as the dream proceeds, and repeats over and over. Finally, he is able to wrench himself awake. He jerks and lies still for a few moments, his heart pounding and his chest heaving. He then leaps out of bed and snatches his silver dagger from the drawer of his bedside table, ready to weave an Imago of... what? <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">A one-trick pony, Ragnar, that's what you are. You can't even do combat magic yet. You screwed over that mage Saturday, but that's it. </span></i>What he needed was knowledge of Fraying. Mathias and Valentine had mentioned that as being the ability to start damaging things and people with magic, but he wasn't powerful enough to do that yet. It would take him time to understand Fate or Time enough to use Fraying, and time wasn't on his side. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>He's coming. </i></span>He hadn't discussed it enough with Mathias or Valentine yet, but he had the feeling that unlike what Sleepers thought, dreams really were prophetic- at least for Awakened, or maybe just for Acanthi. And there had been that laughter. In his mind's eye, the shadowy hand had reached forward to place Alux on the board in place of the mage. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Would the real Emperor Palpatine please stand up? </span></i><br /> <br /> Before he can do anything else, his phone begins to buzz with an incoming call. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Coincidence? Yeah right. </span></i>He immediately snatches it up answers. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Simon Collins speaking.&quot; </span><i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">Oh, it is way too early in the morning for me to sound that awake. </span></i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T16:19:50-07:00","id":1092138,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experience: 1 - Arcane Experience: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Simon Collins speaking.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Ragnar?</span>&quot; Lynx huffs as he flops into bed, trying to suppress the lingering anxiety in his voice. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Thank fuck. Sorry for calling this early, I just... Look, I...</span>&quot; He fumbles for words. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">So. Uh. It's 6:30, so... that's a thing.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx facepalms. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Look, this is going to sound stupid, but I had this nightmare about... about that alleyway encounter with our, uh... paradoxical friend, and it's got me really freaked out, and Valentine wasn't much help and I don't know what to think or do-</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Great. I sound like a buffoon.</span></i><br /> <br /> He groans audibly and buries his face deeper into his palm. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm sorry, it's just, you're my closest friend, and I don't know who else to turn to, and...</span>&quot; He sighs as the self-loathing hits him. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Fuck me. I just woke you up because I had a nightmare, what the hell am I doing?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T21:36:34-07:00","id":1092224,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar listens to Lynx, growing more and more convinced by the second. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Yep. Not a coincidence. </span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Fuck me. I just woke you up because I had a nightmare, what the hell am I doing?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;No, it's fine.&quot; </span>Ragnar says, grim. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Alone in the alley, can't do anything, a voice laughing in the background? Yeah, I had the same nightmare. I'm willing to bet money that Phoenix, Moonstone, and Binder had it, too.&quot; </span>He wipes a hand over his face. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Listen, to tell you the truth... I'm kind of terrified, because I don't think I'm actually a very good mage.&quot; </span>He relates the story of his fight with the strange mage to Lynx, how nothing he did seemed to turn the tide, and how he was in dire straits until Moonstone and Phoenix showed up. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I feel like I needed to learn this all a long time ago, and now we have less then a week before we have to stop this thing from hurting a bunch of people. I know I'm all snark and wit on the outside, but inside? I'm just as clueless as everybody else.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-14T16:36:17-07:00","id":1092569,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Valentine, Moonstone must admit, is a good fit for him as a teacher. He's strict and specific. The elder Mastigos knows the workings of the mind, and it helps guide Moonstone out of his own arrogance and preconceptions about magic, rather than pushing him into a corner. It fits well with learning High Speech and organizing his thoughts according to the Supernal language. With a bit of work, he steps outside the prison of his own pride, and learns almost like a fresh student.<br /> <br /> Before he leaves for the day, he releases one more fear. It's easier to speak mind-to-mind than say it aloud: <span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>&lt;I see now how little I know. My future isn't with the Arrow. I want to learn control over my magic from a place of humility. I wish to join the Guardians of the Veil.&gt;</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Pattern scouring again in the morning. Completed my 'Gain a Familiar' Aspiration and replaced it with 'Investigate La Grange Park.'</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The lesson of this dream is: <i><span style=\"color:#008080\">I urgently need to learn defensive magic.</span></i><br /> <br /> He wakes up with a start. Moonstone's Fear is looming over his chest like a classical nightmare, but he's not afraid. It's just...there.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I don't hate you,&quot;</span> he explains to the Goetic reflection, <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;but I'm glad you're out of me.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The awful silhouette is just part of the scenery. It's helpful to meditate on. Fear arises in the mind, but its external source is merely another part of the world.<br /> <br /> After his morning exercise, vigorous dancing, and some hot tea, he crosses his legs and meditates on the kitchen counter with Valentine's business card in his hands. He opens his Mind with a relatively simple act of magic, expecting his newfound mentor to hear him: <i><span style=\"color:#008080\">&lt;Good morning. Dreamed of Alux in the alley (still can't remember summoning it) but felt no fear. The ritual succeeded. I expected that would be the end of Abyssal nightmares, since Spade excised the bad dream itself, but last night was intense and focused, over and over, with traces of a 'laughing man.' Feeling that my dreams are under attack. Don't think it's paranoia. Maybe an injection of dream-poison by a rival warlock.&gt;</span></i><br /> <br /> Addendum: <i><span style=\"color:#008080\">&lt;Not afraid of Alux, but afraid of my thoughts and dreams being unsafe. Already vulnerable in this arena. Need to feel confident in distinguishing Fallen World mental illness from external attack by a Mind mage.&gt;</span></i><br /> <br /> Addendum: <i><span style=\"color:#008080\">&lt;god, listen to me, i'm rambling telepathically. feel like i'm leaving a long voicemail. sorry, sorry. ignore me. enjoy your breakfast. sorry&gt;</span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 05-24-2017, 12:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-14T17:10:58-07:00","id":1092577,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Well, yeah, of course you're clueless,</span>&quot; Lynx sighs softly. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Don't beat yourself up over it now. You've been awake for how long now, a couple of weeks? Barely a week and a half for me. Fuck if I know what I'm doing. Before we met Mathias, you hadn't met any other experiences mages either, right? We'll learn together.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm glad you're okay, though. I don't know what I'd...</span>&quot; He pauses for a moment, deliberating momentarily before he steers away from that particular sentence. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">If you think Phoenix, Moonstone and Binder had the same nightmare, shouldn't we get in touch with them as quickly as possible? I mean, what if, I dunno, Alux suddenly came knocking on your door?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <i><b>Knock. Knock. Knock.</b></i><br /> <br /> Lynx bolts upright and fumbles with his phone, cursing quietly and rapidly in Norwegian.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Oy, Oscar, I don't mean to interrupt whatever you're doing in there,</span>&quot; Ewan calls rather loudly, &quot;<span style=\"color:#DAA520\">I forgot to buy food yesterday, mind if I fix myself a sandwich outta your stuff?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Faen da</span></i>,&quot; Lynx whimpers. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Y</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">eah, sure. Don't eat all of the cheese,</span>&quot; Lynx replies, trying to keep his voice steady. He waits until he hears Ewan's footsteps fade away.<span style=\"color:#800000\"> &quot;Sorry, roommate,</span>&quot; he adds to Ragnar. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Could we maybe get together, like, right now? As in, <i>now</i>? You can use your magic to track down the others. Or did you get their numbers? I didn't.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-15T18:50:23-07:00","id":1093059,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 4/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Don't beat yourself up over it now. You've been awake for how long now, a couple of weeks?&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;A couple months, actually,&quot;</span>Ragnar groans and he sits back down on the bed. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I was hiking the Appalachian Trail when I Awakened. It took me about that long to figure out how to do my luck spell.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm glad you're okay, though. I don't know what I'd...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Ragnar doesn't finish the sentence for Lynx. But the implications are... well. You don't say stuff like that to people who are just friends.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Could we maybe get together, like, right now? As in, <i>now</i>? You can use your magic to track down the others. Or did you get their numbers? I didn't.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Yeah, I did. Meet me at my place as soon as possible.&quot;</span> Ragnar gives Lynx his address and then hangs up.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Do I need to tell them to get here, or is Fate going to be nice enough to send them for me? </i></span>\u200bRagnar reaches out and peers forward in Time, trying to see the answer to the riddle before him.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will cast Divination. One free Reach, spent on a specific answer to the question: <span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><i>Are events transpiring to bring the others towards me without me telling them where to go? </i></span>Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Path Tool 1 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/516822\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He then sends a text to the others: <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">I just got off the phone with Lynx. Looks like we both had the same nightmare about you-know-who. Phoenix, Moonstone, Binder, I assume you guys had it too?</span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 05-15-2017, 09:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-15T20:00:09-07:00","id":1093071,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> At the conclusion of your lesson, when you crystallize your thoughts and attempt to project them to Valentine, there is a moment in which your mentor blinks and studies you quizzically. And then, shortly after, you feel a phantom breeze and a chill down your spine as Valentine asserts his will on the world...and your mind.<br /> <br /> You have an odd sensation like an itch on the edge of your senses, or of your skin brushing against leaves as you try to walk through a forest of large trees. Then, you <i>feel</i> more than <i>hear</i> Valentine's consciousness pressing up against yours: <i><span style=\"color:gray\">&lt;Very well. Then watch others, and yourself, for the temptation of hubris. We will talk further another time.&gt;</span></i><br /> <br /> In this moment, admitting to Valentine -- and yourself -- that you might not be destined for the Adamantine Arrow requires vulnerability. And Valentine listens. You <i>feel</i> him listening, understanding the meaning and intent behind your thoughts more than just hearing the words.<br /> <br /> On the next day, when you try to project your thoughts to Valentine again, he either willfilly ignores you, fails to hear you, or cannot currently respond. You hear nothing but silence, the void of which threatens to summon those images from your dream. Just because they don't scare you doesn't mean they are comforting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You send your Sight forward to the near future, trying to fix your gaze on the river of Time at the point where the present meets up with it. Glimpses and intuitions present a clear message: <i>These events are pulling you to them, and them to you.</i> But then you realize that you're not sure if you are texting them because that they are going to seek you out, or if they are seeking you out because you texted them.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I think it's safe to say that at least one person had the foresight to ask everyone for their contact information, and Ragnar strikes me as the person who would do that, so I'm cool with him doing this.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder and Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> You each receive Ragnar's text message. You aren't sure what he's talking about.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone and Phoenix</b><br /> Oh, you <i>definitely</i> know what Ragnar is talking about. But that's just a coincidence, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T05:08:48-07:00","id":1094084,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm just gonna say Phoenix eats the energy bar and scours his Pattern for Mana as practice, rather than roleplay it out for the sake of brevity. I'll go for Presence, making it 2 dots. Now, he's done this when training with Boomer, and if I remember correctly that was around 11 AM, so he's gonna regain that dot in 5 hours if that's the case.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, I'm assuming that Phoenix doesn't regain a WP because his sleep wasn't restful.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Is it asking too much to have a break? Really?<br /> <br /> Whatever. I tear away from bed, checking my phone. Boomer wants me to call back about mana? Okay...<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Phoenix here, what's up?</span>&quot; I greet her. She explains there's unstable tass in La Grange. I guess I could go for quick recharge. I mean, if I can't recharge my mundane batteries, I can at least recharge the magical ones. The others might need some, too. Just after I hang up, I get a text from Ragnar.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">I just got off the phone with Lynx. Looks like we both had the same nightmare about you-know-who. Phoenix, Moonstone, Binder, I assume you guys had it too?</span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><i>Yup. Can't be a coincidence. Boomer told me about a place where we can get some juice. Good time to call?</i></span><br /> <br /> \u200bThat didn't sound kinky in my head, I swear. Ugh, I need some coffee...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T17:38:50-07:00","id":1094358,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><i>Yup. Can't be a coincidence. Boomer told me about a place where we can get some juice. Good time to call?</i></span><br /> <br /> Ragnar raises an eyebrow. He has a good idea where Boomer told Phoenix to go. He replies with <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Sure</span></i>. When Phoenix calls, he answers immediately. Before Phoenix can even say a word, he says, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Let me guess, it's in La Grange, right?&quot; </span><i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bNo, it's not </span><b><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">at all </span></b><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">spooky that I know that. </span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 05-18-2017, 08:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T21:04:33-07:00","id":1096155,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If you haven't done so recently, please update your post header with correct stats (e.g., remove all bashing damage) and active spell list. Also, I am going to review the list of current aspirations tomorrow or Thursday, so please review your character sheet here on the OOC thread to make sure that you have 3 current aspirations (2 short-term, 1 long-term).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ragnar soon sends out a group text to everyone in the Stormeborne cabal, helping you to stay in contact and inviting everyone over to La Grange to investigate this odd disturbance together. After successfully dealing with the surprisingly annoying difficulties that you've realized come up when you don't have each others' phone numbers, you also use this opportunity to save everyone's number to your phone contacts list, if interested.<br /> <br /> It's early in the morning when the cabal gathers, but the sun still rises early here in September, so the dark sky quickly gives way to grays and then a bright, colorful sunrise. Those of you native to the Chicago area or who have spent more time in the western suburbs know that La Grange Park isn't a literal park; it's technically the name of the entire town due north of La Grange, IL. However, the town does include a large stretch of the Salt Creek Woods, the protected woodlands that overlaps with and extends east of Bemis Woods<br /> <br /> Because some of you are coming into town early, your group decides to gather at the Stone Avenue Metra station on the BNSF Railway. From there, assuming none of you have a car here, you decide to take a brisk morning walk to the neighborhood that Boomer and Dante each independently informed your group about. Boomer had said that there might be something odd going on around Edgewood, Malden, and Woodlawn Avenue, and that stretch of road is only about a mile's walk to the north.<br /> <br /> At first blush, as you might completely expect for a pleasant suburban neighborhood on a Monday morning, the area seems calm and inviting. You walk past Nazareth Academy, a college-prep Catholic high school, and a retirement community, and make your way to the blocks that Boomer was mentioning. Nothing seems immediately out of place.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may each make a perception check (Wits + Composure).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You thought you sensed it a few blocks away, back by the prep school, but now that you are closer to Edgewood Avenue you definitely feel the hairs rise on the back of your neck. Something is triggering your Peripheral Sight.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> As the cabal walks north of the retirement community building, you start to feel a tingle of energy passing up an down your spine, signaling something on your Periphery. If anything, the sensation begins to grow as you walk north towards the woods. <i>Something</i> feels off to you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Typos 05-24-2017, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T22:12:17-07:00","id":1096170,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Moonstone only moved to the suburbs after Hakim was banished from the old sanctum in Chicago proper, and his distance from Sleepers has kept him from integrating more than he had to. But with his fear lifted and bound, he's feeling adventurous this morning. He wore a suburban tax professional's sweater, made small talk with the cashier who sold him an overpriced coffee and sticky donut, read the local paper, and has been animatedly babbling about it since they left the train station.<br /> <br /> He also brought his sword in a duffel bag over his shoulder. His chained nightmare of Alux (<span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>&quot;don't worry, he's tame!&quot;</i></span>) lurks behind him in Twilight. He's relaxed, but he's not getting caught off guard again.<br /> <br /> 