-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> The opportunity to get some more Mana is a welcome expedition for Ragnar. He had run down his batteries so to speak fighting the mage, and the sudden Mana surge close to him was too good of an opportunity. He looks uneasily at the space next to- <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">or behind, damn it, I hate spirits- </span></i>Moonstone, but tries to walk close to Lynx and Binder. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Welcome to my neck of the woods,&quot; </span>he says with a crooked smile. It's pleasantly warm out, even for this early in the morning, and it's nice spending time with the others outside of the snide comments and political intrigue that had surrounded the Consilium meeting.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, Lynx and Ophis both tense. He sees both of them get that faraway look that signals the Sight. He looks around warily. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Okay, so the spirit guy and the ghost guy both have their weirdness sensors going off. </i></span><br /> <br /> Ragnar doesn't have any talent for Spirit, but it seems that it's very similar to Life in some respects, even if it operates on a more symbolic or archetypal basis than the very concrete rules of Life. Death, however, is completely foreign. In his mind, it is simultaneously partnered with and yet in opposition to Life, both of which ebb and flow in accordance with the tempo of Time and the calculations and ordinances of Fate. Plus, whatever they are seeing is invisible to him. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Talk to us, guys. What's up?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits 2 + Composure 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/519153\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 05-25-2017, 12:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T20:52:43-07:00","id":1096586,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> As you're walking and talking with the rest of the Stormborne, you're also keenly studying the neighborhood. While doing so, you notice something strange: the streets are unusually quiet for this time of day. On a normal weekday morning, there would be a string of cars on the street as people leave for work, especially for those who need to commute to Chicago or one of the other suburbs to the east. Your guess is that the traffic and pedestrian activity here is simply too quiet.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> As far as you can tell, this is just a pleasant suburban neighborhood. Nothing too exciting going on here, right? Something else catches your eye, though. You notice some odd flowering plants cropping up here and there in the lawns in front of people's houses on this street. They look kind of like bright purple dandelions. You only see a few at first, and they look so much like wildflowers or weeds that you didn't even notice them at first. But as your group walks further north along Edgewood Avenue, you see more and more of the plants on the lawns in front of the houses, and in some cases, actually growing on the trees lining the street. You might be able to study them better if you look at some close up.<br /> <br /> When you take a deep breath and open your Sight to the Primal Wild, you are taken aback at the ephemeral activity around you. There isn't just a single spirit here floating in Twilight; there are easily <i>dozens</i>, of various sizes and shapes. They seem intent on studying the odd flowers, but many of them are scuttling or floating to the north or east, heading down another nearby street like insects attracted to a bright light.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> A block or two ahead of you, on the quiet street you notice two different people going about their business. Nothing seems odd at first glance, but you look back and realize that both individuals are moving extremely slowly. They seem lethargic and tired. One is a man probably in his mid-30s, wearing a suit and tie with a briefcase in his hand. He's shuffling his feet but barely moving from his front door to his car parked in the driveway; he looks like the might fall asleep or fall over at any time. The other is a young child, a girl perhaps around 8 years old. She's sitting on a bicycle with her head plopped down and resting on her arms, which are lazily crossed on top of the handlebars. Every minute or so, she idly yawns and rings the bell on her bike. She doesn't even look in your direction as your cabal walks past her house.<br /> <br /> By Seeing the world through the lens of Death, you can tell that both individuals are alive and have intact souls. You also see several ghosts wandering the streets. That doesn't surprise you like it used to, but something seems very odd about their behavior. First, they are moving very quickly and energetically, and with a <i>purpose</i> that the other ghosts you've seen before were seemingly lacking. Secondly, they are all generally moving in the same direction, further north and east towards a nearby part of the neighborhood. Finally, and perhaps most surprisingly, you don't sense any Anchors around here for any of the ghosts. You know from experience that without an Anchor in the area, ghosts will rapidly lose Essence and ultimately cross over to the Underworld. So why are these ghosts ignoring their own &quot;survival&quot; instincts of their afterlife to come here? And where are they going?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> Something about this place just feels <i>off</i> to you. This isn't something you are detecting on your Periphery; it's just an intuition that something around here seems odd. As you look around for the source of that feeling, you realize that every house on this street has its doors, curtains, shutters, or blinds closed. You feel stifled just being in the proximity of this street. The people around here are either remarkably private, or very withdrawn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-25T09:28:06-07:00","id":1096768,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> Even as Ragnar looks around, he finally becomes aware of the nagging thought that has in the back of his mind. He's all too familiar with the behavior of suburbanites who keep to themselves, but this is ridiculous. There should be mothers and fathers coming back from dropping children off at school, or leaving to go to their 9-to-5. This is the stereotype of the sleepy, withdrawn suburban development taken up to eleven. He doesn't hear the familiar chiming of bells that normally alerts him to the working of magic, but maybe that's because this is out of his league? Is there some subtle magical presence, too discrete and ubiquitous for his Sight to notice? Or is it because somebody came and worked the magic before they arrived?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Anybody else getting a 'too quite' feeling from this place?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar will attempt to figure out what he can about he situation through brainpower. Intelligence 4 + Occult 3 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/519588\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-25T10:38:40-07:00","id":1096789,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: Life &amp; Spirit<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#006400\">You felt it too, right, son?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Oh,</span>&quot; Lynx stammers for a moment, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Talk to us, guys. What's up?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Purple dandelions,</span>&quot; Lynx blurts out, pointing at lawns and trees, as he surveys the area through the lens mundane and magical. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Not just on the lawns, but on the actual trees, look. Also, dozens upon dozens of spirits floating around in Twilight. Some of them are mesmerised by those purple dandelions, but others are floating down that street over there,</span>&quot; he gestures, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Attracted to something.</span>&quot; He frowns. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">At least it's not... you-know-what floating around.</span>&quot; <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Yet</span>.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I think we need to check out some of those dandelions, but I don't think examining them alone is a good idea, so... if anybody good with biology, or with Life, could help me, that'd be swell.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 05-30-2017, 07:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-26T09:15:32-07:00","id":1097155,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active (Matter/Death/Life) | <b>Active Spells: </b>Speak with the Dead (1 Scene, affects anyone within arm's reach)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats/Exp: </b>2/2 | <b>Arc. Beats/Exp:</b> 1/0</div> <br /> <i>*Any of you close to Ouroboros can perceive Death entities and phenomena in twilight*</i><br /> <br /> Ophis clears his throat - <span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;I am a renowned biologist and a... I think the term is <i>Disciple</i> of the Mysteries of Life. I will take at look at those dandelions&quot;</b></span> - he points to the few people on the street and to the pletora of ghosts to those that aproach enough- <span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;This is all backwards, the living seems drained and slugish, barely able to act, while the dead seems energized and focused. They are also ignoring their own deep seated survival instincts, there is no Anchor at all in the vincinity, their Essence must be draining at a fast pace but they don't seem to care either, same as those Spirits seem to be attracted to the dandelions the ghosts only focus is going north-east into the neighborhood. Should we follow?&quot;</b></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Analizing the dandelions from a purely biological point:<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/519860\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes (reduced from 4 because I forgot the -2 penalty due to the Active Sight)</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">1 Mana to add Life to Active Sight</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-26T23:17:57-07:00","id":1097435,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Too quiet is right.&quot;</span> Moonstone muses. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I say we follow the ephemerals. They usually have a better idea of what's going on than Sleepers do.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Purple or not, dandelions are weeds. Maybe they're draining the life from the locals, converting it, and blooming with Essence for the spirits to eat?&quot;</span> He doesn't sound overly bothered by it. Aren't mystical ecosystems fascinating?<br /> <br /> That sluggish little girl on the sidewalk looks like a good case study. He breaks off from the cabal to silently squat in front of her bike and look her in the eye, even laying two fingers on her forehead like he's checking her temperature. Does her lethargy reflect in Pandemonium?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Activating Mind+Space Sight, with an eye towards seeing whether or not the Sleepers outside are under some magical Mind effect.<br /> <br /> Casting my praxis, Time 1 Divination, on the girl at touch range. 1 free reach for instant cast, 1 free reach for more detailed questions and answers.<br /> Gnosis 1+Time 2, 3 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/520014\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes.</a><br /> I get two questions about the future: <b>How will her condition change by this time tomorrow? </b>and <b>Will removing her from the presence of the dandelions end her lethargy?</b><br /> <br /> I'm also gonna cast Mind 1 Mental Scan on her at touch range. 1 free reach for instant cast, 1 free reach to read her surface thoughts.<br /> Gnosis 1+Mind 2-Potency 2, 1 die: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/520015\" target=\"_blank\">failure.</a> Since I have at least 1 die in the pool and no Paradox, I'll &quot;take 1&quot; and try again until I succeed.<br /> Potency 3 withstood by her Composure, presumably 2. Question: <b>In what ways is her mind being altered?</b></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-29T06:12:34-07:00","id":1098084,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You run through a few ideas in your head, using your budding knowledge of Supernal magic and the arcane, and generate a few possible working hypotheses. <br /> <br /> There's the possibility that the magic here was created by a much powerful mage, but you know that Mathias' spells can still give you that odd feeling on your Periphery of your Sight. Perhaps this mage, if one is indeed involved, also used some way to mask or obscure the source of his magic? But you're not even sure if this is caused by a mage or a spell; for all you know, some ephemeral entity could have caused this. <br /> <br /> You definitely could be seeing the aftermath of a spell. You know that you only detect active effects on your Periphery, not passive ones, so you might need to enhance the focus of your Sight to detect or learn more. <br /> <br /> There's also the possibility that you're too far away from the source to detect the phenomenon directly. Your Sight only picks up on supernatural effects within the nearby vicinity. With Ouroboros Ophis' spell on you, you can now visibly see the collection of energized ghosts moving further to the north and east, heading down the street to the right and then turning north again. Perhaps they know something you don't. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> Studying the small dandelion-like plants with your mundane senses shows that these flowers look remarkably like any other plant. Their apparent biology is natural, other than for their unusual color.<br /> <br /> With your arcane senses, you are able to discern more useful information to help you better understand this phenomenon. Unsurprisingly, your Matter Sight reveals nothing about these living objects, but you <i>are</i> surprised to see through the lens of Death a faint wisp of energy leaking out of the plant. Are they leaking...Essence?<br /> <br /> Your Life Sight further reveals that there are no apparent toxins or diseases in this plant. If you had to guess, they would be safe to eat. The flowers are thriving, suffused with energy -- more lively than just <i>alive</i>.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Opacity of this Mystery is 4.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> As you approach her, the little girl barely moves. She doesn't react when you move to squat in front of her other than to ring her bell again and move her eyes to track you. She has a confused look on her face. She blinks when you touch her forehead. <br /> <br /> Opening your Sight reveals that there are no scrying windows or other odd phenomena related to the domain of Space, so at least there is nothing supernatural trapping these people in this location. You can tell at a glance using your Mind Sight that both people here, including the girl, are incredibly lethargic mentally, comparable to a state of relaxed daydreaming but not yet asleep. Your companions, in contrast, all appear focused and alert.<br /> <br /> Channeling your will into your magic, you envision the smoke and brimstone of Pandemonium swirling around the girl and funneling into two different directions, to the past and the future. You follow the movements of the haze and divine the following: <i>If nothing changes, she will be comatose or lifeless. If removed from this area, her energy will gradually return.</i><br /> <br /> Scanning the girl's mind reveals half-formed ideas, sluggish thinking, and an overpowering urge to nap. The best way to describe it is excessive sleepiness. She simply isn't thinking much, or very clearly. She's struggling to form words, but you catch the intent in her mind despite her never opening her mouth: <i>Who are you?</i> and <i>What's wrong with my mom and dad?</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-29T11:17:27-07:00","id":1098159,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Active Sight (Mind, Space) | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Moonstone's eyes are dilated. Through his Sight, the little girl on the bike becomes a captive bound on an altar, and the smoke rising from the sacrifice of her Mind is a divinatory omen about possible futures. The captive can't speak, but her thoughts spill past the chains if he listens closely. He smiles sweetly at her. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Don't worry. I'm a magician. We're going to wake everyone up.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The ordered suburban grid of cross-streets and sidewalks and painted houses and manicured lawns is revealed in Pandemonium as a maddening cubic labyrinth, suddenly jutting up at right angles or disappearing down an inescapable cul-de-sac. Demons of the sin of sloth are lounging on driveways and rooftops, weighing their prisoners down with their leaden bulk, while Clive Barker-esque slave drivers whip vigor and activity into the ghostly parade as they're herded deeper into the maze. The interaction of Ophis' Deathly spell with his own Supernal perception is a strange feeling: the ghosts had always been trapped in Pandemonium by their own obsessions, he now realizes; he's just never looked from the right angle to see them.<br /> <br /> He rejoins the group and starts babbling at once. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;They've been utterly mazed, but not by a spell. I read her mind. The people know that something's wrong, but they can't see it clearly. That's the Sleeping Curse for you. And their chains are only getting tighter: comatose or dead by tomorrow morning. But! Taking little Dorothy and her friends away from the field of opium poppies- er, dandelions- will clear things up. That means killing the flowers should break their chains, too.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He stares after the ghosts. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Where in Aion's name are those sinners shuffling off to? I should be able to read the labyrinth from here, or rather, the street layout. I wish you all could see it, Hell is absolutely <i>beautiful </i>in the suburbs!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> After digging his trusty mirror out of his bag, he falls in line with one of the ghosts and starts walking backwards, looking at the many-angled maze's reflection to see their ultimate destination.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Improvising a Space 1 Knowing spell: &quot;Where exactly are these ghosts going?&quot;<br /> <br /> 1 free reach for instant cast, 1 free reach for sensory range, no paradox.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1+Space 2+Tool 1. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/520598\" target=\"_blank\">success</a>. I'm hoping for an answer in the form of &quot;what is their end destination as they understand it,&quot; but a simple address or landmark would be good too.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T04:06:59-07:00","id":1098392,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#006400\">I am a renowned biologist and a... I think the term is Disciple of the Mysteries of Life. I will take at look at those dandelions.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Renowned, huh,</span>&quot; Lynx glances at Ouroboros. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Wonder if he knows of dad.</span></i> When his senses are opened to the realm of the Dead, he shudders. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">The dead, huh. They're so...dead.</span>&quot; He buries his own face in his palms. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Well done, Captain Obvious.</span></i> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">Purple or not, dandelions are weeds. Maybe they're draining the life from the locals, converting it, and blooming with Essence for the spirits to eat?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">That's...awfully specific.</span>&quot; Lynx follows the good doctor and studies the plants with him. He shifts between his Life and Spirit senses, observing the essence leaking out. He reaches out to gently touch the seeping material, before he brushes over the flower's head. Before he gets a chance to study it properly, however, his Senses fizzle - he clutches his head as the Veil is drawn before him. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Fuck, that hurts...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">As Lynx has no Willpower, his Mage Senses end after a minute.</span></b></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">They've been utterly mazed, but not by a spell. I read her mind. The people know that something's wrong, but they can't see it clearly. That's the Sleeping Curse for you. And their chains are only getting tighter: comatose or dead by tomorrow morning. But! Taking little Dorothy and her friends away from the field of opium poppies- er, dandelions- will clear things up. That means killing the flowers should break their chains, too.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">The spirits were gathering in those directions,</span>&quot; Lynx points down the street, grimacing. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Before we go become serial flower-murderers, maybe we should figure out what's going on? Bigger picture or something like that.</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T21:26:09-07:00","id":1098655,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> Ironically, looking into the mirror reveals the answer you seek in both its literal and symbolic reflection: An internal compass springs into existence in your mind, and it seems to be pointing due northeast. From where you are standing, facing to the north on Edgewood Avenue, you see the ghosts passing east along Woodlawn Avenue and then back north at the next block over, Malden Avenue.<br /> <br /> You have only rarely had the opportunity to see ghosts -- truly <i>see</i> them in the literal sense, due to your previous lack of Mage Sight as a Sleepwalker. However, you've helped Hakim's previous cabal with various exorcisms, and you've seen what a ghost is capable of when it is intelligent and <i>alert</i>. Perhaps that's why you aren't stunned when you see the closest ghost, a feminine specter with wavy hair and large round eyes, turn to you suddenly and reach out to you. She touches a finger to your forehead, and a vivid vision fills your mind: A massive cloud of Essence, swirling above the houses in a nearby neighborhood. And with the vision, you feel an <i>ache</i>, a hunger, to stand in that storm of Essence. The craving is stronger than any urge you could imagine. It's pure desire, distilled into obsession.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm modifying your spell because I think the cost needs to be reflected differently in your spell factors. By using a Space Knowing spell in this way, you're essentially modifying Locate Object, but using it to find a specific location rather than an object. I think that the primary factor should be Duration, and the spell gives you an innate sense of the destination as long as it lies within the Area of the spell; if the destination is outside of the Area, you know the most direct route to it. This makes it comparable to the Pathfinder Numen, which makes more sense to me thematically.<br /> <br /> The ghost's Numen gives you the Obsession condition until you accomplish its mission, which is to travel to the heart of the Mystery nearby. Until then, any spell cast or action you take that does not directly relate to finding or traveling to this location loses the 10-again quality; any action taken to pursue the mission grants 9-again.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> With your enhanced Sight, you study and sniff the dandelions. To your Sight, similar to what Ophis likely experienced, you see that the plant is seemingly mundane but brimming with internal energy. It is clearly free of any toxins or mundane poison, and appears entirely harmless from an organic perspective. In fact...the more you look at the dandelion, the more it reminds you of the mushrooms you harvested in your first Highstorm, the ones filled with mana inside. Smelling the floral wisps of Essence gently wafting from the dandelion further supports your theory.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Everyone else</b><br /> You feel a sense of something <i>shifting</i>, of something tugging at the edge of your consciousness, at the moment the ghost reaches out to Moonstone and places a finger on him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T22:55:37-07:00","id":1098667,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors), Obsessed (Reach the Essence Cloud) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> So cold on his skin, it's like being touched by a corpse-<br /> <br /> Oh. <i>Oh. </i>His breath catches in his throat. <i>Now </i>he understands. The dark cloud, that's where it's all been leading. Won't it feel incredible to stand at the eye of the Essence storm and rise up to heaven on a column of cold wind? Maybe he would have noticed that something was wrong if he'd cast a Mind Shielding spell as he planned, but as it stands, disordered thinking and sudden obsessive urges are nothing new to him.<br /> <br /> He shakes his head and lets the cubic labyrinth and the devils of Pandemonium fade into his periphery. The ghosts stay. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Lynx is right. We need to go northeast now. All the spiritual Essence is swirling in a cloud above the rooftops, and I <i>need</i> it. The specter showed me through its eyes. Don't let them touch you, just come, follow me!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone runs down the middle of the street to the northeast where the ghosts are going, his duffel bag clunking on his back. His embodied Fear obediently drifts behind him in Twilight.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T01:22:32-07:00","id":1098690,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>@rwknoll</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your thoughts are hazy, as if just waking from a dream. You remember going into the portal, but very little after that. You catch a brief scent, or a memory of a scent, of stale air and remember the echo of water dripping. Otherwise, you have no memory of what happened in the portal.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>OOC: I'm running with this. All the way. Is Lynx going mad, or is it something else? You decide.</i></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#8B4513\">Remember the Highstorm?</span></i><br /> <br /> The images flash in his mind. Almost drowning. Shirt, removed. Ragnar, awkward. Dr. Asphodel...<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">What...? A... cave? Water? Mushrooms...? I...</span></i> <br /> <br /> Lynx clutches his head again, a look of pain painted on his face. The smell tickles his senses, yet the flickering images of what was beyond the portal...<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#8B4513\">Remember the Highstorm. Ragnar. Dr. Asphodel. Impossible architecture. Mushrooms. Mana. Remember?</span></i><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Who is this? ... Am I going mad?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Ragnar,</span>&quot; Lynx asks quietly as he picks the dandelion he studies. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Can I have a word in private?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes the handsome man aside, far enough from the others to be out of earshot. <br /> <br /> <b><i>To Ragnar.</i></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Do you remember the day we entered the Highstorm? All I could recall was stale air and echoes of dripping water, only these dandelions...</span>&quot; He wafts it in front of Ragnar's face. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">They remind me of mushrooms. I remember we picked them. They were suffused with mana. Do you remember that?</span>&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T06:47:50-07:00","id":1098748,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 2/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar watches the ghosts with fascination. Whereas his Sight always shows the living as wrapped in bright, noticeable red threads and flowing along the stream of time, ghosts seem to be just the opposite. Some of them do have threads around them, but they are nearly transparent and thin as spider silk. But each of them are wrapped in dark chains, thick and seemingly more solid than that which is material: a solemn procession of Jacob Marleys frozen at the moment of their deaths, dead rocks in a stream standing still among the mortal leaves floating by. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Iron? No, lead. But where do they lead to? The place of their death? </i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I figured that since Death Sight reveals the Anchored Condition, Ragnar would be able to see the connection to their Anchors as chains, but not necessarily understand what they are- being an Acanthus, he probably recognizes them as connections to something, but being connected to an Arcana he doesn't have, he doesn't know what they are connections to.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">They've been utterly mazed, but not by a spell. I read her mind. The people know that something's wrong, but they can't see it clearly. That's the Sleeping Curse for you. And their chains are only getting tighter: comatose or dead by tomorrow morning. But! Taking little Dorothy and her friends away from the field of opium poppies- er, dandelions- will clear things up. That means killing the flowers should break their chains, too.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Ragnar tilts his head. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I figured it was probably some sort of spell. But whatever works. We should get rid of these things, or at least take them away.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Before we go become serial flower-murderers, maybe we should figure out what's going on? Bigger picture or something like that.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Ragnar looks at the girl and feels a pang of remorse. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;We can't just leave them like this. At the very least, we should call somebody if we can't come back here.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Do you remember the day we entered the Highstorm? All I could recall was stale air and echoes of dripping water, only these dandelions...</span> <span style=\"color:#800000\">They remind me of mushrooms. I remember we picked them. They were suffused with mana. Do you remember that?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> As Lynx waves the dandelions in his face, Ragnar picks up a faint smell. Well, maybe not a scent; not in the mundane sense, anyways. But something like that. Some Supernal parallel. And Lynx's words conjure up a memory- not of mushrooms, but of Lynx... shirtless... and wet... and being wet himself. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Um... I don't remember the mushrooms. But I remember us...&quot;</span> he stares at Lynx for a second. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Did we fall into water or something?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Suddenly there's a shift. Ragnar's head snaps back over to Moonstone. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Moon, what the hell did you just do?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Lynx is right. We need to go northeast now. All the spiritual Essence is swirling in a cloud above the rooftops, and I </span><i>need</i><span style=\"color:#008080\"> it. The specter showed me through its eyes. Don't let them touch you, just come, follow me!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar looks from Moonstone to the flowers to the girl in bewilderment. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;But- the flowers- the people- Moon! What part of this does not strike you as a bad idea?! Oh for the love of-&quot; </span><br /> <br /> He dips his finger into the stream of Time.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar casts Time 1 Divination. 2 free Reach, one spent on Instant Casting and the other for specific answers: What is waiting for us at the heart of the Essence? Will waiting to help the Sleepers until after we handle the Essence increase their chances of dying?<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Path Tool 1 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521046\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T20:12:16-07:00","id":1099001,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You left so quickly that you're not even thinking clearly. It's a struggle for you to see beyond the &quot;mission&quot;, the hunger, forced into the front of your mind. You sprint north and cut to the east, running along Woodlawn Avenue as you make your way to the next block.<br /> <br /> Although you clearly are focused on moving, it's impossible not to notice something that your mind latches on to: There are a <i>lot</i> more of those purple &quot;dandelions&quot; growing here. They are sprouting throughout every lawn on this street, clumping densely in some places. Patches of lawn are still plainly visible, but the grass is harder to see in some places.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> Your mind reels. Which thoughts are real? Which are just dreams or false memories? Why are you thinking of mushrooms and being shirtless?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Go ahead and roll Resolve + Composure.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> <i>Something</i> about Lynx's question calls out to you, pulling at memories like grasping at shadows.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Please roll Resolve + Composure.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Time freezes, recoils, and stretches forward. Images flicker through your mind, almost faster than you can consciously remember or comprehend. Swirling clouds of energy, teeth, claws, and screams. You, alone in a field, surrounded by stoic strangers who suddenly collapse when you turn to face them. A young girl sobs, gasps, stops breathing.<br /> <br /> You know your answers, and feel a weight of certainty behind them, perhaps because of how near this potential future is. <i>A swarm of frenzied ghosts and feasting spirits, consuming the Essence flooding the neighorhood. Some Sleepers will be more vulnerable than others in that time, but </i>all<i> of them will be at a greater risk of dying if you wait to help them.</i><br /> <br /> The spell, of course, doesn't tell you which Sleepers are more vulnerable than others. It also doesn't indicate the best way to &quot;handle&quot; the Essence or help the Sleepers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T04:07:28-07:00","id":1099102,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521279\" target=\"_blank\">Resolve + Composure, 5 dice \u2192 1 success.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T08:02:53-07:00","id":1099526,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 4/7 Mana: 9/10 Health: <b>L</b>OOOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div> <br /> <br /> Binder sighs. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Dammit, Moonstone.&quot;</span> He stretches out a hand toward the young man as he sprints away out of sight, considers, then shakes his head. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Well, he's out of reach now, but I can try and prevent that from happening to the rest of us.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Mental Shield</i> (Mind 2)<br /> 2 Reach free: Spending 1 on Spell Control, 1 on advanced scale, 1 on advanced duration, 1 on advanced potency<br /> Containing Paradox 2 - 2 (dedicated tool) vs Wisdom 7 = 0 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521521\" target=\"_blank\">0</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521522\" target=\"_blank\">0</a> ... well, failed to contain, but fortunately, no paradox anyway!<br /> <br /> Yantras: Dedicated tool (-2 paradox)<br /> Factors: Potency 1, Duration week, range touch, subjects 5 (Binder, Lynx, Ragnar, Ophis, and Pheonix)<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 = 4 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521523\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> success! </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Drawing on the power of his knife, Binder silently builds the imago. He takes a moment to tap each of his nearby teammates before letting the spell settle over them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T13:21:51-07:00","id":1099626,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors), Obsessed (Reach the Essence Cloud) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 6/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 4/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> So nice to stop worrying for a change. Oh look, there are more flowers here, practically covering the lawn. How queer! Well, back to the Cloud...<br /> <br /> His eyebrow twitches. As he's running, his hand grips around his mirror. Turning the familiar shape and weight over in his hand helps clear his mind.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>&lt;I'm having an episode. The ghost unbalanced my thoughts.&gt;<br /> <br /> &lt;And I'm lucky it did! This the most fascinating Mystery I've ever encountered!&gt;<br /> <br /> &lt;At least let the cabal catch up. Stop and smell the flowers.&gt;</i></span><br /> <br /> Despite feeling anxious and impatient, he slows down and crouches near a dense patch of purple weeds. The stems are rough against his thumb. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;When did you grow, little lion's-tooth?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Moonstone poses a question in the High Speech. Visualizing the sacrificial smoke again in his Imago, this time he follows the trail that leads backward into the dandelion's past.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Time 1 Postcognition on a patch of dandelions, trying to see when exactly they were first seeded here. At what time did this phenomenon start? I figure that's Medium temporal sympathy, like &quot;an item that has been broken or built,&quot; so I have to overcome Withstand 2.<br /> <br /> 1 free reach for instant cast, 1 free reach for scene duration. No paradox.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1+Time 2+High Speech 2-Potency 2. 3 dice, no 10-again: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/521577\" target=\"_blank\">failure.</a> I spent 1 Mana for the attempt.<br /> <br /> Since Moonstone is Moonstone, and he's supernaturally Obsessed in a way that interferes with the spell, I'll make that a dramatic failure.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T20:59:35-07:00","id":1101097,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You don't have clear answers about the odd images that are still drifting through your mind, but for the moment at least, you are able to force yourself to focus on the problems at hand. You push the images and memories (if that's what they even are) into the corners of your mind.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I didn't see you allocate reach for instant casting, so I added that and modified your Paradox roll. Instead of being a chance die, that brings it to 1d10: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/522644\" target=\"_blank\">still no successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You take your brass knife, your Dedicated Tool, and gently touch it to your forehead as you craft your Imago: chains binding around each of you, keeping your minds intact and keeping foreign influence out. You feel the spell settle into place, but can already tell the extra effort it requires to maintain multiple spells simultaneously.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Despite your longing to follow the trail of Essence, you force yourself to stop and literally smell the flowers. Your efforts to keep the Imago in your mind, however, are futile: Even just thinking about the connection of this flower to this location is enough to prompt thoughts about how close you are to your destination. The Imago falters and fails, and you find yourself even more irritable. Why did you even think this would be a good use of your time? You <i>must</i> keep moving. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Take an arcane beat for the voluntary dramatic failure on the spell casting roll. You gain the Deprived condition as your Obsession deepens for trying to ignore it, taking an additional 1 die each from Stamina, Resolve, and Composure dice pools.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You hurriedly make your way by foot down the street where Ragnar told you to meet him and the rest of your cabal. Your unexpected phone call from your younger sister early this morning made you late getting here, and now you're searching for the others. You're heading north along Edgewood Avenue and are just starting to notice some peculiar purple flowers growing like weeds in people's lawns when you faintly hear Ragnar's voice in the distance:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;But- the flowers- the people- Moon! What part of this does not strike you as a bad idea?! Oh for the love of-&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 06-07-2017, 12:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T01:20:56-07:00","id":1101146,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Lynx is right. We need to go northeast now. All the spiritual Essence is swirling in a cloud above the rooftops, and I </span><span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>need</i></span><span style=\"color:#008080\"> it. The specter showed me through its eyes. Don't let them touch you, just come, follow me!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">What the arse...</span>&quot; Lynx mutters, more to himself, as his surroundings return to focus. He pushes the images out of sight and watches a delirious Moonstone dash off on his own. <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000CD\">But- the flowers- the people- Moon! What part of this does not strike you as a bad idea?! Oh for the love of-</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800080\">Dammit, Moonstone.</span>&quot; <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Moon Moon, hurr.</span></i> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800080\">Well, he's out of reach now, but I can try and prevent that from happening to the rest of us.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">That would be welcome right now, Binder,</span>&quot; Lynx rubs his temples before he returns his focus to the dandelion. He forms an Imago in his mind. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I want to <i>eat</i> this, though. It might contain mana.</span>&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx casts Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot; to determine if the dandelion is safe to eat, and garners 3 successes.</b><br /> <b>Potency:</b> 1<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Self.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> 3 rounds. <br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Dedicated Tool (+1), High Speech (+2)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot;: Life (3) + Gnosis (1) + High Speech (2) + Dedicated Tool (+1)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 3 Free Reaches: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 on Spell Maintenance.<br /> <b>Total dice pool:</b> 7 dice</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/522686\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Roll for Life 1 &quot;Analyse Life&quot; \u2192 3 successes.</span></a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T22:08:30-07:00","id":1101496,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> You study the &quot;dandelion&quot; with a critical eye, and as your spell settles on the flower, you instinctively know that this plant has no physical toxins, poison, or any other inherent quality that might hurt you physically. Between the spell and the results of briefly studying it with your Sight, you have no reason to suggest that eating the plant could harm you, and every reason to suggest that ingesting it should restore a fraction of your mana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T02:32:12-07:00","id":1101895,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 6/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 0<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Welp, here I go.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx eats the dandelion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T03:56:22-07:00","id":1101911,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> It doesn't taste particularly good...about as good as eating a real dandelion would, you expect. But unlike the natural plant, when you chew on the flower and swallow, you feel a small burst of energy become absorbed into your body and enter your internal &quot;well&quot; of mana.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, you don't feel any different.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Gain 1 mana. And take an arcane beat for being the first to take the plunge. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T06:40:42-07:00","id":1101952,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 4/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">By the way, because I can't choose to scour Presence, I've chosen Dexterity instead. It's at 2 for the time being.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Just after hanging up with Ragnar, I get, oh...dammit, I forgot! It's been like, how long since we last caught up?<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Timothy Rodge Kemp.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Here we go, Layla gives me an earful for not keeping in touch. I can't blame her, I'm the one who promised we'd do it, and I haven't made good on that promise lately. After her little tirade, she goes on about how summer camp went for her. She's goes over every little story, she always loved the great outdoors, and how she's now entering the 4th grade, she sounds really excited about it. I always found that weird, I hated school, but she seems to love it. Then she asks me how my...friends...are doing. I choke a bit, but then I just tell her that they're doing fine. I can't tell her what happened to them.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm gonna be a bastard, and see if he can successfully deceive her.<br /> <br /> \u200b<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/523173\" target=\"_blank\">Composure 2 - 1 Untrained Subterfuge = 1 die \u2192 0 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Unfortunately, I'm an awful liar, and she knows it. She keeps asking about them, and I'm just trying to get her off the subject. She doesn't. &quot;<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Layla, I really don't wanna talk about this right now,</span>&quot; I sigh.<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Okay, but you gotta tell me sometime, pinky promise?</span>&quot; she replies.<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Pinky promise,</span>&quot; I answer, wiggling my pinky in front of the camera as she does, since we can't actually hook them. She hangs up shortly afterwards, finally. Still, it's my fault, really.<br /> <br /> The others must be wondering where I am by now, better get going.<br /> <br /> <hr /><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000ff\">&quot;But- the flowers- the people- Moon! What part of this does not strike you as a bad idea?! Oh for the love of-&quot;</span><br /> <br /> What's Moonstone got up to now? I swear, that guy needs supervision all the time. Did Ragnar say something about flowers? What about the flowers? Now that I look, I'm pretty sure dandelions don't come in purple, I'm no flower expert, though. Just as I catch up, Lynx just up and eats one.<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Taste good?</span>&quot; I ask with a raised eyebrow.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Rolling for general perception.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/523177\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 = 5 dice \u2192 2 successes</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 06-09-2017, 09:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T07:24:57-07:00","id":1101968,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 7/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Taste good?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Whew,</span>&quot; Lynx huffs as the infusion makes his soul feel alive. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Tastes like dandelion. With an aftertaste of mana. Maybe I should alter my taste buds... Oh! Right! Hello, Phoenix. Glad you made it,</span>&quot; he grins. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Good to see you got here before everything went to shit. There are purple dandelions,</span>&quot; he gestures to them, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">They fill your mana reserves when you eat them. Local spirits are interested in them. Also, the people around here are sorta... drained. And there's an essence cloud in that direction</span>,&quot; he gestures towards the distant Moonstone, &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">And as you might have realised, Moonstone's gone mental.</span>&quot; <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Nothing new there.</span></i> <br /> <br /> As he fills in Phoenix, Lynx looks for (and picks) five more dandelions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T21:07:29-07:00","id":1102430,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors), Obsessed (Reach the Essence Cloud), Deprived [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 5/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 0/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> Well, that's enough of that. Moonstone lets the half-formed Imago dwindle away in his mind, and returns to sprinting towards where all the ghosts are going. No time to look back for the rest of the cabal now. They'll see the Cloud soon enough!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T11:18:39-07:00","id":1102564,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> By looking around your immediate area, you see that these flowers aren't just odd in their color; they're simply <i>everywhere</i>. You've seen the occasional yard in the summer in which the owners let the dandelions grow out of control, and maybe that's not so strange. But to see multiple yards along the street covered in these strange plants? That's not normal. In addition, they seem even more prevalent as you look to the east and north along the side streets here. You aren't sure why that would happen, except for a supernatural explanation. <br /> <br /> Lynx's brief synopsis reminds you of Boomer's talk about tass. You can't be sure without your Prime Sight or a spell, but these plants sound like they are physically imbued with mana. You don't know as much about Essence, but you hazard a guess that it's a similar kind of energy that spirits can feed on, based on what Lynx shares with you. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You start to collect several of the mana-infused dandelions. You notice that within a few moments of picking them, the flowers start to wilt and droop. After watching them for a little longer, they start to disintegrate and fall apart in your hands.<br /> <br /> It's easy enough to grab more, if you choose, but it's clear to you that you won't be able to take these flowers and save them for later.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can restore your full mana if you choose, but you can't harvest the tass for later.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You race along the street and turn left to go north onto Malden Avenue.<br /> <br /> It's like looking at a sea of purple.<br /> <br /> The supernatural dandelions have consumed the lawns on this street. They crowd out all other plants. They cover the trees like thick purple vines, and you can't even see any grass in sight due to the bed of flowers on the lawns. Whether they are attracted to this location or created by something, this is their source. <br /> <br /> You look up into the sky, and feel a surge of adrenaline as you see the cloud of Essence that is consuming your thoughts. You know immediately that you can only see the Essence because of Ouroboros Ophis' spell: the mystical energy is obviously invisible to your mundane senses, and it falls outside the purview of Mind or Space magic and the realm of Pandemonium.<br /> <br /> A near constant stream of Essence is wafting like perfume from the &quot;dandelions&quot; filling the yards on this street. And swirling like a vortex in the air, you see a small horde of ghosts hovering, arms outstretched as they feed on the energy here. They seem frenzied, some of them grappling with each other and screaming with undead rage to be closest to the largest streams. They rip into each other, but the injured ones regenerate their bodies by inhaling more Essence and channeling it into their Corpus.<br /> <br /> Something suddenly shifts in your focus as without thinking about it, your senses transfer and...you're looking through the very eyes of your goetia. The Fear goetia is hovering near the cloud itself, gorging on the energy. You feel it send a stream of Essence to you, feeding it to you by converting it into mana, and your own internal reservoir of arcane energy is almost instantly filled. You also see through the goetia's senses an even larger vortex of spirits, another type of ephemeral entity you can't see without its help. Like the ghosts, the spirits are clamoring to claim the most Essence, gorging on it and using more to heal as other spirits claw at them. Your familiar starts to draw attention from the other spirits and ghosts, so it quickly retreats to relative safety at your side.<br /> <br /> Your eyes shift again and your senses snap back to your own. You feel like you could share the familiar's senses again, if you wanted to. At the same time, you feel a release of tension as the obsession lifts from you. You're left standing there, wondering what to do, while your cabal catches up with you. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You resolve the Obsessed and Deprived conditions. Take an arcane beat for replacing the supernatural conditions.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Everyone except Moonstone</b><br /> The rest of the cabal follows after Moonstone, heading east for a block along Woodlawn Avenue and turning to the north onto Malden Avenue. You see Moonstone standing in the middle of the street, staring up at the sky. Those of you with Spirit, Death, or Prime Sight active witness the swirling cloud of Essence and the ephemeral entities corresponding to senses attuned to their appropriate arcana. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Everyone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Anyone who chooses to eat the dandelions can bring their mana to full. Moonstone gets full energy from his familiar transferring mana to him. Please update your post headers accordingly so you remember how you're doing on mana.<br /> <br /> In addition, you may all make an Int + Occult roll.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T02:27:46-07:00","id":1103049,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: none<br /> Conditions: Divergent (Active), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b><b>OOOOOO | Willpower: 2/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b><br /> </div> <br /> The ghosts raise their arms in worship, and Moonstone matches them, raising his hands to the sky, his breath catching in his throat. The subtle body of his familiar flies out and feeds and restores him through their bond, and it all seems to make sense. He takes the Cloak of Night out of his bag and raises it reverently over his bowed head, imbuing its stores with his own ever-flowing Mana.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;My cup runneth over! He hath filled the hungry with good things, and so on and so forth...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The ecstasy is fading. He's surrounded by a feeding frenzy of the unquiet dead. It's actually rather disgusting. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Wait. This isn't right. I got <i>mind-whammied, </i>didn't I?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The cabal is here. Phoenix, even. Just in time to catch Moonstone the Mad in full freak-flag mode. He facepalms and groans. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I don't know how you put up with me. You all see it too, right?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Setting my Familiar to 15/15 Essence and my Artifact to 10/10 Mana.<br /> <br /> Intelligence+Occult, 9-again. 5 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524589\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>.<br /> <br /> Also, casting Mental Shield on myself. 1 free Reach for instant casting, +2 for advanced duration and advanced potency. 2 Paradox, spending 2 Mana to reduce it to a chance die: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524591\" target=\"_blank\">dramatic failure!</a> Yay! I get 1 Willpower and don't accumulate a die for risking Paradox this scene.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1+Mind 2+High Speech 2+Path Tool 1-Duration 2. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524592\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. Mental Shield takes effect with 1 week Duration and Advanced Potency, which means +3 on any Clash rolls it causes.<br /> <br /> If it's okay with our ST, I'll also spend 3 Mana to do Pattern Restoration and suppress Divergent for the rest of the scene, unless something triggers it again.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Better keep that from happening again. He gazes into his hand mirror and speaks an idea in the High Speech: a sharp iron crown that will prick him if his head lolls from some glamour or magical deception. Peering at his reflection, he weaves an Imago of a crown of thorns around his brow. At this seemingly endless font of Mana, he easily fortifies his spell to keep the Abyss at bay. Denying Hubris feels good. His senses clear as the heavy crown settles. The clarity of the Guardians feels right.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T06:17:33-07:00","id":1103101,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Active Sight:</b> Prime, Mind | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Sacred Geometry (self, 1 scene)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 3/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (until 11 AM)</div> <br /> <br /> Tastes like dandelion with an aftertaste of mana, interesting. So the flowers are filled with mana, but why would spirits be interested in mana? Unless there's more to the flowers than the mana. Wait, the people here are being drained? How? What's being drained? Now that I think about it, the people around here are, so...still. Whatever's happening to 'em, can't be good, that's for sure. Lynx picks some of the dandelions, but they wilt right after. Seems these things really need whatever's feeding them, and it involves mana. What the name of it again...leylines or nodes? Something like that. Let's take a look.<br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><b>Sacred Geometry (Prime 1, Corebook, p. 166)</b></u><br /> <b>Reach:</b> 2 Free - 2 used for instant casting and Advanced Duration<br /> <b>Paradox:</b> None<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Dedicated Tool for +1<br /> <b>Factors:</b> None<br /> <b>Spellcasting:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524612\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 1 DT = 4 dice \u2192 3 successes</a><br /> \u200b<br /> Now I'm really wishing I cast Supernal Vision, but there ya go.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> Moonstone's gone mental? Nothing new there. Looks like he's going after the essence cloud, better make sure he's not fucking something, or somebody, up. I run after him, and catch a whole lot of purple, and...another mind near him? Wait, it's flowing mana from the source and into him. What's going on?<br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Active Sight for Prime and Mind (1 Mana). Phoenix does have Mind's Eye, allowing him to sense the passive presence, and with Mind Sight, can now see the entity.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;Wait, no it's not a mind, it's...wait, Alux? How is...no, it's not Alux, it's the...fear? Fear of-Oh, I get it, now. It's his fear of Alux,&quot;</span> I sigh in relief. For a second I thought was Alux.<br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I figured it'd just be quicker for Phoenix to see the Goetia for what it is right away, it's not like it's being occluded or anything.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I don't know how you put up with me. You all see it too, right?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;It's a mystery, that's for sure,&quot;</span> I reply with a shrug, <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;But I like mysteries.&quot; </span>I crack a smile as I chuckle. <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;Speaking of which, how did you get that?&quot;</span> I ask as I gesture towards the...fear..thing. The fear-thing, whatever it is.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524634\" target=\"_blank\">Intelligence 2 + Occult 1 = 3 dice \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <br /> \u200bLet's shake things up with a dramatic failure for this one. Moonstone ain't the only one who misinterprets what he sees.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T07:57:13-07:00","id":1103137,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 4/7 Mana: 10/10 Health: <b>L</b>OOOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Mental Shield<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div> <br /> Binder follows suit with the rest of the group and eats a dandelion. He grimaces at how <i>easy</i> it is, compared to scouring himself nearly every day for the past week.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Intelligence 4 + Occult 2 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/524651\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T04:19:39-07:00","id":1103436,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 9/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: None<br /> Beats: 0 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">I don't know how you put up with me.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">That's what friends do, isn't it?</span>&quot; Lynx shrugs, finishing the fourth dandelion with a mild grimace. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Starting to get used to the taste of these. Feels good to be full.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008080\">You all see it too, right?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">That's ... something.</span>&quot; Lynx narrows his eyes. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Doesn't feel right without my Senses.</span></i> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">What <i>is</i> that?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> And instinctively, he forms an imago of Knowing in his mind...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Lynx casts an improvised Spirit 1 spell, using the Practise of Knowing to garner information about the Essence phenomena.<br /> <b>Potency:</b> 3<br /> <b>Primary Spell Factor:</b> Potency.<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Essence Cloud.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Concentration.<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> Concentration (+2), High Speech (+2)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Spirit 1 &quot;Study Essence Cloud&quot;: Spirit (2) + Gnosis (1) + High Speech (+2) + Concentration (+2) - Potency (2)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 2 Free Reaches: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 on Range, 1 on Spell Maintenance.<br /> <b>Total dice pool:</b> 5 dice<br /> <br /> <b>Base Paradox dice:</b> 1 = 1 from Reach.<br /> <b>Mana spent to mitigate Paradox:</b> 1.<br /> <b>Paradox modifiers:</b> -1 from Mana.<br /> <b>Final Paradox dice:</b> 0.<br /> If Paradox is obtained, Lynx will release it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/525005\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Paradox \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/525006\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Spirit 1 &quot;Study Essence Cloud&quot; \u2192 2 successes.</a></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/525048\" target=\"_blank\">Intelligence (2) + Occult (0) roll, chance die \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> OOC: I'd like to convert that into a dramatic failure if that's fine. Feel free to use the resurfacing memories if you'd like. </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valem