es one of the dandelions and the effect thereof. He quickly decides to follow suit, having his own inner reserves almost depleted- <b><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;It is a pity they cannot be harvested and storaged, that would make them doubly useful. I might try to prevent the decay with a spell later, but now we need to deal with this situation quickly before the damage to the inhabitants becomes irreversible&quot;</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/525013\" target=\"_blank\">Intelligence+Occult=2 Successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He looks at the cloud of essence and the ghosts with apprehension-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;This... this cannot be right...&quot;</b></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 06-14-2017, 08:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-15T07:20:13-07:00","id":1103799,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> At Lynx's words, Ragnar grabs handfuls of flowers and starts shoving them into his mouth. The taste is bland, and he can't help but quip, <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Could use some thousand island.&quot; </span>But then the mana hits him all at once, and he's suddenly on something a thousand times better than a sugar rush. Hell, probably better than cocaine. He hadn't realized just how drained he had felt, how long he had been running at less-than-full for. He feels <i>powerful. </i>The task of ending this threat to the Sleepers, of fighting Alux, feels trivial for a brief moment. He can do seven impossible things before breakfast. Despite the seriousness of the situation, he can't help but <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ly7PONiKGUs?t=1m5s\" target=\"_blank\">hum a song</a> as they jog in Moonstone's wake. <br /> <br /> But Ragnar's mood of elation is dampened as they move deeper into the neighborhood, and the dandelions grow thicker and thicker. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200bPeople are going to die. If they haven't already. </span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I don't know how you put up with me. You all see it too, right?&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;It's a mystery the whole Consilium struggles with,&quot; </span>he says with a smirk, but he's not hostile. He looks up at the mass of ghosts, still aided by Ophis' spell. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;It's like... tuna going after a school of sardines or something. They're darting in and out. But they're avoiding the center of it. Look how they jerk away, not towards the sardines but <i>away </i>from something. Like tuna do with... sharks...&quot;</span> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Intelligence 4 + Occult 3 = 7 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/525460\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-18T07:21:24-07:00","id":1105069,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As long as you are not under any time constraints, you may ignore mana costs for spells or other expenses while outside, as you take time to eat more tass.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> Yes, you were definitely mind-whammied. The realization makes you irritated. But rather than let your emotions roll over you like a tidal wave, you channel mana (of which there is more readily available) into your Pattern and reinforce your mental fortitude. <br /> <br /> Being a Mage sure is convenient.<br /> <br /> With your increased clarity of mind, you try to evaluate the situation to better understand this puzzle. You have never seen anything like this, not with so many spirits and ghosts in one place. But by watching them feed, you are confident that the cloud itself is simply the consequence of so much mana being released in this area. It's the end result of this Mystery, not the source. You think that if you can identify the true root of this problem, the Essence cloud -- and thus the ephemeral entities feeding on it -- will most likely leave. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Your spell takes hold, and the street lights up like lightning. The arcane energy coursing through here is blinding. How could you not have seen it before?<br /> <br /> You've never actually seen a ley line before, but with your spell, you see how the Supernal energy forms what reminds you of a power cable humming with energy within the street. Where the Essence cloud hovers, the cable bulges and crackles with energy. The &quot;dandelions&quot; feed into the line, transmitting even more energy, creating a surge of power that's hard to look at because of its intensity. <br /> <br /> More curiously, though, you see ripples of energy from each dandelion streaming toward a certain area on the street...in fact, they're coming from a single house. Each individual strand is razor-thin, but there are thousands upon thousands of them.<br /> <br /> Turning back to the group, and Moonstone specifically, you have that sensation like someone's watching you. Opening your Sight reveals the ephemeral creature floating near Moonstone. You've never seen something like it before, and don't know what to make of it. <br /> <br /> Your Forces Sight does not reveal anything particularly exciting, just showing that the electricity is still running in these houses nearby. But to your Prime Sight, the Supernal becomes visible here and the heavens open up to you. The dandelions are absolutely a form of tass, and they must be leaking Essence by converting the mana and releasing it into the air. You also see clearly now that there is no active spell holding the Essence cloud in formation or hanging over the ephemeral entities here. The effects you are seeing do not seem to be due to a specific spell.<br /> <br /> There are so many options to pursue, so many thoughts and ideas going through your mind, that you feel overwhelmed. You're just a group of novice mages. How are you supposed to be able to figure this out yourselves?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Take a beat and the following condition:<br /> <br /> <b>Perplexed</b>. You feel confused and unsure about what to do because your mental focus is wavering. You take -2 on Mental rolls. You also take twice as long to complete extended actions for Mental skills. Whenever the Storyteller asks you to roll for a Mental action, instead of rolling you may voluntarily fail the roll and resolve this Condition.<br /> <br /> <u>Resolution</u>: Opt to fail a Mental action, as described above.<br /> <br /> <u>Beat</u>: N/A.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> While you eat a not-so-tasty dandelion and feel the mana course through you, you have a thought: If eating these flowers gives you mana, and they wilt and lose that mana shortly after being plucked from the ground, then something else is fueling them. And if you're eating them and none of you have been harmed or drained that you know of, then they are more likely just a symptom of the larger problem here.<br /> <br /> But what else might you be looking for, then? And where might it be? It's probably something nearby, given how many flowers are on this block compared to the previous street. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> You form an Imago of incense swirling around the cloud, intermingling with the Essence, and revealing hidden secrets through the shapes revealed, the way a shaman or spiritual healer might use incense in a divination ritual. The spell blossoms into existence and you feel a sense of insight as you continue to study the cloud. Even without your Mage Sight active, you are able to watch the Essence cloud with your spell. As you study it, you see a trail of Essence leading back to the dandelions, but then also feel the energy coming in through their roots, and further stretching back to...something else. <br /> <br /> Abruptly, jarring thoughts and memories of that otherworldly place you went to through the Highstorm portal interrupt your focus. It's all you can do to keep your spell from wavering and falling apart. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Take a beat and the following condition:<br /> <br /> <b>Distracted</b>. Something is running through your head and you have a very difficult time focusing on anything else. You take -2 on Wits+Composure rolls for perception and spellcasting rolls that have a duration of concentration (effectively negating the Yantra bonus for concentration). In addition, your Resolve is 1 lower for purposes of Withstanding spell effects.<br /> <br /> <u>Resolution</u>: Gain 1 Willpower.<br /> <br /> <u>Beat</u>: N/A.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> You know from studying the cloud with your Sight that there is no Anchor here for the ghosts; this is raw Essence being leaked into the sky. But you know that ghosts who move beyond the range of their Anchors might rapidly lose their Essence, and even though you now see that there is an incredible surplus here, there seems to be more than just Essence bringing the ghosts here. <br /> <br /> You wonder if the Essence cloud is some kind of lure, or if something else made nearby ghosts aware of this Essence feast. That would suggest that the cloud is not the heart of this Mystery, just a piece of a larger puzzle.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> Your first thought is that there must be some kind of quality of this cloud that explains why it's attracting so many creatures and why they aren't leaving. You try to critically analyze the behavior of the ghosts you can see. But the more you watch and try to objectively evaluate your hypothesis, you fail to see any difference between how the ghosts act in relation to where they stand relative to the cloud; they are all just fighting to be as close to the stream of energy as they feel comfortable doing so.<br /> <br /> While watching, you can't help but be impressed at the sheer scope of magic that led to this event. It's certainly more than you know how to create with your limited Spirit mastery. <br /> <br /> And then another thought pops into your head. It's something triggered by one of Moonstone's comments about something draining the Sleepers and fueling the ephemera. What if there was some kind of magical item or Artifact nearby that was causing this? That might explain the scope of this effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-23T01:59:20-07:00","id":1106921,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 9/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Distracted<br /> Beats: 1 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">There's a trail of Essence from the dandelions, but the energy's coming in through...</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He clutches his head. <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Water...? What the hell was that place?</span></i> <br /> He attempts to trace the trail, letting the insight of his spell follow the trail through the roots of the purple. <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">It was definitely a cave... right? And we were drowning...</span></i><br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">The roots,&quot; </span>he grunts, his concentration slipping. <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;Through the roots.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Lynx wants to track the Essence and find out where it stretches to. Which check would be appropriate?</span></b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-23T05:58:44-07:00","id":1106982,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> None<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/node/1105069\">Perplexed</a> | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (untill 11 AM)</div> <br /> What do I do? What can I do? What should I do first? Focus on the house? The people? The flowers? Wait, are the flowers okay to eat? My mind is running a mile a minute. Okay, calm down, get it together. Let's just go back to basic senses and take things one at a time. First, you came for a mana refill. Looks like there's nothing wrong with eating the flowers, and some more greens in my diet wouldn't hurt (or purples more like).<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Eating up the flowers. He also ends Active Sight and Sacred Geometry.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bNot very good, yet has an incredibly satisfying rush to it. Okay, refill down, now people seem to be drained by all the spirits? Whatever's around here, and it looks like the house is the source.<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">There's a trail of Essence from the dandelions, but the energy's coming in through...t</span><span style=\"color:#800000\">he roots,&quot;</span> Lynx grunts, <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;Through the roots.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;And the roots seem to come from that house,&quot;</span> I point, <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;How 'bout we pay a visit?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> \u200bI lead on to the door and give it a few knocks. Maybe somebody's home? Worth a shot, I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-25T08:28:00-07:00","id":1107641,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active (Matter/Death/Life) | <b>Active Spells: </b>Speak with the Dead, Mental Shield<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>4/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats/Exp: </b>2/2 | <b>Arc. Beats/Exp:</b> 1/0</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Great idea, let's go to the house. Whatever this essence cloud is, it is just another byproduct, not the cause of all these phenomena&quot;</b></span>- follows the lead of Phoenix, looking trough the windows to check if someone is in-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;I have the impression that if someone is indeed in the house they would be in grave peril... or past that already. This seems to be the epicenter of all the life draining that these weeds are metabolizing into essence&quot;</b></span>-the doctor kneels next to the lock-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Allow me...&quot;</b></span>-He tries to open the door, if it is locked, he cast the following spell:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting Remote Control to open the door: 1 Reach for Instant Casting. Gnosis 1+Matter 1+Willpower 3=<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/528637\" target=\"_blank\">3 Successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T07:34:14-07:00","id":1108391,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\">&quot;Through the roots.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;And the roots seem to come from that house. </span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">How 'bout we pay a visit?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Hold on, I have an idea.&quot; </span>Ragnar walks up to the front wall of the house and rests his knife on it lightly. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I should be able to look back in time to the moment this started. My ability with Time should allow me to see far enough back to right before and after this all started. Phoenix, Lynx, Ophis, do you guys think you could cast spells that let me check this place out with Death, Life, Spirit, and Prime Sight?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> When the others cast their spells, Ragnar begins to weave an Imago. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">Show me this place at the moment this all started. What happened?</span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar is casting the Time 2 spell Postcognition to study the house in the moments before and after the Mana/Essence thing started. Potency is automatically 2. Two free reach, one for Instant Casting and another for Advanced Potency. Time 2 + Gnosis 1 + Tool 1 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/529270\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>. Hopefully this is enough to overcome Withstand.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T01:57:15-07:00","id":1109666,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> None | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Supernal Vision (Ragnar, Potency 2, 1 scene)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty], <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/node/1105069\">Perplexed</a> | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (until 11 AM)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b<span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Hold on, I have an idea.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> My hand hovers just shy of the door as I look back to Ragnar.<br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;I should be able to look back in time to the moment this started. My ability with Time should allow me to see far enough back to right before and after this all started. Phoenix, Lynx, Ophis, do you guys think you could cast spells that let me check this place out with Death, Life, Spirit, and Prime Sight?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Um, okay,</span>&quot; I reply, then I place a hand on his shoulder. Can't hurt, I suppose.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><b>Supernal Vision (Prime, Corebook, Page 166)</b></u><br /> <b>Reach:</b>\u200b 2 Free - 2 used for instant casting and Advanced Duration<br /> <b>Paradox:</b> None<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Concentration +2<br /> <b>Factors:</b> PSF Potency 2, Duration 1 hour/scene<br /> <b>Spellcasting:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/530036\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Prime 2 + 2 Concentration = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> Damn, no crit.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T08:21:44-07:00","id":1110860,"title":"","content":"<b>Lynx</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can make a Wits + Arcana roll to attempt to perceive where the trails are coming from.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> You walk purposefully up to an older prairie-style home, which looks like it was built in the 1950s but has been well maintained. Well, you can tell that the outside of the house itself has been maintained; it's a little harder to see the landscaping because of all the plants. Upon closer inspection, you can see that there are more dandelions infused in the ground here and on the trees than on the neighboring houses, more than any other house you've seen in the area. <br /> <br /> You knock on the large front door. Nothing happens. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may make a Wits+Composure roll for perception, including your -2 penalty for Perplexed.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> To your surprise, the door is not locked; the knob turns and the heavy door creaks as you gently push it open. <br /> <br /> You look into the entryway and see a long hallway that leads into a living room ahead of you. There is a stairway leading up to a second floor, and several other doors leading to various rooms or closets. None of the lights are on. In fact, the house seems...darker somehow than what you would expect for this time of day.<br /> <br /> Down the hallway ahead of you, you see movement, a small ephemeral body that peeks out from behind a corner and ducks into a small hallway to the right.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">No need for a spell in this case. However, just a reminder that you currently have 2 spells active, so any additional spells needs 2 reach for spell control. If you had cast that spell, you would've risked paradox.<br /> <br /> In addition, please make a perception roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> You focus your mind and take a calming breath to center yourself. Your vision explodes with colors and senses that you have never experienced before, and the glow of arcane energy and torrent of Spirits surrounding the neighborhood appear as Lynx's and Phoenix's spells settle on you.<br /> <br /> Your own Imago is formed clearly in your mind, and you firmly press your will onto the river of Time surrounding the house...<br /> <br /> And nothing happens. You know that the spell worked, but it simply fails to open a window into the past of this house. You feel a significance to this place, a momentous energy, from what has happened here that your spell is not able to overcome. It's like trying to lift weights that are heavier than you expected; with the right effort you might be able to overcome the strain, but that wasn't enough.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Potency 2 is not enough to overcome Withstand. And if I recall correctly, Advanced Potency really only matters for dispellation or Clash of Wills. Only way to boost Potency is to spend spell factors to increase the strength. You also need Duration longer if you want to see more than an instant of the past event. You could try Adcanced Duration reach and use Concentration as a second Yantra to boost your dice pool, and boost Potency to 3? </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T09:41:11-07:00","id":1111310,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> Ragnar blinks as the spell works, but does nothing. He doesn't quite understand the intricacies of Sympathy, but he realizes that the house in its current state is vastly different from what it was originally. He raises his gaze from the tip of his knife resting on the wall of the house and looks up towards the roof. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Some serious mojo went down here...</span> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Keep the spells going, I need to try again.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He lowers his eyes back to the contact point of the wall and his knife, and exerts his will more heavily on the house. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">I am not a conjurer of cheap tricks. I am a Mage, and I will not be denied. Reveal to me what happened here.</span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar is going to try again with the spell. Casting Postcognition (Time 1) on the house. Two free reach, one for Instant Casting, the other for Advanced duration. He'll take a -2 to the dice pool two raise the Potency from 2 to 3. He'll invoke the Path Tool and Concentration Yantras. He does not acquire Paradox on the Casting.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 - Potency 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/530869\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. That should do the trick.<br /> <br /> \u200bI assume that Ragnar telling the others to keep the spells going should be enough for him to still have Death, Life, Prime, and Spirit going on him.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T06:57:19-07:00","id":1111638,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 9/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Distracted<br /> Beats: 1 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531118\" target=\"_blank\">Wits + Spirit Arcanum roll \u2192 1 success.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T09:29:11-07:00","id":1111682,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Nice work! My interpretation of how this spell works is kind of like the Pensieve from Harry Potter. Let me know if you were expecting something else to happen here.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> You impress your will upon the stream of Time surrounding this house, connecting it to a past version of itself. You push, exerting the full strength of your mental energy against the threads of Time anchoring the house to this exact moment. And this time, you feel a satisfying surge of energy as the spell takes hold. <br /> <br /> Before you can open your mouth to say a word, the stream of Time becomes a torrent, a whirlpool. In an instant, Time slams into you and drags you away, drowning out the present. <br /> <br /> Your initial panic turns into wonder as you realize you're not in danger. You see trails of mana tied around you and anchoring to a distant point that you know is the present, but allow yourself to be swept away. As you watch Time flow, the house and its surroundings begin to unravel, or rather, to unwind. The mystical dandelions shrink, disappearing into the ground. The sky brightens around you, the darkens, then brightens again, marking the passage of two days. You continue to repeat the Imago of the spell in your mind, using your concentration to hold power in your spell. <br /> <br /> With a rush, everything stops, and you find yourself standing in front of the house. Alone. No one stands in front of you or around you; your cabal is gone. Some neighbor kids are laughing and riding bikes down the street, and you see the young child riding her bike whom Moonstone looked at -- <i>will</i> look at in two days. You try to move and realize that you can't; you're rooted in this spot. You can look around, but not move or interact with anything. <br /> <br /> Your cabalmates' spells are still wrapped around you, as only your senses are here in the past, not your soul or your existence. With them, you see no special cloud of Essence, no swarm of spirits or ghosts. There is no tass growing anywhere within sight. <br /> <br /> You look at the house, the doors closed and the lights on inside. You briefly see a young boy run past a window overlooking the street and think you hear voices inside, but you can't make out who is speaking. It sounds like someone other than the boy, though. <br /> <br /> As you watch, with a crackle of energy and a boom like thunder, you see a sudden burst of supernatural energy exploding from somewhere inside.<br /> <br /> The lights shut off as the house seems to lose power, although other houses nearby don't seem to be affected. You don't hear any voices anymore. When you look at the yard, you suddenly see a small plant appear as it breaks through the ground, grows a small stalk, and opens into a small purple dandelion. A faint trickle of Essence begins to float into the air. And then another dandelion slowly appears next to it. And another. And another...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Because you didn't spend the Reach for the option to &quot;scrub&quot; time, you can only watch in real time for up to a full scene. But you can end it at any time at will. I wasn't sure if you would be able to walk around or examine the house itself, like the inside, so this is the info I'm giving you for now. Let me know if you think it should work differently.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Sorry, I had a complete brain fart and told you the wrong roll. I wanted Wits + Occult; I thought of Arcana because I was thinking of D&amp;D rules. <br /> <br /> Wits + Occult is a chance die for you. The -2 from Distracted only applies to Wits + Composure rolls for perception, but you have -3 from not having any dots in Occult yet. Re-rolled for you: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531130\" target=\"_blank\">No successes</a>. Sorry for the confusion.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You aren't able to focus enough to puzzle out where the Essence is coming from. You think it might be a nearby house, but that's the best you can come up with.<br /> <br /> <b>Everyone except Ragnar</b><br /> Ragnar suddenly freezes in place, his knife tip touching the house. His eyes have a far-off, unfocused look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awaken