55, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Sense Conciousness</i> (Mind 1)<br /> 3 Reach free: Spending 2 for spell control, 1 for instant cast, 1 for advanced scale<br /> Containing Paradox 1 + 1 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) vs Wisdom 7 = 0 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531159\" target=\"_blank\">0</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531160\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> successes<br /> <br /> Yantras: Concentration +2, Dedicated Tool<br /> Factors: Potency 1, Duration 3 rounds, Scale large building<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 + Yantras 2 = 6 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531161\" target=\"_blank\">1 success!</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T05:04:11-07:00","id":1112050,"title":"","content":"<b>Binder</b><br /> Your spell settles around the house, and you feel...nothing. There is no sign of any living person inside the house.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T08:58:10-07:00","id":1112132,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>BINDER</b><br /> Willpower: 4/7 Mana: 10/10 Health: <b>L</b>OOOOOO<br /> [<b>Shaken</b>]<br /> Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Spell Control (1): Hidden Door, Mental Shield<br /> Beats: 1 Arcane Beats: 2</div><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Well there's nobody alive in there, so this isn't a rescue mission. That doesn't preclude ghosts or spirits or who knows what else, though.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T15:42:01-07:00","id":1112379,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> <br /> </div> As the vision of the events follow unfold, Ragnar connects the dots. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">This is the source alright. And I don't think this ended well for the people inside. </span></i>Once he has had enough of watching the purple dandelions bloom, he erases the mental image of his Imago. He immediately begins fly forward through time, things moving at ludicrous speeds again, but now in the right direction. Finally, his senses slam back into the present, and he actually takes a couple steps back once he becomes aware of his own body again. He takes a couple of breaths as he steadies himself, and then nods. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;This is definitely the place. Two days ago, some sort of magical fluctuation occurred inside the house. The house immediately lost power, and then the flowers immediately began to sprout and start transmitting Essence.&quot; </span>He levels his knife at the window he saw the boy's silhouette in. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;There was a boy in that room up there. Drop the spells, guys, I got what I needed.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Well there's nobody alive in there, so this isn't a rescue mission. That doesn't preclude ghosts or spirits or who knows what else, though.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar sighs slightly. It wasn't unexpected, but it still hurts. Part of Ragnar realizes that the Tass they have been consuming may very well contain a little bit of the inhabitants' essence. <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Soylent Green is people! </span></i>But he shoves down the thought. He looks back towards the place where the ghosts and- his stomach flips at his first sight of spirits. <i><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">What the hell would I even title that paper? &quot;Examining the trophic interactions of the meme-fauna of La Grange?&quot; ... On second thought, somebody in that Mysterium that Mathias mentioned has probably beat me to it.</span></i><br /> <br /> As the door opens like a horror movie clich\u00e9, Ragnar steps into the hallway. Once he crosses the threshold, he gathers himself for a moment and begins to gaze forwards in time, rather than backwards. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>What threats await us in here? Which room is the source of this disturbance in? Which rooms are the bodies of the inhabitants in?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar is casting Time 1 Divination to get some info on the house. Two free Reach, one for Instant Casting, the other for specific answers. He doesn't invoke Paradox. He'll take a -2 to the roll to increase his Potency by one for a third question.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1 + Time 2 + Path Tool 1 + Concentration 2 - Potency 2 = 4 dice -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531471\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a>.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T15:44:15-07:00","id":1112382,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active (Matter/Death/Life) | <b>Active Spells: </b>Speak with the Dead, Mental Shield<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats/Exp: </b>2/2 | <b>Arc. Beats/Exp:</b> 1/0</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Well there's nobody alive in there, so this isn't a rescue mission. That doesn't preclude ghosts or spirits or who knows what else, though.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> -<b><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;That was what I was afraid of... I've seen somebody taking a peek at us, they looked... they looked like a child&quot;</span></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Perception (Wits+Composure)=<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531474\" target=\"_blank\">1 Success</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:19:34-07:00","id":1112544,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b><b>OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Ragnar's Postcognition spell echoes in Moonstone's periphery. The warlock watches someone else enter a Time-skipping mystical trance for once. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;<i>That's</i> what that looks like!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> That's a good reminder to do his own due diligence. Before entering the house with the others, he rests his hand on the gym bag over his shoulder and poses two questions in the High Speech: <span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>Will I draw my sword in the next hour? Will my cabal shed blood in this house?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting my Praxis, Divination, on myself. Only looking for Yes/No answers.<br /> <br /> 1 reach for instant casting, 1 reach for exceeding spell control. No Paradox.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1+Time 2+High Speech 2. 5 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531628\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;That was what I was afraid of... I've seen somebody taking a peek at us, they looked... they looked like a child&quot;</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Some<i> thing</i>, not somebody. Ghosts are merely the memories and obsessions of an unresolved mind!&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 07-07-2017, 03:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T08:27:21-07:00","id":1112691,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Before replying, I wanted to remind you of a few things. First, just a reminder that Concentration Yantra can only be used on spells with duration longer than 1 turn. Rather than making you re-roll and taking extra time to repost, I will cancel the potency boost for the third question and remove the bonus from Concentration, leaving your dice pool identical and giving you answers to the first two questions. <br /> <br /> Secondly, questions asked as part of Divination need to be worded in such a way that they involve the subject's future. So you can ask &quot;Where will we find this object?&quot;, but not &quot;Where is the object located?&quot; It's used to predict the future, not just give you Storyteller insight. If worded creatively, you can figure out a lot of things, but you need to ask them about the future. I will assume for your second question that you worded it along the lines of &quot;Where will we find the source of this disturbance?&quot;. For future posts, please adjust accordingly.<br /> <br /> Let me know if you have any problems with these changes.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The stream of Time surrounding you briefly flows in the opposite direction of your previous spell, this time summoning glimpses of the future rather than the past. Flickers of images dance through your mind faster than thought, but you catch enough to find the answers you seek. <i>A ghost quickened by the energy in this place will fight to defend her home or her child. The source will be found in her room.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> The glimpse you saw looked like a ghost, forming the shape of a young boy. You hear his laughter echo down the hallway. He seems like he is playing a game of hide and seek.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> You intone High Speech into a mantra. The words carry power and bring your spell to life. You're already seeing how powerful and convenient the language can be to fuel your spells. <br /> <br /> Images of the sword flicker in your mind's eye. <i>Yes</i>. A vision of hands, washed clean. <i>No.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T10:25:16-07:00","id":1112776,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b><b>OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> Moonstone frets. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Forecast predicts drawn weapons, but low chance of bloodshed. Try not to let foreknowledge of the future influence your response to danger. I'd hate to think that I imprisoned us in a needlessly violent timeline by warning against the possibility...oh, dear.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> In we go. He advances down the hallway, trailing his fingers along the walls. His Fear floats behind him like a monster balloon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T15:28:38-07:00","id":1112959,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Forecast predicts drawn weapons, but low chance of bloodshed. Try not to let foreknowledge of the future influence your response to danger. I'd hate to think that I imprisoned us in a needlessly violent timeline by warning against the possibility...oh, dear.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Ghosts don't bleed though. Not shedding blood isn't the same thing as not getting into a fight,&quot;</span> Ragnar says, his expression grim. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;I don't think our chances of getting out of here without violence are good. The lady of the house... left a ghost. Specifically, her protective feelings towards this house and her family. The ghost got amped up by the energy of the incident and she's in the room with the thing that caused this.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#006400\">&quot;That was what I was afraid of... I've seen somebody taking a peek at us, they looked... they looked like a child.&quot;</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Probably the child the ghost wants to protect. Death isn't my wheelhouse, so I have no idea if a ghost's desire to protect somebody extends to that person's ghost. But if the ghost is her mama bear instincts, I don't think we should be trying to play with the cub.&quot; </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T19:34:04-07:00","id":1113061,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Kinetic Blow (self, 4 Potency, 1 scene)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (untill 11 AM)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Something catches my eye as the door opens. What was that? Y'know what? Doesn't matter, I'll see it soon enough.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Opting to fail the Wits + Composure roll to resolve Perplexed. Also ending the Supernal Vision spell</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bI listen to the others talk about what's inside and what might be in store for us.<br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;Well, no harm in being prepared,&quot;</span> I respond simply. Return to breathing, breathe in, and breathe out, focus your Supernal eye on the flow of energy around you, and realize it.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><b>Kinetic Blow [Rote] (Forces 2, Corebook, Page 143)</b></u><br /> <b>Reach:</b> 4 Free - 4 used for instant casting, Advanced Duration, Primary Factor Swap, held weapons effect<br /> <b>Paradox:</b> None<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Rote Mudra Brawl +4, Dedicated Tool +1<br /> <b>Factors:</b> PSF Potency 4 (-4); Duration 1 scene<br /> <b>Spellcasting:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/531783\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Forces 2 + 4 Rote Mudra + 1 DT - 4 Factors = 4 dice \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> Just a friendly reminder that Phoenix also has 3 dots in Martial Arts, which gives him the Whirlwind Strike maneuver, allowing him to automatically cause 1B to everyone within his reach. The spell turns this into 5L. Every turn. To everybody near him.<br /> <br /> \u200bSide note, he puts up Prime Armor and replaces the Mana with another flower.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;No time like the present,&quot;</span> I think out loud as I head on in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":".  Replaced Stunned Tilt Reach effect with instant casting 07-23-2017, 04:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T05:52:12-07:00","id":1116816,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> As Boomer taught you, you execute the series of rapid physical hand movements that encode the Imago for your spell, possibly catching the eyes of your cabalmates. You feel the kinetic energy in your hands as you walk, ready to shift it at a moment's notice to powerfully enhance your blows.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Haha, that's just crazy. Mages, man.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Everyone</b><br /> The cabal enters the quiet home. As soon as you all do, you feel a sudden gust of air blast towards you. A woman's scream, one of torment and outrage rather than fear, echoes loudly throughout the entryway. On a large mirror hanging along the hallway by the door, you see words write themselves in a dark red liquid like blood: <i>GET OUT</i>. You all feel hairs rise on the back of your neck as something unseen watches from your Periphery. None of you actually see anything in the room, even those with a spell to see ghosts.<br /> <br /> In the silence that follows, you faintly hear a little boy's laughter echo down the hallway on your right. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I need a little more info on what you might want to check out. The hallway to the right is where you saw the boy ghost move. There is also a hallway leading instead straight ahead towards other rooms, as well as stairs leading up to the next level. You can explore as a group or individually, just let me know which route you want to investigate.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T13:28:54-07:00","id":1116962,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: </b><b>OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b><br /> <br /> </div> Moonstone holds steady. He's <i>aware </i>that the situation is unearthly and dangerous, but he also has multiple lines of defense against supernatural terror. There's a lot to be afraid of, but he's not afraid.<br /> <br /> Keep talking, that will keep everyone steady. He quietly and patiently thinks out loud: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Now, Phoenix or Binder or myself <i>could </i>link us all telepathically, but the sensation is distracting, so it might be better just to shout. If it's urgent, I can always reach out sympathetically. So there's really nothing to worry about, nothing at all. Of course, if you <i>do </i>want me to conjure a telepathic link, you need only say the word. Doctor Ophis, would you kindly raise a ward against ghosts, if you haven't already?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> It's amazing what a difference suppressing his illness makes. Thanks, Pattern Restoration!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I'm going to follow that boyish ephemeral down the hallway to the right, and hopefully read its echo of a mind. Would anyone like to join me?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> And he does, in fact, go down the hallway to the right.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T04:04:08-07:00","id":1117140,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 9/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Distracted<br /> Beats: 1 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> Lynx takes a deep breath. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">What am I supposed to do now? I'm so... this feels so... insignificant? No, that's not it, it's not, we're all here, but... something's missing. Something's off. There's something... I don't...</span></i><br /> <br /> Lynx eyes Moonstone's departure down the right hallway. He, instead, stands before the mirror, studying the liquid, and his own reflection behind the command to leave. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Is this blood? It... it shouldn't be? What bled? We saw it being written, no floating flesh to wring it from, no hand to write it. What should I do?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">What should I do?</span>&quot; Lynx mutters as he looks up the stairs. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">There's an upstairs too...</span></i><br /> <br /> Without further thought, Lynx walks up the stairs, and once he's on the second floor, he looks to the closest room to enter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-17-2017, 07:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatar