=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;I'm going to follow that boyish ephemeral down the hallway to the right, and hopefully read its echo of a mind. Would anyone like to join me?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Ragnar rolls his eyes behind Moonstone's back as his cabalmate heads for the other room. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Pretty sure that's the exact opposite of 'don't play with the baby bear,' Moon.&quot; </span>Before he can follow after Moonstone, Ragnar notices Lynx heading up the stairs.<span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Okay, guys? We're doing a pretty good job of acting like the moron college students in a slasher movie. Nobody goes anywhere alone.&quot; </span>He briefly debates which one to follow, but the answer is quick and obvious: <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Lynx.</span> </i>He quickly bounds up the stairs after the bearish Shaman.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-18-2017, 09:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T06:04:32-07:00","id":1119479,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">@Thorbes hasn't posted yet, but I will let him include actions in his next post that happen before you leave the room, whatever he decides to do.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You pass through the hallway to the right, and quickly find yourself facing several doors. One is a bathroom, as you can see through the partially cracked door, but the others are closed.<br /> <br /> You hear a giggle and see movement to your left as the boy ghost simply walks through one of the doors. You follow after him, and as you touch the door handle, something tickles your mind...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your Mental Shield spell allows you to roll in a Clash of Wills, using Gnosis + Mind + 3 (including your bonus from the spell factors).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Lynx and Ragnar</b><br /> You arrive at the top of the stairs, Ragnar only moments behind Lynx. This area of the house is a large, open-concept sitting room connecting to other hallways leading to various rooms upstairs.<br /> <br /> To the right, you see bookshelves built into the wall and two small reading nooks with windows looking down onto the front door and the street filled with ephemeral creatures. A book is lying on one of the benches, as if someone was sitting here reading not long ago.<br /> <br /> The closest door is behind you and to your left, adjacent to the railing from the stairs. Before you reach the door, you both see a black creature, about the size of your little finger, crawling under the door. It looks like a cockroach or large insect, but its mere presence raises the hairs on Lynx's neck and gives him a feeling of unease on his Periphery.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Either of you may make a perception roll. Lynx can also make an Int + Occult roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Everyone Else</b><br /> Ophis, Binder, and Phoenix find themselves standing alone in the entryway of the house. You hear your companions moving through the building. Where do you go next? Do you follow the others, or pass through the hallway past where Moonstone and the boy ghost went to investigate the rest of the lower level?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T08:11:37-07:00","id":1119514,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Kinetic Blow (self, 4 Potency, 1 scene)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (untill 11 AM)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Pretty sure that's the exact opposite of 'don't play with the baby bear,' Moon.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">&quot;I'll look after him,&quot;</span> I respond, following Moonstone. I swear, that guy's gonna get himself killed one of these days.<br /> <br /> \u200bI just barely catch a glimpse of the kid ghost moving through the door, then something flickers in my Periphery as Moonstone touches the handle. Looks like the mama bear's come to guard her cub.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Phoenix is on the defensive now. He's alert and focused, using mundane perception for any signs of overt danger.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/535169\" target=\"_blank\">Wits 3 + Composure 2 = 5 dice \u2192 1 success</a><br /> <br /> \u200bAbout the whole Peripheral thing, I think it's safe to assume that if Mental Shield is triggering a Clash of Wills, then an active power is trying to influence Moonstone's mind, and Peripheral Mage Sight detects active powers.<br /> <br /> \u200bSide note, when I cast Kinetic Blow, I forgot to spend a Reach for instant casting, so I swapped out the Stunned Reach effect for it instead, so his attacks won't cause the Stunned Tilt automatically (though the spell could reasonably do that on its own).</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T11:18:10-07:00","id":1119581,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active (Matter/Death/Life) | <b>Active Spells: </b>Ghost Shield, Mental Shield<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>4/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats/Exp: </b>2/2 | <b>Arc. Beats/Exp:</b> 1/0</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Please, please, Moonstone, no matter your perception I had nothing but the experience that ghosts are indeed sentient beings capable of though and emotions. I will not step aside and let you harm a child or his mother unless there is absolutely no other option&quot;</b></span>- The doctor let's his previous spell vanish and does his best at creating an aura that hopefully protects them against ghosts.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting &quot;Ghost Shield&quot; 1 Free Reach for Instant Casting, 3 additional Reach for Extended Duration (One Scene/Hour), Advanced Scale (Everyone on a small room) and to protect against ghost's phisical attacks. Dedicated Tool to negate 2 out of 3 Paradox dice. Containing Paradox=<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/535182\" target=\"_blank\">=0 Paradox successes</a>. Spell roll: Gnosis 1+Death 2 + Willpower 3= 6 dice=<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/535184\" target=\"_blank\">2 Successes!</a><br /> <br /> <i>Everyone now has a Potency 2 Ghost Shield instead of Speak witht the Dead for the remaining hour</i></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Putting his doctor's coat on, Ouroboros Ophis traces a circle in the air encompasing all his cabalmates before they go their separate ways,imbuing them with the protecion of Stygia, the air becoming sterile, like that from a surgery room.<br /> <br /> -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;That should award us some measure of protection against them if things come to worse, but let's try to talk to them first, please&quot;</b></span>-that said he goes with Phoenix after Moonstone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 07-23-2017, 02:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T17:06:23-07:00","id":1119682,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Lynx!&quot; </span>Ragnar reaches the top of the stairs and stops right next to his friend as they survey the scene. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;Oh. Okay. These are, uh, spirits right? They aren't going to be any trouble, are they?&quot; </span>The black cockroach-thing inspires a deep feeling of revulsion- and the way Lynx stiffens next to him at the sight of it adds deep apprehension to the mix. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>Oh, that's not normal, is it? </i></span><span style=\"color:#0000cd\">&quot;I've got a bad feeling about this,&quot; </span>he mutters. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><i>What will we encounter beyond this door?</i></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragnar is going to cast Time 1 Postcognition to learn what is beyond the door the cockroach crawled under. Two free Reach, one for instant casting, one for specific answers. Since he never accumulates dice in the Paradox pool, he can just &quot;take 1&quot; and assume the spell works with a single success, right?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-23-2017, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T17:09:27-07:00","id":1119684,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;My knight in shining armor! I feel safer already. I feel that ghosts are better studied than spoken to, but I will honor the spirit of your request.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> His hand catches on the door. What's that laughter...? Moonstone visualizes iron ramparts around the palace of his mind, besieged by a ghostly invader.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Clash of Wills, 6 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/535293\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T16:29:03-07:00","id":1121078,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 7/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Distracted<br /> Beats: 1 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Books are nice,</span>&quot; Lynx murmurs to himself as he spots it by the window. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Books are nice? We're graduating moron college, surrounded by supernal phenomena, and books are nice? Great fucking job, keeping my fucking priorities. What am I supposed to do!?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Lynx!</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Oh, hey, Ragnar. Glad it's you joining me-</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He stiffens as he catches the black creature in the corner of his eye.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/536050\" target=\"_blank\">Perception roll \u2192 0 Successes.</a><br /> No dramatic failure.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/536051\" target=\"_blank\">Intelligence + Occult roll \u2192 0 Successes.</a><br /> No dramatic failure.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000CD\">Oh. Okay. These are, uh, spirits right? They aren't going to be any trouble, are they?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> Lynx rubs his beard apprehensively, his senses scattered everywhere. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I honestly don't know, Ragnar, I'm... fuck me, I'm not sure where I am right now.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He rubs his temple, taking a deep breath, trying to open his Senses - but it gets him nowhere. He tries to listen, to smell, to touch the air, but his body and mind are both deprived of the will to manifest it. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">I'll try to see what that is,</span>&quot; he mutters, frowning, and under his breath, &quot;<span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">Pretend I'm useful or something.</span></span>&quot; He tries to impose his senses upon the creature, to glean something, <i>anything</i>, to stabilise his thoughts.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Lynx attempts to casts Spirit 1 &quot;Know Spirit&quot; to garner information about the Essence phenomena with Potency 3, and he succeeds, allowing him to ask 3 questions and netting him up to 3 answers to what the entity is. In order of importance: 1: <i>What is its name</i>, 2: <i>what is its influence</i>, and 3: <i>what is its bane?</i></b><br /> <b>Potency:</b> 3<br /> <b>Primary Spell Factor:</b> Potency.<br /> <b>1 target:</b> Black insect-like spirit.<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Target's Rank.<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Instant<br /> <b>Yantra:</b> High Speech (+2), Dedicated Tool (+1)<br /> <b>Base Dice Pool:</b> Spirit 1 &quot;Know Spirit&quot;: Spirit (2) + Gnosis (1) + High Speech (+2) + Dedicated Tool (+1) - Potency (2)<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> 2 Free Reaches: 1 on Instant Cast, 1 on Range, 1 on Spell Maintenance.<br /> <b>Total dice pool:</b> 4 dice<br /> <br /> <b>Base Paradox dice:</b> 2 - 1 from Reach, 1 from second consecutive Paradox risk.<br /> <b>Mana spent to mitigate Paradox:</b> 2.<br /> <b>Paradox modifiers:</b> -2 from Mana.<br /> <b>Final Paradox dice:</b> 0.<br /> If Paradox is obtained, Lynx will release it.</span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/536059\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Paradox \u2192 0 successes.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/536058\" target=\"_blank\">Roll for Spirit 1 &quot;Know Spirit&quot; \u2192 2 successes.</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">Come on, give me answers, damn it,</span>&quot; he grumbles angrily under his breath, growing visibly agitated. His imago fixes in place, and he attempts to read ... <i>whatever</i> the creature is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 07-29-2017, 02:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T04:14:42-07:00","id":1124246,"title":"","content":"<b>Phoenix</b><br /> An unseen presence sends a tingle up your spine as soon as Moonstone opens the door. You hear creaking in the ceiling above you, assumedly because Lynx and Ragnar have gone up there to explore, but you can't be sure. You don't see or hear anything else. Whatever creature or spirit is in this area trying to influence Moonstone, it doesn't try to make its presence clearly known.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> You create an Imago of an airborne sterilizing field, and your spell wraps your cabal in a protective presence. But you also know that by letting your other spell unravel, the rest of your group will lose their ability to see and interact with ghosts that aren't fully manifested in this world, and that they will need you now more than ever.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Normally that would be the case, but because we're moving into a situation where actions are more time sensitive and may require initiative rolls, I'd like you to actually roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Moonstone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/537755\" target=\"_blank\">Clash of Wills</a>: <u>4d10h8</u> <b>0</b> successes.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> Your mental shield easily rebounds an attempt to cloud your mind. You open the door and see a small office, with a desktop computer sitting on a desk in the corner and a small sofa facing a window looking out on the yard to the side of the house.<br /> <br /> The laughter is replaced with a sad moan as you enter the room. You feel the unseen presence on your periphery again, and suddenly words start to appear on the computer monitor as if being typed, even though the screen is obviously powered off.<br /> <br /> <b><i>No fair. I want to play.</i></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> Your mundane knowledge is useless here. You have no idea what the creature is. But you craft an Imago to gain inspiration about the creature, and you place it on the spirit. A sudden chill fills you body, tingling up your spine, and your breath catches in your throat. This is a spirit of death, with Influence over deceased creatures and rotting flesh. You don't know its weakness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-06-2017, 07:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T05:11:05-07:00","id":1124253,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>LYNX<br /> Active Sight: None (Unavailable, no Willpower)<br /> Active Spells: Body Control (Potency 3, Duration, 1 Week)<br /> Willpower: 0/5 Mana: 7/10<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Distracted<br /> Beats: 1 - Arcane Beats: 1<br /> Experiences: 1 - Arcane Experiences: 1</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Lynx shudders as he reads the spirit, placing his right hand on Ragnar's shoulder, gripping his pendant with his left. <i><span style=\"color:#800000\">Is this for his benefit? Or mine?</span></i><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">It's a spirit of death,</span>&quot; he huffs as he slows down his breathing and calms his heart with his Body Control. Tension runs through his body as he readies his reflexes. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800000\">It can influence dead creatures and rotting flesh, so be careful.</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>OOC: The spirit doesn't have a name?</b></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":12046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","user":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","date":". 08-03-2017, 08:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T04:19:38-07:00","id":1124688,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#006400\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> Mage Sight: </b>Active (Matter/Death/Life) | <b>Active Spells: </b>Ghost Shield, Mental Shield<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>4/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)</div> <div align=\"center\"><b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None | <b>Beats/Exp: </b>2/2 | <b>Arc. Beats/Exp:</b> 1/0</div> <br /> <br /> The doctor's senses ping both when the child ghost tried to mess with Moonstone's head (again) and later when he &quot;typed&quot; his message on the turned off computer. -<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Are you alright, Moonstone? I felt some ghostly activity being directed at you&quot;</b></span>-he enters the room, hands up in a calming motion-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Hello, child, we are here to help you and your mother... can we talk for a moment?&quot;</b></span>-he turns to Phoenix and Moonstone-<span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;He is just a child, let's try to keep things civil, please. Remember, he and his mother are victims, not enemies&quot;.</b></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T05:06:38-07:00","id":1125545,"title":"","content":"<b>Ragnar</b><br /> You quickly but sufficiently construct your Imago of not just a literal door opening, but of a metaphorical door opening into a glimpse of the future. You peek through the crack into your immediate future and see a woman's body, her face contorted into an expression of pain and shock, covered in writhing black shadows and reeking of death.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Lynx</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For some spirits, I think of them as generic representations of their type, so its name is really a reflection of what kind of spirit it is. Spirits with actual names are those with higher rank or more memorable NPCs (higher than rank 1).</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis, Phoenix, and Moonstone</b><br /> The words fade away and others appear. <br /> <br /> <b><i>But I just want to play. Play with me.</i></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Binder</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Hey, you still around? How would you like to act here? You're basically still just standing by yourself on the ground floor.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T22:58:23-07:00","id":1127496,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 10/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Moonstone's eyes get milky and faraway for a few seconds...<br /> <br /> But his magic holds out. It feels so good to say <i>NO</i> for a change when someone tries to mess with him.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#006400\"><b>&quot;Are you alright, Moonstone? I felt some ghostly activity being directed at you&quot;</b></span><br /> <br /> The warlock grumbles: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;The thought-form tried to turn me into Jack Torrance. You will be happy to know that I am keeping my blade sheathed.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> How do you deal with ghost kids? Or real kids? It's not really his area of expertise. But the presence of a mind in the dusty computer room is something he can latch onto, at least. He rubs his gloved hands together and sweetly says: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;What game do you like to play, little friend?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> A response is evidence of a mind, however fractured. And a mind is a target. He draws his mirror and studies the computer monitor in the reflection, ready to chant in the High Speech to clarify his command to the world. The driving Obsessions of the poor unfortunate mind-echo should be revealed in the mirror.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Let's cast some spells, baby.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 1 Know Nature: </b>1 reach for exceeding spell control, 1 reach for instant cast. +1 for sensory range. +1 to determine Aspirations and Obsessions, or ghostly equivalent. I think CofD ghosts have Aspirations at least.<br /> 2 Paradox, chance die from dedicated tool: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/539934\" target=\"_blank\">fail.</a><br /> Gnosis 1, Mind 2, High Speech 2. 5 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/539936\" target=\"_blank\">success.</a><br /> I learn the ghost boy's Virtue, Vice, Aspirations, and total number of dots in Mental/Social attributes. Or...however that works for Power/Finesse/Resistance.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 1 Mental Scan: </b>1 reach for exceeding spell control, 1 reach for instant cast. +1 for sensory range. +1 for scene duration. +1 to read surface thoughts. +1 for paradox rolls in the scene.<br /> 4 Paradox, -2 from Mana. 2 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/539943\" target=\"_blank\">fail.</a><br /> Gnosis 1, Mind 2, High Speech 2, Path Tool 1, Potency -2. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/539945\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes.</a><br /> Potency 3 withstood by Composure, or ghostly equivalent. Rank? Anything? With whatever Potency I have left, I'll ask in descending order of importance: <i>What does the ghost imagine by &quot;playing&quot;? What is the ghost's Anchor? What is the ghost's current mood?</i><br /> I also get to hear what the ghost is thinking about at a given moment for the rest of the scene, which will probably be weird since it's a ghost. Does listening to the thoughts of the lingering obsessions of a dead person give an Arcane Beat?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T15:52:40-07:00","id":1128232,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>RAGNAR</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\">Mage Sight: Peripheral<br /> Active Spells: None<br /> Conditions/Tilts: Inspired, Steadfast<br /> Health: OOOOOOOO I WP: 3/4 I Mana: 10/10 I Wisdom: 7<br /> Beats: 0/5 I Arcane Beats: 2/5<br /> Experiences: 1 I Arcane Experiences: 1<br /> <br /> </div> Ragnar grabs Lynx's arm. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;It's here. The mother's ghost is behind this door. Guys,&quot; </span>he raises his voice so that the others can hear. <span style=\"color:#0000cd\">\u200b&quot;I found the room the mother's ghost is in. The artifact that started all of this is in there with her.&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T17:04:18-07:00","id":1128257,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Phoenix</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Armor:</b> Prime | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Kinetic Blow (self, Potency 4, 1 scene), Sense Consciousness (self, 1 day, +2 to CoW)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 2/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 9/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Grieving [Guilty] | <b>Tilts:</b> None | -1 Dexterity (until 11 AM)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200bI don't like this; I can't sense the ghosts. The mother could be right on top of our asses right now, and we're none the wiser. Plus, my fists are useless against something I can't punch. Although the kid has some form of mind manipulation, that needs a mind itself. Perhaps I could see them through the world's mind...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Phoenix is casting an Unveiling Mind spell that allows him to sense minds, roughly what type of mind (he can tell apart ghost minds from human minds, for example), and a rough emotional Resonance ('Furious', 'Playful', 'Worried' are just a few examples). Think of it as a mage version of Aura Reading. Anyone trying to occlude themselves provokes a Clash of Wills. Primary Factor is Duration.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Sense Consciousness (Mind 1, CT)</b></u><br /> <b>Reach:</b> 2 Free - 4 used for instant casting, 1 over Spell Control, Advanced Duration, and Advanced Potency<br /> <b>Paradox:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540244\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox 2 - 2 Dedicated Tool = Chance die \u2192 0 successes</a><br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Dedicated Tool for -2 Paradox and +1 spellcasting<br /> <b>Factors:</b> PSF Duration to 1 day<br /> <b>Spellcasting:</b> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540245\" target=\"_blank\">Gnosis 1 + Mind 2 + 1 DT = 4 dice \u2192 1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 08-15-2017, 07:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T03:47:12-07:00","id":1129168,"title":"","content":"<b>Moonstone</b><br /> You create your spell Imago in such a way that it encompasses the computer and the space around it, like a net being thrown into the sea with hopes that it will ensnare its target, and your mind suddenly fills with knowledge about this friendly little ghost.<br /> <br /> The &quot;mind&quot; you reveal is more like a recording than a consciousness, much like a voicemail is to the spoken word, except that it seems capable of responding to outside stimuli. The ghostly child seeks to entertain itself by confusing you and hiding from you, but it has no malicious intent.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Virtue: Curious<br /> Vice: Stubborn<br /> Aspirations: I don't see rules for these for ghosts, so I'm just going to give it a single short-term aspiration: &quot;Use its Numina to play games with someone's mind.&quot;<br /> Attributes: You learn that its Finesse + Resistance = 4.<br /> <br /> You learn the following information: It imagines &quot;playing&quot; by using its Numina to create illusions or hallucinations in the target, to amuse itself and confuse the target. He just wants to show you funny things. He has one Anchor, which is his bedroom just down the hallway.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Immediately upon casting your spell, your skin begins to crawl and you hear a horrible shriek echo throughout the entire house. New words appear on the screen:<br /> <br /> <b><i>You made her angry.</i></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ragnar and Lynx</b><br /> Just as the words leave Ragnar's mouth, a chill passes up your spine and you hear a terrible, furious scream. The door to the room in front of you slams open towards you, so close to you that it nearly threatens to knock you off your feet. The visage of a middle-aged woman clearly stalks through the door, her teeth growing into fangs and her hands as claws. She lunges forward -- and slips like a knife between you, shoving you forcefully into the nearby wall as she disappears downstairs.<br /> <br /> As you steady yourselves and look into the bedroom, you hear loud hissing. A thick black cloud of those black beetles swarms in the center of the room. It splits into three human-sized swarms. Between them on the ground, you see several unmoving, pale fingers with insects crawling on it and a partial glimpse of a woman's dead face twisted in agony. Now that you are closer, you can see that these insects look like some kind of scarab beetle.<br /> <br /> The swarms begin to move towards you in unison.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Phoenix</b><br /> Your spell reveals the minds of your companions, an unseen presence here in this room with a &quot;playful&quot; Resonance, and suddenly a presence moving rapidly towards you with a &quot;furious&quot; Resonance. Moments later, you see a ghostly presence in the shape of a woman burst into the room. Her eyes are burning with vengeance, and her hands and teeth look sharper than knives.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Everyone</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Time to roll Initiative!</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T13:56:34-07:00","id":1129410,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Moonstone<br /> Peripheral Sight | Spells: Mental Shield (self, 1 week, +3 Clash)<br /> Conditions: Divergent (suppressed), Guilty, Triumphant, Informed (Rumors) [-1 Strength]<br /> Health: OOOOOO | Willpower: 3/8 | Mana: 8/10 | Beats: 4/5 | Arcane Beats: 1/5</b></div> <br /> Moonstone drops the kid-friendliness as his spell reveals the animating passions of the ghost. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Harmless. It can only show us pictures, not hurt us. The memory is tied to the poor boy's bedroom-&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <i>shriek!</i><br /> <br /> He stows the mirror and whips around. <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;<i>Made her angry</i>- I only read its mind! These ephemerals are so <i>sensitive</i>-&quot;</span><br /> <br /> A ghostly woman bursts in. He's about to reach for his sword, but...looks in the mirror instead. He forms an Imago of Time as a choice and murmurs: <span style=\"color:#008080\">&quot;Choose peace, choose peace, choose peace...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Initiative: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540892\" target=\"_blank\">17</a>. I don't think anyone's gonna exceed that so I'll just take my action.<br /> <br /> Casting Time 2 Choose the Thread on myself. 1 reach for instant, +2 reach to affect spellcasting. +1 paradox for exceeding spell control, +1 for rolls already this scene. 4 Paradox: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540902\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. Contain: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540904\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a>. 2 bashing for me.<br /> <br /> Gnosis 1+Time 2+Path Tool 1. 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/540906\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a><br /> <br /> Spent 1 Mana to cast a Time spell. In the next turn, I get to make my roll twice. Probably gonna be a Mind domination effect if things get violent.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy U